  "courseTitle": "Ionic - Build iOS, Android & Web Apps with Ionic & Angular",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "errors": [],
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "13727776",
      "title": "Wrap Up",
      "lectureOrder": 101,
      "videoOrder": 82,
      "sourceHash": "3380f55f3628a9a4d897a220ca1aafbd729a047b9e3219fc02686727a2bb85af",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.45,
          "end": 6.93,
          "en": "So these were a couple of possible strategies when it comes to debugging,",
          "zh": "這些就是 debug 時幾種可行的策略，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.04,
          "end": 9.05,
          "en": "obviously just scratching the surface,",
          "zh": "顯然只是觸及表面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.08,
          "end": 14.96,
          "en": "you could create a whole course about debugging after all but very important lessons and very important",
          "zh": "畢竟 debug 可以做成整門課程，但這些都是非常重要的課題、非常重要的"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 15.14,
          "end": 16.54,
          "en": "things to keep in mind.",
          "zh": "觀念，要記在心裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.58,
          "end": 19.56,
          "en": "You will encounter errors throughout this course and throughout",
          "zh": "你在這門課程以及你打造的"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.58,
          "end": 26.72,
          "en": "any project you build and therefore reading the error messages, using console log, using breakpoints, inspecting",
          "zh": "任何專案中都會遇到錯誤，因此讀錯誤訊息、用 console log、用 breakpoints、檢查"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 26.72,
          "end": 32.21,
          "en": "the user interface, inspecting network requests and also having a look at memory and so on,",
          "zh": "使用者介面、檢查網路請求，還有查看 memory 等等，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 32.21,
          "end": 37.07,
          "en": "these are core things you've got to be aware of and you should definitely look into when you're facing",
          "zh": "這些都是你必須知道的核心事項，當你遇到"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 37.07,
          "end": 37.67,
          "en": "problems.",
          "zh": "問題時，一定要去研究。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727790",
      "title": "Module Introduction",
      "lectureOrder": 103,
      "videoOrder": 83,
      "sourceHash": "101dc9553080174e83190959a4143da75344ed2546295713b1388236d3441aa1",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.18,
          "end": 8.9,
          "en": "We already had a first look at how we can switch between different pages in our application",
          "zh": "我們在上幾個模組已經初步看過如何在應用程式中"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.9,
          "end": 10.52,
          "en": "in the last modules",
          "zh": "切換不同頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.52,
          "end": 12.47,
          "en": "but that was a very basic look,",
          "zh": "但那只是很基礎的介紹，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.53,
          "end": 19.19,
          "en": "there's so much more you can do in an Ionic and Angular app. And in this module, you will therefore learn",
          "zh": "在 Ionic 與 Angular app 裡還有非常多可以做的事。因此在本模組，你會學到"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 19.19,
          "end": 26.78,
          "en": "about all the different ways of switching between pages and that does not just mean how to trigger these",
          "zh": "所有切換頁面的不同方式，而且這不只是一些觸發這些"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 27.02,
          "end": 33.08,
          "en": "switches but mostly also how to implement things like tabs and so on. To be precise,",
          "zh": "切換的方式，重點還包括如何實作 tabs 之類的東西。更精確地說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 33.08,
          "end": 38.48,
          "en": "we'll have a look at the Angular router and the Ionic nav controller,",
          "zh": "我們會看看 Angular router 與 Ionic nav controller，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 38.51,
          "end": 44.06,
          "en": "you haven't heard about the nav controller yet but this is another tool that can help us with switching",
          "zh": "你還沒聽過 nav controller，但這是另一個能幫助我們切換"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 44.06,
          "end": 48.75,
          "en": "pages, though you will learn that you primarily use the Angular router.",
          "zh": "頁面的工具，不過你會學到，你主要還是使用 Angular router。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 48.92,
          "end": 51.77,
          "en": "You will learn how to add tabs to your application,",
          "zh": "你會學到如何為應用程式加入 tabs，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 51.77,
          "end": 59.57,
          "en": "so a tab based navigation if you want to, you will learn how to add a side drawer which you can use for",
          "zh": "也就是所謂的 tab 式導覽；你會學到如何加入 side drawer，它除了導覽以外"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 59.57,
          "end": 65.54,
          "en": "our things than navigation too but you will also learn how to use it for navigation in this module. You",
          "zh": "也能用於其他事情，但在本模組你也會學到如何用它來導覽。你"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 65.54,
          "end": 71.78,
          "en": "will learn how to use overlays or specifically, a modal which is also kind of the navigation since it",
          "zh": "會學到如何使用 overlay，具體來說是 modal，它也算是一種導覽，因為它"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 71.84,
          "end": 79.4,
          "en": "occupies the page and gives the user a new page on top of the other one so to say and we'll at the end",
          "zh": "佔用頁面，可以說是在原本頁面之上給使用者一個新頁面；我們在"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 79.4,
          "end": 85.46000000000001,
          "en": "of the module also dive into guards which is a feature provided by Angular, not something coming",
          "zh": "模組最後也會深入 guards，這是 Angular 提供的功能，不是來自"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 85.46000000000001,
          "end": 92.81,
          "en": "from Ionic but still a feature we can use of course in Ionic Angular apps which can help us for example",
          "zh": "Ionic，但當然仍是我們能在 Ionic Angular app 中使用的功能，例如它可以幫我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 92.81,
          "end": 95.11,
          "en": "with things like authentication.",
          "zh": "處理像身分驗證這樣的事情。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 95.39,
          "end": 97.59,
          "en": "So a lot of ground to cover,",
          "zh": "所以有很多內容要涵蓋，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 97.72999999999999,
          "end": 99.07,
          "en": "let's dive right into it.",
          "zh": "我們直接開始吧。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727794",
      "title": "How Routing Work In An Ionic + Angular App",
      "lectureOrder": 104,
      "videoOrder": 84,
      "sourceHash": "92e93419c55a9ed11b3c8e65bff768ff55540502ecafed269fce828aca22210a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.35,
          "end": 3.67,
          "en": "It is really important",
          "zh": "有一件事非常重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.67,
          "end": 4.08,
          "en": "that",
          "zh": "那就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.09,
          "end": 10.54,
          "en": "you understand how navigation works behind the scenes. In an Angular Ionic app,",
          "zh": "你要瞭解導覽在背後是如何運作的。在 Angular Ionic app 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.54,
          "end": 17.9,
          "en": "we use the Angular router for navigation and that is what you also already saw in the previous modules.",
          "zh": "我們使用 Angular router 來導覽，這也是你在前面模組已經看過的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.92,
          "end": 25.21,
          "en": "We set up our routes in our Angular router configuration just as we do it in a normal Angular app",
          "zh": "我們在 Angular router 設定中設定路由，就跟在一般 Angular app 裡一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 25.21,
          "end": 31.6,
          "en": "and as I emphasized multiple times, this is just a normal Angular app but we use that router for setting",
          "zh": "而我強調過很多次，這就只是一般的 Angular app，但我們用那個 router 來"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 31.6,
          "end": 38.08,
          "en": "up the routes and then we can use the router link or the navigate method when we inject the router to",
          "zh": "設定路由，然後我們可以透過注入 router 後使用 routerLink 或 navigate 方法，來"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 38.08,
          "end": 42.91,
          "en": "switch between the different paths and therefore the different pages.",
          "zh": "在不同路徑、也就是不同頁面之間切換。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 42.91,
          "end": 49.23,
          "en": "Now here comes the interesting part when using the Angular router in an Ionic app because this Ionic",
          "zh": "在 Ionic app 中使用 Angular router 有趣的地方來了，因為這個 Ionic"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 49.23,
          "end": 57.52,
          "en": "app with the @angular/ionic package actually kind of wraps that Angular routing functionality and",
          "zh": "app 搭配 @angular/ionic 套件，其實算是包裝了 Angular 的 routing 功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 57.52,
          "end": 61.5,
          "en": "you can tell that it does by the fact that we use this ion router outlet",
          "zh": "從我們使用這個 ion-router-outlet 就可以看出這一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 61.5,
          "end": 66.45,
          "en": "if you remember. It does so to basically add all these nice transitions,",
          "zh": "如果你還記得的話。它這麼做基本上是為了加入這些漂亮的轉場效果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 66.46,
          "end": 74.23,
          "en": "that's the main purpose and for that, Ionic thinks of navigation or the different pages as a stack of",
          "zh": "這是主要目的。為此，Ionic 把導覽或不同頁面想成一個頁面的"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 74.23,
          "end": 75.14,
          "en": "pages.",
          "zh": "stack（堆疊）。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 75.34,
          "end": 81.59,
          "en": "Because if you think about a mobile app, you typically see one page at a time right",
          "zh": "因為如果你想想行動 app，通常一次只看得到一個頁面，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 81.61,
          "end": 87.16,
          "en": "and you can go to a new page or press the back button and go back. Well you can essentially do the same",
          "zh": "你可以前往新頁面，或按返回鍵回到上一頁。其實你在"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 87.16,
          "end": 93.4,
          "en": "in the browser of course, there you also have a back button. So you can think of navigation as a stack",
          "zh": "瀏覽器裡也能做一樣的事，那裡也有返回鍵。所以你可以把導覽想成一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 93.4,
          "end": 100.12,
          "en": "of pages and you always view the page which is on top of this stack, so the topmost page, that is the",
          "zh": "頁面堆疊，而你總是看到堆疊最上面的頁面，也就是最頂端那一頁，那就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 100.12,
          "end": 104.62,
          "en": "page you see but the other pages are still there, just hidden so to say",
          "zh": "你看到的頁面，但其他頁面其實還在，只是可說是被隱藏起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 104.8,
          "end": 111.1,
          "en": "and when you go back, you basically pop that top page and you see the other pages. Ionic controls these",
          "zh": "當你返回時，基本上就是把最上面那頁 pop 掉，然後看到其他頁面。Ionic 用一個 stack"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 111.31,
          "end": 114.68,
          "en": "stack of pages with a stack controller.",
          "zh": "controller 來控制這個頁面堆疊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 114.7,
          "end": 120.21,
          "en": "Now that's a class you don't work with directly in your Angular app, Ionic does that for you,",
          "zh": "這是你在 Angular app 中不會直接使用的 class，Ionic 會幫你處理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 120.22,
          "end": 126.81,
          "en": "so it's internal to Ionic and as I mentioned, when you use the Angular router for navigating, Ionic basically",
          "zh": "所以它是 Ionic 內部的東西。如我所說，當你使用 Angular router 導覽時，Ionic 基本上"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 126.82,
          "end": 130.99,
          "en": "watches the Angular router, it has a listener to your routing actions.",
          "zh": "會監看 Angular router，它對你的 routing 動作有註冊監聽器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 131.14,
          "end": 138.28,
          "en": "When you go forward, it basically pushes a new page onto that stack and when you go back or use that",
          "zh": "當你往前時，它基本上會把新頁面 push 到那個堆疊上；當你返回或使用那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 138.31,
          "end": 146.2,
          "en": "ion back button, it pops that topmost page off. Now in case you're wondering how it knows whether a navigate",
          "zh": "ion-back-button 時，它會把最頂端的頁面 pop 掉。如果你想知道它怎麼知道某個 navigate"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 146.2,
          "end": 149.25,
          "en": "call is meant to go forward or backward,",
          "zh": "呼叫是要往前還是往後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 149.29,
          "end": 155.5,
          "en": "it basically has a look at the internal ID of your navigation action and it turns out that by that",
          "zh": "它基本上是看你導覽動作的內部 ID，而結果是，從那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 155.5,
          "end": 163.06,
          "en": "ID you can determine whether the new route is basically one step ahead of the old route or behind",
          "zh": "ID 你就能判斷新路由基本上是比舊路由往前一步還是往後"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 163.06,
          "end": 163.32,
          "en": "it",
          "zh": "一步，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 163.32999999999998,
          "end": 168.4,
          "en": "so to say. So you don't have to worry about that, Ionic is really smart about finding out if you're going",
          "zh": "可以這麼說。所以你不必擔心這件事，Ionic 非常聰明，能判斷你是往前"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 168.4,
          "end": 174.19,
          "en": "forward or backward and that in turn is important for playing the right animation for transitioning",
          "zh": "還是往後，而這又對播放正確的動畫很重要，用來做"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 174.19,
          "end": 175.77,
          "en": "from pages.",
          "zh": "頁面之間的轉場。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 175.82999999999998,
          "end": 181.68,
          "en": "Now these stack of pages and that's also something special Ionic does is then also cached for you and",
          "zh": "這個頁面堆疊，也是 Ionic 做的特別之處，它還會幫你快取起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 181.71,
          "end": 188.82,
          "en": "that is now a difference to your normal Angular for web in browser experience. There what happens is if",
          "zh": "這就跟一般 Angular 用於網頁、在瀏覽器中的體驗不同。在那裡，情況是當"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 188.82,
          "end": 195.21,
          "en": "you go to a new page and you go back, all these pages which in the end are just components are essentially",
          "zh": "你前往新頁面再返回時，這些終究只是元件的頁面基本上都會"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 195.21,
          "end": 199.78,
          "en": "destroyed when you leave them, no matter if you're going forward or backward.",
          "zh": "在你離開時被銷毀，不管是往前還是往後都一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 199.89,
          "end": 205.16,
          "en": "Now with Ionic, that's actually not the case. When you are going forward to a new page,",
          "zh": "但在 Ionic 中其實不是這樣。當你往前到新頁面時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 205.26,
          "end": 211.78,
          "en": "that old page which is still in that stack of pages so to say is kept in a cache in memory.",
          "zh": "那個還留在頁面堆疊裡的舊頁面，可以說會被保留在記憶體的快取中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 212.07,
          "end": 217.44,
          "en": "So this whole stack of pages is actually cached you could say and when you pop a page off,",
          "zh": "所以你可以說整個頁面堆疊都會被快取，而當你把某個頁面 pop 掉時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 217.44,
          "end": 221.6,
          "en": "well then this is removed from the cache because it's removed from the stack.",
          "zh": "它就會從快取中被移除，因為它已從堆疊中移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 221.64,
          "end": 228.42000000000002,
          "en": "This will become important and it will also explain that little bug we had in our last modules which",
          "zh": "這會變得重要，也會解釋我們在前幾個模組遇到的那個小 bug，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 228.42000000000002,
          "end": 231.61,
          "en": "I'll fix now or which I'll now explain you why it happens.",
          "zh": "我現在會修掉它，或者說我現在會跟你解釋它為什麼發生。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 231.84,
          "end": 237.18,
          "en": "Now besides the Angular router for navigating around which we'll primarily use and which is the main",
          "zh": "除了我們主要使用、也是 Ionic Angular app 中導覽"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 237.18,
          "end": 240.64,
          "en": "recommended tool for going around in your Ionic Angular app,",
          "zh": "最主要推薦工具的 Angular router 之外，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 240.75,
          "end": 246.66,
          "en": "besides that, we also got the Ionic nav controller. That is an injectable service which you can inject",
          "zh": "我們還有 Ionic nav controller。那是一項可注入的 service，你可以把它注入"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 246.66,
          "end": 252.08,
          "en": "into any component or a service you might have and that essentially gives you some utility methods that",
          "zh": "到任何元件或你手上的 service，它基本上會提供你一些工具方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 252.09,
          "end": 254.88,
          "en": "will also interact with that start controller,",
          "zh": "這些方法也會和那個 stack controller 互動，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 254.88,
          "end": 260.28,
          "en": "for example it will give you a pop method which allows you to manually pop off the latest page on the",
          "zh": "例如它會給你一個 pop 方法，讓你手動把頁面堆疊上最新的頁面 pop 掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 260.28,
          "end": 266.31,
          "en": "stack of pages and which will therefore trigger a back navigation. We'll not use the nav controller too",
          "zh": "因此就會觸發返回導覽。我們不會太"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 266.31,
          "end": 266.99,
          "en": "much,",
          "zh": "常使用 nav controller，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 267.03,
          "end": 268.32,
          "en": "still I will show it to you,",
          "zh": "不過我還是會示範給你看，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 268.32,
          "end": 271.1,
          "en": "it's good to know it's there, can help you with going back",
          "zh": "知道有這個東西是好的，它可以幫你返回，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 271.11,
          "end": 275.01,
          "en": "as I mentioned but primarily, we'll use the Angular router.",
          "zh": "如我所說，但最主要我們會使用 Angular router。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727798",
      "title": "Ionic Page Caching & Extra Lifecycle Hooks",
      "lectureOrder": 105,
      "videoOrder": 85,
      "sourceHash": "5637381701dfa45affb99a8e79d0585cf6ba8853dd65b6dcb459f687ace7fa68",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.91,
          "end": 8.18,
          "en": "I mentioned that Ionic caches pages, these stack of pages",
          "zh": "我提過 Ionic 會快取頁面，也就是這個頁面堆疊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.4,
          "end": 14.25,
          "en": "and that explains why in the last module we had this back that when we deleted a recipe, it was still",
          "zh": "這也解釋了為什麼上個模組我們遇到那個 bug：當我們刪除一個 recipe 時，它仍然"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 14.25,
          "end": 15.45,
          "en": "there.",
          "zh": "還在那裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 15.45,
          "end": 21.39,
          "en": "It's important to understand how the Angular lifecycle behaves and how it differs",
          "zh": "重要的是要瞭解 Angular 的生命週期如何運作，以及它的差異，特別是"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 21.39,
          "end": 27.35,
          "en": "when we're talking about a page that was loaded with the Angular router and that is therefore indirectly",
          "zh": "當我們談的是透過 Angular router 載入、因此也間接"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 27.36,
          "end": 35.1,
          "en": "also controlled by Ionic. In regular Angular components, no matter if we're using them by embedding their",
          "zh": "由 Ionic 控制的頁面時。在一般的 Angular 元件中，不管我們是把它們的"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 35.1,
          "end": 42.39,
          "en": "selector into our templates or by loading them via routing, we have a certain lifecycle but we also",
          "zh": "selector 嵌進 template，還是透過 routing 載入它們，我們都有一定的生命週期，但我們也"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 42.39,
          "end": 44.93,
          "en": "have a special lifecycle for the components",
          "zh": "對這些元件有一個特殊的生命週期，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 44.94,
          "end": 51.72,
          "en": "we did load via routing and I will call them Ionic pages here though these are regular Angular components,",
          "zh": "就是我們透過 routing 載入的那些元件，我在這裡稱它們為 Ionic pages，雖然它們是一般的 Angular 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 51.93,
          "end": 52.8,
          "en": "just components",
          "zh": "就只是元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 52.8,
          "end": 58.29,
          "en": "we loaded via the Angular router and which are therefore indirectly controlled by Ionic.",
          "zh": "只是我們透過 Angular router 載入、因此間接由 Ionic 控制的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 58.29,
          "end": 62.85,
          "en": "So for the regular Angular components, we have the ngOnInit,",
          "zh": "對一般的 Angular 元件，我們有 ngOnInit，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 62.85,
          "end": 65.96,
          "en": "then we also have other lifecycle hooks like ngOnChanges",
          "zh": "我們也有其他生命週期 hook，例如 ngOnChanges，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 65.97,
          "end": 67.93,
          "en": "but that's not so important here",
          "zh": "但那在這裡不是那麼重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 67.98,
          "end": 75.89,
          "en": "and if we in a web for example go to a different page, we have ngOnDestroy. Now that will be called",
          "zh": "而如果在網頁中我們前往不同頁面，就會有 ngOnDestroy。它會在"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 75.89,
          "end": 80.87,
          "en": "when the component is basically removed and when it's really at this post.",
          "zh": "元件基本上被移除、真正離開的時候被呼叫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 81.02,
          "end": 87.65,
          "en": "Now for Ionic pages, because of that caching mechanism we got some new lifecycle methods. We got",
          "zh": "而對 Ionic pages 來說，因為那個快取機制，我們有了一些新的生命週期方法。我們有"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 87.69,
          "end": 91.7,
          "en": "ionViewWillEnter for example and that will run after ngOnInit,",
          "zh": "例如 ionViewWillEnter，它會在 ngOnInit 之後執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 91.7,
          "end": 97.00999999999999,
          "en": "we also got ionViewDidEnter which also runs after that and also after WillEnter.",
          "zh": "我們也有 ionViewDidEnter，它同樣在那之後執行，也就是在 WillEnter 之後。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 97.15,
          "end": 98.65,
          "en": "Now the difference here is",
          "zh": "這裡的差別在於，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 98.69,
          "end": 104.87,
          "en": "ionViewWillEnter basically execute right before the content of the page has been loaded and is displayed",
          "zh": "ionViewWillEnter 基本上是在頁面內容載入完成、並且顯示"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 104.87,
          "end": 109.5,
          "en": "on the screen you could say and ionViewDidEnter will be called right after that.",
          "zh": "到螢幕上之前執行，可以這麼說，而 ionViewDidEnter 會緊接在那之後被呼叫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 109.75999999999999,
          "end": 117.59,
          "en": "Both are called whenever a page becomes visible and that is important because with caching, if a page",
          "zh": "兩者都會在頁面變得可見時被呼叫，這很重要，因為有了快取，如果一個頁面"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 117.65,
          "end": 123.56,
          "en": "is still in cache and you are just not seeing it because another page is on top of it, on that stack",
          "zh": "還在快取中，你只是因為另一個頁面在那個頁面堆疊的最上面而看不到它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 123.56,
          "end": 126.74,
          "en": "of pages, it will actually never be destroyed",
          "zh": "它其實永遠不會被銷毀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 126.74,
          "end": 132.29,
          "en": "so ngOnDestroy will never be called and ngOnInit will also never be called when you go back to",
          "zh": "所以 ngOnDestroy 永遠不會被呼叫，而當你回到"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 132.29,
          "end": 138.11,
          "en": "that page which is still on the stack of pages. ionViewWillEnter and DidEnter will be called because",
          "zh": "那個還在頁面堆疊上的頁面時，ngOnInit 也永遠不會被呼叫。ionViewWillEnter 和 DidEnter 則會被呼叫，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 138.14,
          "end": 143.18,
          "en": "these are called whenever the page becomes visible, when it becomes the top of that stack of pages",
          "zh": "它們會在頁面變得可見、成為那個頁面堆疊最頂端時被呼叫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 143.18,
          "end": 149.21,
          "en": "so to say. And since ngOnDestroy never gets called but you might still want to do some cleanup work,",
          "zh": "可以這麼說。而既然 ngOnDestroy 永遠不會被呼叫，但你可能還是想做些清理工作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 149.54,
          "end": 153.13,
          "en": "you also get ionViewWillLeave and ionViewDidLeave",
          "zh": "你也有 ionViewWillLeave 和 ionViewDidLeave，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 153.38,
          "end": 159.8,
          "en": "and these also are called whenever the page becomes invisible so to say, whenever a new page is on top",
          "zh": "這兩個也會在頁面變得不可見時被呼叫，可以這麼說，也就是每當有新頁面到它"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 159.8,
          "end": 160.38,
          "en": "of it",
          "zh": "上面時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 160.55,
          "end": 165.41,
          "en": "but it will also be called in places where ngOnDestroy is not called, which is the case if it's",
          "zh": "但它也會在 ngOnDestroy 不會被呼叫的情況下被呼叫，也就是當它"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 165.41,
          "end": 170.26,
          "en": "just not the topmost page of the stack anymore but still on the stack.",
          "zh": "不再是堆疊的最頂端頁面、但仍在堆疊上時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 170.32999999999998,
          "end": 176.81,
          "en": "So let's have a look at this in practice. Here is the little recipes project we worked on and which",
          "zh": "那我們實際來看看。這是我們先前處理、debug 過的"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 176.81,
          "end": 178.11,
          "en": "we debugged and so on",
          "zh": "那個小小的 recipes 專案等等，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 178.28,
          "end": 179.96,
          "en": "and here is our code for that.",
          "zh": "而這是它對應的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 180.05,
          "end": 186.5,
          "en": "Now I'm in the recipes.page.ts file, in our main starting page, this page here and there we have",
          "zh": "我現在在 recipes.page.ts 檔案裡，也就是我們主要的起始頁面，就是這個頁面，而那裡我們有"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 186.53,
          "end": 187.76,
          "en": "ngOnInit.",
          "zh": "ngOnInit。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 187.76,
          "end": 194.66,
          "en": "Here we load the recipes and as we found out in the debugging module, our problem is that ngOnInit",
          "zh": "我們在這裡載入 recipes，而如同我們在 debug 模組發現的，我們的問題是 ngOnInit"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 195.05,
          "end": 196.24,
          "en": "is called initially,",
          "zh": "一開始會被呼叫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 196.25,
          "end": 200.93,
          "en": "so when I reload that page, we do see that loaded recipes log here",
          "zh": "所以當我重新載入那個頁面時，我們的確會在這裡看到那筆 loaded recipes 的 log，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 200.93,
          "end": 206.96,
          "en": "but if I then go to another page and I go back and I clear the console so that we can really see all",
          "zh": "但如果我接著前往另一個頁面再返回，然後清掉 console，好讓我們真的看到所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 206.96,
          "end": 214.13,
          "en": "new logs, we see nothing there because ngOnInit is not executed again because this starting",
          "zh": "新的 log，我們在那裡什麼都看不到，因為 ngOnInit 沒有再次執行，因為這個起始"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 214.13,
          "end": 219.8,
          "en": "page is on the stack of pages and it is still on that stack when we go to the detail page, the detail",
          "zh": "頁面在頁面堆疊上，當我們前往 detail 頁面時它仍在堆疊上，而 detail"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 219.8,
          "end": 223.91,
          "en": "page is now just on top of that stack which is why we see that.",
          "zh": "頁面現在只是在那個堆疊的最上面，這就是我們看到那種結果的原因。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 224.06,
          "end": 230.77,
          "en": "So that means that this starting page, the recipes page was never deleted. To verify this,",
          "zh": "這表示這個起始頁面、也就是 recipes 頁面從未被刪除。為了驗證這點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 230.84,
          "end": 235.07,
          "en": "let's include the onDestroy interface, so let's implement it,",
          "zh": "我們來加入 onDestroy 介面，也就是實作它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 235.07,
          "end": 239.15,
          "en": "make sure you also import onDestroy from @angular/core",
          "zh": "記得也要從 @angular/core 匯入 onDestroy，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 239.18,
          "end": 242.75,
          "en": "and that forces us to add ngOnDestroy here and",
          "zh": "這會強制我們在這裡加入 ngOnDestroy，然後"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 243.03,
          "end": 246.27,
          "en": "there, I'll console log ngOnDestroy.",
          "zh": "在那裡，我會 console log 出 ngOnDestroy。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 247.25,
          "end": 255.44,
          "en": "Now if we save that and we let this reload, we still see our loaded recipes log from ngOnInit",
          "zh": "現在如果我們存檔並讓它重新載入，我們還是會看到 ngOnInit 印出的 loaded recipes log，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 255.45,
          "end": 260.99,
          "en": "and if I go to another page, well we don't see ngOnDestroy being logged because that page is not",
          "zh": "而如果我前往另一個頁面，我們不會看到 ngOnDestroy 被印出來，因為那個頁面沒有"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 260.99,
          "end": 262.5,
          "en": "destroyed,",
          "zh": "被銷毀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 262.58,
          "end": 269.51,
          "en": "let's now add ionViewDidEnter and so on. You just add them as normal methods like this, ionViewDidEnter",
          "zh": "現在我們來加入 ionViewDidEnter 等等。你就像這樣把它們當一般方法加入，ionViewDidEnter"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 269.51,
          "end": 276.56,
          "en": "and you don't need to implement any interface and there let me console log ionViewDidEnter",
          "zh": "你不需要實作任何介面，然後在那裡讓我 console log 出 ionViewDidEnter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 277.11,
          "end": 281.99,
          "en": "and we of course don't just have DidEnter, we also have WillEnter and I mentioned that WillEnter will",
          "zh": "當然我們不只有 DidEnter，我們也有 WillEnter，而我提過 WillEnter 會"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 281.99,
          "end": 283.25,
          "en": "run before DidEnter,",
          "zh": "在 DidEnter 之前執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 283.28,
          "end": 289.88,
          "en": "so let's add it there logically, doesn't matter for the functionality but makes sense to kind of order it",
          "zh": "所以我們基於邏輯把它加在那裡，對功能沒影響，但按照"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 290,
          "end": 291.47,
          "en": "in the order it will execute,",
          "zh": "它執行的順序排列比較合理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 295.82,
          "end": 304.46,
          "en": "like that and let's also add the other two lifecycle hooks, ionViewWillLeave and there I of course",
          "zh": "就像這樣。我們也來加入另外兩個生命週期 hook，ionViewWillLeave，在那裡我當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 304.46,
          "end": 314.98,
          "en": "want to log ionViewWillLeave and then also ionViewDidLeave where I unsurprisingly will log",
          "zh": "要 log 出 ionViewWillLeave，然後也加上 ionViewDidLeave，在那裡我不意外地會 log 出"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 315.25,
          "end": 318.34,
          "en": "ionViewDidLeave.",
          "zh": "ionViewDidLeave。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 318.9,
          "end": 324.09,
          "en": "So now we have all these important lifecycle hooks in place and now let's wait for this page to reload",
          "zh": "現在我們已經把所有這些重要的生命週期 hook 都放好了，我們等這個頁面重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 324.38,
          "end": 330.09,
          "en": "and we see loaded recipes from ngOnInit but then we also see ionViewWillEnter and ionViewDidEnter.",
          "zh": "我們看到 ngOnInit 印出的 loaded recipes，但接著我們也會看到 ionViewWillEnter 和 ionViewDidEnter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 330.09,
          "end": 338.04,
          "en": "If we now go to Schnitzel, we see ionViewWillLeave which actually is logged when our leaving",
          "zh": "如果我們現在前往 Schnitzel，就會看到 ionViewWillLeave，它其實是在我們的離開"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 338.04,
          "end": 343.02,
          "en": "animation starts and ionViewDidLeave which is executed when we really left,",
          "zh": "動畫開始時被印出，而 ionViewDidLeave 則是在我們真正離開、"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 343.02,
          "end": 348.99,
          "en": "so when that animation finished. We don't see ngOnDestroy because again, the page isn't destroyed,",
          "zh": "也就是那個動畫結束時執行。我們不會看到 ngOnDestroy，因為再次強調，這個頁面沒有被銷毀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 348.99,
          "end": 356.4,
          "en": "it's still on the stack of pages. If I now clear my console to only see new logs, if we go back, we see",
          "zh": "它還在頁面堆疊上。如果我現在清掉 console，只留下新的 log，然後我們返回，就會看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 356.4,
          "end": 364.5,
          "en": "WillEnter when our animation starts and DidEnter again. This now of course means that we now have places",
          "zh": "動畫開始時的 WillEnter，然後又是 DidEnter。這當然表示我們現在有一些地方"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 364.5,
          "end": 371.07,
          "en": "to load our data in a way that it's always loaded when this page becomes visible and for that, we could",
          "zh": "可以載入資料，讓這個頁面每次變得可見時資料都會被載入，而為此我們可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 371.07,
          "end": 378.2,
          "en": "use ionViewWillEnter or DidEnter. For example here in ionViewWillEnter, I set my recipes now",
          "zh": "使用 ionViewWillEnter 或 DidEnter。例如在這裡的 ionViewWillEnter，我現在設定我的 recipes，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 378.24,
          "end": 384.21,
          "en": "just as I did it before in ngOnInit and there I'll change the log to just ngOnInit because we're not",
          "zh": "就像我之前在 ngOnInit 裡做的一樣，而在那裡我會把 log 改成只印 ngOnInit，因為我們不再"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 384.21,
          "end": 394.53,
          "en": "really logging any recipes anymore. If I now save that and we let this app reload, we see ngOnInit,",
          "zh": "真的印出 recipes 了。如果我現在存檔並讓這個 app 重新載入，我們會看到 ngOnInit，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 394.55,
          "end": 399.40999999999997,
          "en": "then we see undefined which is actually output from this console log which makes sense because these",
          "zh": "接著看到 undefined，那其實是這行 console log 的輸出，這很合理，因為這些"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 399.40999999999997,
          "end": 402.32,
          "en": "recipes are undefined at this point of time,",
          "zh": "recipes 在這個時間點還是 undefined，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 402.40999999999997,
          "end": 407.42,
          "en": "we haven't loaded them yet. We load them here in ionViewWillEnter though and therefore we see them",
          "zh": "我們還沒載入它們。不過我們在 ionViewWillEnter 這裡載入它們，因此我們會看到它們"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 407.42,
          "end": 407.95,
          "en": "here",
          "zh": "出現在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 408.17,
          "end": 413.95,
          "en": "and now if I go to spaghetti and I delete them and I therefore am navigated back,",
          "zh": "現在如果我進到 spaghetti、把它們刪除，因此被導覽回上一頁，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 414.14,
          "end": 420.47,
          "en": "they are removed here too because ionViewWillEnter runs again, this in turn now loads our updated",
          "zh": "它們在這裡也會被移除，因為 ionViewWillEnter 又執行了，這就載入了我們更新後的"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 420.47,
          "end": 423.92,
          "en": "recipes and therefore we're all good.",
          "zh": "recipes，因此一切就沒問題了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 423.95,
          "end": 429.56,
          "en": "Now if you're wondering when ngOnDestroy runs, well you can see that in the recipe detail page,",
          "zh": "如果你想知道 ngOnDestroy 什麼時候執行，你可以在 recipe detail 頁面看到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 430.1,
          "end": 440.7,
          "en": "there if I implement onDestroy and I now just copy my lifecycle hooks from the recipes page, all these",
          "zh": "在那裡如果我實作 onDestroy，然後把 recipes 頁面的生命週期 hook 複製過來，所有這些"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 440.7,
          "end": 447.69,
          "en": "lifecycle hooks are now copied over in the recipe detail page, let me add them here and of course I don't",
          "zh": "生命週期 hook 現在都複製到 recipe detail 頁面了，讓我在這裡加入它們，而我當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 447.69,
          "end": 451.08,
          "en": "want to load any recipes in ionViewWillEnter so I'll remove that,",
          "zh": "不想在 ionViewWillEnter 裡載入任何 recipes，所以我會把它移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 451.2,
          "end": 454.4,
          "en": "other than that I'm just logging the lifecycle hook names.",
          "zh": "除此之外，我只是印出這些生命週期 hook 的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 454.68,
          "end": 461.15999999999997,
          "en": "So now with that, let's also log ngOnInit so that we can see when that runs, ngOnInit",
          "zh": "有了這些之後，我們也來 log ngOnInit，這樣就能看到它什麼時候執行，ngOnInit"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 461.15999999999997,
          "end": 462.15,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": "就這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 462.22,
          "end": 470.85,
          "en": "And now if we save this, let's reload, let's clear the console and let's go to Schnitzel, we see",
          "zh": "現在如果我們存檔，重新載入、清掉 console，然後前往 Schnitzel，我們會看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 470.88,
          "end": 471.31,
          "en": "ngOnInit,",
          "zh": "ngOnInit，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 471.32,
          "end": 477.78,
          "en": "ionViewWillLeave, WillEnter, DidEnter, DidLeave and that of course, WillLeave is coming from",
          "zh": "ionViewWillLeave、WillEnter、DidEnter、DidLeave。當然，WillLeave 是來自"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 477.78,
          "end": 482.52,
          "en": "the recipes page, DidLeave is also coming from that and you can see that WillLeave and WillEnter",
          "zh": "recipes 頁面，DidLeave 也是來自那裡，而你可以看到 WillLeave 和 WillEnter"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 482.6,
          "end": 483.23,
          "en": "a line,",
          "zh": "是對齊的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 483.24,
          "end": 489.78,
          "en": "so when WillLeave starts in the old page, WillEnter in a new page and when entering is done",
          "zh": "也就是舊頁面的 WillLeave 開始時，新頁面的 WillEnter 也開始；而當新頁面的進入完成時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 489.78,
          "end": 494.79,
          "en": "in a new page, leaving is done in the old page which makes sense because these hooks basically wait",
          "zh": "舊頁面的離開也完成，這很合理，因為這些 hook 基本上會等"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 494.79,
          "end": 497.29,
          "en": "for the animation to finish.",
          "zh": "動畫結束。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 497.31,
          "end": 504.84,
          "en": "Now if I delete that Schnitzel here, you see ngOnDestroy gets called here too because when the topmost",
          "zh": "現在如果我在這裡刪除那個 Schnitzel，你會看到 ngOnDestroy 在這裡也被呼叫，因為當最頂端的"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 504.84,
          "end": 509.44,
          "en": "page is popped off the stack of pages, it's really gone from that stack of pages,",
          "zh": "頁面被 pop 出頁面堆疊時，它就真的從那個頁面堆疊消失，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 509.49,
          "end": 514.7,
          "en": "it's not hidden by some other page, the page we're going back to is not getting pushed on top,",
          "zh": "它不是被其他頁面隱藏起來，我們要返回的頁面也不是被 push 到最上面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 514.74,
          "end": 520.23,
          "en": "instead the pop page is really removed and what's removed from the stack is removed from the cache you",
          "zh": "而是被 pop 的頁面真的被移除了，而從堆疊移除的東西也就從快取移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 520.23,
          "end": 526.05,
          "en": "could say and therefore ngOnDestroy runs, of course by the way not just when I delete a recipe",
          "zh": "可以這麼說，因此 ngOnDestroy 就會執行。順帶一提，當然不只是在刪除 recipe 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 526.17,
          "end": 532.91,
          "en": "but also when I simply navigate back. So this is this stack of pages and how Ionic caches pages",
          "zh": "當我只是單純返回上一頁時也一樣。這就是這個頁面堆疊，以及 Ionic 如何快取頁面"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 532.91,
          "end": 533.78,
          "en": "for you,",
          "zh": "的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 533.78,
          "end": 535.03,
          "en": "why is this important?",
          "zh": "為什麼這很重要？"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 535.13,
          "end": 541.97,
          "en": "Because you have to be aware of the fact that ngOnInit and ngOnDestroy will not run on every page",
          "zh": "因為你必須知道，ngOnInit 和 ngOnDestroy 不會在每個頁面、"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 542,
          "end": 543.23,
          "en": "every time you leave it,",
          "zh": "每次你離開它時都執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 543.23,
          "end": 548.66,
          "en": "it depends on whether you are popping the page or you're pushing a new page on top of it and therefore",
          "zh": "這取決於你是把頁面 pop 掉，還是把新頁面 push 到它上面，因此"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 548.66,
          "end": 551.61,
          "en": "you should rely on these ionView hooks here",
          "zh": "你應該依靠這裡這些 ionView hook，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 551.66,
          "end": 557.75,
          "en": "if you need to do some state or data updating whenever a page becomes visible or invisible so to say.",
          "zh": "如果你需要在頁面變得可見或不可見時更新一些 state 或資料的話。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727800",
      "title": "Planning the Course Project",
      "lectureOrder": 106,
      "videoOrder": 86,
      "sourceHash": "04686175ba987f0bf890ba56d7448b3eb2d2f4c1cd3a6e5fd0923b69b20dbb77",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.32,
          "end": 8.68,
          "en": "It's now time to change to our main course project because that will be a way bigger app that actually",
          "zh": "現在是時候轉到我們的主要課程專案了，因為那會是大得多的 app，能真正"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.68,
          "end": 10.83,
          "en": "implements all the navigation concepts",
          "zh": "實作所有的導覽概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.84,
          "end": 13.67,
          "en": "I want to show you and for later modules,",
          "zh": "這是我要展示給你看的，而對之後的模組來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.69,
          "end": 20.44,
          "en": "it also allows me to add all these cool features like accessing the device camera and so on which I want",
          "zh": "它也讓我能加入所有這些很酷的功能，例如存取裝置相機等等，這些我都想"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 20.44,
          "end": 21.73,
          "en": "to show you.",
          "zh": "展示給你看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 21.82,
          "end": 23.41,
          "en": "So what are we going to build?",
          "zh": "那我們要打造什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.41,
          "end": 25.99,
          "en": "Well you saw it in the first course module already,",
          "zh": "你在第一堂課程模組已經看過了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.29,
          "end": 33.79,
          "en": "we're going to build that place booking app here, where people can offer their places and you can book",
          "zh": "我們要打造那個場地預訂 app，人們可以在那裡提供自己的場地，而你可以預訂"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 33.79,
          "end": 36.66,
          "en": "other places, a little bit like AirBnB-like",
          "zh": "其他場地，有點像 Airbnb 那樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 36.7,
          "end": 40.62,
          "en": "you could say. Therefore we'll have a couple of different pages,",
          "zh": "可以這麼說。因此我們會有幾個不同的頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 40.66,
          "end": 44.28,
          "en": "we definitely need a page where people can find places.",
          "zh": "我們絕對需要一個讓人們尋找場地的頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 44.34,
          "end": 45.67,
          "en": "Now what can we see on that page?",
          "zh": "那個頁面上會看到什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 45.67,
          "end": 52.78,
          "en": "We can see that we'll have a toolbar with a side menu and we'll also use tabs navigation here where",
          "zh": "我們會看到一個帶有側邊選單的 toolbar，而這裡也會使用 tabs 導覽，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 52.78,
          "end": 58.3,
          "en": "one tab is obviously the tab for finding places. On the page,",
          "zh": "其中一個 tab 當然就是尋找場地的 tab。在頁面上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 58.3,
          "end": 63.75,
          "en": "we then have let's say a featured place and then a list of all the other places you could rent",
          "zh": "我們會有比如說一個精選場地，然後是可以租用的所有其他場地的清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 63.88,
          "end": 69.76,
          "en": "and at the top, I want to have a toggle where you can basically toggle between all places which includes",
          "zh": "而在最上方，我想要一個 toggle，讓你基本上可以在「所有場地」——包含"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 69.76,
          "end": 75.13,
          "en": "the ones you offered and bookable places which only includes the ones that are not offered you by",
          "zh": "你自己提供的那些——與「可預訂場地」——只包含不是由你提供、"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 75.13,
          "end": 77.56,
          "en": "you which are bookable indeed.",
          "zh": "而確實可預訂的那些——之間切換。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 77.56,
          "end": 84.37,
          "en": "Now this is one thing, when you tap on a place let's say place 2 here, we'll be taken to the place detail",
          "zh": "這是一件事。當你點選某個場地，比如說這裡的 place 2，我們就會被帶到 place detail"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 84.37,
          "end": 87.94,
          "en": "page which is now is still on the same stack of pages here,",
          "zh": "頁面，它現在還在同一個頁面堆疊上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 88.09,
          "end": 89.49,
          "en": "just pushed on top of it",
          "zh": "只是被 push 到它上面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 89.5,
          "end": 95.59,
          "en": "so to say and there we see the image and we can see title, maybe a short description, whatever we want",
          "zh": "可以這麼說。在那裡我們會看到圖片，也可以看到標題、也許一段簡短描述，看我們想放什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 95.9,
          "end": 101.68,
          "en": "and we'll have a button that allows us to book that place which will actually open a booking modal and",
          "zh": "而我們會有一個按鈕讓我們預訂那個場地，它其實會開啟一個 booking modal，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 101.68,
          "end": 108.43,
          "en": "a modal is basically an overlay not pushed on top of the page stack but instead simply a visual overlay",
          "zh": "而 modal 基本上是一個 overlay，不是被 push 到頁面堆疊上，而只是單純在"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 108.43,
          "end": 113.11,
          "en": "on the current page and you'll learn how to open such a modal in this module as well.",
          "zh": "當前頁面上的視覺覆蓋層，你在本模組也會學到如何開啟這樣的 modal。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 114.45,
          "end": 121.35,
          "en": "Then thereafter, we'll not just have the places area where we can view and book places, we'll also be",
          "zh": "接著，我們不只有可以瀏覽和預訂場地的 places 區域，我們也會"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 121.35,
          "end": 124.71,
          "en": "able to offer places and that will be our other tab.",
          "zh": "能提供場地，那就是我們的另一個 tab。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 124.71,
          "end": 130.11,
          "en": "So in the tab navigation at the bottom, one tab is for viewing places we can book or we want to book",
          "zh": "所以在底部的 tab 導覽中，一個 tab 是用來瀏覽我們可以預訂或想預訂的場地，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 130.2,
          "end": 132.98,
          "en": "and the other tab is for offering our own places.",
          "zh": "另一個 tab 則是用來提供我們自己的場地。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 133.02,
          "end": 138.98,
          "en": "There we'll also have that top bar where we can bring in the side drawer and we'll have an",
          "zh": "在那裡我們也會有那個 top bar，可以叫出 side drawer，我們也會有一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 138.99,
          "end": 144.9,
          "en": "add new place I can which we can tap to get into the mode of adding a new place,",
          "zh": "add new place 圖示，我們可以點它進入新增場地的模式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 144.93,
          "end": 148.71,
          "en": "more on that later. If we tap one of the places we offered here,",
          "zh": "這部分之後再說。如果我們點選自己提供過的其中一個場地，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 148.71,
          "end": 150.27,
          "en": "we'll see the offer details,",
          "zh": "就會看到 offer details，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 150.32999999999998,
          "end": 156.78,
          "en": "so again that is then pushed on top of that stack of pages where we can see who booked our places or we",
          "zh": "同樣地它會被 push 到那個頁面堆疊上，在那裡我們可以看到誰預訂了我們的場地，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 156.78,
          "end": 160.21,
          "en": "see basically the bookings for this place we offered.",
          "zh": "也就是看到我們提供的那個場地的預訂紀錄。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 160.21,
          "end": 162.09,
          "en": "Now that's not all, on that offer page",
          "zh": "這還不是全部。在那個 offer 頁面上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 162.09,
          "end": 167.74,
          "en": "as I mentioned, we can press that plus button and that will take us to the new offer page. By the way,",
          "zh": "如我所說，我們可以按那個加號按鈕，這會帶我們到 new offer 頁面。順帶一提，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 167.82,
          "end": 175.56,
          "en": "we'll also implement ways of editing existing offers, so existing places we're offering and when we're",
          "zh": "我們也會實作編輯現有 offer 的方式，也就是我們正在提供的現有場地；而當我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 175.56,
          "end": 181.83,
          "en": "talking about bookings which we can go to from the side menu, there we'll have a link to go to the our",
          "zh": "談到預訂——我們可以從側邊選單前往——那裡會有連結可以到我們的"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 181.83,
          "end": 187.87,
          "en": "bookings page where we now don't see the bookings of places we offered but bookings we made for other",
          "zh": "bookings 頁面，在那裡我們看到的不是自己提供場地的預訂，而是我們對其他"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 187.87,
          "end": 193.51,
          "en": "places. On that page, we'll also be able to swipe our bookings to remove them.",
          "zh": "場地所做的預訂。在那個頁面上，我們也可以滑動我們的預訂來刪除它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 193.56,
          "end": 198.84,
          "en": "And last but not least, we'll also have an authentication screen which is basically controlled with a",
          "zh": "最後但同樣重要的是，我們也會有一個身分驗證畫面，它基本上由一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 198.84,
          "end": 204.24,
          "en": "guard whether we see that or the other screens which we see if we're not logged in, where we then have to login",
          "zh": "guard 控制我們會看到它還是其他畫面；如果我們沒登入就會看到它，在那裡我們必須登入"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 204.24,
          "end": 207.16,
          "en": "first to go to all the other pages.",
          "zh": "才能前往所有其他頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 207.18,
          "end": 211.82999999999998,
          "en": "That is the rough setup, now we'll not add all the functionality in this module,",
          "zh": "這就是大致的架構。我們不會在本模組加入所有功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 211.82999999999998,
          "end": 218.28,
          "en": "otherwise this module will take like 15 hours or something like that. We'll add all these different pages",
          "zh": "否則這個模組會花上大概 15 小時之類的。我們會加入所有這些不同的頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 218.61,
          "end": 224.55,
          "en": "and we'll add the navigation concepts to go around. The content on the pages will then be added",
          "zh": "也會加入用來四處移動的導覽概念。頁面上的內容則會"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 224.55,
          "end": 230.85,
          "en": "step-by-step with the other modules where we will learn things like fetching user input, accessing the device",
          "zh": "隨著其他模組逐步加入，我們會學到取得使用者輸入、存取裝置"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 230.85,
          "end": 237.39,
          "en": "camera, loading data in different formats, working with a back-end server and so on.",
          "zh": "相機、載入不同格式的資料、與後端伺服器協作等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 237.39,
          "end": 243.06,
          "en": "So let's now start with setting up the project and with actually creating our page structure and adding",
          "zh": "那我們現在就從設定專案開始，實際建立我們的頁面結構並加入"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 243.06,
          "end": 244.59,
          "en": "the different types of navigation.",
          "zh": "不同類型的導覽。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727804",
      "title": "Creating Our App Pages",
      "lectureOrder": 107,
      "videoOrder": 87,
      "sourceHash": "036476151b2b3bfd82a967ef50c78a56a2b7f40770f9b6509d7a2d02cd819a02",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.09,
          "end": 7.1,
          "en": "So regarding that new project, I will actually continue with the one I have here, but you can, of",
          "zh": "關於那個新專案，我其實會繼續用我現在這裡的這個，不過你當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.1,
          "end": 9.85,
          "en": "course, create a new one with the ionic start command.",
          "zh": "也可以用 ionic start 指令建立一個新的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.22,
          "end": 15.16,
          "en": "What I'll do here is ultimately get rid of my recipes folder here.",
          "zh": "我在這裡最後要做的就是把我這個 recipes 資料夾移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 15.71,
          "end": 16.88,
          "en": "I don't need that anymore.",
          "zh": "我不再需要它了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.03,
          "end": 18.98,
          "en": "And then I'll generate new pages.",
          "zh": "接著我會產生新的 page。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.01,
          "end": 23.04,
          "en": "And of course, I have to adjust my routing here and so on.",
          "zh": "當然，我還得調整這裡的 routing 等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.57,
          "end": 29.59,
          "en": "So let's start with generating new pages and we can do that with the ionic generate page command.",
          "zh": "那我們就從產生新的 page 開始，這可以用 ionic generate page 指令來做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 29.93,
          "end": 31.67,
          "en": "Now, which pages do we need?",
          "zh": "那麼，我們需要哪些 page 呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 32.06,
          "end": 33.68,
          "en": "We need a bunch of pages, obviously.",
          "zh": "很明顯地，我們需要一堆 page。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 34.07,
          "end": 37.56,
          "en": "We'll certainly need an off page and I'll just name it all.",
          "zh": "我們一定會需要一個 auth page，我就把它命名為 auth。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.61,
          "end": 43.37,
          "en": "That will be our off screen, which we see when we start app for the first time when we haven't locked",
          "zh": "那會是我們的登入畫面，也就是我們第一次啟動 app、還沒登入時"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 43.37,
          "end": 43.81,
          "en": "in yet.",
          "zh": "看到的畫面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.36,
          "end": 45.17,
          "en": "So let me run.",
          "zh": "那我就來執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.17,
          "end": 53.06,
          "en": "I want to generate page off here and this will now give us a new off folder and we'll add that off route",
          "zh": "我要在這裡產生 auth page，這會給我們一個新的 auth 資料夾，接著我們會把這個 auth route"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 53.06,
          "end": 54.68,
          "en": "to our app routing module.",
          "zh": "加到我們的 app routing module。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 55.25,
          "end": 59.69,
          "en": "Speaking of that, I can, of course, already delete that whole recipe's routing stuff here.",
          "zh": "說到這個，我當然已經可以把這裡那一整組 recipe 的 routing 東西刪掉了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 60.83,
          "end": 68.33,
          "en": "Now, one important note at this point, depending on the version of Ionic you're using, what was generated",
          "zh": "現在，這裡有個重點：取決於你使用的 Ionic 版本，產生在"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 68.33,
          "end": 71.47,
          "en": "in the app routing file might also look like this.",
          "zh": "app routing 檔案裡的內容可能也會長得像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 71.78,
          "end": 74.72,
          "en": "So the lazy loading syntax changed a bit.",
          "zh": "也就是說，lazy loading 的語法稍微改變了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 74.91,
          "end": 81.2,
          "en": "Instead of having one long string here, you now have this function which in its body calls the import",
          "zh": "這裡不再是一個長字串，而是現在有這樣一個函式，它在函式主體中呼叫 import"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 81.2,
          "end": 87.83,
          "en": "function, then points at the module and then resolves the to be important class like this.",
          "zh": "函式，接著指向 module，然後像這樣解析出要匯入的 class。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 88.37,
          "end": 91.9,
          "en": "Now, if that's the case, you can definitely keep this syntax.",
          "zh": "如果情況是這樣，你當然可以保留這個語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 91.91,
          "end": 95.65,
          "en": "So keep the syntax that is generated by the ionic generate command.",
          "zh": "也就是說，保留 ionic generate 指令所產生的語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 95.93,
          "end": 101.72,
          "en": "You don't need to adapt the one shown in the videos, even though that should also still work.",
          "zh": "你不需要改成影片中示範的那一種，雖然那一種應該也還是可以運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 101.75,
          "end": 104.18,
          "en": "It's just a different syntax dis generated.",
          "zh": "只是產生出來的語法不同而已。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 104.18,
          "end": 106.52000000000001,
          "en": "One, however, is the one I recommend that you keep.",
          "zh": "不過，我建議你保留其中一種就好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 106.91,
          "end": 113.6,
          "en": "Also important if you have a look at the folder and compare this to what you see in the lectures, you",
          "zh": "同樣重要的是，如果你看一下資料夾，並把它跟你在講座中看到的做比較，你"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 113.6,
          "end": 117.95,
          "en": "will note that there is an extra file that was generated here.",
          "zh": "會注意到這裡多產生了一個檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 118.34,
          "end": 125.06,
          "en": "In the lectures you see five files were generated, the off page, the off page testing file, Dolf",
          "zh": "在講座中你會看到產生了五個檔案：auth page、auth page 的測試檔、auth"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 125.06,
          "end": 129.56,
          "en": "page styling file, the off page template and the of module.",
          "zh": "page 的樣式檔、auth page 的 template，以及 auth module。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 129.89,
          "end": 135.67,
          "en": "Now in your folder you will probably also see the of routing module file.",
          "zh": "而在你的資料夾裡，你大概還會看到 auth routing module 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 135.86,
          "end": 142.97,
          "en": "Now in the end, the alpha routing module file and the of module file combined are just what's all in",
          "zh": "最後，auth routing module 檔案和 auth module 檔案合起來，其實就等於"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 142.97,
          "end": 146.3,
          "en": "my signal of module file you see in the videos.",
          "zh": "你在影片中看到的那個單一 auth module 檔案裡的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 146.69,
          "end": 148.34,
          "en": "So nothing changed there.",
          "zh": "所以那裡並沒有改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 148.34,
          "end": 154.57999999999998,
          "en": "It's just split across two files and in a lecture after this lecture, you will also find this all in",
          "zh": "只是被拆成兩個檔案，而在這堂講座之後的一堂講座中，你也會看到這一切"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 154.57999999999998,
          "end": 159.05,
          "en": "written form so that you can digest it there in case it's unclear what I mean.",
          "zh": "以文字形式呈現，讓你可以好好消化，以防你不清楚我的意思。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 159.26,
          "end": 162.05,
          "en": "So long story short, what's generated is fine.",
          "zh": "所以長話短說，產生出來的內容沒問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 162.05,
          "end": 163.43,
          "en": "Keep what's generated.",
          "zh": "保留產生出來的內容就好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 163.61,
          "end": 166.7,
          "en": "Also what was generated here in the app routing module.",
          "zh": "還有這裡在 app routing module 中產生出來的內容也一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 167.03,
          "end": 169.25,
          "en": "What I show you is still holds, though.",
          "zh": "不過，我示範給你看的內容仍然成立。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 169.25,
          "end": 174.74,
          "en": "So how we interact with those pages, how we set up taps ends on this all still holds.",
          "zh": "所以我們如何與那些 page 互動、我們如何設定 tabs，這些全都仍然成立。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 174.92000000000002,
          "end": 181.85,
          "en": "It's just that you have one extra file because content was split across files and that this lazy loading",
          "zh": "只是你多了一個檔案，因為內容被拆到不同檔案，而且這個 lazy loading"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 181.85,
          "end": 183.32,
          "en": "syntax changed slightly.",
          "zh": "語法稍微改變了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 183.32,
          "end": 183.95,
          "en": "That's all.",
          "zh": "就這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 183.95,
          "end": 185.72,
          "en": "The rest is entirely the same.",
          "zh": "其餘的部分完全相同。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 185.72,
          "end": 186.89,
          "en": "Ionic hasn't changed.",
          "zh": "Ionic 並沒有改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 186.89,
          "end": 188.57,
          "en": "You write your app in the same way.",
          "zh": "你還是用同樣的方式寫你的 app。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 189.86,
          "end": 191.88,
          "en": "So that's the off route, the off page.",
          "zh": "所以那就是 auth route、auth page。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 192.23,
          "end": 198.77,
          "en": "We're not done with that, of course, we will also have a place as area in this app and you can name",
          "zh": "當然，我們還沒做完，這個 app 裡也會有一個 places 區域，你可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 198.77,
          "end": 199.52,
          "en": "it whatever you want.",
          "zh": "隨意在命名。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 199.52,
          "end": 205.73,
          "en": "But with that, I mean the area where we can view all the places we can book as well as offer new places.",
          "zh": "但我指的是我們可以查看所有可預訂地點，以及提供新地點的那個區域。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 206.36,
          "end": 212.54,
          "en": "And therefore, what I want to have here is definitely some places page, which will actually later",
          "zh": "因此，我這裡一定要有的就是一個 places page，它之後實際上"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 212.54,
          "end": 213.71,
          "en": "hold our taps.",
          "zh": "會裝我們的 tabs。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 214.89,
          "end": 219.54,
          "en": "And inside of that place is folder, and therefore I'll repeat the command, but now add a slash and",
          "zh": "而在那個 places 資料夾裡面，所以我會重複同樣的指令，但這次加上一個斜線，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 219.54,
          "end": 225.96,
          "en": "then a subfolder, a subcomponent I want to create, so to say, I want a half, let's say a search",
          "zh": "然後加上我想建立的子資料夾、子元件，可以這麼說，我想要一個，比如說 search"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 226.29,
          "end": 229.5,
          "en": "or find or whatever you want to call it.",
          "zh": "或 find 或任何你想叫的名字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 229.5,
          "end": 232.16,
          "en": "I'll name it search page.",
          "zh": "我會把它命名為 search page。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 232.17000000000002,
          "end": 236.51,
          "en": "And that is basically the page which allows us to search or find new pages.",
          "zh": "那基本上就是讓我們搜尋或尋找新 page 的 page。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 236.64,
          "end": 238.65,
          "en": "Well, actually will not add a search bar.",
          "zh": "嗯，其實我們不會加搜尋列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 238.77,
          "end": 240.96,
          "en": "So let's maybe call it.",
          "zh": "所以我們也許就叫它"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 241.87,
          "end": 248.2,
          "en": "Discover that sounds good, so we'll have our discover area here where we can discover places we can",
          "zh": "discover 吧，聽起來不錯，這樣我們這裡就會有一個 discover 區域，可以在裡面探索我們能"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 248.2,
          "end": 254.15,
          "en": "book, and in order to be able to discover something, people need to be able to offer places and therefore",
          "zh": "預訂的地點；而要能夠探索些什麼，人們必須能夠提供地點，因此"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 254.17,
          "end": 255.53,
          "en": "still in that places.",
          "zh": "仍然在那個 places"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 255.76,
          "end": 257.35,
          "en": "Future area of our app.",
          "zh": "未來區域裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 257.59,
          "end": 264.22,
          "en": "I'll add my offers subfolder and component and page, and that will basically discover tab where we",
          "zh": "我會加上 offers 子資料夾、元件和 page，那基本上就是 discover tab，我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 264.22,
          "end": 266.83,
          "en": "can create a new page and see our offers.",
          "zh": "可以在那裡建立新 page 並查看我們的 offers。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 267.89,
          "end": 274.46,
          "en": "Speaking of that, well, in our officers area, as I mentioned, we have to be able to create a new",
          "zh": "說到這個，嗯，在我們的 offers 區域裡，就像我提到的，我們必須能夠建立新的"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 274.46,
          "end": 274.97,
          "en": "offer.",
          "zh": "offer。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 275.24,
          "end": 284.6,
          "en": "So as a never subfolder here in the places offers area, I'll add New Dasch offer as a new page, which",
          "zh": "所以在 places offers 區域裡的一個新子資料夾中，我會把 new-offer 加為一個新 page，它現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 284.75,
          "end": 288.46,
          "en": "will now be generated inside of places offers.",
          "zh": "會被產生在 places/offers 裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 288.47,
          "end": 291.17,
          "en": "And here it is, the new offer.",
          "zh": "它就在這裡，這個 new offer。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 291.32,
          "end": 296.27,
          "en": "And that is basically where we will be able to enter the data for a new place we want to offer.",
          "zh": "那基本上就是我們可以輸入想要提供的新地點資料的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 296.48,
          "end": 302.51,
          "en": "There will also later include capabilities to interact with the device, camera and so on.",
          "zh": "之後那裡也會包含與裝置互動、相機等等的功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 303.23,
          "end": 304.82,
          "en": "Offering new places is nice.",
          "zh": "提供新地點很棒。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 304.85,
          "end": 312.65,
          "en": "We also want to be able to edit our offerings, so I'll add an added offer, a place to next to new",
          "zh": "我們也希望能夠編輯自己提供的地點，所以我會在 new"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 312.65,
          "end": 313.07,
          "en": "offers.",
          "zh": "offer 旁邊加上一個 edit offer 的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 313.07,
          "end": 316.94,
          "en": "So as a sibling to new offer, we now have the added offer folder there.",
          "zh": "所以作為 new offer 的同層項目，我們現在那裡有了一個 edit offer 資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 317.12,
          "end": 319.71,
          "en": "That will be our page for, well, editing offers.",
          "zh": "那會是我們用來編輯 offers 的 page。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 320.72,
          "end": 322.25,
          "en": "Now we're getting there.",
          "zh": "我們快完成了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 322.85,
          "end": 324.44,
          "en": "We're done with the offers for now.",
          "zh": "offers 的部分暫時做完了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 324.44,
          "end": 328.06,
          "en": "But in our places we have that discover area.",
          "zh": "但在我們的 places 裡有那個 discover 區域。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 328.07,
          "end": 328.29,
          "en": "Right?",
          "zh": "對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 328.31,
          "end": 331.95,
          "en": "So we created that discoverer's subfolder already.",
          "zh": "所以我們已經建立了那個 discover 子資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 332.33,
          "end": 336.29,
          "en": "Now, that would be the page where we can see all the places we can book.",
          "zh": "那會是我們可以查看所有可預訂地點的 page。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 336.71,
          "end": 340.06,
          "en": "Now, when we tap on one of these places, we want to see the details.",
          "zh": "而當我們點選其中一個地點時，我們會想看到詳細資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 340.4,
          "end": 347.23,
          "en": "So here I'll add a place to detail component or page nested in my Discover folder.",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我會在 discover 資料夾裡嵌套加入一個 place detail 元件或 page。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 347.99,
          "end": 353.18,
          "en": "And as you can already see, I am basically replicating the structure as we will have it in our.",
          "zh": "如你已經看到的，我基本上是在複製我們之後會有的結構，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 353.18,
          "end": 357.47,
          "en": "You are all you could say in that folder here too, in that project folder.",
          "zh": "可以說在我們那個資料夾裡也是這樣，在那個專案資料夾裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 357.56,
          "end": 364.07,
          "en": "And that is a pattern you commonly use and see when building angular projects, no matter with or without",
          "zh": "這是你在建立 Angular 專案時經常使用和看到的模式，不論有沒有"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 364.25,
          "end": 364.85,
          "en": "ionic.",
          "zh": "用 Ionic。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 366.54,
          "end": 368.38,
          "en": "So that sounds pretty good.",
          "zh": "所以這聽起來很不錯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 368.4,
          "end": 372.78,
          "en": "We're able to find places, offer places, what's missing?",
          "zh": "我們能夠尋找地點、提供地點，還缺什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 373.26,
          "end": 376.28,
          "en": "Well, we also want to be able to see bookings with that.",
          "zh": "嗯，我們還希望能查看預訂紀錄。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 376.29,
          "end": 381.96,
          "en": "I mean, both bookings for places we offered, as well as our own bookings now for places we offered.",
          "zh": "我指的是，我們提供的地點的預訂，以及我們自己對所提供地點的預訂。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 381.99,
          "end": 387.66,
          "en": "I'll go back to places, offers and then there next to edit offer a new offer.",
          "zh": "我會回到 places、offers，然後在那裡 edit offer 旁邊的 new offer 旁，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 388.03,
          "end": 395.58,
          "en": "I want to have my place bookings component, let's say, and you can say or let's name it, offer bookings",
          "zh": "我想要有我的 place bookings 元件，比如說，你也可以叫它、我們就命名為 offer bookings，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 395.58,
          "end": 396.3,
          "en": "to be in line.",
          "zh": "以保持一致。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 398.2,
          "end": 403.06,
          "en": "Offer bookings, you can name this whatever you want, of course, so offer bookings will be a page",
          "zh": "offer bookings，你當然可以隨意命名，所以 offer bookings 會是一個 page，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 403.06,
          "end": 405.12,
          "en": "who can go to from our offers page.",
          "zh": "可以從我們的 offers page 前往。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 405.61,
          "end": 412.63,
          "en": "But we also have the bookings we made ourselves and that will now actually be a sibling to places because",
          "zh": "但我們自己做的預訂也是有的，而那現在實際上會是 places 的同層項目，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 412.63,
          "end": 414.1,
          "en": "it's not nested in there.",
          "zh": "它並不是嵌套在裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 414.1,
          "end": 415.51,
          "en": "It's not the same tab.",
          "zh": "它不是同一個 tab。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 415.51,
          "end": 419.29,
          "en": "Navigation instead will be able to reach dad via our sites.",
          "zh": "相反地，導覽上我們之後可以透過我們的網站"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 419.29,
          "end": 420.05,
          "en": "Draw later.",
          "zh": "抵達那裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 420.4,
          "end": 426.43,
          "en": "So here, I'll just add my bookings page, which I then want to be able to well, load and view.",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我會直接加上我的 bookings page，之後就能載入和查看它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 427.15,
          "end": 428.32,
          "en": "And that's it for now.",
          "zh": "目前就這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 428.32,
          "end": 430.45,
          "en": "If we need more pages later, we can add them.",
          "zh": "如果之後需要更多 page，我們再加就好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 430.45,
          "end": 436.18,
          "en": "We already added a bunch of places, feel free to post a video and go through the folder structure and",
          "zh": "我們已經加了一堆 places，歡迎暫停影片，去看看資料夾結構，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 436.18,
          "end": 443.83,
          "en": "compare it with the slides I attached to this module where I lay out the project structure so that you",
          "zh": "並把它跟我在這個模組附加的投影片做比較，我在裡面列出了專案結構，讓你"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 443.83,
          "end": 448.47,
          "en": "get a feeling for which folder, which page belongs to which item on the slides.",
          "zh": "感受一下哪個資料夾、哪個 page 對應投影片上的哪個項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 448.96,
          "end": 451,
          "en": "And once you're done with that, let's continue.",
          "zh": "做完之後，我們就繼續。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 451,
          "end": 456.04,
          "en": "Let's update our routing configuration here, which is not in the format I want it to be.",
          "zh": "我們來更新這裡的 routing 設定，它現在不是我想要的格式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 456.34000000000003,
          "end": 462.28,
          "en": "And let's, of course, make sure that we also display things like taps and so on.",
          "zh": "當然，也要確保我們能顯示 tabs 之類的東西。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727810",
      "title": "Adjusting Our Main Routing Configuration",
      "lectureOrder": 109,
      "videoOrder": 88,
      "sourceHash": "9f755561a7915f91ff4c6cbfb5eeff7acc6bb31f2732c464714ac12d3f56a391",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 8.13,
          "en": "Now that we learn how this project should look like in the end and that we prepared all these pages,",
          "zh": "現在我們已經知道這個專案最後應該長什麼樣子，也準備好了所有這些 page，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.13,
          "end": 12.6,
          "en": "let's first of all start by adjusting this main routing configuration.",
          "zh": "我們先從調整這個主要的 routing 設定開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 12.6,
          "end": 15.93,
          "en": "I don't want to have all these routes as root routes like this,",
          "zh": "我不想要把所有這些 route 都像這樣當成根 route，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 16.38,
          "end": 22.8,
          "en": "instead I only want to have the root routes here which really are a kind of top level routes and",
          "zh": "相反地，我這裡只想留下真正屬於某種頂層 route 的根 route，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 22.8,
          "end": 29.21,
          "en": "that would be auth which obviously is something we load as a first route in case we never logged in.",
          "zh": "那會是 auth，顯然它是我們從未登入時會載入的第一個 route。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 29.25,
          "end": 34.02,
          "en": "I want to have my places there which will then be the page with the tabs and where I then set up its",
          "zh": "我這裡想要有我的 places，它之後會是帶有 tabs 的 page，然後我會在裡面設定它"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 34.02,
          "end": 35.3,
          "en": "own routing",
          "zh": "自己的 routing；"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 35.58,
          "end": 41.16,
          "en": "and I want to have my bookings here as a top level route too because that is not a nested route inside",
          "zh": "我也想要把我的 bookings 放在這裡當作頂層 route，因為它不是 places 裡面"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 41.16,
          "end": 42.68,
          "en": "of places or anything like that,",
          "zh": "嵌套的 route 或之類的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 42.69,
          "end": 47.83,
          "en": "it is a sibling to places logically. All these other routes are not needed here,",
          "zh": "它在邏輯上是 places 的同層項目。所有其他這些 route 這裡都不需要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 47.85,
          "end": 51.79,
          "en": "I don't want to set them up as top level routes and therefore I'll delete them.",
          "zh": "我不想把它們設成頂層 route，所以我會把它們刪掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 51.99,
          "end": 57.19,
          "en": "And here as a default when we're logging in, for now I will redirect to places here, later we'll add",
          "zh": "而這裡作為預設，當我們登入時，目前我會重新導向到 places，之後我們會在這裡加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 57.19,
          "end": 63.03,
          "en": "an auth guard here and find out whether we are allowed to visit the places and if we're not authenticated,",
          "zh": "一個 auth guard，判斷我們是否被允許造訪 places，如果我們沒有通過身分驗證，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 63.03,
          "end": 63.98,
          "en": "we'll redirect to auth",
          "zh": "就會重新導向到 auth，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 64.01,
          "end": 65.84,
          "en": "but that's something we'll do later, for now",
          "zh": "但那是之後才會做的事，目前"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 65.85,
          "end": 67.92,
          "en": "let's redirect to places.",
          "zh": "我們先重新導向到 places。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 67.98,
          "end": 70.41,
          "en": "So that is my top level configuration",
          "zh": "這就是我的頂層設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 70.41,
          "end": 78.33,
          "en": "and with that, when we run Ionic serve, we should load that places module here obviously and that places",
          "zh": "如此一來，當我們執行 Ionic serve 時，我們顯然應該載入這裡的 places module，而那個 places"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 78.42,
          "end": 82.86,
          "en": "module basically is responsible for rendering the places page,",
          "zh": "module 基本上負責 render places page，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 82.86,
          "end": 90.38,
          "en": "so what we should see in the end is this places page with the title of just places here. And we do,",
          "zh": "所以我們最後應該會看到這個標題只是 places 的 places page。而我們確實看到了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 90.43,
          "end": 92.02000000000001,
          "en": "here it is,",
          "zh": "它就在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 92.02000000000001,
          "end": 96.08,
          "en": "that is our places page. That's the route configuration adjusted,",
          "zh": "那就是我們的 places page。這樣 route 設定就調整好了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 96.08,
          "end": 104.09,
          "en": "now in the places page, I don't want to start setting up anything too fancy, I'll just fix the title, instead",
          "zh": "現在在 places page 裡，我不想要開始設定太花俏的東西，我只會修一下標題，相反地，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 104.15,
          "end": 110.42,
          "en": "I want to dive right into tabs and explain how you can add tabs to have a tab bar which then allows",
          "zh": "我想要直接深入 tabs，說明你可以如何加入 tabs，做出一個 tab bar，讓你"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 110.42,
          "end": 116.72999999999999,
          "en": "you to switch between the find a place or discover a place and offer a place",
          "zh": "可以在 find a place 或 discover a place 以及 offer a place"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 116.75,
          "end": 117.28999999999999,
          "en": "page.",
          "zh": "page 之間切換。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727812",
      "title": "Understanding Ionic Tabs",
      "lectureOrder": 110,
      "videoOrder": 89,
      "sourceHash": "55cd6ad86e816aa3860f550ac3b9cbd3c1f28a4a7c7472fd2de5c4d435d440ef",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.23,
          "end": 9.17,
          "en": "So let's add some tabs to the places page now. Tabs are a common navigation concept you see in mobile",
          "zh": "那我們現在就為 places page 加一些 tabs。tabs 是你在行動 app 中常見的導覽概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 9.17,
          "end": 15.02,
          "en": "apps, you can of course use them on web apps just as well but you especially see them in mobile apps",
          "zh": "你當然也可以在網頁 app 中照樣使用它們，但你尤其是在行動 app 中會看到它們，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 15.98,
          "end": 21.2,
          "en": "and tabs basically allow you to, well press the different tabs in the bottom tab bar and then load different",
          "zh": "而 tabs 基本上讓你按下底部 tab bar 中不同的 tab，然後根據你按下的 tab"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 21.2,
          "end": 23.51,
          "en": "pages based on which tab you pressed.",
          "zh": "載入不同的 page。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 23.57,
          "end": 29.51,
          "en": "One important takeaway is that you will have separate navigation page stacks and that just means that",
          "zh": "一個重要的重點是，你會有各自獨立的導覽 page stack，這意思就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 29.84,
          "end": 35.78,
          "en": "when you are in tab one, so on the left side here and there let's say you have a button which takes you",
          "zh": "當你在第一個 tab，也就是左邊這裡，那裡比如說有一個按鈕帶你"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 35.81,
          "end": 42.08,
          "en": "to some child page and you go there and then you press the other tab without going back first, then on",
          "zh": "到某個子 page，你去了那裡，然後你沒有先返回就按下另一個 tab，那麼在"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 42.08,
          "end": 48.95,
          "en": "the other tab, you also go to let's say a child page and another child page, so you have three pages",
          "zh": "另一個 tab 上，你也去了比如說一個子 page 和另一個子 page，所以右邊 tab 的 page stack"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 48.95,
          "end": 53.84,
          "en": "on the page stack on the right tab and two pages on the page stack in the left",
          "zh": "上有三個 page，而左邊 tab 的 page stack 上有兩個"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 53.84,
          "end": 59.87,
          "en": "tab. If you then go back from the right tab to the left tab, you'll go back to that previous page stack",
          "zh": "page。如果你接著從右邊的 tab 返回左邊的 tab，你會回到先前那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 59.87,
          "end": 60.79,
          "en": "with the two pages",
          "zh": "有兩個 page 的 page stack，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 60.83,
          "end": 64.43,
          "en": "and if you go back to the second tab, you'll go back to that stack page.",
          "zh": "而如果你回到第二個 tab，你會回到那個 stack page。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 64.43,
          "end": 71.51,
          "en": "So the separate page stacks are kept around and are separated from each other so they don't mix or anything",
          "zh": "所以這些各自獨立的 page stack 會被保留下來，而且彼此分開，不會混在一起之類的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 71.51,
          "end": 72.26,
          "en": "like that and",
          "zh": "而"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 72.35,
          "end": 78.83,
          "en": "that of course is very useful for making sure that navigation is stored and users don't reset their",
          "zh": "這當然非常有用，可以確保導覽狀態被保存下來，使用者不會因為使用 tabs"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 78.83,
          "end": 84.23,
          "en": "navigation by using tabs which would be a strange user experience.",
          "zh": "而重置自己的導覽，那會是很奇怪的使用者體驗。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 84.23,
          "end": 87.41,
          "en": "So how do we implement the tabs into our application then?",
          "zh": "那麼，我們要如何把 tabs 實作到我們的應用程式裡呢？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727816",
      "title": "Adding Tabs to the App",
      "lectureOrder": 111,
      "videoOrder": 90,
      "sourceHash": "33d8785d746018f22720e5a10add5c6df0d79bf2083ba72c1def10c9fe432252",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.21,
          "end": 9.17,
          "en": "As always the official docs are a great place to learn all about tabs, there on the bottom of that components",
          "zh": "一如往常，官方文件是學習 tabs 一切相關知識的好地方，在那些元件的"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 9.38,
          "end": 12.02,
          "en": "documentation you find the ion-tabs element.",
          "zh": "文件底部，你會找到 ion-tabs 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 12.14,
          "end": 16.79,
          "en": "Now it is worth pointing out that you use them a little bit different when working with Angular than",
          "zh": "這裡值得指出的是，在 Angular 中使用它們的方式與這裡文件記載的"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 16.79,
          "end": 22.7,
          "en": "it's documented here and I'll explain you how you work with it but the general idea is the same.",
          "zh": "稍有不同，我會說明你可以怎麼使用它，但整體概念是一樣的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 22.7,
          "end": 24.56,
          "en": "So how do you work with tabs then?",
          "zh": "那麼你要如何使用 tabs 呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 26.26,
          "end": 30.25,
          "en": "First of all, let me get rid of the padding so that we don't have any extra padding on the page,",
          "zh": "首先，讓我把 padding 拿掉，這樣 page 上就不會有任何多餘的 padding，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 30.25,
          "end": 37,
          "en": "I don't need that and then you add tabs by adding that ion-tabs component, that is your wrapper around",
          "zh": "我不需要它，接著你透過加入那個 ion-tabs 元件來加入 tabs，那是包住你"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 37,
          "end": 39.94,
          "en": "your entire tabbing logic.",
          "zh": "整個 tab 邏輯的外層容器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 39.94,
          "end": 46,
          "en": "Then you need to add an ion-tab bar and that basically allows you to define which buttons you want to",
          "zh": "然後你需要加入一個 ion-tab-bar，它基本上讓你定義你想要有哪些按鈕、"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 46,
          "end": 54.43,
          "en": "have, which actual tabs with which text and which icons you want to have. That ion-tab bar must receive",
          "zh": "哪些實際的 tab、搭配什麼文字和什麼圖示。那個 ion-tab-bar 必須加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 54.88,
          "end": 62.29,
          "en": "a slot of bottom here so that it's correctly positioned at the bottom of the page. Inside of the ion",
          "zh": "一個 bottom 的 slot，才能正確定位在 page 底部。在 ion"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 62.29,
          "end": 63.33,
          "en": "tab bar,",
          "zh": "tab bar 裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 63.34,
          "end": 69.25,
          "en": "you then add your ion-tab button components which allow you to set up the different buttons in",
          "zh": "你接著加入你的 ion-tab-button 元件，它們讓你設定 tab bar 中"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 69.25,
          "end": 76.3,
          "en": "your tab bar and each tab button needs to get a unique identifier which you assign with the tab attribute",
          "zh": "不同的按鈕，而每個 tab button 都需要一個唯一的識別碼，你用 tab 屬性來指定它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 76.87,
          "end": 80.88,
          "en": "and in our case with the places, we'll have let's say discover",
          "zh": "在我們的 places 這個例子中，我們會有比如說 discover，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 80.89,
          "end": 88.9,
          "en": "but you can choose whatever you want here and I'll also add my second tab button and there I'll add",
          "zh": "但這裡你可以選擇任何你想要的，我也會加上我的第二個 tab button，在那裡我會加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 89.23,
          "end": 92.65,
          "en": "a tab attribute with a value of offers,",
          "zh": "一個 tab 屬性，值為 offers，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 92.65,
          "end": 94.17,
          "en": "again this is totally up to you.",
          "zh": "同樣地，這完全取決於你。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 95.38,
          "end": 102.97,
          "en": "Now you can add text and or icons to your tabs and I'll add both, you add text by adding a ion label",
          "zh": "現在你可以為 tabs 加上文字和／或圖示，我會兩者都加，你透過加入一個 ion-label 來加文字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 103.53999999999999,
          "end": 110.50999999999999,
          "en": "and then in between you just enter whichever text you want to display, like discover.",
          "zh": "然後在中間直接輸入你想顯示的任何文字，例如 discover。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 110.64,
          "end": 119.82,
          "en": "You can also then add an ion icon and here I'll use a name of search which should give us a nice search",
          "zh": "你也可以接著加上一個 ion-icon，這裡我會用 search 這個名稱，它應該會給我們一個漂亮的搜尋"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 120,
          "end": 123.85,
          "en": "icon. For the second tab,",
          "zh": "圖示。至於第二個 tab，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 123.85,
          "end": 128.71,
          "en": "I'll add my ion label with a text of offer or offers,",
          "zh": "我會加上我的 ion-label，文字為 offer 或 offers，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 128.77,
          "end": 134.17,
          "en": "makes more sense since we might have multiple places offered and then also my ion icon with a name",
          "zh": "用 offers 比較合理，因為我們可能會有多個提供的地點，然後也加上我的 ion-icon，名稱為"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 134.17,
          "end": 140.09,
          "en": "of a card here, that is actually a nice icon I picked in advance that fits quite well.",
          "zh": "card，那其實是我事先挑好的漂亮圖示，相當合適。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 140.11,
          "end": 144.57,
          "en": "Of course you can always go to ionicons.com and search for your own",
          "zh": "你當然隨時可以到 ionicons.com 搜尋你自己的"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 144.57999999999998,
          "end": 149.07999999999998,
          "en": "icons you could use here. And now the part that differs,",
          "zh": "圖示來用。而現在來到不同的部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 149.1,
          "end": 155.19,
          "en": "if you follow the official docs, then you would now also add the ion-tab elements here where you",
          "zh": "如果你照著官方文件做，那麼你現在還要在這裡加上 ion-tab 元素，你"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 155.19,
          "end": 161.7,
          "en": "actually use the same identifiers you used on the tab buttons to then control which content gets displayed",
          "zh": "實際上會使用與 tab 按鈕相同的識別碼，來控制哪個內容要顯示給"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 161.97,
          "end": 165.15,
          "en": "for which button that is pressed. With Angular,",
          "zh": "哪個被按下的按鈕。但在 Angular 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 165.18,
          "end": 167.46,
          "en": "that works a bit different,",
          "zh": "運作方式有點不同，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 167.55,
          "end": 172.86,
          "en": "you don't add ion-tab and indeed ion-tab at this time is not even supported here,",
          "zh": "你不加 ion-tab，而且事實上 ion-tab 目前在這裡甚至不被支援，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 172.95,
          "end": 180.42,
          "en": "instead Angular will automatically insert the right page based on the button you pressed and to ensure",
          "zh": "相反地，Angular 會根據你按下的按鈕自動插入正確的 page，而要確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 180.42,
          "end": 182.37,
          "en": "that Angular is able of doing that,",
          "zh": "Angular 有能力做到這一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 182.4,
          "end": 186.6,
          "en": "you just have to make sure that you match this tab identifier",
          "zh": "你只需要確保你比對這裡設定的這個 tab 識別碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 186.63,
          "end": 191.76,
          "en": "you're setting up here in your routing setup and for that, we first of all need to tune our routing",
          "zh": "與你的 routing 設定相符，而為了做到這點，我們首先當然需要調整我們的 routing"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 191.77,
          "end": 197.64,
          "en": "setup of course. We do that in the places module because is the place responsible for the places page",
          "zh": "設定。我們在 places module 裡做這件事，因為它是負責 places page 的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 198.21,
          "end": 199.04,
          "en": "and in there",
          "zh": "在那裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 199.05,
          "end": 201.49,
          "en": "currently, we have one route.",
          "zh": "目前我們有一個 route。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 201.81,
          "end": 206.43,
          "en": "Now we'll add more routes and therefore I'll actually do something which is totally optional but which",
          "zh": "現在我們會加入更多 route，因此我實際上會做一件完全非必要、"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 206.43,
          "end": 207.57,
          "en": "is a good practice,",
          "zh": "但算是良好做法的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 207.66,
          "end": 214.77,
          "en": "I'll outsource my routes here into a new module, into my places-routing.module.ts file",
          "zh": "我會把我的 routes 抽到一個新 module，抽到我的 places-routing.module.ts 檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 215.1,
          "end": 220.65,
          "en": "and that is a similar pattern we have for the main routes with the app routing module as well. In the",
          "zh": "這與我們用 app routing module 處理主要 route 的模式類似。在"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 220.65,
          "end": 228.36,
          "en": "places-routing module, I'll export a class which is named PlacesRoutingModule and the duty of that",
          "zh": "places-routing module 裡，我會匯出一個名為 PlacesRoutingModule 的 class，那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 228.36,
          "end": 233.82,
          "en": "class is to get the ngModule decorator and if that is something you never saw before,",
          "zh": "class 的職責就是加上 ngModule 裝飾器；如果這是你以前從未見過的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 234.27,
          "end": 240.03,
          "en": "as always check out my complete guide about Angular, there you'll learn all about Angular modules and",
          "zh": "一如往常，去看看我完整的 Angular 指南，你在那裡會學到所有關於 Angular module 的知識，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 240.03,
          "end": 244.56,
          "en": "what's up with them and on this ngModule here,",
          "zh": "以及它們是怎麼回事；而在這個 ngModule 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 244.56,
          "end": 252.45,
          "en": "I will now set or I will now import the router module and that is coming from @angular/router,",
          "zh": "我現在會設定，或者說我現在會匯入 router module，它來自 @angular/router，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 252.45,
          "end": 258.81,
          "en": "so nothing ionic specific, that still is Angular routing we're using. The idea is that we here set up some",
          "zh": "所以這不是 Ionic 專屬的東西，我們使用的仍然是 Angular routing。概念是我們在這裡用"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 258.81,
          "end": 266.1,
          "en": "child routes with forChild which are then basically merged with the global route definition once this",
          "zh": "forChild 設定一些子 route，一旦這個 module 被延遲載入，它們基本上就會"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 266.1,
          "end": 268.02,
          "en": "module is lazy loaded,",
          "zh": "與全域的 route 定義合併；"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 268.05,
          "end": 274.95,
          "en": "we also need to export our router module here without forChild being called again though,",
          "zh": "我們這裡也需要匯出我們的 router module，不過不要再呼叫一次 forChild，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 275.04,
          "end": 280.2,
          "en": "so this is now the router module with the new configuration you could say. Now for the routes,",
          "zh": "所以這可以說是帶有新設定的 router module。現在講到 routes，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 280.2,
          "end": 285.99,
          "en": "I'll add my routes constant which will be of type routes and routes just as router module needs to be",
          "zh": "我會加上我的 routes 常數，它的型別會是 Routes，而 Routes 就像 router module 一樣，需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 285.99,
          "end": 288.26,
          "en": "imported from @angular/router,",
          "zh": "從 @angular/router 匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 288.33,
          "end": 291.12,
          "en": "that is an array of our route objects,",
          "zh": "那是一個由我們的 route 物件組成的陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 291.12,
          "end": 300.93,
          "en": "so again just plain old Angular logic. Now in that object here, in the first object, I want to set a path",
          "zh": "所以這同樣只是普通的 Angular 邏輯。現在在這裡的物件中，第一個物件裡，我想要設定一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 301.05,
          "end": 307.68,
          "en": "which I'll name tabs and you could name this place-tabs as well, whatever you want, I'll just name it tabs.",
          "zh": "path，我會把它命名為 tabs，你也可以把它命名為 place-tabs，隨你高興，我就叫它 tabs。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 309.99,
          "end": 316.42,
          "en": "The component I want to render for this path is my places component because that will actually be",
          "zh": "我想要為這個 path render 的 component 是我的 places component，因為那實際上會是"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 316.54,
          "end": 323.58,
          "en": "the component, excuse me, places page is the name, that is the component in the end that has my tabs and that",
          "zh": "那個 component，抱歉，places page 是名稱，那才是最後擁有我的 tabs 的 component，而那"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 323.58,
          "end": 324.33,
          "en": "is important.",
          "zh": "很重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 324.33,
          "end": 330.24,
          "en": "So here you want to render that component that holds your tabs and of course you need to import that",
          "zh": "所以在這裡你要 render 那個裝著你 tabs 的 component，當然你需要在這裡匯入那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 330.24,
          "end": 338.44,
          "en": "component here. Now that will have a couple of children, a couple of child routes and now that is an important",
          "zh": "component。現在它會有一些 children，一些子 route，而現在這是個重要的"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 338.44,
          "end": 339.15,
          "en": "pattern,",
          "zh": "模式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 339.37,
          "end": 345.87,
          "en": "the page, the component where you have your ion-tabs element needs to have some child routes",
          "zh": "擁有 ion-tabs 元素的那個 page、那個 component 必須有一些子 route，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 345.90999999999997,
          "end": 353.89,
          "en": "and now for these child routes, we'll have to make sure that we adjust them correctly to meet our identifiers",
          "zh": "而對於這些子 route，我們必須確保正確調整它們，以符合我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 353.89,
          "end": 358,
          "en": "we added on our tab buttons. How do we do that?",
          "zh": "加在 tab 按鈕上的識別碼。我們要怎麼做呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 358,
          "end": 365.89,
          "en": "Well we add again just an object to configure a path and the path here now has to match one of these",
          "zh": "我們同樣只要加入一個物件來設定 path，而這裡的 path 現在必須符合這些識別碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 365.89,
          "end": 372.6,
          "en": "identifiers because ionic behind the scenes will then look for such a path when this button is pressed.",
          "zh": "其中之一，因為 Ionic 會在背後於這個按鈕被按下時尋找這樣的 path。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 372.67,
          "end": 381.32,
          "en": "So here, I'll now add discover as a path and discover for me will actually then just be a wrapper with",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我現在會加入 discover 作為 path，而 discover 對我來說實際上就只是"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 381.32,
          "end": 388.94,
          "en": "more child routes because in these child routes, I'll now have both my discover main page where we see all",
          "zh": "一個包裝，裡面有更多子 route，因為在這些子 route 裡，我現在會有我的 discover 主 page，在那裡我們看到所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 388.94,
          "end": 394.49,
          "en": "the places we can book but I'll then always have another child which will be my place detail page",
          "zh": "可以預訂的地點，但我也會一直有另一個 child，也就是我的 place detail page，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 394.49,
          "end": 402.92,
          "en": "so to say. So I'll have an empty path in there and there I want to lazy load my discover module, so the",
          "zh": "可以這麼說。所以我在裡面會有一個空 path，在那裡我要 lazy load 我的 discover module，也就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 402.92,
          "end": 411.02,
          "en": "discover page, I'll do that by pointing at the discover folder and then the discover module and in",
          "zh": "discover page；我會指向 discover 資料夾，然後指向 discover module，而在"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 411.02,
          "end": 412.09000000000003,
          "en": "there, without .ts",
          "zh": "那裡，不加 .ts，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 412.1,
          "end": 414.23,
          "en": "that's important and then a hashtag",
          "zh": "這很重要，然後加上一個井字號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 414.44,
          "end": 417.1,
          "en": "and then discover module.",
          "zh": "再接著 discover module。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 417.23,
          "end": 423.53,
          "en": "So you basically now need to enter the name of this class, discover page module it is here after the",
          "zh": "所以你基本上現在需要在井字號後面輸入這個 class 的名稱，這裡是 discover page module，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 423.53,
          "end": 431.06,
          "en": "hashtag and that is how you set up lazy loading in Angular, relative path from this file on and that allows",
          "zh": "這就是你在 Angular 中設定 lazy loading 的方式，從這個檔案算起的相對路徑，而這讓我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 431.06,
          "end": 433.28,
          "en": "us to use lazy loading even inside of tabs.",
          "zh": "即使在 tabs 裡面也能使用 lazy loading。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 433.28,
          "end": 438.92,
          "en": "That means if we never press a tab button, the code for the page that is loaded when you press it will",
          "zh": "意思就是如果我們從不按下某個 tab 按鈕，按下它時所載入的那個 page 的程式碼就"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 438.92,
          "end": 445.15,
          "en": "not be downloaded unnecessarily which is of course great. So that is my first route which is a child",
          "zh": "不會被不必要地下載，這當然很棒。所以這是我的第一個 route，它是 discover 的 child，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 445.15,
          "end": 450.73,
          "en": "of discover and in the end, we reach this by simply typing /tabs/discover you could say",
          "zh": "最後我們只要輸入 /tabs/discover 就能抵達，可以這麼說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 451.09,
          "end": 458.40999999999997,
          "en": "or actually /places/tabs/discover since this whole module is only loaded after we visited",
          "zh": "或者其實是 /places/tabs/discover，因為這整個 module 只有在我們已經造訪過"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 458.53,
          "end": 463.69,
          "en": "/places already, so now then we load this discover page.",
          "zh": "/places 之後才會載入，所以接著我們就載入這個 discover page。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 463.84000000000003,
          "end": 470.62,
          "en": "Now the other child page I have here which should start with /places/tabs/discover",
          "zh": "現在我在這裡有的另一個 child page，它應該以 /places/tabs/discover 開頭，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 471.34000000000003,
          "end": 476.72,
          "en": "is the page with a path of :placeId",
          "zh": "是 path 為 :placeId 的那個 page，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 477.07,
          "end": 480.55,
          "en": "and that is a dynamic parameter, hence the colon",
          "zh": "那是一個動態參數，所以有那個冒號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 480.64,
          "end": 483.34,
          "en": "because we'll have different places with different IDs",
          "zh": "因為我們會有多個地點、各有不同的 ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 483.4,
          "end": 484.54,
          "en": "and I want to show my place",
          "zh": "而我想要在這裡顯示我的 place"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 484.54,
          "end": 485.62,
          "en": "detail page here",
          "zh": "detail page，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 485.68,
          "end": 488.8,
          "en": "and I want to pass the ID as a parameter",
          "zh": "並且我想要把 ID 當作參數傳遞，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 488.8,
          "end": 493.99,
          "en": "in the URL and that is also something we already saw in an earlier module and",
          "zh": "放在 URL 裡，這也是我們在前面某個模組已經看過的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 493.99,
          "end": 497.33,
          "en": "that is also just how it works in Angular in general.",
          "zh": "而且這也單純就是 Angular 中一般的運作方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 497.38,
          "end": 504.94,
          "en": "Here again I'll set up lazy loading by going to /discover and there now to the place detail folder",
          "zh": "這裡我同樣會設定 lazy loading，前往 /discover，然後在那裡前往 place detail 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 505.22,
          "end": 509.81,
          "en": "and there to the place detail module, without .ts",
          "zh": "然後前往 place detail module，不加 .ts，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 509.84,
          "end": 515.3,
          "en": "it's important that you remove that otherwise this path will be resolved incorrectly",
          "zh": "記得一定要把它移除，否則這個 path 會被錯誤地解析，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 515.3,
          "end": 518.74,
          "en": "and then you add a hashtag and then the name of this module.",
          "zh": "然後你加上一個井字號，再來是這個 module 的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 518.81,
          "end": 520.08,
          "en": "So let's go in there,",
          "zh": "那我們就進去那裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 520.16,
          "end": 522.53,
          "en": "let's copy and paste that name, it's place",
          "zh": "把那個名稱複製貼上，它是 place"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 522.53,
          "end": 528.31,
          "en": "detail page module and let's add it here after the hashtag.",
          "zh": "detail page module，然後把它加在這裡的井字號後面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 528.5,
          "end": 529.45,
          "en": "Perfect,",
          "zh": "太好了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 529.46,
          "end": 531.84,
          "en": "so now we have that setup.",
          "zh": "這樣我們就設定好了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 531.86,
          "end": 533.98,
          "en": "This is my discover area,",
          "zh": "這是我的 discover 區域，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 534.02,
          "end": 539.7,
          "en": "of course I also have offers and that will now be a sibling to the discover route object.",
          "zh": "當然我也有 offers，而那現在會是 discover route 物件的同層項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 539.78,
          "end": 541.95,
          "en": "Here I have a path of offers",
          "zh": "這裡我有一個 path 為 offers，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 542.03,
          "end": 547.43,
          "en": "and again, this path now needs to match your button tab attribute here",
          "zh": "同樣地，這個 path 現在必須符合你這裡的 button tab 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 547.43,
          "end": 551.1,
          "en": "otherwise it will not be loaded correctly. Here",
          "zh": "否則它不會被正確載入。這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 551.1,
          "end": 556.74,
          "en": "I'll then also add children because I want to have a couple of routes that actually start with",
          "zh": "我接著也會加上 children，因為我想要有一些確實以"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 556.74,
          "end": 564.81,
          "en": "/places/tabs/offers and the first child route I'll add is again just an empty path for just",
          "zh": "/places/tabs/offers 開頭的 route，而我要加的第一個子 route 同樣只是一個空 path，對應"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 564.81,
          "end": 574.01,
          "en": "/places/tabs/offers and there I'll lazy load the offers modules, so that main offers",
          "zh": "/places/tabs/offers，在那裡我會延遲載入 offers module，也就是那個主要的 offers"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 574.02,
          "end": 578.74,
          "en": "page, again without ts here and then just as before,",
          "zh": "page，這裡同樣不加 ts，然後就跟之前一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 578.79,
          "end": 586.11,
          "en": "make sure you do copy the right name here so that lazy loading works correctly. So let's copy that and",
          "zh": "記得一定要複製正確的名稱，這樣 lazy loading 才能正確運作。那我們把它複製起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 586.11,
          "end": 587.98,
          "en": "add it here after the hashtag.",
          "zh": "加在這裡的井字號後面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 588.01,
          "end": 594.01,
          "en": "Now feel free to pause the videos and add routes for the other files we have here,",
          "zh": "現在你可以隨時暫停影片，為我們這裡的其他檔案加上 route，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 594.15,
          "end": 599.46,
          "en": "you'll need to pass some dynamic parameters for some of the other routes, for example for editing or",
          "zh": "你會需要為其他一些 route 傳入動態參數，例如用來編輯或"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 599.46,
          "end": 604.75,
          "en": "viewing the details. After the short pause which I give you to pause this video, we'll do it together.",
          "zh": "查看詳細資料。在我給你暫停這部影片的短暫時間之後，我們會一起來做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 606.83,
          "end": 608.54,
          "en": "So were you successful?",
          "zh": "所以你有成功嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 608.54,
          "end": 610.07,
          "en": "Let's do it together now.",
          "zh": "我們現在一起來做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 610.07,
          "end": 613.34,
          "en": "So we have that first route here already,",
          "zh": "我們這裡已經有第一個 route 了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 613.37,
          "end": 620.63,
          "en": "now I also want to be able to create new offers and I'll do this with a path of new.",
          "zh": "現在我也希望能夠建立新的 offers，我會用 path 為 new 來做這件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 620.63,
          "end": 624.2,
          "en": "Here you can choose any path you want of course",
          "zh": "這裡你當然可以選擇任何你想要的 path，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 624.2,
          "end": 625.9,
          "en": "and again, load children",
          "zh": "同樣地，load children，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 626.06,
          "end": 632.72,
          "en": "and then I'll go into the offers folder, then into new offer and then load my new offer module and as",
          "zh": "然後我會進到 offers 資料夾，接著進到 new offer，再載入我的 new offer module，而就跟"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 632.72,
          "end": 635.25,
          "en": "before, make sure you do type or copy",
          "zh": "之前一樣，記得一定要輸入或複製"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 635.27,
          "end": 638.37,
          "en": "the correct module name otherwise routing will break.",
          "zh": "正確的 module 名稱，否則 routing 會壞掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 638.78,
          "end": 644.3,
          "en": "So now after a hashtag, I load the new offer page module.",
          "zh": "所以現在在井字號後面，我載入 new offer page module。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 644.39,
          "end": 646.16,
          "en": "Now besides that, I'll have two other routes,",
          "zh": "除此之外，我還會有另外兩個 route，"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 646.16,
          "end": 648.89,
          "en": "the first one is the route for editing,",
          "zh": "第一個是編輯用的 route，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 648.89,
          "end": 651.84,
          "en": "here I'll have added /placeId.",
          "zh": "這裡我會加上 /placeId。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 651.98,
          "end": 655.01,
          "en": "So that is actually a path that consists of two segments,",
          "zh": "所以那實際上是一個由兩個區段組成的 path，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 655.01,
          "end": 660.32,
          "en": "the first one is hardcoded but the second one is a dynamic segment because when I added a place, I",
          "zh": "第一個是寫死的，但第二個是動態區段，因為當我新增一個地點時，我"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 660.32,
          "end": 666.02,
          "en": "need to get its ID and I will pass that ID through the URL.",
          "zh": "需要取得它的 ID，而我會透過 URL 傳遞那個 ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 666.02,
          "end": 668,
          "en": "The rest is not that difficult,",
          "zh": "其餘的並不難，"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 668.03,
          "end": 675.59,
          "en": "I will lazy load it from the offers folder, added offers.module.ts without ts and then it's the added",
          "zh": "我會從 offers 資料夾 lazy load 它，也就是 edit-offers.module.ts，不加 ts，然後這裡應該載入的"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 676.1,
          "end": 683.56,
          "en": "offer page module that should be loaded here. And after that, there's one more route to go and that is",
          "zh": "是 edit offer page module。而在那之後，還有一個 route 要處理，那就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 683.59,
          "end": 690.22,
          "en": "just :placeID, that is for the details page where I basically can see all the bookings for",
          "zh": "單純的 :placeId，那是給詳細資料 page 用的，在那裡我基本上可以看到我的 offer"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 690.22,
          "end": 690.85,
          "en": "my offer,",
          "zh": "的所有預訂紀錄，"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 691.27,
          "end": 699.28,
          "en": "so here I'll implement loadChildren ./offer-bookings/offer-bookings.module and then",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我會實作 loadChildren ./offer-bookings/offer-bookings.module，然後"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 699.28,
          "end": 704.3,
          "en": "#OfferBookingsPageModule.",
          "zh": "#OfferBookingsPageModule。"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 704.32,
          "end": 707.97,
          "en": "Now one important note, the order here matters,",
          "zh": "現在有個重點，這裡的順序很重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 708.03,
          "end": 713.86,
          "en": "the hardcoded paths have to go before the ones with the dynamic segments because if you would have",
          "zh": "寫死的 path 必須放在帶有動態區段的 path 之前，因為如果你把順序"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 713.86,
          "end": 719.68,
          "en": "a reverse order, when you go to something like /new and you have :placeId",
          "zh": "反過來，當你前往像 /new 這樣的東西，而 :placeId"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 719.68,
          "end": 724.27,
          "en": "in front of that, well then new would be treated as a value for placeId",
          "zh": "排在它前面時，那麼 new 就會被當成 placeId 的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 724.33,
          "end": 725.62,
          "en": "and this route would be loaded",
          "zh": "於是載入的就會是這個 route，"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 725.62,
          "end": 732.22,
          "en": "instead of this route, so hardcoded routes first. With that, the routing setup is complete,",
          "zh": "而不是那個 route，所以寫死的 route 要放前面。這樣 routing 設定就完成了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 732.22,
          "end": 739.84,
          "en": "now let's pass the routes to router module for child here and then let's import our place routing module",
          "zh": "現在我們把 routes 傳給 router module 的 forChild，然後把我們的 places routing module"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 739.99,
          "end": 741.88,
          "en": "into the places module.",
          "zh": "匯入 places module。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 741.88,
          "end": 746.35,
          "en": "There, we can therefore get rid of that route setup we had in there before, we can get rid of that entire",
          "zh": "在那裡，我們因此可以把之前放在裡面的那組 route 設定拿掉，也可以把整個"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 746.35,
          "end": 748.86,
          "en": "Angular router import here,",
          "zh": "Angular router 的匯入拿掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 750.38,
          "end": 753.07,
          "en": "can also get rid of the forms module by the way right now,",
          "zh": "順帶一提，現在也可以把 forms module 拿掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 753.08,
          "end": 758.06,
          "en": "we're currently not using forms here and you could delete it for all the other modules too at the moment.",
          "zh": "我們目前這裡沒有用到 forms，而且目前所有其他 module 也都可以把它刪掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 758.06,
          "end": 763.34,
          "en": "And then here in imports, I'll just import my places routing module and you need to add that import",
          "zh": "然後在這裡的 imports 中，我會直接匯入我的 places routing module，而你也需要加上那個匯入"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 763.34,
          "end": 765.11,
          "en": "path here as well.",
          "zh": "路徑。"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 765.11,
          "end": 773.8,
          "en": "So now let's save that and let it recompile and then go back to the ionic app here and reload it and",
          "zh": "那我們現在儲存，讓它重新編譯，然後回到這裡的 Ionic app 並重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 773.8,
          "end": 775.78,
          "en": "we're not seeing anything, do we?",
          "zh": "我們什麼都看不到，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 777.32,
          "end": 779.28,
          "en": "Well that is because we're using lazy loading,",
          "zh": "嗯，那是因為我們使用了 lazy loading，"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 779.31,
          "end": 783.14,
          "en": "there's one thing we need to adjust in the places-routing module.",
          "zh": "我們需要在 places-routing module 中調整一件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 783.14,
          "end": 791.52,
          "en": "There, we have that big tabs object here in the end where we have all these nested tabs pages,",
          "zh": "在那裡，我們最後有那個很大的 tabs 物件，裡面有所有這些嵌套的 tabs page，"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 791.87,
          "end": 795.77,
          "en": "next to that big tabs path or route object here",
          "zh": "在那個很大的 tabs path 或 route 物件旁邊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 795.89,
          "end": 801.44,
          "en": "you need to add a new route object with a path of empty which is triggered when you're going to just",
          "zh": "你需要加入一個新的 route 物件，path 為空，當你只前往"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 801.44,
          "end": 802.03,
          "en": "/places",
          "zh": "/places 時會觸發它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 802.07,
          "end": 813.95,
          "en": "so to say and there, you should redirect to /places/tabs/discover to start on that discover",
          "zh": "可以這麼說；在那裡，你應該重新導向到 /places/tabs/discover，以從那個 discover"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 813.97,
          "end": 814.39,
          "en": "page",
          "zh": "page 開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 814.41,
          "end": 817.55,
          "en": "or of course redirect to another page if you want to start there.",
          "zh": "或者當然，如果你想從別的 page 開始，就重新導向到別的 page。"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 817.71,
          "end": 823.23,
          "en": "Important here, you need to set path match to full so that this only kicks in if we're really just going",
          "zh": "這裡重要的是，你需要把 path match 設為 full，這樣只有在我們真的只前往"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 823.23,
          "end": 827.22,
          "en": "to /places and not to /places/something else",
          "zh": "/places、而不是 /places/其他東西 時才會生效，"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 827.43,
          "end": 834.58,
          "en": "and we need a similar redirection. Actually in here, inside of our tabs,",
          "zh": "而我們也需要類似的重新導向。其實在這裡，在我們的 tabs 裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 834.6,
          "end": 842.7,
          "en": "there we have the rediscover and the offer part, in there you should also add an empty path for cases where",
          "zh": "那裡我們有 discover 和 offer 的部分，在裡面你也應該加上一個空 path，以應付我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 842.7,
          "end": 846.68,
          "en": "we go to just /places/tabs, there",
          "zh": "只前往 /places/tabs 的情況，在那裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 846.75,
          "end": 855.12,
          "en": "I also want to redirect to /places/tabs/discover and also set path match to full.",
          "zh": "我也想要重新導向到 /places/tabs/discover，並且同樣把 path match 設為 full。"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 855.12,
          "end": 858.7,
          "en": "So with these two redirections set up here,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡設定好這兩個重新導向之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 858.78,
          "end": 863.11,
          "en": "let's now save that and wait for the compilation to finish",
          "zh": "我們現在儲存，並等待編譯完成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 863.49,
          "end": 866.64,
          "en": "and now we can see something. It's still not the final output",
          "zh": "現在我們就能看到東西了。這還不是我最終想要"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 866.64,
          "end": 867.61,
          "en": "I want to have",
          "zh": "的輸出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 867.69,
          "end": 872.3,
          "en": "but we can see that we have the discover page active here and if I go to offers,",
          "zh": "但我們可以看到這裡 discover page 是啟用狀態，而如果我前往 offers，"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 872.31,
          "end": 874.08,
          "en": "we see the offers page.",
          "zh": "我們會看到 offers page。"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 874.29,
          "end": 876.21,
          "en": "So that's looking good,",
          "zh": "所以這看起來不錯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 876.48,
          "end": 882.72,
          "en": "we can also see that lazy loading works if we open a network tab, go back to discover, reload here and",
          "zh": "我們也可以看到 lazy loading 有在運作：如果我們開啟 network 分頁，回到 discover，在這裡重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 882.72,
          "end": 884.34,
          "en": "then clear the network log",
          "zh": "然後清空 network 紀錄，"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 884.34,
          "end": 890.54,
          "en": "and now I go to offers, you see that is downloaded separately, so that's lazy loading in action.",
          "zh": "接著我前往 offers，你會看到那是另外下載的，所以這就是 lazy loading 實際運作的樣子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 890.94,
          "end": 893.7,
          "en": "But what about that extra navigation bar?",
          "zh": "但那條多出來的導覽列是怎麼回事？"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 893.7,
          "end": 900.15,
          "en": "Well the fix is simple. In your places.page.html file where you have your tabs, you should actually",
          "zh": "嗯，修正方法很簡單。在你的 places.page.html 檔案裡，也就是你有 tabs 的地方，你其實"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 900.21,
          "end": 901.74,
          "en": "only have your tabs,",
          "zh": "應該只留下你的 tabs，"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 901.74,
          "end": 908.04,
          "en": "so get rid of the ion header and also of ion content and just have ion-tabs in here.",
          "zh": "所以把 ion-header 拿掉，也把 ion-content 拿掉，這裡只留 ion-tabs。"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 909.17,
          "end": 914.93,
          "en": "And now with that if you save it, this will reload and we'll get rid of that extra header and this is",
          "zh": "這樣一來，如果你儲存，它就會重新載入，我們就會去掉那條多出來的 header，而這現在就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 914.93,
          "end": 916.31,
          "en": "now the look and feel",
          "zh": "我想要在此基礎上繼續發展的"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 916.31,
          "end": 920.12,
          "en": "I want to build up on. This is how you can implement tabs in your application.",
          "zh": "外觀與感覺。這就是你可以在應用程式中實作 tabs 的方式。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
