        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 38.46,
          "end": 45.26,
          "en": "and in there I want to output a featured place and below that, a list of places. We'll get more fancy regarding",
          "zh": "而在裡面我想要輸出一個精選地點，並在下面列出地點清單。我們之後會在"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 45.26,
          "end": 51.02,
          "en": "the styling and we'll also add real data later but we can start with dummy data and some basic layout",
          "zh": "樣式上做得更花俏，也會加入真實資料，但我想我們可以先從假資料和一些基本的版面"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 51.05,
          "end": 55.36,
          "en": "and styling already I guess. So for that,",
          "zh": "與樣式開始。所以為此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 55.72,
          "end": 61.11,
          "en": "let's first of all set up a data source we can use to manage our places and",
          "zh": "我們先建立一個可以用來管理我們 places 的資料來源，"
