        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 90.37,
          "end": 93.55,
          "en": "throughout this course, for now I'll start really simple,",
          "zh": "讓它變得越來越精細，目前我會從非常簡單的開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 93.82,
          "end": 102.00999999999999,
          "en": "I'll have a private underscore places property which is an array and I'll add a getter which I'll",
          "zh": "我會有一個私有的 places 屬性，前面帶底線，它是一個陣列，而我會加上一個 getter，"
