        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 102.00999999999999,
          "end": 109.8,
          "en": "name places without an underscore where I return a copy of this places, so that we can directly edit",
          "zh": "命名為不帶底線的 places，在裡面回傳這個 places 的副本，這樣我們就能直接從"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 109.8,
          "end": 117.39,
          "en": "the array from other places where we get access to that array and well it also makes sense to define",
          "zh": "其他取得該陣列存取權的地方編輯這個陣列，而且定義一些我們可以使用的"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 117.42,
          "end": 123.21,
          "en": "some data model we can work with, so that we have some clearly defined structure of how a place should",
          "zh": "資料模型也很合理，讓我們對一個地點在應用程式中應該長什麼樣子"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 123.21,
          "end": 127.75,
          "en": "look like in our application. For that next to the places service,",
          "zh": "有清楚定義的結構。為此，在 places service 旁邊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 127.77,
          "end": 139.09,
          "en": "I'll add a place.model.ts file and in there, I'll export a class which I'll just name place,",
          "zh": "我會加入一個 place.model.ts 檔案，在裡面我會匯出一個 class，就直接命名為 place，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 139.29,
          "end": 144.32999999999998,
          "en": "you can of course name it whatever you want and then we'll have a constructor where I heavily use that",
          "zh": "你當然可以隨意命名，然後我們會有一個 constructor，我會大量使用那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 144.36,
          "end": 150.63,
          "en": "Typescript shortcut of adding public or private in front of an argument to automatically bind that argument",
          "zh": "TypeScript 的簡寫，也就是在參數前面加上 public 或 private，自動把那個參數"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 150.63,
          "end": 152.88,
          "en": "to an equally named class property.",
          "zh": "綁定到同名的 class 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 153.63,
          "end": 155.37,
          "en": "And now what should a place have?",
          "zh": "那麼一個 place 應該要有什麼呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 155.61,
          "end": 166.14,
          "en": "Let's say a place has some ID which is a string, a place will also have a title which is a string and",
          "zh": "比如說一個 place 要有某個 ID，它是字串；一個 place 也要有 title，它是字串；"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 166.14,
          "end": 178.45,
          "en": "a place will definitely also have a description which is a string, a place will have an image URL",
          "zh": "一個 place 一定也要有 description，它是字串；一個 place 要有 image URL，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 178.46,
          "end": 185.61,
          "en": "which is a string and a place will also have a price which is a number actually.",
          "zh": "它是字串；而一個 place 也要有 price，它其實是數字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 185.85,
          "end": 193.5,
          "en": "And we can fine tune this and refine this later to add things like a location, availability and stuff",
          "zh": "我們之後可以微調、改良這些，加入像是地點、可預訂狀況之類的"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 193.5,
          "end": 194.28,
          "en": "like that",
          "zh": "東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 194.28,
          "end": 197.32999999999998,
          "en": "but for now, this is my simple setup with which I want to go.",
          "zh": "但目前這就是我簡單的設定，我打算就這樣做下去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 197.61,
          "end": 203.64,
          "en": "Now with that added in the places service, I can make clear that my places here will be of type place.",
          "zh": "現在把這個加進 places service 之後，我就可以明確表示我這裡的 places 會是 place 型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 203.7,
          "end": 212.57999999999998,
          "en": "So now I will add my place model and for that, you need to add import at the top and import place from",
          "zh": "所以我現在會加入我的 place model，為此你需要在最上面加上 import，從"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 213.12,
          "end": 222.92000000000002,
          "en": "./place_model and it should be an array of places here of course, not a single place",
