        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 222.92000000000002,
          "end": 224,
          "en": "and now with that set up,",
          "zh": "現在這樣設定好之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 224,
          "end": 228.11,
          "en": "let's add some dummy places. Now for that we need an ID,",
          "zh": "我們來加一些假的地點。為此我們需要一個 ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 229.34,
          "end": 238.74,
          "en": "we can also use the constructor here of course, new place and then pass in the ID, P1 maybe, title Manhattan",
          "zh": "我們當然也可以在這裡使用 constructor，new place，然後傳入 ID，也許是 P1，標題為 Manhattan"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 240.57,
          "end": 241.32,
          "en": "mansion,",
          "zh": "mansion，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 243.68,
          "end": 254.06,
          "en": "description in the heart of New York City, then an image URL which I prepared here,",
          "zh": "description 為 in the heart of New York City，接著是我事先準備好的 image URL，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 254.07,
          "end": 261.4,
          "en": "you can of course simply use Google image search and find any image that fits your name and a price",
          "zh": "你當然可以簡單地用 Google 圖片搜尋，找到任何符合你需求的圖片，然後是一個 price，"
