          "start": 263.04,
          "end": 268.41,
          "en": "149.99 per night let's say, that is what our price is for. Now",
          "zh": "比如說每晚 149.99，這就是我們為它定的價格。現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 268.42,
          "end": 273.54,
          "en": "I'll add another place next to it, gets an ID of P2,",
          "zh": "我會在它旁邊再加上另一個地點，給它 ID 為 P2，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 276.21,
          "end": 279.62,
          "en": "let's name it L'Amour Toujours,",
          "zh": "我們把它命名為 L'Amour Toujours，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 281.12,
          "end": 283.1,
          "en": "so some French place",
          "zh": "所以是一個法式的"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 283.6,
          "end": 292.29,
          "en": "which is let's say a romantic place in Paris",
          "zh": "地點，比如說巴黎的浪漫地點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 298.58,
          "end": 307.2,
          "en": "which comes at a cost at let's say 189.99 per night and let's add a third",
          "zh": "它的價格比如說每晚 189.99，那我們再加第三個"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 307.2,
          "end": 308.97,
          "en": "place, shall we",
          "zh": "地點好嗎，"
