        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 308.97,
          "end": 322.36,
          "en": "with let's say an idea of P3, the foggy palace which is actually not your average city trip, there",
          "zh": "比如說 ID 為 P3，the foggy palace，它其實不是普通的城市之旅；在那裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 322.36,
          "end": 329.68,
          "en": "I also picked an image in advance, you can of course search for any foggy image you find, foggy city image",
          "zh": "我也事先挑了一張圖片，你當然可以搜尋任何你找到的霧景圖片、霧都圖片，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 329.68,
          "end": 335.48,
          "en": "you find and that will come at let's say 99.99 per night.",
          "zh": "而它的價格比如說每晚 99.99。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 335.63,
          "end": 342.76,
          "en": "Okay now I got the three places here and here auto-completion messed up my string but that's fine. So",
          "zh": "好的，現在我這裡有三個地點，而這裡自動完成把我的字串弄亂了，但沒關係。所以"
