          "id": 59,
          "start": 342.77,
          "end": 348.21,
          "en": "I got my three places here in the service, I got a getter to get these places. With that prepared. let's",
          "zh": "我在 service 裡有三個地點，也有一個取得這些地點的 getter。準備好之後，我們"
