        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 348.21,
          "end": 351.02,
          "en": "now get them and let's display them in the discover page.",
          "zh": "現在就來取得它們，並把它們顯示在 discover page 上。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727820",
      "title": "Outputting \"Places\"",
      "lectureOrder": 113,
      "videoOrder": 92,
      "sourceHash": "e18ffbd997de00650222176f9ed3bc0a5ce28388c4fe507f20b597856030b4d6",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.92,
          "end": 9.58,
          "en": "So with that dummy places added and our places service in its first basic version added, let's use",
          "zh": "假的地點加好、我們的 places service 也完成了第一個基本版本之後，我們就來使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 9.58,
          "end": 14.92,
          "en": "these places and let's start in the discover page where I want to output them. In the discover page, I",
          "zh": "這些地點，並從 discover page 開始，我想在那裡把它們輸出。在 discover page 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 14.92,
          "end": 23.61,
          "en": "therefore will inject my places service, places service which is possible by the way because places",
          "zh": "因此我會注入我的 places service，也就是 places service；順帶一提這是可行的，因為 places"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 23.67,
          "end": 29.4,
          "en": "service here has add injectable with provided set to root, if you wouldn't have that, we could still",
          "zh": "service 這裡有 @Injectable 且 providedIn 設為 root，如果沒有那個，我們仍然可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 29.4,
          "end": 34.74,
          "en": "inject it but then we would have to add it to providers in the app module, that service.",
          "zh": "注入它，但那樣我們就得把它加到 app module 的 providers 裡，也就是那個 service。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 34.74,
          "end": 36.55,
          "en": "So that's just important to highlight",
          "zh": "所以這點值得特別強調，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 36.69,
          "end": 39.99,
          "en": "but with provided in root here, it's auto-provided",
          "zh": "但有 providedIn root 的話，它就是自動提供的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 40.11,
          "end": 45.1,
          "en": "and now we can inject it anywhere in this application, for example in the discover page of course",
          "zh": "而現在我們可以在這個應用程式的任何地方注入它，當然例如在 discover page 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 46.11,
          "end": 49.63,
          "en": "and I want to fetch my places when we load that page.",
          "zh": "而我想要在載入那個 page 時取得我的 places。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 49.67,
          "end": 55.08,
          "en": "Now I will do that in ngOnInit here because for now, that will work but be aware that of course",
          "zh": "現在我會在 ngOnInit 裡做這件事，因為目前那樣可以運作，但要注意，當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 55.08,
          "end": 56.85,
          "en": "with all that caching and so on,",
          "zh": "因為有那些快取等等，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 56.85,
          "end": 61.2,
          "en": "by the way pages are also cached when you were going from tab A to tab B,",
          "zh": "順帶一提，當你從 tab A 切到 tab B 時，page 也會被快取，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 61.38,
          "end": 67.7,
          "en": "so be aware that with the caching, ngOnInit will not run every time this page becomes visible.",
          "zh": "所以要注意，有了快取之後，每當這個 page 變為可見時，ngOnInit 並不會每次都執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 67.71,
          "end": 74.35,
          "en": "For now, I have no way of changing my places anyways, so I don't need to be able to update them and therefore",
          "zh": "目前我反正也沒有任何方法可以改變我的 places，所以我不需要能夠更新它們，因此"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 74.37,
          "end": 84.33,
          "en": "fetching them one time only is fine. Hence here, I'll first of all add my own places or loaded places",
          "zh": "只取得一次就可以了。所以在這裡，我首先會在 discover page 加上我的 loadedPlaces"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 84.33,
          "end": 90.99,
          "en": "property in the discover page, that is of type place and therefore you need to import that from your",
          "zh": "屬性，它是 place 型別，因此你需要從你的"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 90.99,
          "end": 95.52000000000001,
          "en": "place model and that will be an array of places actually and in ngOnInit,",
          "zh": "place model 匯入它；而它實際上會是一個 places 陣列。而在 ngOnInit 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 95.55,
          "end": 103.71000000000001,
          "en": "I'll set this loaded places equal to this places service which is a property of this class because I added",
          "zh": "我會把這個 loadedPlaces 設為 this.placesService，它是這個 class 的屬性，因為我在這個參數前"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 103.71000000000001,
          "end": 108.78,
          "en": "private in front of this argument which automatically binds this argument to an equally named private",
          "zh": "加了 private，這會自動把這個參數綁定到 class 中同名的私有"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 108.78,
          "end": 114.6,
          "en": "property of the class and therefore here in places service, I can access places which uses this places",
          "zh": "屬性，因此這裡在 placesService 上，我可以存取 places，它會使用我定義的這個 places"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 114.63,
          "end": 119.6,
          "en": "getter I defined. So that loads us some places, in the template",
          "zh": "getter。這樣就為我們載入了一些地點；在那個 page 的 template"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 119.61,
          "end": 127.1,
          "en": "now of that page, we can now add code to render the places. For that, I'll actually construct the ion grid",
          "zh": "裡，我們現在可以加上程式碼來 render 這些地點。為此，我其實會在這裡建構 ion-grid，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 127.11,
          "end": 132.74,
          "en": "here with an ion row and ion column because I want to control the width of that featured place",
          "zh": "裡面有 ion-row 和 ion-column，因為我想要控制我放在最上方的那個精選地點"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 132.75,
          "end": 139.93,
          "en": "I want to have at the top. So for that here right at the top, I want to add an ion card in that ion",
          "zh": "的寬度。所以為此，就在最上面這裡，我想要在那個 ion"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 139.94,
          "end": 147.52,
          "en": "column, that should display my featured place. In that card, we can add an ion card header with an ion",
          "zh": "column 裡加上一個 ion-card，它應該顯示我的精選地點。在那張 card 裡，我們可以加上 ion-card-header，裡面有 ion-"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 147.52,
          "end": 152.23,
          "en": "card title and the title now of course should be my featured place title.",
          "zh": "card-title，而標題現在當然應該是我的精選地點標題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 152.44,
          "end": 156.69,
          "en": "Now at the moment, I only have my places array,",
          "zh": "現在目前我只有我的 places 陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 156.7,
          "end": 166.78,
          "en": "so what we could do here is we simply access place loaded places and then the first element and then",
          "zh": "所以我們這裡可以做的就是直接存取 loadedPlaces，然後第一個元素，再取"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 166.78,
          "end": 172.38,
          "en": "the title of that element, that is my featured element, the first element of my loaded places always",
          "zh": "那個元素的 title，那就是我的精選元素；我的 loadedPlaces 的第一個元素永遠"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 172.38,
          "end": 175.67000000000002,
          "en": "is my featured element. Outside of the ion card header,",
          "zh": "都是我的精選元素。在 ion-card-header 外面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 175.72,
          "end": 180.7,
          "en": "I want to have an image that takes the full width of that card and therefore we add it right here below",
          "zh": "我想要有一張佔滿那張 card 全寬的圖片，因此我們就在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 180.7,
          "end": 186.58,
          "en": "the header, an ion image and the source of that image should be the URL, the image URL of our",
          "zh": "在 header 下方加上一個 ion-image，而那張圖片的來源應該是我們地點的"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 186.58,
          "end": 187.25,
          "en": "place,",
          "zh": "URL，也就是 image URL，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 187.36,
          "end": 197.23,
          "en": "so source is property bound to loaded places, the first element and then the image URL. Below the",
          "zh": "所以 source 屬性綁定到 loadedPlaces 的第一個元素，然後取 image URL。在"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 197.23,
          "end": 203.6,
          "en": "ion image, we'll add the ion card content to wrap the rest of the content we want to display",
          "zh": "ion-image 下方，我們會加上 ion-card-content 來包住我們想顯示的其餘內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 203.61,
          "end": 212.23,
          "en": "and for me here, that will simply be my description, so I'll simply add a paragraph here where I output",
          "zh": "而對我來說，那單純就是我的 description，所以我就簡單地在這裡加上一個段落，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 212.23,
          "end": 218.89,
          "en": "with string interpolation loaded places, the first element and then the description. Now the price would",
          "zh": "用字串插值輸出 loadedPlaces 的第一個元素，然後取 description。現在價格"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 218.89,
          "end": 224.43,
          "en": "also be interesting to see and I'll add that below the ion card title with the ion card subtitle and",
          "zh": "看得到也會很有意思，我會把它加在 ion-card-title 下方，用 ion-card-subtitle，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 224.44,
          "end": 227.95,
          "en": "in there, we can set the output loaded places,",
          "zh": "在那裡我們可以設定輸出 loadedPlaces 的"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 230.26,
          "end": 236.56,
          "en": "price like this and let's add /night after that,",
          "zh": "price，像這樣，然後在後面加上 /night，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 236.57999999999998,
          "end": 242.02,
          "en": "now that's hardcoded text here, simply not referring to anything dynamic, not referring to an Angular",
          "zh": "現在那是寫死的文字，單純不指向任何動態內容，不指向任何 Angular"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 242.02,
          "end": 247.42,
          "en": "property, that is just some text and I also want to format this as a currency and for that, we can use",
          "zh": "屬性，就只是一些文字；我也想要把它格式化為貨幣，為此我們可以使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 247.42,
          "end": 252.58,
          "en": "the currency pipe Angular ships with which you add with a pipe symbol and then currency and that's",
          "zh": "Angular 內建的 currency pipe，你用一個直線符號接著 currency 來加上它，那是"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 252.58,
          "end": 259.27,
          "en": "a default Angular feature not related to Ionic, it just transforms this price to look like dollar currency",
          "zh": "Angular 的預設功能，與 Ionic 無關，它開箱就能把這個價格轉換成看起來像美元貨幣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 259.27,
          "end": 265.52,
          "en": "out of the box. You could configure that but the official docs are the place to go for that and when we save",
          "zh": "你可以設定它，但官方文件才是查這件事的地方；而當我們儲存"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 265.52,
          "end": 270.68,
          "en": "this and we go back, this is what we should see. If you getting an error here by the way, try restarting",
          "zh": "這個並返回時，這就是我們應該看到的樣子。順帶一提，如果你這裡遇到錯誤，試著重新啟動"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 270.68,
          "end": 275.96,
          "en": "the Ionic serve process, quit it with control C and then rerun Ionic serve, sometimes you need to do",
          "zh": "Ionic serve 程序，用 control C 結束它，然後重新執行 Ionic serve；有時在"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 275.96,
          "end": 282.14,
          "en": "this after adding new files to the project like we did with our service, that looks beautiful. Now on",
          "zh": "像我們加入 service 這樣為專案新增檔案之後，你就需要這麼做。看起來很美。現在在"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 282.14,
          "end": 288.08,
          "en": "a non-mobile device, this card is super big though and that is exactly what I want to control with my",
          "zh": "非行動裝置上，這張 card 還是超級大，而那正是我想要用 template 裡的"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 288.08,
          "end": 295.39,
          "en": "ion grid here in the template. That is why I did wrap my card into the ion grid because on this ion",
          "zh": "ion-grid 來控制的。這就是為什麼我把我的 card 包進 ion-grid，因為在這個 ion-"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 295.4,
          "end": 304.31,
          "en": "column here, we can now set a default size of 12 but for let's say smaller screens or bigger, we'll",
          "zh": "column 上，我們現在可以設定預設尺寸為 12，但對於比如說較小或較大的螢幕，我們會"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 304.31,
          "end": 311.72,
          "en": "set it to 8 and add an offset for the same screen size of 2, so that this is a bit centered. I also want",
          "zh": "把它設為 8，並為相同螢幕尺寸加上 2 的 offset，讓它稍微置中。我也想要"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 311.72,
          "end": 318.29,
          "en": "to center all the text that's in there, so the text inside of the card too, this then is applied to all",
          "zh": "把裡面所有文字置中，也就是 card 內部的文字也置中，這樣一來就會套用到所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 318.29,
          "end": 325.23,
          "en": "the child elements, thanks to CSS inheritance. This looks better, now the card isn't as large,",
          "zh": "子元素，這要感謝 CSS 繼承。這樣看起來好多了，現在這張 card 沒那麼大了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 325.23,
          "end": 331.44,
          "en": "it's still big and you could shrink it down further by playing around more with the CSS grid, with",
          "zh": "它還是很大，你可以透過更多 CSS grid 的嘗試、更多 Ionic grid 的尺寸"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 331.44,
          "end": 333.06,
          "en": "the Ionic grid sizes",
          "zh": "把它縮得更小，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 333.09000000000003,
          "end": 336.5,
          "en": "but for me that will do, we'll dive deeper into the Ionic grid later,",
          "zh": "但對我來說這樣就夠了；我們之後會更深入探討 Ionic grid，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 336.51,
          "end": 339.74,
          "en": "don't want to spend too much time on it right now.",
          "zh": "現在不想花太多時間在上面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 339.75,
          "end": 340.32,
          "en": "This is nice,",
          "zh": "這樣很好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 340.32,
          "end": 342.06,
          "en": "that's the featured place,",
          "zh": "那就是精選地點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 342.06,
          "end": 346.78,
          "en": "now what about the other places we have? With the featured place",
          "zh": "那其他地點呢？有了精選地點"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 347.24,
          "end": 348.6,
          "en": "in place,",
          "zh": "之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 348.8,
          "end": 357.44,
          "en": "let's also add other places and for this, I'll add another ion row and another ion column with exactly",
          "zh": "我們也來加入其他地點，為此我會再加上一個 ion-row 和另一個 ion-column，尺寸設定"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 357.44,
          "end": 365.23,
          "en": "the same size set up as the card, so that it's nicely aligned below the card and in here,",
          "zh": "與那張 card 完全相同，讓它能漂亮地對齊在 card 下方；而在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 365.25,
          "end": 372.97,
          "en": "I want to render all the other places I have. We can use an ion list for this with ion items in there",
          "zh": "我想要 render 我擁有的所有其他地點。我們可以用 ion-list，裡面放 ion-item，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 372.97,
          "end": 376.95,
          "en": "and then use ngFor to loop through all our places.",
          "zh": "然後用 ngFor 迴圈走過我們所有的地點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 376.96,
          "end": 381.79,
          "en": "Now it's up to you if you want to loop through all the places including the featured one or only the",
          "zh": "現在取決於你，是要迴圈走過所有地點、包括精選的那個，還是只走過"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 381.91,
          "end": 384.24,
          "en": "other places that are not featured yet.",
          "zh": "其他尚未精選的地點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 384.49,
          "end": 389.35,
          "en": "I'll go through all the non-featured places by creating a place variable, you can name this whatever you",
          "zh": "我會走過所有非精選的地點，建立一個 place 變數，你可以隨意命名它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 389.35,
          "end": 392.25,
          "en": "want and going through our loaded places",
          "zh": "然後走過我們的 loadedPlaces，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 392.35,
          "end": 399.82,
          "en": "and now to get only the one that's not featured, we can use slice here and start at index 1 and this",
          "zh": "而現在為了只取得非精選的那一個，我們可以在這裡使用 slice，從索引 1 開始，這"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 399.82,
          "end": 405.58,
          "en": "will basically take all the places, all the elements in this loaded places array after the first element",
          "zh": "基本上會取這個 loadedPlaces 陣列中第一個元素之後的所有地點、所有元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 405.58,
          "end": 413.68,
          "en": "which is our featured element. Ion item is then replicated for all these places and in there, I'll add",
          "zh": "而第一個元素就是我們的精選元素。ion-item 接著會為所有這些地點重複，在裡面我會加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 414.52,
          "end": 421.44,
          "en": "an ion thumbnail component which you can also find in the official docs,",
          "zh": "一個 ion-thumbnail 元件，你也可以在官方文件中找到它；"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 421.44,
          "end": 428.25,
          "en": "you saw ion avatar before, thumbnail is basically similar but doesn't render a rounded image but a",
          "zh": "你之前看過 ion-avatar，thumbnail 基本上類似，但它 render 的不是圓角圖片，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 428.25,
          "end": 435.95,
          "en": "square image and I'll give this a slot of start to position it on the left inside of this ion item,",
          "zh": "而是方形圖片，而我會給它一個 start 的 slot，把它定位在這個 ion-item 內的左側，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 435.95,
          "end": 442.1,
          "en": "so the slot refers to the surrounding ion item and inside of ion thumbnail, you use an ion image",
          "zh": "所以那個 slot 指的是周圍的 ion-item；而在 ion-thumbnail 裡面，你通常會"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 442.1,
          "end": 443.22,
          "en": "typically",
          "zh": "使用 ion-image，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 443.24,
          "end": 449.03,
          "en": "and here again I bind my source dynamically, in this case to place because I get a place here when I",
          "zh": "這裡同樣我動態綁定我的 source，在這個例子中綁定到 place，因為當我"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 449.03,
          "end": 455.95,
          "en": "loop through all the places, image URL. Now besides the thumbnail and the place,",
          "zh": "迴圈走過所有地點時會取得一個 place，然後取 image URL。現在除了 thumbnail 和 place 之外，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 455.98,
          "end": 462.94,
          "en": "I'll then also add an ion label which you should use as a wrapper for the other text next to your thumbnail,",
          "zh": "我接著也會加上一個 ion-label，你應該用它作為 thumbnail 旁邊其他文字的容器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 462.94,
          "end": 468.58,
          "en": "especially if you plan on using multiple text elements which I'll do and then I'll add a h2 tag here",
          "zh": "特別是如果你打算使用多個文字元素，而我會這麼做；然後我會在這裡加上一個 h2 標籤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 469.02,
          "end": 470.54,
          "en": "where I output the place",
          "zh": "輸出 place 的"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 470.57,
          "end": 480.07,
          "en": "title and beneath that, paragraph tag with the place description, something like that.",
          "zh": "title，並在下方加上段落標籤，裡面放 place 的 description，大概像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 481.49,
          "end": 487.82,
          "en": "Now with that if we save this, let's have a look at our results here on the page as it reloads,",
          "zh": "現在這樣一來，如果我們儲存，就讓我們在 page 重新載入時看看結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 487.82,
          "end": 489.8,
          "en": "here we see the other places.",
          "zh": "在這裡我們看到其他地點。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727824",
      "title": "Adding Forward Navigation",
      "lectureOrder": 114,
      "videoOrder": 93,
      "sourceHash": "233c130b1b1edd7cda722624d9ca91c2db7d0f718a1236fc34857f67c77fee16",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.65,
          "end": 7.57,
          "en": "Seeing the places is nice but we only added them so that we could dive deeper into navigation and have",
          "zh": "看到這些地點很不錯，但我們加入它們，是為了能更深入探討導覽，並有一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.57,
          "end": 14.71,
          "en": "a way of going to the details of such a place and eventually opening that booking modal and to achieve",
          "zh": "前往這類地點詳情的方式，最終還能開啟那個預訂 modal，而要達成"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 14.74,
          "end": 21.19,
          "en": "this, we need to make sure we can tab these places or we add some kind of book this place button. It's up",
          "zh": "這點，我們得確保可以點選這些地點，或者加入某種「預訂此地點」的按鈕。這取決於"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 21.19,
          "end": 22.89,
          "en": "to you what you want to do,",
          "zh": "你想怎麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 22.99,
          "end": 30.54,
          "en": "I want to make these items here tappable, these ion items and here for my favorite place, for my featured",
          "zh": "我想讓這裡的這些項目可以點選，也就是這些 ion-item，而在這裡，針對我的最愛地點、我的精選"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 30.55,
          "end": 37.15,
          "en": "place, I want to add a button that actually allows us to go to the details.",
          "zh": "地點，我想加入一個按鈕，讓我們真的能前往詳情頁。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 37.69,
          "end": 41.83,
          "en": "Let's start with the button on the featured place, here",
          "zh": "我們從精選地點上的按鈕開始，這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 41.86,
          "end": 50.08,
          "en": "after ion card content but still in the ion card, so before the closing tag of ion card, I'll add",
          "zh": "在 ion-card-content 之後，但仍在 ion-card 裡面，所以在 ion-card 的結束標籤之前，我會加入"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 50.08,
          "end": 51.57,
          "en": "a new div,",
          "zh": "一個新的 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 51.79,
          "end": 56.16,
          "en": "simple normal div with text right",
          "zh": "單純普通的 div，帶有 text-right，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 56.16,
          "end": 61.82,
          "en": "so that all the text is moved all the way to the right and with some padding and then in here, I'll add",
          "zh": "這樣所有文字都會被推到最右邊，再加上一些 padding，然後在這裡面，我會加入"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 61.82,
          "end": 67.62,
          "en": "an ion button and that ion button will get a fill mode of clear which means it has no background and",
          "zh": "一個 ion-button，那個 ion-button 會設定 fill 為 clear，意思是它沒有背景，也"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 67.62,
          "end": 69.18,
          "en": "no border.",
          "zh": "沒有邊框。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 69.18,
          "end": 78.17,
          "en": "I'll give it a color of primary and I want to add a router link here to go to a certain page.",
          "zh": "我會給它 primary 的顏色，而我想在這裡加入 routerLink，用來前往某個頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 78.21000000000001,
          "end": 84.27,
          "en": "Now that router link will be bound dynamically because I will need to pass the ID of that place.",
          "zh": "這個 routerLink 會以動態方式綁定，因為我需要傳入那個地點的 ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 84.27,
          "end": 91.62,
          "en": "So here, we pass multiple route segments between square brackets and here, I'll construct this in a very",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我們在方括號之間傳入多個路由區段，而在這裡，我會用非常"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 91.62,
          "end": 94.75999999999999,
          "en": "long way to make it really clear what our individual segments are,",
          "zh": "冗長的方式來建構，讓每個區段是什麼變得非常清楚，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 94.77000000000001,
          "end": 99.95,
          "en": "you could merge them all into one string here actually if you wanted to but I'll start with a slash",
          "zh": "其實如果你想要，也可以把它們全部合併成一個字串，但我會以斜線開頭，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 99.96000000000001,
          "end": 105.53999999999999,
          "en": "to have an absolute navigation because relative navigation is a bit buggy at the moment still,",
          "zh": "來進行絕對導覽，因為相對導覽目前仍然有點問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 105.53999999999999,
          "end": 110.99000000000001,
          "en": "then places, then tabs and I'm simply moving through all my route config, right?",
          "zh": "然後是 places，再來是 tabs，我就這樣一路走過我所有的路由設定，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 111,
          "end": 114.64,
          "en": "So I have, in the app routing module, we have places,",
          "zh": "所以在 app-routing module 裡，我們有 places，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 114.72,
          "end": 120.51,
          "en": "that's our first segment and therefore here we start with an absolute, with a slash for an absolute",
          "zh": "那是我們的第一個區段，因此這裡我們以絕對路徑開頭，用斜線來進行絕對"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 120.51,
          "end": 121.24,
          "en": "navigation,",
          "zh": "導覽，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 121.26,
          "end": 124.46,
          "en": "then we go into places, that will take us if",
          "zh": "接著我們進入 places，如果"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 124.56,
          "end": 131.58,
          "en": "we have a look, to the places page module, so the places module loads the places-routing file and there",
          "zh": "我們看一下，那會帶我們到 places page module，所以 places module 會載入 places-routing 檔案，而在那裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 131.58,
          "end": 133.7,
          "en": "we have that tabs route we want to go into",
          "zh": "我們有想進入的那條 tabs 路由，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 133.98,
          "end": 136,
          "en": "and then we want to go into discover",
          "zh": "然後我們想進入 discover，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 136.14,
          "end": 143.76,
          "en": "and then here into place ID and that is of course a dynamic segment then. So back in the discover page,",
          "zh": "接著再進入 place ID，那當然就是動態區段了。所以回到 discover 頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 144.06,
          "end": 154.26,
          "en": "we go to places, tabs, then discover and then that dynamic segment is my place here, my loaded places,",
          "zh": "我們前往 places、tabs，然後 discover，接著那個動態區段就是我的 place，也就是我載入的 places"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 154.35,
          "end": 161.98,
          "en": "the first element and then the ID. Well let's close that button tag and restructure this across multiple",
          "zh": "的第一個元素，然後是 ID。好，我們把那個 button 標籤關起來，並把這段重新排版成多行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 161.98,
          "end": 168.68,
          "en": "lines to make it easier to read and inside of this button, I'll simply have a text of more",
          "zh": "讓它更容易閱讀，而在這個按鈕裡面，我就放一段文字「more」，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 168.73,
          "end": 170.95,
          "en": "and of course you can have any text you want.",
          "zh": "當然你要放什麼文字都可以。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 172.4,
          "end": 177.9,
          "en": "Now if you save that, we should have a nice button here,",
          "zh": "現在如果你儲存，這裡應該會有一個漂亮的按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 177.95,
          "end": 178.82999999999998,
          "en": "there it is",
          "zh": "就是這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 178.88,
          "end": 183.62,
          "en": "and if we tab it, we are indeed taken to the place detail page with no back button right now",
          "zh": "而如果我們點選它，確實會被帶到 place detail 頁面，只是目前沒有返回按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 183.62,
          "end": 186.02,
          "en": "but of course we can use the browser back button. Here",
          "zh": "但我們當然可以用瀏覽器的返回按鈕。在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 186.02,
          "end": 193.66,
          "en": "however we don't get that nice transition, that's important to note because we leverage a browser feature",
          "zh": "我們卻沒有那個漂亮的轉場，這點很重要，因為我們用的是瀏覽器功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 193.66,
          "end": 197.91,
          "en": "here which is not captured by Javascript or handled in any way.",
          "zh": "JavaScript 並不會捕捉到，也不會以任何方式處理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 199.5,
          "end": 201.96,
          "en": "So that's nice and that works",
          "zh": "這樣很不錯，而且可行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 204.76,
          "end": 208.06,
          "en": "and actually I think we could even do without the padding on that",
          "zh": "其實我覺得我們甚至可以不要那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 208.07,
          "end": 210.74,
          "en": "div here around the button, might look nicer,",
          "zh": "按鈕周圍 div 上的 padding，可能會更好看，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 213.21,
          "end": 219.82999999999998,
          "en": "it definitely does in my opinion but you can style this however you want or we'll actually center this and therefore",
          "zh": "在我看來確實如此，但你要怎麼設計樣式都行，或者我們其實會把它置中，因此"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 219.89,
          "end": 225.19,
          "en": "since we already center all the text in the card, I just remove text right now to think about this",
          "zh": "既然卡片裡所有文字都已經置中，我現在就把 text-right 移掉，讓你們想想看，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 226.11,
          "end": 229.32999999999998,
          "en": "but that are minor things and you can adjust this to your liking.",
          "zh": "但這些都是小事，你可以依自己的喜好調整。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 229.36,
          "end": 234.73,
          "en": "One thing you can set when you set router link which I haven't showed you before is you can also set",
          "zh": "設定 routerLink 時可以設定的一項東西，我之前沒給你們看過，就是你也可以設定"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 234.73,
          "end": 235.99,
          "en": "router direction.",
          "zh": "routerDirection。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 235.99,
          "end": 239.88,
          "en": "Now that is Ionic specific, not Angular, not an Angular feature",
          "zh": "這是 Ionic 專屬的，不是 Angular，不是 Angular 的功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 240.19,
          "end": 246.61,
          "en": "and this will give Ionic a hint whether this navigation here will be a forward navigation and therefore",
          "zh": "它會給 Ionic 一個提示，指出這裡的導覽會是向前導覽，因此"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 246.61,
          "end": 252.58,
          "en": "it should play an animation that actually adds a page to the stack and looks like you're going forward",
          "zh": "它應該播放真正把頁面加入堆疊的動畫，看起來像是往前進，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 253.15,
          "end": 260.56,
          "en": "or if it should play a backward animation. So you can set this here to forward or to backward or you",
          "zh": "或者應該播放向後動畫。所以你可以在這裡設成 forward 或 backward，或者"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 260.56,
          "end": 265.45,
          "en": "just give it away and Ionic will detect it automatically which typically works quite nice",
          "zh": "乾脆不設定，Ionic 會自動偵測，通常效果都相當不錯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 265.6,
          "end": 271.24,
          "en": "but setting this router direction can be helpful when this is a page that might be loaded as the first",
          "zh": "但當這個頁面可能被載入為應用程式的第一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 271.24,
          "end": 275.8,
          "en": "page of your application where this should actually go back instead of forward",
          "zh": "頁面，而這裡其實應該向後而不是向前時，設定這個 routerDirection 就會有幫助，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 275.86,
          "end": 282.67,
          "en": "and then by setting this to backward manually, would apply the right animation and not play the default",
          "zh": "然後手動把它設成 backward，就會套用正確的動畫，而不會播放預設的"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 282.67,
          "end": 289.54,
          "en": "of forward which Ionic probably which detect if the page is loaded for the first time. We don't need",
          "zh": "forward，那是 Ionic 在頁面第一次載入時大概會偵測到的結果。我們在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 289.54,
          "end": 295.36,
          "en": "it here though, that's our button. Now for the list down there,",
          "zh": "並不需要，那就是我們的按鈕。現在來看下面那個清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 295.36,
          "end": 301.42,
          "en": "I want to navigate when we tab one of the list items, that is actually super simple to implement, on ion",
          "zh": "我希望當我們點選其中一個清單項目時就導覽，這其實非常容易實作，在 ion-"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 301.43,
          "end": 302.17,
          "en": "item,",
          "zh": "item 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 302.17,
          "end": 308.41,
          "en": "you can simply add router link and of course, you could always also add a click listener and execute",
          "zh": "你可以直接加入 routerLink，當然你也隨時可以加入 click 監聽器，並執行"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 308.41,
          "end": 313.24,
          "en": "a method in which you then route programmatically with the injected Angular router",
          "zh": "一個方法，在裡面用注入的 Angular router 以程式化方式路由，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 313.24,
          "end": 315.76,
          "en": "but here, I'll use router link. Again",
          "zh": "但在這裡，我會用 routerLink。同樣地，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 315.8,
          "end": 319.09,
          "en": "this also needs to be bound to a dynamic value",
          "zh": "這也需要綁定到動態值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 319.09,
          "end": 330.14,
          "en": "and this will be an array where we go to //places tabs discover and then also the dynamic",
          "zh": "這會是一個陣列，我們前往 //places、tabs、discover，然後還有那個動態"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 330.14,
          "end": 336.38,
          "en": "segment here is place because we're going through all the places and we store each place in a place variable",
          "zh": "區段就是 place，因為我們會走過所有 places，並把每個 place 存到 place 變數裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 336.92,
          "end": 339.37,
          "en": "and then it's just place ID",
          "zh": "然後就只是 place ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 339.89,
          "end": 342.79,
          "en": "and now we have that router link on the ion item.",
          "zh": "現在我們就在 ion-item 上有了那個 routerLink。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 343.01,
          "end": 350.89,
          "en": "If we now let this reload, we can tab these items and the navigation works but it's not super clear that",
          "zh": "如果我們現在讓它重新載入，我們可以點選這些項目，導覽也正常運作，但並不是很明顯"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 350.89,
          "end": 357.28,
          "en": "we can tab them and therefore Ionic gives us a little convenience feature. On an ion item, you can add a special",
          "zh": "我們可以點選它們，因此 Ionic 給了我們一個小小的便利功能。在 ion-item 上，你可以加入一個特別的"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 357.28,
          "end": 363.07,
          "en": "detail attribute, you don't need to pass in any value, you just add it like this and this will render a",
          "zh": "detail 屬性，你不需要傳入任何值，只要像這樣加上去，它就會渲染一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 363.07,
          "end": 369.01,
          "en": "little icon, a little arrow icon that indicates that this moves you forward, here",
          "zh": "小圖示，一個小箭頭圖示，表示這會帶你往前，在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 369.04,
          "end": 373.99,
          "en": "this little arrow on the right and this makes it clearer that we can press this.",
          "zh": "右邊這個小箭頭，這讓它更清楚可以看出我們可以按它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 374.2,
          "end": 377.92,
          "en": "So that is the basic forward backward navigation implemented,",
          "zh": "這樣就實作了基本的向前、向後導覽，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 377.95,
          "end": 378.49,
          "en": "let's move on.",
          "zh": "我們繼續往下。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727830",
      "title": "Going Back with NavController",
      "lectureOrder": 115,
      "videoOrder": 94,
      "sourceHash": "df79456a69faa67fe5dd8f565a91692b4c78062cab14720554d2e1a266ca8ef7",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.79,
          "end": 6.42,
          "en": "So how can we go back from let's say our place detail page?",
          "zh": "那麼，我們要怎麼從比如說 place detail 頁面返回呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.6,
          "end": 10.91,
          "en": "Now one easy way of course is to add an ion back button,",
          "zh": "當然，一個簡單的方法就是加入 ion-back-button，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.98,
          "end": 13.11,
          "en": "do you remember how that worked?",
          "zh": "你還記得那是怎麼運作的嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.11,
          "end": 19.59,
          "en": "You don't just add it like this, you instead wrap it into ion buttons where you should set the slot to",
          "zh": "你不能就這樣直接加上去，而是要把它包在 ion-buttons 裡，並把 slot 設為"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 19.59,
          "end": 21.83,
          "en": "start which positions it",
          "zh": "start，這會決定它的位置，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 22.05,
          "end": 26.97,
          "en": "most of the time on the left but start really depends on the device you're running on and also in the",
          "zh": "大多數時候在左邊，但 start 其實取決於你執行的裝置，也取決於"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 26.97,
          "end": 34.37,
          "en": "region settings but wrapped in there, you now add your ion back button and that ion back button now",
          "zh": "地區設定，但包在那裡面之後，你現在加入 ion-back-button，而那個 ion-back-button 現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 34.41,
          "end": 35.16,
          "en": "by default,",
          "zh": "預設就會"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 35.19,
          "end": 36.96,
          "en": "well takes you back.",
          "zh": "帶你返回。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 36.99,
          "end": 41.07,
          "en": "Now let me also adjust the title here a little bit,",
          "zh": "現在也讓我把這裡的標題稍微調整一下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 41.1,
          "end": 44.16,
          "en": "we can later display the actual title of the place we loaded,",
          "zh": "我們之後可以顯示我們載入的地點的實際標題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 44.16,
          "end": 52.02,
          "en": "for now I'll just at least set it to this a little bit nicer looking title and now when we go to a",
          "zh": "目前我至少先把它設成這個看起來好看一點的標題，而現在當我們前往"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 52.02,
          "end": 56.28,
          "en": "page, we do have the back button and it does take us back.",
          "zh": "某個頁面時，我們確實有返回按鈕，而且它確實帶我們返回。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 56.34,
          "end": 61.47,
          "en": "Now one problem we have is when we reload this page, we don't have the back button because Ionic detects",
          "zh": "現在有個問題是，當我們重新載入這個頁面時，我們沒有返回按鈕，因為 Ionic 偵測到"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 61.47,
          "end": 64.23,
          "en": "that it doesn't know where to take us.",
          "zh": "它不知道要帶我們去哪裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 64.32,
          "end": 69.93,
          "en": "As this page reloaded, the app restarted and therefore this stack of pages is removed,",
          "zh": "因為這個頁面重新載入時，app 重新啟動，因此這個頁面堆疊被移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 69.93,
          "end": 70.53,
          "en": "it's cleared,",
          "zh": "被清空了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 70.56,
          "end": 75.87,
          "en": "that's just how Javascript works, if you reload the app restarts and all the other memory or what you",
          "zh": "JavaScript 就是這樣運作的，如果你重新載入，app 就會重新啟動，所有其他記憶體或你"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 75.87,
          "end": 81.87,
          "en": "had in memory is lost and therefore Ionic can't really go back because it doesn't know which page came",
          "zh": "存在記憶體裡的東西都會遺失，因此 Ionic 無法真的返回，因為它不知道哪個頁面在"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 81.87,
          "end": 83.58,
          "en": "before this page",
          "zh": "這個頁面之前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 83.58,
          "end": 89.07,
          "en": "and that is why on the ion back button, you can add that default the ref attribute, by the way you could",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼在 ion-back-button 上，你可以加入 default-href 屬性，順帶一提，你也可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 89.07,
          "end": 92.6,
          "en": "also add default ref like this and set this to the path",
          "zh": "像這樣加入 default-href，並把它設成"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 92.61,
          "end": 96.84,
          "en": "you want to go to in case Ionic doesn't know where to go to",
          "zh": "當 Ionic 不知道要去哪裡時你想前往的路徑，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 97.05,
          "end": 104.18,
          "en": "and then that would be in our case places tabs discover. And if you add this now, when display detail",
          "zh": "在我們的例子裡就會是 places、tabs、discover。如果你現在加上這個，當 display detail"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 104.19,
          "end": 110.52000000000001,
          "en": "page reloads which is of course a reasonable scenario in a web app where you can load any page by entering",
          "zh": "頁面重新載入時，這在 web app 裡當然是合理的情境，你可以輸入"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 110.52000000000001,
          "end": 111.47,
          "en": "the right URL,",
          "zh": "正確的 URL 來載入任何頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 111.50999999999999,
          "end": 113.77000000000001,
          "en": "now we have the back button here too.",
          "zh": "現在我們這裡也有返回按鈕了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 114.03,
          "end": 120.34,
          "en": "However, doesn't work right? Well that's just the thing here in Angular.",
          "zh": "不過，這樣行不通對吧？嗯，在 Angular 裡就是這麼一回事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 120.34,
          "end": 126.94,
          "en": "There you indeed have to use default ref like this, default ref with a slash in between works if you're",
          "zh": "在那裡你確實得用像這樣的 default-href，中間有斜線的 default-href 在你"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 126.94,
          "end": 133.18,
          "en": "using Ionic components in a vanilla Javascript application, when using the Angular one, it should be default",
          "zh": "於 vanilla JavaScript 應用程式中使用 Ionic 元件時可以運作，但使用 Angular 版本時，它應該是 default"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 133.18,
          "end": 134.86,
          "en": "ref like this in camel case",
          "zh": "Href，像這樣用駝峰式"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 134.86,
          "end": 140.17000000000002,
          "en": "notation and now with that, that will reload and then this button will take us back.",
          "zh": "命名，而現在這樣一來，重新載入後這個按鈕就會帶我們返回。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 140.2,
          "end": 141.22,
          "en": "Here we go.",
          "zh": "看吧。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 141.22,
          "end": 143.53,
          "en": "How else could we go back when we're on this page?",
          "zh": "當我們在這個頁面上時，還有什麼其他方式可以返回？"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 143.53,
          "end": 149.37,
          "en": "Let's say on place detail, we do have our bookings button to book this place.",
          "zh": "比如在 place detail 上，我們有個預訂按鈕可以預訂這個地點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 149.53,
          "end": 159.37,
          "en": "So in there, I'll add an ion button and put just book onto it as label and give it a color of primary,",
          "zh": "所以在裡面，我會加入一個 ion-button，標籤就放 book，並給它 primary 的顏色，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 159.54,
          "end": 164.28,
          "en": "something like that and maybe add a little margin around this button with the margin",
          "zh": "大概像那樣，也許再用 margin"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 164.35,
          "end": 167,
          "en": "CSS utility attribute.",
          "zh": "這個 CSS 工具屬性在按鈕周圍加一點邊距。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 167.07999999999998,
          "end": 171.37,
          "en": "Now we should see a nice button on the page as it reloads,",
          "zh": "現在頁面重新載入後，我們應該會看到一個漂亮的按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 171.37,
          "end": 172.63,
          "en": "here it is",
          "zh": "就是這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 172.63,
          "end": 176.22,
          "en": "and this button when we tap it of course does nothing at the moment.",
          "zh": "而這個按鈕當我們點它時，目前當然什麼都不會做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 176.35,
          "end": 178.35,
          "en": "It can't because we haven't added any logic, so",
          "zh": "它也沒辦法，因為我們還沒加入任何邏輯，所以"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 178.76,
          "end": 183.67,
          "en": "let's add a click listener and there I'll execute onBookPlace.",
          "zh": "我們來加入 click 監聽器，在那裡執行 onBookPlace。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 183.67,
          "end": 190.57,
          "en": "Now later we'll open a modal there which will later then allow us to add our user details for booking",
          "zh": "之後我們會在那裡開啟一個 modal，屆時就能讓我們加入使用者資料來預訂"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 190.57,
          "end": 192.39,
          "en": "that place, for the moment",
          "zh": "那個地點，目前"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 192.79,
          "end": 194.43,
          "en": "I just want to execute this method,",
          "zh": "我只想執行這個方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 194.44,
          "end": 201.59,
          "en": "so let's add onBookPlace here to the Typescript file and in onBookPlace at the moment,",
          "zh": "所以我們把 onBookPlace 加到 TypeScript 檔案裡，而在 onBookPlace 裡目前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 201.6,
          "end": 202.89,
          "en": "I just want to go back.",
          "zh": "我只想返回。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 202.99,
          "end": 206.54,
          "en": "Now we have a couple of different options for going back,",
          "zh": "我們有幾種不同的返回方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 206.62,
          "end": 210.01,
          "en": "one of them is that we inject the Angular router.",
          "zh": "其中一種是注入 Angular router。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 210.01,
          "end": 212.14,
          "en": "We do it like this,",
          "zh": "我們這樣做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 212.56,
          "end": 213.9,
          "en": "import router from",
          "zh": "從"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 213.9,
          "end": 220.32999999999998,
          "en": "@angular/router and with that injected here, we can call this router navigate and then enter the",
          "zh": "@angular/router 匯入 router，把它注入到這裡之後，我們可以呼叫 this.router.navigate，然後輸入"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 220.32999999999998,
          "end": 220.59,
          "en": "URL to",
          "zh": "我們想前往的"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 220.6,
          "end": 221.66,
          "en": "which we want to navigate",
          "zh": "URL，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 221.74,
          "end": 232.27,
          "en": "like places tabs discover, like that, should be navigate by URL if you're using a full URL,",
          "zh": "像 places、tabs、discover 這樣，用完整 URL 時應該是 navigateByUrl，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 232.37,
          "end": 241.06,
          "en": "otherwise you have to pass in an array with all the segments. With that if this app reloads and I click book,",
          "zh": "否則你必須傳入一個包含所有區段的陣列。有了這個，如果 app 重新載入而我點 book，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 241.83,
          "end": 242.85,
          "en": "we go there.",
          "zh": "我們就會到那裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 244.57,
          "end": 250.33,
          "en": "Now what you noticed and that by the way is also still the case on the back button if we reload,",
          "zh": "你注意到了，順帶一提，如果我們重新載入，返回按鈕也還是有同樣的情況，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 250.39,
          "end": 255.42,
          "en": "it's playing the wrong animation, it plays the animation it normally plays when adding a page, where the",
          "zh": "它播放了錯誤的動畫，它播放的是新增頁面時通常播放的動畫，也就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 255.46,
          "end": 256.99,
          "en": "page slides up from the bottom.",
          "zh": "頁面從底部往上滑。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 257.02,
          "end": 262.54,
          "en": "It should play this down sliding animation but when this page is reloaded, even for the back button, it",
          "zh": "它應該播放向下滑的動畫，但當這個頁面重新載入時，即使是返回按鈕，它"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 262.54,
          "end": 263.8,
          "en": "placed the wrong one.",
          "zh": "播放的也是錯的那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 263.8,
          "end": 266.2,
          "en": "Now that you'll just be a bug with the back button",
          "zh": "那個大概只是返回按鈕的 bug，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 266.2,
          "end": 269.02,
          "en": "but for our own navigation, it's not a bug,",
          "zh": "但對我們自己的導覽來說，這不是 bug，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 269.02,
          "end": 276.15999999999997,
          "en": "instead Ionic by default plays the forward animation if it doesn't know what the previous page was, if there",
          "zh": "而是 Ionic 在不知道上一個頁面是什麼時，預設會播放向前動畫，如果"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 276.15999999999997,
          "end": 281.71,
          "en": "is no previous page on the stack because it correctly assumes that any navigation you're doing with",
          "zh": "堆疊上沒有上一個頁面，因為它正確地假設你在頁面堆疊"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 281.71,
          "end": 287.14,
          "en": "an empty stack of pages is a forward navigation and hence it doesn't know it should actually play the backward",
          "zh": "為空時所做的任何導覽都是向前導覽，因此它不知道這次導覽其實應該播放向後"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 287.40999999999997,
          "end": 292.17,
          "en": "animation for this navigation. For the book button when we do go back,",
          "zh": "動畫。而對 book 按鈕來說，當我們確實要返回時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 292.18,
          "end": 293.1,
          "en": "it should though",
          "zh": "它應該要才對，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 293.26,
          "end": 296.19,
          "en": "and here, the nav controller can help us.",
          "zh": "而在這裡，NavController 可以幫我們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 296.38,
          "end": 304.33,
          "en": "You inject it like this, simply by referencing nav controller as a type and that is imported from @ionic/angular",
          "zh": "你像這樣注入它，只要把 NavController 當成型別來參考，而它是從 @ionic/angular 匯入的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 304.33,
          "end": 310.75,
          "en": "so it's important to add this import and now the nav controller can be used for navigating around.",
          "zh": "所以加入這個 import 很重要，現在 NavController 就可以用來四處導覽。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 310.75,
          "end": 318.28,
          "en": "You can use this nav controller and then here, you have navigate back and navigate forward methods and",
          "zh": "你可以使用這個 NavController，然後在這裡有 navigateBack 和 navigateForward 方法，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 318.28,
          "end": 327.61,
          "en": "navigate back then takes either an array with these different segments or just a URL to recipes,",
          "zh": "navigateBack 可以接受包含這些不同區段的陣列，或只是像 recipes 這樣的 URL，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 327.76,
          "end": 334.48,
          "en": "not recipes, to places tabs discover. And now the difference is under the hood,",
          "zh": "不是 recipes，是 places、tabs、discover。而現在的差別在於底層，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 334.48,
          "end": 341.08,
          "en": "this will use the Angular router, so this doesn't use any fancy new Ionic router, it uses the Angular router",
          "zh": "這會使用 Angular router，所以它不是用什麼花俏的新 Ionic router，而是用 Angular router，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 341.40999999999997,
          "end": 347.52,
          "en": "but it set some internal metadata or configuration so that the right animation is played.",
          "zh": "但它會設定一些內部的 metadata 或設定，好讓正確的動畫被播放。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 347.59000000000003,
          "end": 355.27,
          "en": "So now if I click book, this plays the back animation here instead of the forward navigation. Another way",
          "zh": "所以現在如果我點 book，這裡就會播放返回動畫，而不是向前導覽。另一種"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 355.39,
          "end": 362.59,
          "en": "of navigating back is to use the nav controller and call the pop method there, this will pop the last page",
          "zh": "返回的方式是使用 NavController 並呼叫那裡的 pop 方法，這會把堆疊上的最後一個頁面"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 362.68,
          "end": 364.32,
          "en": "of the stack.",
          "zh": "彈出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 364.33,
          "end": 366.36,
          "en": "Now this has one problem though,",
          "zh": "不過這有一個問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 366.43,
          "end": 368.37,
          "en": "let me show you what the problem is.",
          "zh": "讓我示範問題在哪裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 368.45,
          "end": 372.49,
          "en": "Let's wait for this app to reload and if I go forward and I click book,",
          "zh": "我們等這個 app 重新載入，如果我往前進然後點 book，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 372.49,
          "end": 373.35,
          "en": "I go backward,",
          "zh": "我就往後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 373.36,
          "end": 374.56,
          "en": "perfect.",
          "zh": "完美。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 374.59,
          "end": 378.21,
          "en": "Now let's say we loaded this detail page as our first page,",
          "zh": "現在假設我們把這個 detail 頁面載入成為第一個頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 378.25,
          "end": 379.28,
          "en": "so I reload the page",
          "zh": "所以我重新載入頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 379.28,
          "end": 383.27,
          "en": "whilst I'm on that. If I now click book,",
          "zh": "當我停在那個頁面上時。如果我現在點 book，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 383.36,
          "end": 388.23,
          "en": "this does not work because popping doesn't work if the stack of pages is empty.",
          "zh": "這就沒用了，因為如果頁面堆疊是空的，pop 就不會有作用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 388.34,
          "end": 389.98,
          "en": "So this is unreliable",
          "zh": "所以這並不可靠，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 389.99,
          "end": 396.14,
          "en": "if you can't guarantee there that there is something on the stack of pages. If you can guarantee that",
          "zh": "如果你無法保證頁面堆疊上一定有什麼東西。但如果你可以保證，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 396.17,
          "end": 401.96,
          "en": "though because it is a page which doesn't really have a route people will use to start into your app",
          "zh": "因為這是個其實沒有路由、人們不會用來起始進入你的 app 的頁面"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 401.99,
          "end": 405.94,
          "en": "or something like that, then you can use that as well,",
          "zh": "之類的情況，那你也可以使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 405.95,
          "end": 409.97,
          "en": "otherwise simply use this mechanism.",
          "zh": "否則就簡單用這個機制。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 409.97,
          "end": 414.65,
          "en": "The advantage of pop of course would have been that we don't need to specify the path we",
          "zh": "pop 的優點當然會是我們不需要指定想前往的路徑，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 414.65,
          "end": 419.17,
          "en": "want to go to but the disadvantage of course is that we have to guarantee that there is a previous page.",
          "zh": "但缺點當然就是我們必須保證有上一個頁面。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727846",
      "title": "Navigating via Toolbar Buttons",
      "lectureOrder": 116,
      "videoOrder": 95,
      "sourceHash": "f760b593ca0d2aabd0a85c18cf1b0052337364eb4c4e3f5bfdad57cc8b3e65b2",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.62,
          "end": 7.72,
          "en": "To create a new offer on the offers page in the toolbar, we need",
          "zh": "要在 offers 頁面的工具列上建立新的 offer，我們需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.72,
          "end": 8.23,
          "en": "an icon",
          "zh": "一個圖示"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.23,
          "end": 11.38,
          "en": "or a button that actually let's us go to that new page.",
          "zh": "或一個按鈕，讓我們真的能前往那個新頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.39,
          "end": 13.27,
          "en": "It actually is quite trivial,",
          "zh": "這其實相當簡單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.27,
          "end": 18.54,
          "en": "we can add another ion buttons group because any button you add to your toolbar should always be in",
          "zh": "我們可以再加入一個 ion-buttons 群組，因為你加到工具列的任何按鈕都應該放在"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.56,
          "end": 20.03,
          "en": "such an ion buttons group",
          "zh": "這樣的 ion-buttons 群組裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.29,
          "end": 25.45,
          "en": "and here the slot will be primary and you can of course find out which slots exist in the official docs,",
          "zh": "而這裡的 slot 會是 primary，你當然可以在官方文件裡查出有哪些 slot 可用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.45,
          "end": 29.38,
          "en": "primary typically is at the end of the toolbar. In there,",
          "zh": "primary 通常在工具列的末端。在那裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.38,
          "end": 34.87,
          "en": "I'll now add my ion button and in that ion button, I'll add my ion icon with a name of add",
          "zh": "我現在會加入我的 ion-button，並在那個 ion-button 裡加入 name 為 add 的 ion-icon，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 34.87,
          "end": 41.02,
          "en": "and that will render a nice plus. I'll give that icon a slot of icon only, so that inside of this",
          "zh": "那會渲染出一個漂亮的加號。我會給那個圖示 slot 為 icon-only，這樣在這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 41.02,
          "end": 41.51,
          "en": "button,",
          "zh": "按鈕裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 41.56,
          "end": 49.5,
          "en": "it's positioned perfectly to be the only icon in there. Now on the button, we want to go to our new page",
          "zh": "它會被完美定位成裡面唯一的圖示。現在在這個按鈕上，我們想前往我們的新頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 49.8,
          "end": 56.25,
          "en": "and if we have a quick look at the places-routing again, that would be under places tabs offers/",
          "zh": "如果我們再快速看一下 places-routing，那會在 places、tabs、offers/"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 56.52,
          "end": 60.8,
          "en": "new, this page here. So back in the offers page,",
          "zh": "new 底下，就是這個頁面。所以回到 offers 頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 60.81,
          "end": 70.42,
          "en": "we of course can simply add a router link now with a hardcoded value of places tabs offers new and",
          "zh": "我們當然現在可以直接加入一個 routerLink，用寫死的值 places、tabs、offers、new，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 70.42,
          "end": 71.73,
          "en": "that should already be all.",
          "zh": "這樣應該就完成了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 71.73,
          "end": 79.03999999999999,
          "en": "If this page now reloads, we can press the plus button and here we are on the new offer",
          "zh": "如果這個頁面現在重新載入，我們可以按加號按鈕，而我們就在 new offer"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 79.03999999999999,
          "end": 91.74,
          "en": "page. Now on that new offer page, I'll adjust the title, new offer and to also have a back button, we can add",
          "zh": "頁面上了。現在在那個 new offer 頁面上，我會調整標題為 new offer，而為了也有返回按鈕，我們可以加入"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 91.77,
          "end": 105.17,
          "en": "ion buttons slot start and then the ion back button with a default ref of places tabs offers and",
          "zh": "ion-buttons、slot 為 start，然後是 ion-back-button，default-href 為 places、tabs、offers，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 105.31,
          "end": 111.25,
          "en": "now as this page reloads, we should see the new title, we see the back button and we can go back and forth",
          "zh": "現在當這個頁面重新載入，我們應該會看到新標題，看到返回按鈕，而且我們可以來回"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 111.25,
          "end": 111.75999999999999,
          "en": "here now.",
          "zh": "切換了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 112.18,
          "end": 115.67,
          "en": "So this is now working as it should,",
          "zh": "所以現在這運作正常了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 115.78,
          "end": 118.39,
          "en": "how can we go to that edit page then?",
          "zh": "那我們要怎麼前往那個 edit 頁面呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 118.39,
          "end": 121.04,
          "en": "Well right now we have no direct way, later",
          "zh": "嗯，現在我們沒有直接的方式，之後"
