        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 121.06,
          "end": 128.89,
          "en": "I'll add a way for us to slide these items so that we can then expose an edit button. For now",
          "zh": "我會加入一種讓我們滑動這些項目的方式，這樣就能露出 edit 按鈕。目前"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 128.98,
          "end": 134.26,
          "en": "we haven't learned how to slide these items yet, let's simply make sure that we can't go to the edit place",
          "zh": "我們還沒學到怎麼滑動這些項目，我們就先確保我們能從這裡的"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 134.26,
          "end": 137.57999999999998,
          "en": "from the offer detail page here.",
          "zh": "offer detail 頁面前往 edit place。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 137.65,
          "end": 142.2,
          "en": "So on the offer bookings page is how we called it, there",
          "zh": "所以我們稱之為 offer bookings 頁面，在那裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 142.24,
          "end": 150.67000000000002,
          "en": "we can add another button with some margin and maybe a color of primary, of course you can also use other",
          "zh": "我們可以再加入一個按鈕，帶點 margin，也許顏色用 primary，當然你也可以用其他"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 150.79,
          "end": 154.79,
          "en": "colors like secondary, tertiary, danger, warning, whatever you want.",
          "zh": "顏色，例如 secondary、tertiary、danger、warning，你想用什麼都行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 154.99,
          "end": 165.44,
          "en": "Color primary for me it is, I'll say add it here and I will simply add a router link and that will now be",
          "zh": "我就用 primary，我會在這裡加進去，然後我直接加入一個 routerLink，而這現在會"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 165.44,
          "end": 171.53,
          "en": "a bit tricky because that router link needs to be bound dynamically because I need that ID of the",
          "zh": "有點棘手，因為那個 routerLink 需要以動態方式綁定，因為我需要那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 171.53,
          "end": 178.04,
          "en": "place I want to edit, right, in places-routing, I do pass that ID here as a dynamic segment and on",
          "zh": "我想編輯的地點的 ID。對，在 places-routing 裡，我確實把那個 ID 當成動態區段傳入，而在"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 178.04,
          "end": 185.29,
          "en": "the offered bookings page, we of course have that ID but currently I'm not extracting it.",
          "zh": "offer bookings 頁面上，我們當然有那個 ID，但目前我還沒有把它取出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 185.33,
          "end": 190.81,
          "en": "So let's extract it now so that we can then forward it to the edit offer page.",
          "zh": "所以我們現在把它取出來，這樣就能把它帶到 edit offer 頁面。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727850",
      "title": "Extracting the ID of Loaded Places",
      "lectureOrder": 118,
      "videoOrder": 96,
      "sourceHash": "c8a9f206fb6768854377fa3656d5a79309666f45976475ee14322cf287f8f9e3",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.22,
          "end": 7.48,
          "en": "So on offer bookings, we need to extract that ID of the place we loaded",
          "zh": "所以在 offer bookings 上，我們需要取出我們載入的地點的 ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.53,
          "end": 13.62,
          "en": "and for that, I'll actually store the whole place here in a property of the offer bookings page class,",
          "zh": "為此，我其實會把整個 place 存在 offer bookings 頁面 class 的一個屬性裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 13.92,
          "end": 20.34,
          "en": "for that you need to import that place model and to get access to the dynamic parts in our URL, we",
          "zh": "為此你需要匯入那個 place model，而要取得我們 URL 中的動態部分，我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 20.34,
          "end": 22.64,
          "en": "can use the activated route and",
          "zh": "可以使用 ActivatedRoute，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 22.68,
          "end": 24.8,
          "en": "I'll just name it route here, that property",
          "zh": "我在這裡就把那個屬性命名為 route，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 24.81,
          "end": 31.5,
          "en": "but the type is activated route which you need to import from @angular/router.",
          "zh": "但型別是 ActivatedRoute，你需要從 @angular/router 匯入它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 31.5,
          "end": 37.74,
          "en": "This then allows us to subscribe to changes to our route params in the URL which is where we do store",
          "zh": "這樣就能讓我們訂閱 URL 中路由參數的變化，那也是我們儲存"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 37.86,
          "end": 39.64,
          "en": "that dynamic segment.",
          "zh": "那個動態區段的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 39.66,
          "end": 48.15,
          "en": "So here we can set up this root param map subscribe, by the way with all the information about caching",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我們可以設定這個 route.paramMap.subscribe，順帶一提，關於快取"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 48.15,
          "end": 55.47,
          "en": "pages and so on, the subscription here will live on even if the page is invisible and therefore you don't",
          "zh": "頁面等資訊，這裡的訂閱即使在頁面不可見時仍會存在，因此你"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 55.47,
          "end": 58.85,
          "en": "need to do this in ionViewWillEnter or anything like this,",
          "zh": "不需要在 ionViewWillEnter 或類似的地方做這件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 58.89,
          "end": 64.83,
          "en": "it's OK if you do it in ngOnInit, this will be set up one time but it will then automatically update",
          "zh": "寫在 ngOnInit 裡也沒問題，這只會被設定一次，但之後它會自動更新，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 64.86,
          "end": 70.95,
          "en": "even if you are coming back from another page that did change that selected place ID because that subscription",
          "zh": "即使你是從另一個改變了所選 place ID 的頁面返回，因為那個訂閱"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 71.01,
          "end": 76.65,
          "en": "that listens to changes in the URLs will always be live, no matter if the page is currently visible",
          "zh": "會監聽 URL 的變化，它永遠是活的，不管這個頁面目前是可見"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 76.65,
          "end": 77.78999999999999,
          "en": "or not visible",
          "zh": "還是不可見，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 77.78999999999999,
          "end": 85.62,
          "en": "and no matter if ngOnInit executed once or five times. It's managed for you by Angular, this subscription",
          "zh": "也不管 ngOnInit 執行了一次還是五次。這個訂閱是由 Angular 為你管理的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 85.86,
          "end": 92.52000000000001,
          "en": "and therefore you can rely on getting the latest place ID or any dynamic segment you might have all",
          "zh": "因此你可以放心，任何時候都能取得最新的 place ID 或你擁有的任何動態區段，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 92.52000000000001,
          "end": 93.21000000000001,
          "en": "the time.",
          "zh": "隨時都是如此。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 93.97999999999999,
          "end": 102.19,
          "en": "So in here, you get that param map object and now we first of all can check if we don't have our place",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，你會拿到那個 paramMap 物件，現在我們首先可以檢查，如果因為某些原因我們沒有"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 102.19,
          "end": 108.52000000000001,
          "en": "ID for some reason, if that would be the case, then I want to navigate away and then we can actually",
          "zh": "place ID，如果真是這樣，那我就想導覽離開，而這時我們其實可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 108.75999999999999,
          "end": 117.4,
          "en": "use the nav controller now by injecting nav controller here, from @ionic/angular is where you have",
          "zh": "使用 NavController，在這裡注入 NavController，而要從 @ionic/angular"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 117.4,
          "end": 118.6,
          "en": "to import it",
          "zh": "匯入它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 118.99000000000001,
          "end": 125.94,
          "en": "and now if we don't have a place ID for whatever reason, then I want to navigate back here to places",
          "zh": "而現在如果我們因為任何原因沒有 place ID，那我就想在這裡導覽返回 places、"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 125.94,
          "end": 133,
          "en": "tabs offers. I'll also return here so that other code doesn't get executed in here.",
          "zh": "tabs、offers。我也會在這裡 return，這樣裡面其他程式碼就不會被執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 133.94,
          "end": 139.43,
          "en": "If we do have a place ID, well then we simply want to store or we want to load the place with that",
          "zh": "如果我們確實有 place ID，那我們就只是想儲存，或者想載入具有那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 139.43,
          "end": 144.56,
          "en": "ID and for this, we'll needs to place service because that is where we have the places.",
          "zh": "ID 的 place，為此我們需要 places service，因為 places 就在那裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 144.56,
          "end": 153.13,
          "en": "So our places service is what we need to inject as well and for that of course, you also need to add",
          "zh": "所以我們也需要注入 places service，為此你當然也要加入"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 153.13,
          "end": 161.89,
          "en": "the import to places service and then down there, we can set this place equal to this places service",
          "zh": "places service 的 import，然後在下面，我們可以把 this.place 設為 this.placesService."
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 162.01,
          "end": 169.03,
          "en": "places which is a list of all the places and there we could now find our fitting place by executing",
          "zh": "places，那是一份所有 places 的清單，我們現在可以透過執行"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 169.03,
          "end": 175.75,
          "en": "a function on it where we get the place as an input because this function executes on every element",
          "zh": "一個函式來找出符合的 place，這個函式會以 place 作為輸入，因為它會在 places 陣列中的每個元素上執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 175.75,
          "end": 180.94,
          "en": "in the places array and then we need to return true if that is the place we want and then the execution",
          "zh": "然後如果那就是我們要的 place，我們需要回傳 true，接著執行"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 180.94,
          "end": 187.02,
          "en": "will stop and it will return that place here and store it in this place and true should be returned",
          "zh": "就會停止，並在這裡回傳那個 place，把它存進 this.place，而 true 應該在"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 187.03,
          "end": 194.16,
          "en": "when the ID of the place we're looking at here is equal to param map get place ID.",
          "zh": "我們這裡看到的 place 的 ID 等於 paramMap.get('placeId') 時被回傳。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 194.76,
          "end": 199.77,
          "en": "Alternatively, you could outsource this logic into a function in the service and that is what I will do.",
          "zh": "另一種做法是，你可以把這段邏輯外包到 service 裡的一個函式，而我就會這麼做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 199.98,
          "end": 207.18,
          "en": "So in the places service, I will add a get place method where I pass in the ID of the place and then",
          "zh": "所以在 places service 裡，我會加入一個 getPlace 方法，傳入 place 的 ID，然後"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 207.18,
          "end": 217.8,
          "en": "in here, I return this underscore places, accessing my private places array, find comparing the ID here, not",
          "zh": "在這裡我回傳 this._places，存取我私有的 places 陣列，用 find 比較 ID，這裡不是"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 217.8,
          "end": 222.81,
          "en": "to param map get place ID, I don't have access to that here but simply to the ID we're getting",
          "zh": "比對 paramMap.get('placeId')，我在這裡無法存取那個，而是單純比對我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 222.81,
          "end": 231.16,
          "en": "as an argument and I return that and I will clone that entire object like this using the spread operator",
          "zh": "作為引數拿到的 ID，我回傳它，而我會像這樣用展開運算子複製整個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 231.16,
          "end": 237.28,
          "en": "here and then I pull out all the properties of the place object we retrieved here and add them into a",
          "zh": "然後把我這裡取回的 place 物件的所有屬性抽出來，加進一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 237.28,
          "end": 243.01,
          "en": "new object so that if we now were to add it, this object, we wouldn't edit the original object which is",
          "zh": "新物件，這樣如果我們之後要修改這個物件，就不會改到原始物件，這是"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 243.01,
          "end": 246.37,
          "en": "a good pattern and a good habit to get into.",
          "zh": "一個好模式，也是值得養成的好習慣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 246.37,
          "end": 248.37,
          "en": "So we have the get place method,",
          "zh": "所以我們有了 getPlace 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 248.53,
          "end": 256.11,
          "en": "therefore here on places service, I now call get place and I now pass param map get place ID",
          "zh": "因此在這裡的 places service 上，我現在呼叫 getPlace，並傳入 paramMap.get('placeId')"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 256.36,
          "end": 261.64,
          "en": "to this get place method. This now gives us access to the place and we have access to this place in our",
          "zh": "給這個 getPlace 方法。這現在讓我們能取得 place，而我們在整個"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 261.64,
          "end": 263.93,
          "en": "entire component here now.",
          "zh": "元件裡都能取用這個 place 了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 263.95,
          "end": 271.3,
          "en": "Therefore for one, I can adjust the title and can adjust this to place title and for constructing this",
          "zh": "因此首先，我可以調整標題，把它設成 place.title，而要建構這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 271.3,
          "end": 273.55,
          "en": "link here, now we can do that,",
          "zh": "這裡的連結，我們現在可以這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 273.58,
          "end": 283.26,
          "en": "now we can go to /places tabs offers and then our place ID,",
          "zh": "現在我們可以前往 /places、tabs、offers，然後是我們的 place ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 283.27,
          "end": 287.26,
          "en": "so that dynamic segment here. Let's give that a try,",
          "zh": "也就是這裡的那個動態區段。我們來試試看，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 287.29,
          "end": 294.3,
          "en": "if I now click edit here, we are editing the Manhattan mansion by the looks of it and nothing happens",
          "zh": "如果我現在在這裡點 edit，看起來我們正在編輯 Manhattan mansion，但什麼都沒發生，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 294.31,
          "end": 297.01,
          "en": "because I of course have the wrong link.",
          "zh": "因為我當然用錯了連結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 297.04,
          "end": 302.34,
          "en": "This is the link of the page we already are on, of the offer bookings page.",
          "zh": "這是我們已經所在頁面的連結，也就是 offer bookings 頁面的連結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 302.47,
          "end": 305.88,
          "en": "If we have a quick look at the places-routing module again,",
          "zh": "如果我們再快速看一下 places-routing module，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 306.04,
          "end": 310.01,
          "en": "I of course want to go to edit/ and then that place ID,",
          "zh": "我當然想前往 edit/，然後是那個 place ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 310.03,
          "end": 313.69,
          "en": "so the correct path here would be another segment,",
          "zh": "所以這裡正確的路徑會是再多一個區段，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 313.72,
          "end": 317.44,
          "en": "the edit segment after offers and then the place ID.",
          "zh": "也就是 offers 之後的 edit 區段，然後是 place ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 317.47,
          "end": 323.48,
          "en": "So now let's wait for this to reload and this takes us to the edit offer page. So we can reach that",
          "zh": "所以現在我們等它重新載入，這會帶我們到 edit offer 頁面。所以我們也能到達那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 323.48,
          "end": 324.49,
          "en": "page too,",
          "zh": "頁面了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 324.5,
          "end": 327.44,
          "en": "let's now just adjust the title a little bit,",
          "zh": "現在我們再把標題稍微調整一下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 329.95,
          "end": 332.14,
          "en": "add an offer and we're good.",
          "zh": "改成 add an offer，這樣就行了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727854",
      "title": "Adding a SideDrawer",
      "lectureOrder": 120,
      "videoOrder": 97,
      "sourceHash": "27c097b98170e1934fbecbbc33bed0fd836993df78b088c7945ce9cf3f7c2cad",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.15,
          "end": 5.87,
          "en": "Now that we spend so much time on going back and forth and loading data,",
          "zh": "既然我們花了這麼多時間在來回切換與載入資料上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.97,
          "end": 11.99,
          "en": "let's move into the other big navigation concept we see in mobile but also in web apps",
          "zh": "我們來進入另一個在行動裝置、也在 web app 中常見的重要導覽概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 11.99,
          "end": 18.26,
          "en": "and that would be a side drawer and Ionic ships with a built-in side drawer which you can easily add to",
          "zh": "那就是側邊抽屜，而 Ionic 內建了側邊抽屜，你可以輕鬆加到"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 18.26,
          "end": 19.11,
          "en": "your app.",
          "zh": "你的 app 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 19.17,
          "end": 25.28,
          "en": "Now a side drawer of course is that thing you trigger typically with that hamburger icon in your pop navigation",
          "zh": "側邊抽屜當然就是你通常在上方導覽列或工具列中用那個漢堡圖示觸發的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 25.28,
          "end": 28.67,
          "en": "bar or your toolbar and then you tap that and",
          "zh": "然後你點它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 28.73,
          "end": 30.37,
          "en": "the side drawer opens up,",
          "zh": "側邊抽屜就會打開，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 30.37,
          "end": 31.94,
          "en": "that is how that typically works",
          "zh": "通常就是這樣運作的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 31.97,
          "end": 39.26,
          "en": "and in that side drawer, you can have links to other pages, other areas in your application and you can",
          "zh": "而在那個側邊抽屜裡，你可以放連到應用程式中其他頁面、其他區域的連結，也可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 39.26,
          "end": 45.47,
          "en": "also have other utility buttons, like for example logging the user out which might also navigate away",
          "zh": "放其他工具按鈕，例如把使用者登出，那可能也會導覽離開，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 45.56,
          "end": 48.47,
          "en": "but which mainly does something different.",
          "zh": "但主要做的是別的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 48.47,
          "end": 50.69,
          "en": "Let's see how we implement this in Ionic.",
          "zh": "我們來看看在 Ionic 裡怎麼實作這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 50.84,
          "end": 53.67,
          "en": "Now I'm not getting tired of mentioning this,",
          "zh": "我一直不厭其煩地提這點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 53.78,
          "end": 59.84,
          "en": "you can always dive into the official docs of course and there, you'll find this menu area which covers the",
          "zh": "你當然隨時可以深入官方文件，在那裡你會找到 menu 這個區域，涵蓋"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 59.84,
          "end": 65.18,
          "en": "ion menu which is how you set up such a side drawer and you find detailed instructions on how you",
          "zh": "ion-menu，也就是你設定這種側邊抽屜的方式，你會找到詳細說明，告訴你"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 65.18,
          "end": 69.34,
          "en": "may configure it there and how it works together with all these other components there",
          "zh": "可以怎麼設定它，以及它如何與那裡所有其他元件搭配運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 69.53,
          "end": 71.78,
          "en": "but of course, let's now do that together.",
          "zh": "但當然，我們現在就一起來做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 71.81,
          "end": 78.32,
          "en": "Now where do I want to have that hamburger icon? That's the first thing we have to ask ourselves and",
          "zh": "那麼我想把那個漢堡圖示放在哪裡？這是我們得先問自己的第一件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 78.32,
          "end": 80.88,
          "en": "the answer is for me in this application,",
          "zh": "而答案是，在這個應用程式裡，對我來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 80.88,
          "end": 89.44,
          "en": "the hamburger icon should be found on that discover page here, it should also be found in the toolbar",
          "zh": "漢堡圖示應該出現在這裡的 discover 頁面上，也應該出現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 89.53,
          "end": 92.81,
          "en": "of the offers page here",
          "zh": "這裡 offers 頁面的工具列上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 93.00999999999999,
          "end": 99.16,
          "en": "and I also then want to find it on that bookings page because the bookings page is actually the page",
          "zh": "而且我也想在那個 bookings 頁面上看到它，因為 bookings 頁面其實就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 99.28999999999999,
          "end": 102.88,
          "en": "we'll navigate to through the side menu.",
          "zh": "我們會透過側邊選單導覽過去的頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 102.88,
          "end": 108.64,
          "en": "So basically put in other words, I'll add that hamburger menu in this app and basically all the places",
          "zh": "所以基本上，換句話說，我在這個 app 裡會加入那個漢堡選單，基本上就是所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 108.64,
          "end": 110.08,
          "en": "where I have no back button",
          "zh": "沒有返回按鈕的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 110.08,
          "end": 115.21000000000001,
          "en": "but of course that's just how it is in this app, might be totally different story for your application.",
          "zh": "但當然，這只是這個 app 裡的做法，你的應用程式可能完全是另一回事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 115.21000000000001,
          "end": 116.97999999999999,
          "en": "Now how do we add that menu then",
          "zh": "那我們要怎麼加入那個選單呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 117.03999999999999,
          "end": 124.52,
          "en": "because we first need the menu before we can add any form of button that opens it? You add that menu",
          "zh": "因為我們得先有選單，才能加入任何形式的按鈕來打開它。你把那個選單"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 124.52,
          "end": 130.76,
          "en": "in your root component as a sibling to your root ion router outlet.",
          "zh": "加在你的 root component 裡，作為 root ion-router-outlet 的兄弟節點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 130.79,
          "end": 137.24,
          "en": "Now actually, you can configure multiple menus in an Ionic app and you can even control into which",
          "zh": "其實你可以在 Ionic app 裡設定多個選單，你甚至可以控制它們要渲染到哪個"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 137.27,
          "end": 137.97,
          "en": "content,",
          "zh": "content，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 138.05,
          "end": 142.07999999999998,
          "en": "so into which ion content object they should render.",
          "zh": "也就是該渲染進哪個 ion-content 物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 142.25,
          "end": 150.11,
          "en": "But typically, you use that main ion content or in the case of this iconic Angular app with the ion router",
          "zh": "但通常你會用那個主要的 ion-content，或者在這個使用 ion-router-"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 150.22,
          "end": 156.41,
          "en": "outlet, you use that main outlet and that basically means whichever page is loaded through that outlet,",
          "zh": "outlet 的 Ionic Angular app 裡，你會用那個主要 outlet，這基本上表示無論哪個頁面透過那個 outlet 載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 156.41,
          "end": 163.85,
          "en": "the drawer, the side menu which opens up will be rendered as a animated overlay across that page on",
          "zh": "打開的抽屜、側邊選單都會以動畫覆蓋層的形式渲染在那個頁面上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 163.85,
          "end": 165.07999999999998,
          "en": "top of that page",
          "zh": "疊在那個頁面之上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 165.14,
          "end": 171.89,
          "en": "and this ensures that the side drawer doesn't get hidden behind some page or behind some toolbar or anything",
          "zh": "這能確保側邊抽屜不會被某個頁面、某個工具列或任何"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 171.89,
          "end": 172.34,
          "en": "like that.",
          "zh": "類似的東西遮住。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 173.18,
          "end": 179.12,
          "en": "So inside of ion app, next to ion router outlet, you therefore add ion menu, that is your wrapper",
          "zh": "所以在 ion-app 裡面、ion-router-outlet 旁邊，你就加入 ion-menu，那是包住你整個"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 179.12,
          "end": 181.76,
          "en": "around your entire side drawer.",
          "zh": "側邊抽屜的外層容器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 181.97,
          "end": 190.1,
          "en": "Now that ion menu now takes a side attribute and you can set this to start or you can set this to end",
          "zh": "這個 ion-menu 會接受 side 屬性，你可以把它設成 start，或設成 end，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 190.31,
          "end": 192.74,
          "en": "to define from where this should slide in.",
          "zh": "來定義它要從哪一側滑入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 192.92,
          "end": 194.88,
          "en": "Now it's not named left or right,",
          "zh": "它不叫 left 或 right，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 194.93,
          "end": 201.11,
          "en": "just as you didn't name the buttons in the toolbar, the slot there left or right, because start typically",
          "zh": "就像你也沒把工具列裡的按鈕、那裡的 slot 命名為 left 或 right，因為 start 通常"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 201.11,
          "end": 206.66,
          "en": "is on the left but depending on the device we're talking about or the region in the world you're using",
          "zh": "在左邊，但取決於我們談的裝置，或你使用它的世界地區，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 206.66,
          "end": 212.57,
          "en": "this, start might actually be on the right of the screen and therefore start simply means what typically",
          "zh": "start 其實可能在螢幕右邊，因此 start 單純就是指在你的地區、你的裝置上通常"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 212.57,
          "end": 219.23,
          "en": "is treated as the start in your region and on your device and on most devices and regions, that would",
          "zh": "被視為起始的那一側，而在大多數裝置與地區，那會"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 219.23,
          "end": 220.64,
          "en": "be on the left.",
          "zh": "在左邊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 220.67000000000002,
          "end": 227.15,
          "en": "Now you also should add the main attribute here, to the ion router outlet because Ionic will internally",
          "zh": "現在你也應該在這裡把 main 屬性加到 ion-router-outlet 上，因為當你切換時，Ionic 內部會"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 227.15,
          "end": 232.73,
          "en": "look for that main attribute when it tries to open that menu when you toggle it and I'll show you how",
          "zh": "在嘗試打開那個選單時尋找那個 main 屬性，而之後我會示範怎麼"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 232.73,
          "end": 234.06,
          "en": "to toggle it later.",
          "zh": "切換它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 234.11,
          "end": 239.99,
          "en": "So main should be added here and then this menu will render itself into whichever page is loaded here",
          "zh": "所以這裡應該加上 main，然後這個選單就會把自己渲染進這裡載入的任何頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 240.11,
          "end": 245.23,
          "en": "and it will open from the left, thanks to side start or it will open from the start",
          "zh": "而且它會從左邊打開，這要歸功於 side 為 start，或者說它會從 start 那一側打開，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 245.3,
          "end": 251.03,
          "en": "I should say. Now inside of that ion menu, you can have an ion header and it's the same ion header",
          "zh": "我應該這麼說。現在在那個 ion-menu 裡面，你可以有 ion-header，而它就是你已經在頁面裡認識的"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 251.03,
          "end": 257.49,
          "en": "component you already know from your pages. So the ion header is not limited to those pages",
          "zh": "同一個 ion-header 元件。所以 ion-header 並不限於那些頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 257.61,
          "end": 263.91,
          "en": "and the same is true for the ion toolbar which you can add in there, which could then in turn have an",
          "zh": "ion-toolbar 也一樣，你可以把它加在裡面，而它又可以有一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 263.91,
          "end": 264.89,
          "en": "ion title and here",
          "zh": "ion-title，在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 264.9,
          "end": 271.8,
          "en": "I'll simply add the title of my application and I'll name it PairBnB because we have mostly places",
          "zh": "我就直接加入我應用程式的標題，我會把它命名為 PairBnB，因為我們的地點大多是"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 271.8,
          "end": 276.33,
          "en": "that are for couples, for pairing up with other people,",
          "zh": "給情侶的，用來與其他人配對，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 276.35,
          "end": 278.01,
          "en": "I don't know, something like this.",
          "zh": "我也不知道，大概是這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 278.28,
          "end": 280.32,
          "en": "So PairBnB is what we have,",
          "zh": "所以我們有的是 PairBnB，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 280.32,
          "end": 286.5,
          "en": "that is the toolbar and now we also have ion content, so you can already see the content you have inside",
          "zh": "那就是工具列，現在我們也有 ion-content，所以你已經可以看到，你在"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 286.65,
          "end": 292.5,
          "en": "ion menu is basically the same content you would have in a page. You have the ion header and then you",
          "zh": "ion-menu 裡放的內容基本上和你在頁面裡放的內容一樣。你有 ion-header，然後你"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 292.5,
          "end": 297.65999999999997,
          "en": "have the ion content, oh and the ion content should be outside of the ion header of course. So ion",
          "zh": "有 ion-content，喔，而 ion-content 當然應該在 ion-header 外面。所以 ion-"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 297.65999999999997,
          "end": 303.09,
          "en": "header and ion content are inside the ion menu and inside the ion content, you can now really render",
          "zh": "header 和 ion-content 都在 ion-menu 裡面，而在 ion-content 裡面，你現在真的可以渲染"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 303.09,
          "end": 304.08,
          "en": "whatever you want,",
          "zh": "任何你想要的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 304.08,
          "end": 311.07,
          "en": "could be cards, could be a list, could be images, you can use any element in there. You can use paragraphs",
          "zh": "可以是卡片、清單、圖片，你可以用任何元素。你可以用段落"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 311.07,
          "end": 315.99,
          "en": "and divs in there, you can use whatever you want in here but of course typically, you want to render something",
          "zh": "和 div，在這裡你想用什麼都行，但通常你當然會想渲染出"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 315.99,
          "end": 317.33,
          "en": "that looks nice.",
          "zh": "好看的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 317.4,
          "end": 323.94,
          "en": "So here I will render an ion list with a couple of list items. Now which list items would that be?",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我會渲染一個 ion-list，裡面有幾個清單項目。那會是哪些清單項目呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 324.6,
          "end": 334.03,
          "en": "Well the first item will get an icon here with a name of business maybe, I find that this is a nice icon for",
          "zh": "第一個項目會有一個圖示，名字也許用 business，我覺得這是個不錯的圖示，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 334.03,
          "end": 335.18,
          "en": "the purpose I have here",
          "zh": "很適合我這裡的用途，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 335.19,
          "end": 340.56,
          "en": "but of course you can use any icon you want from ionicons.com and the slot will be start so",
          "zh": "但當然你可以從 ionicons.com 使用任何你想要的圖示，而 slot 會是 start，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 340.56,
          "end": 346.23,
          "en": "that this is on the left of that ion item and in the ion label, so in the text for this item, I then",
          "zh": "這樣它就會在那個 ion-item 的左邊，而在 ion-label 裡，也就是這個項目的文字裡，我"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 346.23,
          "end": 353.88,
          "en": "want to have find or maybe discover places. That takes us to the discover places",
          "zh": "想放 find，或者也許是 discover places。那會帶我們到 discover places"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 353.89,
          "end": 356.82,
          "en": "page, so to the places page with the tabs.",
          "zh": "頁面，也就是有 tabs 的 places 頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 356.82,
          "end": 359.32,
          "en": "We also want the second item and here",
          "zh": "我們也要第二個項目，而在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 359.34000000000003,
          "end": 372.02,
          "en": "I'll use a checkbox outline, also slot start which is for your bookings, so which leads you to your bookings",
          "zh": "我會用 checkbox-outline，slot 同樣是 start，那是給你的 bookings，會帶你到你的 bookings，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 372.02,
          "end": 376.35,
          "en": "and with that I of course mean the bookings you made, not the bookings for places you're offering.",
          "zh": "我當然是指你做的預訂，不是你提供的地點收到的預訂。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 376.73,
          "end": 382.75,
          "en": "And last but not least, I'll add another ion item which will become important later and that will be for",
          "zh": "最後但同樣重要的是，我會再加入一個 ion-item，它之後會變得很重要，那是用來"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 382.87,
          "end": 384.13,
          "en": "logging out,",
          "zh": "登出的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 384.16,
          "end": 386.44,
          "en": "so the name here will be exit,",
          "zh": "所以這裡的 name 會是 exit，"
