          "end": 70.94,
          "en": "So now if we save that, we should have some links here in that menu, so",
          "zh": "所以現在如果我們儲存，那個選單裡應該就會有一些連結，所以"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 70.97,
          "end": 77.26,
          "en": "let's wait for the application to reload and let's try going to the bookings page and it kind of works.",
          "zh": "我們等應用程式重新載入，然後試著前往 bookings 頁面，它算是可以運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 77.3,
          "end": 78.21000000000001,
          "en": "Here it is",
          "zh": "就是這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 78.28999999999999,
          "end": 84.77,
          "en": "but wouldn't it be nice if that menu closed after going there because right now, if I go somewhere, if",
          "zh": "但如果前往之後那個選單能關起來不是很好嗎？因為現在如果我前往某處、如果"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 84.77,
          "end": 90.89,
          "en": "I click something, it stays open and by the way for logout, you also see we got no animation when I play",
          "zh": "我點了什麼，它都會保持開啟，順帶一提，就 logout 來說，你也看到我按的時候沒有任何動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 90.89,
          "end": 98.06,
          "en": "this, when I click this, reason for that is by default an ion item is not a button, the click will still be registered",
          "zh": "當我點這個時，原因是預設情況下 ion-item 不是按鈕，點擊仍然會被註冊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 98.09,
          "end": 99.85,
          "en": "and will still execute on logout",
          "zh": "也仍然會執行 onLogout，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 99.86,
          "end": 105.43,
          "en": "but to have that nice ripple animation, you should add button here as an attribute to ion item.",
          "zh": "但要有那個漂亮的漣漪動畫，你應該在 ion-item 上加入 button 這個屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 106.00999999999999,
          "end": 110.68,
          "en": "But this is not related to the issue of the menu not closing, it will just fix that,",
          "zh": "但這和選單沒有關閉的問題無關，它只會修好那點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 110.69,
          "end": 114.3,
          "en": "when this page reloads, we now get a ripple effect here too.",
          "zh": "當這個頁面重新載入，我們現在這裡也有漣漪效果了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 114.32,
          "end": 118.84,
          "en": "But what about closing the menu when we select an item? For that,",
          "zh": "但當我們選取一個項目時要關閉選單呢？為此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 118.85,
          "end": 120.26,
          "en": "we got two options,",
          "zh": "我們有兩個選項，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 120.26,
          "end": 127.59,
          "en": "one option is we could add our own click listener, inject the menu controller and then manually call close,",
          "zh": "一個選項是我們可以加入自己的 click 監聽器、注入 MenuController，然後手動呼叫 close，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 127.64,
          "end": 129.39,
          "en": "you learned how that would work.",
          "zh": "你已經學過那會怎麼運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 129.65,
          "end": 132.06,
          "en": "But to me, that sounds really cumbersome,",
          "zh": "但對我來說，那聽起來真的很麻煩，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 132.11,
          "end": 133.7,
          "en": "there is a way easier way of doing that,",
          "zh": "有個簡單得多的做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 133.7,
          "end": 141.86,
          "en": "there is a special component Ionic gives you. You can wrap your list items or anything in your app anywhere,",
          "zh": "Ionic 給你一個特別的元件。你可以把清單項目或你 app 中任何地方的任何東西包起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 142.4,
          "end": 146.37,
          "en": "that should close or should toggle to be precise",
          "zh": "那些東西應該要關閉，或者精確來說應該切換"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 146.54,
          "end": 155.54,
          "en": "the main menu with ion menu toggle. The difference to ion menu button is that this will now not render",
          "zh": "主要選單，用 ion-menu-toggle。它和 ion-menu-button 的差別在於，它不會渲染"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 156.35,
          "end": 161.75,
          "en": "a hamburger and open the menu, instead it will render nothing but you can wrap it around anything that",
          "zh": "漢堡圖示來打開選單，而是什麼都不渲染，但你可以把它包在任何應該"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 161.75,
          "end": 165.35,
          "en": "should toggle the menu, doesn't have to be inside of the menu by the way,",
          "zh": "切換選單的東西外面，順帶一提，它不必在選單裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 165.35,
          "end": 168.59,
          "en": "you could have this anywhere in your application.",
          "zh": "你可以把它放在應用程式的任何地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 168.59,
          "end": 173.96,
          "en": "Now of course, ion menu toggle also takes a menu attribute in case you're using an ID on your menu",
          "zh": "當然，如果你在選單上用了 ID，ion-menu-toggle 也接受 menu 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 173.99,
          "end": 179.29,
          "en": "so that you can tell Ionic which menu you're trying to toggle, if you don't set an ID,",
          "zh": "這樣你就能告訴 Ionic 你想切換哪個選單，如果你沒有設定 ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 179.39,
          "end": 187.76,
          "en": "it will use the main menu it detects and I will simply wrap ion menu toggle around all my list items here",
          "zh": "它就會使用它偵測到的主要選單，而我就直接在這裡把所有清單項目都用 ion-menu-toggle 包起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 188.21,
          "end": 197.31,
          "en": "so that they all will close the menu when I press them,",
          "zh": "這樣當我按它們時，它們都會關閉選單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 197.35,
          "end": 198.28,
          "en": "here I am.",
          "zh": "我來了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 198.34,
          "end": 201.91,
          "en": "So now with ion menu toggle wrapped around all items,",
          "zh": "所以現在所有項目都包在 ion-menu-toggle 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 201.91,
          "end": 207.93,
          "en": "now as this reloads, the menu closes when I tap one of these icons.",
          "zh": "現在重新載入後，當我點其中一個圖示時，選單就會關閉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 207.96,
          "end": 214.44,
          "en": "So let's now make sure we also fixed that bookings page here and add the menu icon there too, first",
          "zh": "那我們現在也確保修好這裡的 bookings 頁面，並在那裡也加上選單圖示，首先"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 214.44,
          "end": 217.24,
          "en": "of all I set the title to your bookings",
          "zh": "我把標題設成 your bookings，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 217.32,
          "end": 225.7,
          "en": "and then here I'll add ion buttons with a slot of start and in there, add the ion menu button",
          "zh": "然後在這裡我會加入 slot 為 start 的 ion-buttons，並在裡面加入 ion-menu-button，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 225.81,
          "end": 230.64,
          "en": "and now we will be able to open the menu from inside our bookings as well.",
          "zh": "現在我們也能從 bookings 裡打開選單了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 230.64,
          "end": 232.32,
          "en": "So let's wait for this to finish,",
          "zh": "我們等這個完成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 232.42000000000002,
          "end": 238.7,
          "en": "discover places, bookings, all working just fine.",
          "zh": "discover places、bookings，全都運作正常。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 238.71,
          "end": 241.59,
          "en": "So this is now how we can add such a side menu,",
          "zh": "以上就是我們怎麼加入這樣的側邊選單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 241.65,
          "end": 243.81,
          "en": "not too difficult as you can tell",
          "zh": "你可以看出來，不太難，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 243.84,
          "end": 249.87,
          "en": "and really powerful with all these special components and with the menu controller that allow us to",
          "zh": "而且搭配這些特別的元件與 MenuController 後真的很強大，它們讓我們能"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 249.87,
          "end": 252.96,
          "en": "control the menu from anywhere on our page.",
          "zh": "從頁面上的任何地方控制選單。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727868",
      "title": "Adding the Auth Service",
      "lectureOrder": 123,
      "videoOrder": 100,
      "sourceHash": "9d4226ab4d1618537a94683a23ddbf1d2099c6d7d6799c190d797209d97e4df9",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 3.95,
          "en": "We're nearing the end of this module.",
          "zh": "我們快要結束這個模組了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.99,
          "end": 9.03,
          "en": "Obviously a lot of functionality of this application is still missing but this module is about the",
          "zh": "顯然這個應用程式還缺少很多功能，但這個模組的重點是"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.03,
          "end": 12.7,
          "en": "routing, we'll add the functionality step-by-step throughout the course.",
          "zh": "路由，我們會在課程中一步步加入各種功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.72,
          "end": 17.27,
          "en": "One thing that is still missing though is the authentication page, when I tap logout here,",
          "zh": "不過還缺一樣東西，就是身分驗證頁面。當我在這裡點 logout 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.28,
          "end": 22.59,
          "en": "I actually want to go to that authentication page and I already want to have some dummy authentication",
          "zh": "我其實想前往那個身分驗證頁面，而且我希望能先有一個假的驗證"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 22.59,
          "end": 29.76,
          "en": "flow here where I can't really authenticate but where I can fake that I can authenticate, so that we",
          "zh": "流程，雖然實際上無法真正驗證，但可以假裝驗證成功，這樣我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 29.76,
          "end": 36.45,
          "en": "can also control whether when the app starts, we see that discover or offers or bookings part or if we",
          "zh": "就能控制 app 啟動時要看到 discover、offers 或 bookings 區塊，還是"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 36.45,
          "end": 40.17,
          "en": "just see the authentication page and we need to login first.",
          "zh": "只看到身分驗證頁面，必須先登入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 40.17,
          "end": 46.48,
          "en": "Now for that, we have that auth page here of course. I'll set the title to authenticate and I certainly",
          "zh": "為此，我們當然有這個 auth 頁面。我會把標題設為 authenticate，而我當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 46.48,
          "end": 52.9,
          "en": "don't want to add my menu button here because you can't go anywhere if you're not authenticated. Instead",
          "zh": "不想在這裡加入選單按鈕，因為沒通過驗證就哪裡都去不了。所以"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 52.9,
          "end": 61.63,
          "en": "here I'll add a button, a normal button with a color of primary and I'll say login and later we'll add",
          "zh": "我改為在這裡加一個按鈕，一個 color 為 primary 的普通按鈕，文字是 login，之後我們會加入"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 61.63,
          "end": 68.46000000000001,
          "en": "a real login with user input and so on, for now it's just that button. When we press this button, I want",
          "zh": "真正需要使用者輸入的登入功能，現在就只有這個按鈕。當按下這個按鈕時，我想要"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 68.46000000000001,
          "end": 75.65,
          "en": "to execute onLogin and I want to flip something that actually does set me to login,",
          "zh": "執行 onLogin，並且切換某個值，實際把我設為已登入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 75.66,
          "end": 78.18,
          "en": "so simply a boolean that is switched to true",
          "zh": "也就是單純把一個 boolean 切換成 true"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 78.18,
          "end": 83.06,
          "en": "for now let's say. And for this, I'll add a new service, an auth service.",
          "zh": "就先這樣。為此，我會新增一個 service，也就是 auth service。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 83.16,
          "end": 92.72,
          "en": "So with Ionic generate service, in my auth folder, I'll add a new auth service. So this will generate a",
          "zh": "用 Ionic generate service，在我的 auth 資料夾中新增一個 auth service。這會產生一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 92.72,
          "end": 98.99000000000001,
          "en": "new auth service file in there, don't need the testing file and that auth service file for now will simply",
          "zh": "新的 auth service 檔案，不需要測試檔，而那個 auth service 檔案目前只會有"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 98.99000000000001,
          "end": 107.94,
          "en": "have a user is authenticated property which is false as a default let's say and I will add a login",
          "zh": "一個 user is authenticated 屬性，我們就說它預設為 false，然後我會加入一個 login"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 107.94,
          "end": 114.75,
          "en": "method here which sets user is authenticated to true and I'll add a logout method to that service which",
          "zh": "方法，把 user is authenticated 設為 true，並在該 service 加入 logout 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 114.75,
          "end": 118.08,
          "en": "when called will set user is authenticated back to false",
          "zh": "被呼叫時會把 user is authenticated 設回 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 118.08,
          "end": 124.23,
          "en": "so that we simply have that dummy authentication flow, that is all, nothing too fancy of course. Now on",
          "zh": "這樣我們就有那個假的驗證流程，就這樣，當然沒什麼花俏的。現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 124.23,
          "end": 130.08,
          "en": "login in the auth page component has to be added of course, this method has to be added here and now",
          "zh": "當然要在 auth 頁面元件加入 onLogin，這個方法必須加在這裡，而現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 130.08,
          "end": 136.14,
          "en": "here, I want to trigger the login method in my service. For that, I need to inject the auth service here,",
          "zh": "我想在這裡觸發 service 中的 login 方法。為此，我需要在此注入 auth service，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 136.82999999999998,
          "end": 144.57,
          "en": "auth service, make sure to add the import to the auth service file and in onLogin, I will simply call login",
          "zh": "auth service，記得加入 auth service 檔案的 import，然後在 onLogin 中，我只要呼叫"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 144.57,
          "end": 146.32999999999998,
          "en": "on my auth service.",
          "zh": "auth service 上的 login。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 146.4,
          "end": 152.57999999999998,
          "en": "Now one tiny thing I'll change is also I'll set a user is authenticated to a private property and",
          "zh": "另外我要改一個小地方，就是我會把 user is authenticated 設為 private 屬性，並"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 152.57999999999998,
          "end": 153.39,
          "en": "add a getter, get",
          "zh": "加入一個 getter，get"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 156.19,
          "end": 161.64,
          "en": "user is authenticated and return",
          "zh": "user is authenticated，並回傳"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 161.68,
          "end": 167.89,
          "en": "this user is authenticated, simply to wrap this so that we can't set this directly from outside but so",
          "zh": "this.user is authenticated，只是把它包起來，讓我們無法從外部直接設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 167.89,
          "end": 173.65,
          "en": "that we have to use the login or logout method. Simply a pattern which isn't too bad to use to make",
          "zh": "而必須使用 login 或 logout 方法。這其實是個不錯的模式，可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 173.65,
          "end": 179.47,
          "en": "sure you can't accidentally overwrite this to true or false from any other place in your app, you have",
          "zh": "確保你不會不小心從 app 的其他地方把它改成 true 或 false，你必須"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 179.47,
          "end": 182.62,
          "en": "to go through login or logout instead.",
          "zh": "改用 login 或 logout。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 182.62,
          "end": 188.35,
          "en": "So the auth page now has to on logging method added that will actually trigger the login method in the",
          "zh": "所以 auth 頁面現在加入了 onLogin 方法，它會實際觸發"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 188.44,
          "end": 189.45,
          "en": "auth service.",
          "zh": "auth service 裡的 login 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 189.73,
          "end": 190.86,
          "en": "That's part number one",
          "zh": "這是第一部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 190.87,
          "end": 194.58,
          "en": "but right now, we never see the auth page of course and to see it,",
          "zh": "但現在我們當然根本看不到 auth 頁面，而要看到它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 194.62,
          "end": 204.65,
          "en": "I want to add a guard that prevents access to both my places and my bookings in cases where I'm not authenticated.",
          "zh": "我想加入一個 guard，在未通過身分驗證時阻止存取 places 和 bookings。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 204.68,
          "end": 206.12,
          "en": "So that's the next thing we'll add.",
          "zh": "這就是我們接下來要加入的東西。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727870",
      "title": "Adding an Auth Guard",
      "lectureOrder": 124,
      "videoOrder": 101,
      "sourceHash": "14c5afc226f45150f9b0785fceaf7adccf3b54be7729a1b6474b7e6acea58d1e",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.22,
          "end": 8.37,
          "en": "To add such a guard, we can run ionic generate again and there in the dropdown,",
          "zh": "要加入這樣的 guard，我們可以再執行一次 ionic generate，在選單中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.37,
          "end": 9.93,
          "en": "we also have a guard.",
          "zh": "也有 guard 選項。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.65,
          "end": 18.56,
          "en": "So let's select guard here and now the path will be in the auth folder and then I will name it auth guard.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡選擇 guard，路徑會是在 auth 資料夾中，然後我把它命名為 auth guard。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 18.6,
          "end": 23.31,
          "en": "Now there is a lot of auth in here but the name just makes sense because we're checking the authentication",
          "zh": "這裡出現很多 auth，但這個名字很合理，因為我們要檢查身分驗證"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 23.31,
          "end": 24.3,
          "en": "status",
          "zh": "狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 24.3,
          "end": 29.96,
          "en": "but this now gave me that new auth.guard.ts file here and the testing file which I'll get rid of.",
          "zh": "這產生了新的 auth.guard.ts 檔案，還有測試檔，我會把測試檔刪掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 30.72,
          "end": 32.75,
          "en": "So the auth.guard.ts file here",
          "zh": "這個 auth.guard.ts 檔案"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 32.75,
          "end": 35.04,
          "en": "implements can activate as a default.",
          "zh": "預設會實作 canActivate。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 35.04,
          "end": 39.95,
          "en": "Now in case you don't know how guards work in Angular, guards are in the end also just services,",
          "zh": "如果你不知道 Angular 的 guard 怎麼運作，guard 說到底也只是 service，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 39.96,
          "end": 47.94,
          "en": "which is why this is also provided in root but guards can then be added to routes, we can attach them",
          "zh": "所以它也 provided in root，但 guard 可以加到路由上，我們可以把它附加"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 47.94,
          "end": 55.62,
          "en": "to a route and then depending on how we attach it, a method defined in that guard like canActivate is",
          "zh": "到某個路由，然後依照附加的方式，執行該 guard 中定義的方法，例如 canActivate，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 55.62,
          "end": 57.91,
          "en": "executed and only if it returns true,",
          "zh": "而且只有當它回傳 true 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 58.05,
          "end": 62.41,
          "en": "the navigation is allowed and the user may go where he wanted to go.",
          "zh": "才允許導覽，使用者才能前往他想去的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 62.43,
          "end": 68.87,
          "en": "Now I want to add that auth guard in my app routing module to places and bookings, to these two routes.",
          "zh": "現在我想在 app routing module 中把 auth guard 加入 places 和 bookings 這兩個路由。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 69.15,
          "end": 75.57,
          "en": "Since we lazy load our content here, canActivate is actually the wrong guard because that would mean",
          "zh": "由於我們在這裡採 lazy load，canActivate 其實是錯的 guard，因為那意味著"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 75.57,
          "end": 81.96000000000001,
          "en": "that the code for the lazy loaded module gets downloaded before the guard actually executes and that means",
          "zh": "lazy loaded 模組的程式碼會在 guard 實際執行前就被下載，也就是說"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 81.96000000000001,
          "end": 86.63,
          "en": "if we prevents the navigation, we downloaded the code for nothing.",
          "zh": "如果我們阻止了導覽，那段程式碼就白下載了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 86.73,
          "end": 93.69,
          "en": "So instead we should use canLoad which actually is a guard that runs before lazy loaded code is fetched.",
          "zh": "所以我們應該改用 canLoad，它才是會在 lazy loaded 程式碼被取得前執行的 guard。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 93.69,
          "end": 100.02000000000001,
          "en": "Now we don't need to implement canActivate here but the canLoad method and you can press command",
          "zh": "這裡我們不需要實作 canActivate，而是 canLoad 方法。你可以按 command"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 100.08,
          "end": 106.8,
          "en": "or on Windows control and click on canLoad to go to the definition of that and there you see how that",
          "zh": "或在 Windows 上按 control 並點擊 canLoad，前往它的定義，在那裡就能看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 106.8,
          "end": 113.02000000000001,
          "en": "canLoad method should look like. So you can just copy that from there and move that into your auth guard",
          "zh": "canLoad 方法應該長什麼樣。你可以直接從那裡複製，貼到你的 auth guard，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 113.03,
          "end": 116.24000000000001,
          "en": "and now you just need to import all the things it requires here,",
          "zh": "接著只要匯入它需要的所有東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 116.25,
          "end": 120.78,
          "en": "the light bulb here helps you with that, if you click on what's missing and then on the light bulb, you",
          "zh": "這裡的燈泡圖示可以幫你，點擊缺少的東西再點燈泡，你"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 120.78,
          "end": 127.26,
          "en": "can simply add all these imports and at the end, you must not have a semicolon but opening and closing",
          "zh": "就能直接加入這些 import。最後要注意不能加分號，而是用一對"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 127.26,
          "end": 132.18,
          "en": "curly braces because this is a method definition here.",
          "zh": "大括號，因為這裡是方法定義。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 132.22,
          "end": 138.52,
          "en": "Now you can get rid of all the imports which are not required and now in here, we're getting an error",
          "zh": "現在你可以移除所有不需要的 import，而這裡出現錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 138.64,
          "end": 144.55,
          "en": "because in the guard, we need to return a boolean, true or false or a promise that eventually resolves",
          "zh": "因為在 guard 中我們需要回傳 boolean，true 或 false，或是最終 resolve 成"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 144.55,
          "end": 148.62,
          "en": "to a boolean or an observable that eventually yields a boolean.",
          "zh": "boolean 的 promise，或是最終產生 boolean 的 observable。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 148.69,
          "end": 151.24,
          "en": "We'll use an observable later in the course,",
          "zh": "我們會在課程後段使用 observable，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 151.24,
          "end": 153.75,
          "en": "for now I will just return true or false",
          "zh": "現在我就先回傳 true 或 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 153.85,
          "end": 156.4,
          "en": "but of course I don't want to hardcode it like this.",
          "zh": "但當然我不想這樣寫死。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 156.4,
          "end": 161.4,
          "en": "Instead I want to return true or false depending on whether the user is authenticated or not",
          "zh": "我想依照使用者是否通過身分驗證來回傳 true 或 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 161.55,
          "end": 166.78,
          "en": "and we have that information in the auth service, here with user is authenticated.",
          "zh": "而我們在 auth service 中有這個資訊，就是這裡的 user is authenticated。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 166.78,
          "end": 173.32,
          "en": "Now thankfully, we can inject services into services, so by adding a constructor to the auth guard, we can",
          "zh": "好消息是，我們可以把 service 注入 service，所以只要在 auth guard 中加入 constructor，就能"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 173.32,
          "end": 178.6,
          "en": "inject the auth service into the auth guard. So auth service like this,",
          "zh": "把 auth service 注入 auth guard。像這樣寫 auth service，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 178.6,
          "end": 180.7,
          "en": "make sure to add the import here at the top",
          "zh": "記得在最上面加入 import，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 181.76,
          "end": 189.86,
          "en": "and then here you can return the result of this auth service user is authenticated because this will",
          "zh": "然後在這裡回傳 this.authService.userIsAuthenticated 的結果，因為它會是"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 189.86,
          "end": 191.27,
          "en": "be a boolean.",
          "zh": "一個 boolean。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 191.57,
          "end": 197.93,
          "en": "Of course if the user is not authenticated, I want to not just block the navigation, I want to provide",
          "zh": "當然，如果使用者未通過身分驗證，我不只想阻止導覽，還想提供"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 197.93,
          "end": 203.63,
          "en": "an alternative instead and for this, we can manually redirect the user.",
          "zh": "一個替代方案，為此我們可以手動重新導向使用者。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 203.63,
          "end": 212.64,
          "en": "So here we can inject our router and I will check if this auth service user is authenticated.",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我們可以注入 router，然後檢查 this.authService.userIsAuthenticated。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 212.8,
          "end": 216.79,
          "en": "If this is not true, hence the exclamation mark here,",
          "zh": "如果它不是 true，也就是這裡的驚嘆號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 216.82,
          "end": 224.53,
          "en": "if this is not true, then I want to use my router and navigate to /auth, to the auth page where the",
          "zh": "如果它不是 true，我就要用 router 導覽到 /auth，也就是 auth 頁面，讓"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 224.53,
          "end": 230.06,
          "en": "user can login and that should be navigate by URL therefore.",
          "zh": "使用者可以登入，因此這裡應該用 navigateByUrl。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 230.11,
          "end": 237.16,
          "en": "So now we can go to /auth if the user is not authenticated and this code will then still execute",
          "zh": "這樣一來，若使用者未通過身分驗證就會前往 /auth，而這段程式碼仍會繼續執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 237.16,
          "end": 238.48,
          "en": "and it will return false",
          "zh": "並回傳 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 238.48,
          "end": 243.83,
          "en": "to prevent the original navigation we wanted to do, otherwise if the user is authenticated,",
          "zh": "以阻止我們原本想做的導覽；否則如果使用者已通過身分驗證，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 243.85,
          "end": 245.16,
          "en": "this code will never run",
          "zh": "這段程式碼就不會執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 245.23,
          "end": 246.78,
          "en": "and here this will return true,",
          "zh": "而這裡會回傳 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 246.82,
          "end": 248.61,
          "en": "so we may continue.",
          "zh": "所以我們可以繼續。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 248.8,
          "end": 256.3,
          "en": "Now we just need to attach the guard and I want to attach the guard to my app component, to my app routing",
          "zh": "現在只要附加 guard 就行了，我想把 guard 附加到 app component、也就是 app routing"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 256.3,
          "end": 262.24,
          "en": "module, to the places and bookings routes. You attach a guard by adding the name of the guard,",
          "zh": "module 中的 places 和 bookings 路由。附加 guard 的方式是加入 guard 的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 262.27,
          "end": 267.79,
          "en": "something like canActivate or in this case, canLoad here and then this takes an array because you can",
          "zh": "例如 canActivate，或這裡的 canLoad，然後它接受一個陣列，因為你可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 267.79,
          "end": 271.54,
          "en": "add multiple guard services for one and the same type of card.",
          "zh": "為同一種 guard 類型加入多個 guard service。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 271.57,
          "end": 274.93,
          "en": "Here I only have one though and this will be my auth guard.",
          "zh": "這裡我只用一個，就是我的 auth guard。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 274.93,
          "end": 281.44,
          "en": "You need to import auth guard from your auth folder and there the auth guard file and then,",
          "zh": "你需要從 auth 資料夾的 auth guard 檔案匯入 auth guard，然後"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 281.44,
          "end": 285.01,
          "en": "well this is all you need to add and the same of course for bookings.",
          "zh": "這樣就夠了，bookings 當然也一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 285.01,
          "end": 285.52,
          "en": "So here",
          "zh": "所以在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 285.52,
          "end": 291.2,
          "en": "I'll also add canLoad and add my auth guard here as a canLoad guard.",
          "zh": "我也會加入 canLoad，並把我的 auth guard 設為 canLoad guard。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 291.2,
          "end": 297.62,
          "en": "Now these routes are protected and that also is then true for all their child routes.",
          "zh": "現在這些路由受到保護，而所有子路由也一併受到保護。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 297.73,
          "end": 304.3,
          "en": "So if the page now reloads and user is authenticated is set to false by default, we indeed end up here",
          "zh": "所以如果頁面重新載入，而 user is authenticated 預設為 false，我們就會來到"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 304.48,
          "end": 306.48,
          "en": "on the login page.",
          "zh": "登入頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 306.58,
          "end": 311.8,
          "en": "Now logging in doesn't help because if you click this, it will be set to true but as you reload your",
          "zh": "不過登入也沒用，因為點下去雖然會設為 true，但當你重新載入"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 311.8,
          "end": 316.51,
          "en": "page, this state will be lost so it's back to false again.",
          "zh": "頁面時，這個狀態就會遺失，又變回 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 316.51,
          "end": 322.15,
          "en": "Of course when logging in, I want to navigate though, I want to go to another page and therefore here",
          "zh": "當然，登入時我希望能導覽到另一個頁面，因此在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 322.18,
          "end": 328.08,
          "en": "on the auth page, in on login, I want to navigate, so I'll inject my router here",
          "zh": "在 auth 頁面的 onLogin 中，我想要導覽，所以我會在這裡注入 router，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 329.09,
          "end": 336.9,
          "en": "from @angular/router, this import needs to be added at the top of your page and then in on login,",
          "zh": "來自 @angular/router，這個 import 要加在頁面最上方，然後在 onLogin 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 337.68,
          "end": 346.29,
          "en": "there I will call this router navigate and I want to go to, I can navigate by URL actually, I want",
          "zh": "我會呼叫 this.router.navigate，我想前往……其實我可以用 navigateByUrl，我想"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 346.29,
          "end": 357.01,
          "en": "to go to /places tabs discover let's say. Now the route guard will of course still protect this",
          "zh": "前往 /places/tabs/discover。這個 route guard 當然仍會保護這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 357.01,
          "end": 362.53,
          "en": "root but now that we do login, we are actually authenticated, so we'll be able to make it through",
          "zh": "路由，但既然我們登入了，就真的通過身分驗證，所以可以通過"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 362.53,
          "end": 364.75,
          "en": "the guard. So if I hit login there,",
          "zh": "guard。如果我在那裡按下 login，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 364.75,
          "end": 370.45,
          "en": "here we are and I can now use this app as before but if I reload, we lose that state, we're back to false",
          "zh": "我們就進來了，現在可以像之前一樣使用這個 app，但只要重新載入就會失去狀態，變回 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 370.45,
          "end": 373.36,
          "en": "and therefore we're back to the authenticate page.",
          "zh": "因此又回到 authenticate 頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 373.57,
          "end": 380.07,
          "en": "Now one thing I of course want to add is the logout button. We do have it here in the app.component.html",
          "zh": "我當然還想加入登出按鈕。我們在 app.component.html"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 380.08,
          "end": 384.43,
          "en": "file, we trigger on logout when we click it and in on logout,",
          "zh": "檔案中已經有它，點擊時會觸發 onLogout，而在 onLogout 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 384.43,
          "end": 387.58,
          "en": "I now want to use the logout method from the auth service.",
          "zh": "我想使用 auth service 的 logout 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 387.58,
          "end": 392.14,
          "en": "So let's inject the auth service here in the app component",
          "zh": "所以我們在 app component 中注入 auth service，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 392.43,
          "end": 399.58,
          "en": "and for that, you need to add the import to auth service, to that auth service file and then add on logout,",
          "zh": "為此要加入 auth service 的 import，指向那個 auth service 檔案，然後在 onLogout 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 399.59000000000003,
          "end": 405.08,
          "en": "we can call this auth service logout",
          "zh": "我們可以呼叫 this.authService.logout，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 405.40999999999997,
          "end": 411.44,
          "en": "and now with that if this reloads and I do login, I can logout but we're not redirected.",
          "zh": "這樣一來，重新載入後登入，我就能登出，但不會被重新導向。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 411.44,
          "end": 412.96,
          "en": "Well we can see that we succeeded",
          "zh": "我們可以看到成功了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 412.97,
          "end": 418.46,
          "en": "if we now try to go to your bookings because this tries to load a page that is protected by a guard",
          "zh": "如果我們試著前往 bookings，因為那會嘗試載入受 guard 保護的頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 418.49,
          "end": 424.64,
          "en": "and since I logged out and user is authenticated therefore was reset to false, we fail",
          "zh": "而由於我已登出，user is authenticated 因此被重設為 false，我們就失敗了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 424.79,
          "end": 428.78,
          "en": "but obviously I want to redirect right when I click logout here.",
          "zh": "但顯然我希望在這裡一點 logout 就立刻重新導向。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 428.78,
          "end": 434.99,
          "en": "Now for that, we just have to inject the router again into the app component here, so private router like",
          "zh": "為此，我們只要再把 router 注入 app component，寫成 private router 這樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 434.99,
          "end": 436.01,
          "en": "this,",
          "zh": "也就是這個樣子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 436.01,
          "end": 439.28,
          "en": "of course imported from @angular/router",
          "zh": "當然要從 @angular/router 匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 439.28,
          "end": 448.61,
          "en": "and then when on logout is triggered, I will call this router, navigate by URL auth and this means",
          "zh": "然後當 onLogout 被觸發時，我會呼叫 this.router.navigateByUrl 並傳入 auth，這表示"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 448.61,
          "end": 449.46,
          "en": "that",
          "zh": "如此一來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 449.51,
          "end": 452.03,
          "en": "now with that, this page will reload,",
          "zh": "這個頁面會重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 452.03,
          "end": 457.82,
          "en": "I'm logged out by default, if I login and I now press logout, I'm redirected and I can login again",
          "zh": "我預設是登出狀態，如果登入後按下 logout，就會被重新導向，然後我可以再登入"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 457.82,
          "end": 458.93,
          "en": "of course.",
          "zh": "一次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 458.93,
          "end": 464.06,
          "en": "So this is how we can add auth guard and how we can use that default Angular feature in an Ionic Angular",
          "zh": "以上就是我們加入 auth guard 的方式，以及如何在 Ionic Angular"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 464.06,
          "end": 464.75,
          "en": "app as well.",
          "zh": "app 中使用這個 Angular 的預設功能。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727874",
      "title": "Opening a Modal",
      "lectureOrder": 125,
      "videoOrder": 102,
      "sourceHash": "302f81fe2ece4270ecd57d4112ab31f26f7c8d83e95fe1f3f8ffdd9bf7be38bc",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 8.67,
          "en": "With that there's just one thing missing and that is when I click book here on a place detail, I don't",
          "zh": "這樣一來只剩一件事還沒做，那就是當我在 place detail 點擊 book 時，我並不"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.67,
          "end": 10.23,
          "en": "actually want to go back,",
          "zh": "真的想返回，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.56,
          "end": 17.67,
          "en": "I wanted to open a modal, right? Now how does opening modals work in an Ionic Angular app? Just as the",
          "zh": "而是想開啟一個 modal，對吧？那在 Ionic Angular app 中開啟 modal 是怎麼運作的呢？就跟其他"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 17.67,
          "end": 18.31,
          "en": "rest,",
          "zh": "部分一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 18.33,
          "end": 20.78,
          "en": "it's actually pretty simple. Now",
          "zh": "其實相當簡單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 20.82,
          "end": 26.97,
          "en": "the modal will actually be a new component for me and therefore I'll first of all generate this with",
          "zh": "這個 modal 對我來說其實會是一個新的元件，所以我首先要產生它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 27.06,
          "end": 28.67,
          "en": "Ionic generate",
          "zh": "用 Ionic generate 來產生，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 28.81,
          "end": 32.1,
          "en": "and now this is not really a page here, I'll not lazy load it,",
          "zh": "而這裡它其實不是頁面，我不會對它做 lazy load，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 32.1,
          "end": 33.39,
          "en": "that wouldn't work,",
          "zh": "那樣行不通，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.39,
          "end": 39.17,
          "en": "instead it's a regular component which we can generate with Ionic generate component and I will generate",
          "zh": "它是一般的元件，我們可以用 Ionic generate component 產生，我會把它產生"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 39.17,
          "end": 47.28,
          "en": "it in my bookings folder because the component will be responsible for making a booking and there, I'll name",
          "zh": "在 bookings 資料夾中，因為這個元件負責建立預約，在這裡我會把它命名為"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 47.29,
          "end": 51.75,
          "en": "it create booking let's say, you can of course use any name you want.",
          "zh": "create booking，你當然可以用任何想要的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 51.79,
          "end": 56.08,
          "en": "This will generate the create booking component here in the bookings folder,",
          "zh": "這會在 bookings 資料夾中產生 create booking 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 56.08,
          "end": 56.68,
          "en": "there it is",
          "zh": "就是這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 57.4,
          "end": 61.15,
          "en": "and in there, I still want to have a header even though it's not a page,",
          "zh": "而在裡面，雖然它不是頁面，我還是想要有一個 header，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 61.54,
          "end": 66.92,
          "en": "I will load it in a modal which will occupy the full screen, so I'll add a header with a toolbar with",
          "zh": "我會把它載入到佔滿整個畫面的 modal 中，所以我會加入一個 header，裡面有 toolbar，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 66.92,
          "end": 82.1,
          "en": "a title, book this place and then ion content where I'll for now just add a h1, tag book this place and then we'll",
          "zh": "包含標題 book this place，然後是 ion-content，裡面先只加一個 h1 寫著 book this place，之後我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 82.1,
          "end": 83.75,
          "en": "add more later.",
          "zh": "再加入更多內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 83.75,
          "end": 90.23,
          "en": "So this is the component I want to open as a modal, so as a full screen at least on mobile, full screen",
          "zh": "這就是我想以 modal 開啟的元件，也就是全螢幕，至少在行動裝置上是全螢幕"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 90.44,
          "end": 97.65,
          "en": "overlay. How do we achieve that? In the place where I want to open the modal which is in my place",
          "zh": "覆蓋層。那要怎麼做到呢？我想開啟 modal 的地方是在我的 place"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 97.65,
          "end": 98.49000000000001,
          "en": "detail component",
          "zh": "detail 元件中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 98.49000000000001,
          "end": 103.78,
          "en": "when I press that button here, there in onBookPlace,",
          "zh": "也就是當我在這裡按下那個按鈕時，在 onBookPlace 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 103.8,
          "end": 107.19,
          "en": "I now don't want to navigate back as I did it before, instead",
          "zh": "我現在不想像之前那樣導覽返回，而是"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 107.28,
          "end": 110.52000000000001,
          "en": "well unsurprisingly I want to open that modal. For this,",
          "zh": "不意外地，我想開啟那個 modal。為此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 110.52000000000001,
          "end": 115.67,
          "en": "we can inject something into this component and that is the modal controller.",
          "zh": "我們可以注入某個東西到這個元件中，也就是 modal controller。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 115.67,
          "end": 121.62,
          "en": "It's of type modal controller and you do import modal controller from Ionic Angular, just like all these",
          "zh": "它的型別是 ModalController，而要從 Ionic Angular 匯入 ModalController，就像其他這些"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 121.62,
          "end": 124.2,
          "en": "other special Ionic controllers,",
          "zh": "特殊的 Ionic controller 一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 124.2,
          "end": 130.71,
          "en": "the modal controller allows you to open a modal. So in on book place, you can use this modal controller",
          "zh": "modal controller 讓你開啟 modal。所以在 onBookPlace 中，你可以使用 this.modalController"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 130.77,
          "end": 133.73,
          "en": "and call that create method.",
          "zh": "並呼叫它的 create 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 133.76,
          "end": 138.35,
          "en": "Now the create method takes an object where you configure that modal and most importantly, you need to",
          "zh": "create 方法接受一個物件，用來設定那個 modal，最重要的是，你需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 138.35,
          "end": 142.81,
          "en": "set a component here and that is the component that should be opened as a modal.",
          "zh": "在這裡設定 component，那就是要以 modal 開啟的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 142.88,
          "end": 147.18,
          "en": "There you simply point at your component class, so the value for this",
          "zh": "在那裡你只要指向你的元件類別，所以這個的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 147.2,
          "end": 153.49,
          "en": "in my case here is create booking component. So you point at the create booking component class without",
          "zh": "在我的情況下是 CreateBookingComponent。也就是指向 CreateBookingComponent 類別，不加"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 153.49,
          "end": 155.36,
          "en": "the new keyword or anything like that",
          "zh": "new 關鍵字或之類的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 155.54,
          "end": 158.93,
          "en": "and you need to import the create booking component here,",
          "zh": "而且你需要在這裡匯入 CreateBookingComponent，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 159.05,
          "end": 164.62,
          "en": "let me actually use a relative path here, like this.",
          "zh": "讓我用相對路徑，像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 164.82,
          "end": 168.53,
          "en": "So now create booking component is imported here,",
          "zh": "現在 CreateBookingComponent 已經匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 168.56,
          "end": 174.5,
          "en": "one thing we got to do here to make this work though is we need to register this component or we need",
          "zh": "不過要讓它運作，我們還必須註冊這個元件，也就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 174.5,
          "end": 176.03,
          "en": "to declare it.",
          "zh": "宣告它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 176.24,
          "end": 181.07,
          "en": "Now currently that's done in the bookings module because Ionic generate found that this is the nearest",
          "zh": "目前這件事是在 bookings module 中完成的，因為 Ionic generate 認為那是最接近"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 181.07,
          "end": 186.25,
          "en": "module to the create booking component but it's actually not the module I want to use.",
          "zh": "create booking 元件的 module，但那其實不是我想用的 module。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 186.26,
          "end": 191.75,
          "en": "So let me remove it from the declarations there and let me remove the import there and instead, I will",
          "zh": "讓我把它從那裡的 declarations 移除，也把那裡的 import 移除，改為"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 191.75,
          "end": 192.92,
          "en": "declare it in the place",
          "zh": "在 place"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 192.92,
          "end": 197.36,
          "en": "detail module because in the place detail component, I will open it.",
          "zh": "detail module 中宣告它，因為我會在 place detail 元件中開啟它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 197.36,
          "end": 202.04,
          "en": "So in the place detail module, I will add my create booking component.",
          "zh": "所以在 place detail module 中，我會加入我的 CreateBookingComponent。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 202.16,
          "end": 208.1,
          "en": "Now important, if you had multiple components in your app or which are in different Angular modules that",
          "zh": "重點是，如果你的 app 中有多個元件，或是有位於不同 Angular module 中的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 208.1,
          "end": 214.22,
          "en": "would open one and the same modal component, then you could create a shared module with that component",
          "zh": "會開啟同一個 modal 元件，那你就可以建立一個 shared module，把那個元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 214.22,
          "end": 219.67000000000002,
          "en": "in it that you import into all the other components where you need to open it. So here",
          "zh": "放進去，再匯入到所有需要開啟它的其他元件。不過在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 219.68,
          "end": 224.18,
          "en": "I'd only need the create booking component in the place detail module though, so it's fine to add it like",
          "zh": "我只會在 place detail module 中用到 CreateBookingComponent，所以這樣加"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 224.18,
          "end": 225.17000000000002,
          "en": "this,",
          "zh": "就可以了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 225.17000000000002,
          "end": 229.57,
          "en": "obviously you want to add an import at the top like that",
          "zh": "當然你要像那樣在最上面加入 import，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 230.71,
          "end": 231.67000000000002,
          "en": "and now it's declared,",
          "zh": "現在它已經宣告好了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 231.68,
          "end": 233.74,
          "en": "now we can create it here.",
          "zh": "我們就可以在這裡建立它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 233.93,
          "end": 239.9,
          "en": "Now just as with the alerts you saw earlier, this gives us a promise where we get our modal element and",
          "zh": "就像你之前看到的 alert 一樣，這會給我們一個 promise，讓我們取得 modal 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 239.9,
          "end": 244.9,
          "en": "now we can call modal el present to actually show it.",
          "zh": "然後我們可以呼叫 modalEl.present() 來實際顯示它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 244.94,
          "end": 249.2,
          "en": "So create just creates it but doesn't show it, present will show it.",
          "zh": "create 只會建立但不會顯示，present 才會顯示。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 249.23,
          "end": 253.82,
          "en": "Now you can configure other things here too, whether it's animated, whether you want to add your own CSS",
          "zh": "你在這裡也可以設定其他東西，例如是否要有動畫、是否要加入自己的 CSS"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 253.82,
          "end": 256.28,
          "en": "classes, some advanced things,",
          "zh": "class，還有一些進階選項，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 256.28,
          "end": 261.53,
          "en": "if you can close it with the keyboard, things like that, component props will become important later but",
          "zh": "能不能用鍵盤關閉之類的。componentProps 之後會變得很重要，但"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 261.53,
          "end": 269.69,
          "en": "for now, let's just open it with this trick here. So back on our application, let's login,",
          "zh": "現在我們就用這個做法開啟它。回到我們的應用程式，先登入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 270.26,
          "end": 275,
          "en": "let's go to a place, let's click book and we get an error.",
          "zh": "前往某個地點，點擊 book，結果出現錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 275,
          "end": 278,
          "en": "Now this error here is a typical error",
          "zh": "這個錯誤是典型的錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 278,
          "end": 284.6,
          "en": "you will face a lot when working with modals and therefore I'm deliberately showing it to you. No component",
          "zh": "你在使用 modal 時會經常遇到，所以我刻意展示給你看。錯誤訊息寫著 No component"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 284.6,
          "end": 286.82,
          "en": "factory found for create booking component,",
          "zh": "factory found for CreateBookingComponent，也就是找不到這個元件對應的 factory，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 286.82,
          "end": 292.37,
          "en": "did you add it to ngModule entry components and this is a really good error message because it already",
          "zh": "did you add it to ngModule entryComponents？這個錯誤訊息真的很棒，因為它已經"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 292.37,
          "end": 299.69,
          "en": "shows us the solution. When you're opening a component or when you're rendering a component, in a way",
          "zh": "告訴我們解決方法。當你開啟或渲染一個元件，而且方式"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 299.69,
          "end": 300.8,
          "en": "like we're doing it here,",
          "zh": "像我們現在這樣時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 301.19,
          "end": 308.12,
          "en": "so neither by using routing to show it and we aren't using routing, we're not using the Angular router, we",
          "zh": "也就是既不是透過路由來顯示它——我們並沒有用路由，沒有用 Angular router，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 308.12,
          "end": 311.39,
          "en": "haven't configured any route that would load that component",
          "zh": "也沒有設定任何會載入該元件的路由"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 311.75,
          "end": 314.15,
          "en": "and we're also not using it by its selector,",
          "zh": "而且也不是透過它的 selector 來使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 314.15,
          "end": 318.4,
          "en": "we're not including the selector of this component into any of our templates.",
          "zh": "我們沒有把這個元件的 selector 放進任何 template 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 318.47,
          "end": 324.77,
          "en": "So if you're doing neither of these two things, then you need to add the component to a special array",
          "zh": "所以如果這兩件事你都沒做，你就需要把該元件加入 module 中一個特別的陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 324.77,
          "end": 328.97,
          "en": "in your module which is named entry components,",
          "zh": "叫做 entryComponents，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 329.21,
          "end": 331.85,
          "en": "so you simply add your component there.",
          "zh": "只要把你的元件加進去就好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 331.85,
          "end": 333.31,
          "en": "Now why is this required?",
          "zh": "那為什麼需要這樣做呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 333.32,
          "end": 339.05,
          "en": "It let's Angular know that this eventually will be created programmatically and that Angular should basically",
          "zh": "這讓 Angular 知道這個元件最終會以程式方式建立，而 Angular 基本上應該"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 339.05,
          "end": 344.13,
          "en": "be prepared to render that component when you require it to.",
          "zh": "準備好在你需要時渲染那個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 344.18,
          "end": 350.51,
          "en": "So adding create booking component to entry components of the place detail page module is the solution",
          "zh": "所以把 CreateBookingComponent 加入 place detail page module 的 entryComponents 就是解決方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 351.08,
          "end": 356.75,
          "en": "and now once you do that, when this reloads and you login and you go to your place and you click book,",
          "zh": "一旦你這麼做，當頁面重新載入、你登入、前往某個地點並點擊 book 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 356.75,
          "end": 359.61,
          "en": "here is our modal sliding up from the top",
          "zh": "我們的 modal 就從頂端滑上來了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 359.75,
          "end": 364.4,
          "en": "and of course I haven't shown this in a while but of course we have different animations for different",
          "zh": "當然我有一段時間沒展示了，不過我們對不同的"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 364.4,
          "end": 364.93,
          "en": "devices,",
          "zh": "裝置確實有不同動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 364.94,
          "end": 367.16,
          "en": "so if I show this on an iPhone here,",
          "zh": "所以在 iPhone 上顯示時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 370.27,
          "end": 372.62,
          "en": "there it slides up like that.",
          "zh": "它就那樣滑上來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 372.79,
          "end": 374.62,
          "en": "So that is pretty sweet,",
          "zh": "這還挺不錯的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 374.62,
          "end": 377.53,
          "en": "now how can we pass data into that modal,",
          "zh": "那麼我們要怎麼把資料傳進那個 modal，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 377.53,
          "end": 381.61,
          "en": "how can we close it and how can we pass data back?",
          "zh": "怎麼關閉它，又怎麼把資料傳回來呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 381.61,
          "end": 384.37,
          "en": "These are typical questions you have when working with modals.",
          "zh": "這些都是使用 modal 時會遇到的典型問題。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727878",
      "title": "Closing the Modal & Passing Data",
      "lectureOrder": 126,
      "videoOrder": 103,
      "sourceHash": "8f25896eb2eb058174b45012eec22a66864158a9f0eb3470685b0d4ddc4bbd82",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.18,
          "end": 5.73,
          "en": "Passing data into the modal is pretty straightforward.",
          "zh": "把資料傳進 modal 相當直接。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.9,
          "end": 11.4,
          "en": "Here where we create that modal, we probably want a pass in the place for which we're opening it,",
          "zh": "在我們建立 modal 的地方，我們大概會想傳入我們為它開啟 modal 的那個 place，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 11.42,
          "end": 14.09,
          "en": "that is the place we want to book after all.",
          "zh": "畢竟那就是我們想預約的地點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.09,
          "end": 19.82,
          "en": "You can pass data into a modal by adding that component props property to the object you pass to the",
          "zh": "你可以把 componentProps 屬性加到傳給"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 19.82,
          "end": 26.81,
          "en": "create method and that has to be an object where you can now add any key-value pairs you want, like",
          "zh": "create 方法的物件中，藉此把資料傳進 modal，而它必須是一個物件，你可以在裡面加入任何想用的鍵值對，例如"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 27.65,
          "end": 34.26,
          "en": "booked place or selected place. The value here will then be this place,",
          "zh": "bookedPlace 或 selectedPlace。這裡的值就會是 this.place，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 34.27,
          "end": 39.34,
          "en": "so this place property I have in this component and now this gets passed in as a property",
          "zh": "也就是我在這個元件中擁有的 place 屬性，而它現在會以屬性的形式"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 39.4,
          "end": 46.38,
          "en": "to my component, to the create booking component. So in the create booking component, I'll now add this",
          "zh": "傳入我的元件，也就是 create booking 元件。所以在 create booking 元件中，我會加入"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 46.44,
          "end": 48.87,
          "en": "as a bindable property. Here",
          "zh": "一個可綁定的屬性。這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 48.95,
          "end": 55.35,
          "en": "I'll use @input which you need to import from @angular/core and then I should use that same name",
          "zh": "我會使用 @Input，需要從 @angular/core 匯入，然後我應該用同樣的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 55.35,
          "end": 58.16,
          "en": "of course, selected place is the name here,",
          "zh": "當然，這裡的名稱是 selectedPlace，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 58.17,
          "end": 62.91,
          "en": "so let's name it selected place here as well in the create booking component which is loaded as a modal",
          "zh": "所以在以 modal 載入的 create booking 元件中，我們也把它命名為 selectedPlace，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 63.57,
          "end": 66.05,
          "en": "and that will be of type place,",
          "zh": "它的型別會是 Place，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 66.09,
          "end": 69.99,
          "en": "so let's make sure to also import place here.",
          "zh": "所以記得在這裡也匯入 Place。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 69.99,
          "end": 74.42,
          "en": "Now we can interact with that just as we can do in any other component.",
          "zh": "現在我們就可以像在其他元件中一樣與它互動。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 74.55,
          "end": 81.36,
          "en": "So here in create booking component, we could instead of outputting book this place up here, we could",
          "zh": "在 create booking 元件中，我們可以不輸出上面的 book this place，而是"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 81.48,
          "end": 88.83,
          "en": "access our selected place title here and maybe show the description in here, so we could add a text center",
          "zh": "在這裡存取 selectedPlace.title，也許再顯示 description，我們可以加上 text-center"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 88.83,
          "end": 91.53,
          "en": "property and some padding to the ion content",
          "zh": "屬性，並在 ion-content 上加一些 padding，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 91.74,
          "end": 93.33,
          "en": "so that this looks a little bit nicer",
          "zh": "讓它看起來好看一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 93.78,
          "end": 104.22999999999999,
          "en": "and then I have my paragraph here with the selected place description. That is possible and you can output",
          "zh": "然後這裡有我的 p 段落顯示 selectedPlace.description。這是可行的，你當然可以輸出"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 104.22999999999999,
          "end": 112.53999999999999,
          "en": "anything you want here about your place of course. Let's give this a try, if I save that, let's login, load",
          "zh": "任何關於這個地點的內容。我們來試試看，存檔之後登入，載入"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 112.55,
          "end": 117.92,
          "en": "New York City, book this place and here is the title and here is the description, of course you could also",
          "zh": "New York City，點 book this place，就出現標題和說明，當然你也可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 117.92,
          "end": 120.1,
          "en": "display the image and so on.",
          "zh": "顯示圖片等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 120.14,
          "end": 123.7,
          "en": "So this is our way of passing data into the modal,",
          "zh": "以上就是把資料傳進 modal 的方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 123.71,
          "end": 129.62,
          "en": "now how about closing it and passing data back? For this, inside of the modal component,",
          "zh": "那要怎麼關閉它並把資料傳回去呢？為此，在 modal 元件內部，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 130.81,
          "end": 134.08,
          "en": "you of course need to define some condition on when you want to close it.",
          "zh": "你當然需要定義一些何時要關閉它的條件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 134.08,
          "end": 143.57,
          "en": "Maybe you have a book button down there that closes it, so ion button book with a color of primary",
          "zh": "也許你在下面有個 book 按鈕可以關閉它，也就是 ion-button 寫著 book、color 為 primary，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 145.56,
          "end": 151.17000000000002,
          "en": "and that should trigger that the modal is closed and of course that you also book the place.",
          "zh": "它應該觸發關閉 modal，當然也要完成預約這個地點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 151.17000000000002,
          "end": 158.4,
          "en": "So for that, we can add a click listener, onBookPlace maybe and we might also want a button here in our main",
          "zh": "為此我們可以加上 click 事件，也許叫 onBookPlace，而我們可能也會想在主要的"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 158.4,
          "end": 159.29,
          "en": "bar,",
          "zh": "工具列上加一個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 159.32999999999998,
          "end": 170.2,
          "en": "so there we could also add our good old ion buttons wrapper with a slot of primary and in there, add an ion",
          "zh": "所以我們也可以加入熟悉的老朋友 ion-buttons 外層，slot 設為 primary，然後在裡面加入一個 ion-"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 170.24,
          "end": 181.94,
          "en": "button with an ion icon and a name of close and when that is pressed, we maybe want to execute onCancel",
          "zh": "button，裡面有 ion-icon、name 為 close，按下時也許要執行 onCancel，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 181.94,
          "end": 186.47,
          "en": "so that here we don't book the place, you typically want to offer more than one choice to your",
          "zh": "這樣就不會預約這個地點。你通常會想給使用者超過一個選擇，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 186.47,
          "end": 188.18,
          "en": "users.",
          "zh": "對吧。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 188.18,
          "end": 190.7,
          "en": "So now we can add these two methods, onCancel",
          "zh": "現在我們可以加入這兩個方法，onCancel，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 193.41,
          "end": 203.59,
          "en": "and onBookPlace was the other method I think, yes it was and now in there to close the modal,",
          "zh": "另一個方法我想是 onBookPlace，沒錯，而在裡面要關閉 modal，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 203.68,
          "end": 209.92000000000002,
          "en": "you can again inject something where Ionic helps you and that would be the modal controller.",
          "zh": "你一樣可以注入 Ionic 幫你準備的東西，也就是 modal controller。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 209.92000000000002,
          "end": 215.2,
          "en": "So you simply inject the modal controller from @ionic/angular, so the same tool we used for opening",
          "zh": "你只要從 @ionic/angular 注入 modal controller，也就是我們用來開啟"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 215.29,
          "end": 222.67000000000002,
          "en": "the modal and then in onCancel for example, you can execute this modal controller dismiss and it will",
          "zh": "modal 的同一項工具，然後例如在 onCancel 中執行 this.modalController.dismiss()，它會"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 222.67000000000002,
          "end": 224.86,
          "en": "dismiss the nearest modal it finds,",
          "zh": "關閉它找到最靠近的 modal，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 224.86,
          "end": 231.13,
          "en": "alternatively you can also define the ID of a modal as a third param and if you don't need the others,",
          "zh": "或者你也可以把 modal 的 ID 定義為第三個參數，而如果你不需要其他參數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 231.13,
          "end": 238.53,
          "en": "you can simply pass null as a third param because when opening a model which we're doing here, besides",
          "zh": "就可以直接把 null 當作第三個參數傳入，因為在開啟 modal（也就是我們這裡做的）時，除了"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 238.54,
          "end": 244.06,
          "en": "setting component and component props, you can also set an ID so that if you have multiple modals that",
          "zh": "設定 component 和 componentProps，你也可以設定 ID，這樣當你有多個 modal"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 244.06,
          "end": 249.49,
          "en": "might be open at the moment, that are overlapping each other or whatever, you can control which modal",
          "zh": "同時開啟、彼此重疊之類的情況時，你就能控制要關閉"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 249.49,
          "end": 254.68,
          "en": "to close, otherwise it will close simply the topmost one which is perfectly fine here.",
          "zh": "哪個 modal，否則它只會關閉最上層的那個，在這裡這樣完全沒問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 254.8,
          "end": 259.51,
          "en": "Now I said you can pass null for the other arguments but the other arguments are the interesting thing",
          "zh": "我剛說其他參數可以傳 null，但其他參數才是"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 259.51,
          "end": 260.26,
          "en": "here.",
          "zh": "這裡有趣的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 260.26,
          "end": 265.64,
          "en": "We can pass back some data here as a first argument or null if you don't plan to,",
          "zh": "我們可以把一些資料當作第一個參數傳回去，如果不打算傳就傳 null，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 265.66,
          "end": 270.01,
          "en": "you can set a role which is a string, that is something you can set however you want,",
          "zh": "你可以設定 role，它是字串，這部分你可以隨意設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 270.01,
          "end": 274.63,
          "en": "I'll name it cancel and you'll be able to read that role later so that you have a quick and easy way",
          "zh": "我會把它命名為 cancel，之後你就能讀取這個 role，這樣就有一個快速簡便的方法"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 274.63,
          "end": 280.53,
          "en": "of finding out which button was pressed and then that ID I already mentioned. In onBookPlace",
          "zh": "得知按下的是哪個按鈕，接著就是我提過的 ID。在 onBookPlace 中"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 280.54,
          "end": 287.53,
          "en": "I will also dismiss but here of course you typically want to pass some data, maybe in this modal later",
          "zh": "我也會呼叫 dismiss，但這裡你通常會想傳一些資料，也許在這個 modal 之後"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 287.53,
          "end": 294.64,
          "en": "in this application people will be able to select a starting and ending date for when they want to book",
          "zh": "在這個應用程式中，使用者將能選擇想預約這個地點的開始與結束日期，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 294.64,
          "end": 298.87,
          "en": "this place or how long they want to stay there and you might want to pass that data back.",
          "zh": "或是他們想待多久，而你可能會想把那些資料傳回去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 298.99,
          "end": 305.05,
          "en": "For now, I'll just pass back some dummy message but again here, you can pass any key-value pair you want,",
          "zh": "現在我先傳回一些假訊息，但再次強調，你可以傳任何想要的鍵值對，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 305.08,
          "end": 309.01,
          "en": "this is a dummy message, just to show how this would work",
          "zh": "這裡是 message 為 this is a dummy message，只是示範這怎麼運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 309.01,
          "end": 313.66,
          "en": "and now here the role could be confirm. Again these roles are totally settable by you,",
          "zh": "而這裡 role 可以是 confirm。再次強調，這些 role 完全由你自訂，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 313.66,
          "end": 317.05,
          "en": "this is a not limited amount of strings you could use.",
          "zh": "你可以使用的字串沒有限制。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 318.22,
          "end": 320.79,
          "en": "So we got this way of closing the modal now,",
          "zh": "現在我們有了關閉 modal 的方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 321.13,
          "end": 322.54,
          "en": "now let's see whether that works.",
          "zh": "來看看它能不能運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 326.35,
          "end": 333.29,
          "en": "Let's login, go to Manhattan, click book and let's cancel, certainly closes it,",
          "zh": "登入後前往 Manhattan，點擊 book 再按取消，確實關閉了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 333.29,
          "end": 336.26,
          "en": "let's click book, certainly closes it as well.",
          "zh": "再點 book，也確實關閉了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 336.26,
          "end": 339.92,
          "en": "How can we find out which button was pressed and how can we get that data?",
          "zh": "我們要怎麼知道按下的是哪個按鈕，又怎麼取得那些資料呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 340.1,
          "end": 343.97,
          "en": "For that we go back to the place where we opened the modal, here.",
          "zh": "為此我們回到開啟 modal 的地方，也就是這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 343.97,
          "end": 346.84000000000003,
          "en": "Now here we get that modal element and we present it.",
          "zh": "這裡我們取得那個 modal 元素，然後 present 它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 347,
          "end": 358.13,
          "en": "Now we can set a listener here with onDidDismiss and onDidDismiss returns a promise, so we can return",
          "zh": "我們可以用 onDidDismiss 設定監聽器，而 onDidDismiss 會回傳 promise，所以我們可以回傳"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 358.13,
          "end": 358.85,
          "en": "this here",
          "zh": "它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 358.97,
          "end": 365.48,
          "en": "so that on this main promise chain, I can chain another then block. This now will hold my result data",
          "zh": "這樣就能在這條主要的 promise 鏈上再接一個 then 區塊。它會持有我的 resultData，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 366.11,
          "end": 373.56,
          "en": "and the result data in turn will hold if we log it, data and role,",
          "zh": "而 resultData 如果我們印出來，會包含 data 和 role，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 373.56,
          "end": 377.01,
          "en": "so these first two arguments we could pass to dismiss.",
          "zh": "也就是我們可以傳給 dismiss 的前兩個參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 377.01,
          "end": 384.93,
          "en": "So let's output both here, result data data and result data role and let's already use that role and",
          "zh": "我們把兩者都輸出，resultData.data 和 resultData.role，然後我們就來用這個 role，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 384.93,
          "end": 389.13,
          "en": "check if result data role is equal to confirm,",
          "zh": "檢查 resultData.role 是否等於 confirm，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 389.13,
          "end": 391.46,
          "en": "that was one of the roles we set in the modal,",
          "zh": "那是我們在 modal 中設定的其中一個 role，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 391.53,
          "end": 398.52,
          "en": "then I will also output booked here and I'll not do that if we chose the cancel button",
          "zh": "如果是，我就額外輸出 booked，而如果我們選的是取消按鈕就不會輸出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 398.53,
          "end": 403.45,
          "en": "and therefore the role is set to cancel as we did it in the dismiss method.",
          "zh": "因為那時 role 會設為 cancel，就像我們在 dismiss 方法中做的一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 403.45,
          "end": 406.09000000000003,
          "en": "So now let's log back in,",
          "zh": "現在我們再登入一次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 406.09000000000003,
          "end": 412.57,
          "en": "open New York, click book and if I now click the cancel button, we see null and cancel which makes sense",
          "zh": "開啟 New York，點擊 book，如果我現在按取消按鈕，會看到 null 和 cancel，這很合理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 412.57,
          "end": 417.31,
          "en": "because our role we set was canceled and we didn't pass any data.",
          "zh": "因為我們設的 role 是 cancel，而且沒有傳任何資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 417.31,
          "end": 422.86,
          "en": "If I click book however, we see message, this is a dummy message and we see that the role is confirm",
          "zh": "不過如果我點 book，就會看到 message、this is a dummy message，而且 role 是 confirm，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 423.13,
          "end": 428.74,
          "en": "and therefore we logically also see the booked output which stems from this if statement.",
          "zh": "因此我們也理所當然看到來自這個 if 敘述的 booked 輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 428.8,
          "end": 435.31,
          "en": "So this is how you can open a modal, pass data into it, close it and pass data back and then use that",
          "zh": "以上就是如何開啟 modal、把資料傳進去、關閉它、把資料傳回來，然後使用那些"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 435.31,
          "end": 438.42,
          "en": "data which is pretty much all we need right now",
          "zh": "資料，這差不多就是我們現在需要的全部，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 438.43,
          "end": 439.21,
          "en": "in my opinion.",
          "zh": "在我看來。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727884",
      "title": "Wrap Up",
      "lectureOrder": 127,
      "videoOrder": 104,
      "sourceHash": "b71d7b246a075c16b32f87e3ffade0c17a5221d5cbe0758da861c440c392700a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 6.3,
          "en": "So this was a pretty large module but you learned a lot about navigation and routing.",
          "zh": "這是個相當大的模組，但你學到了很多關於導覽與路由的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.36,
          "end": 13.44,
          "en": "You learned how to add tabs, how to implement that forward backwards navigation with the different approaches,",
          "zh": "你學到如何加入 tabs、如何用不同做法實作前進與返回的導覽、"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 13.44,
          "end": 15.51,
          "en": "how to use that nav controller,",
          "zh": "如何使用 nav controller、"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 15.51,
          "end": 21.33,
          "en": "how to open a modal which is not loaded through the Angular router but still occupies a significant",
          "zh": "如何開啟不是透過 Angular router 載入、卻仍佔據一大塊"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 21.33,
          "end": 23.04,
          "en": "part of the space, on mobile",
          "zh": "空間的 modal。在行動裝置上是"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 23.04,
          "end": 25.14,
          "en": "the entire view, on web",
          "zh": "整個畫面，在網頁上"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 25.14,
          "end": 27.07,
          "en": "it's a part of the page,",
          "zh": "則是頁面的一部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 27.18,
          "end": 32.58,
          "en": "there we get this nice looking modal out of the box which is also pretty nice, that we got the right",
          "zh": "我們開箱就得到這個好看的 modal，這也很棒，而且我們還不必做任何事"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 32.58,
          "end": 36.12,
          "en": "styling for different device sizes without us needing to do anything.",
          "zh": "就得到適合各種裝置尺寸的樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 36.93,
          "end": 42.63,
          "en": "You learned how to pass data around in your modal and you also learned how to add such a side drawer so",
          "zh": "你學到如何在 modal 中傳遞資料，也學到如何加入這樣的側邊抽屜，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 42.63,
          "end": 49.14,
          "en": "that you can switch to different parts in your application, logout and also have the right behavior",
          "zh": "讓你能切換到應用程式的不同部分、登出，並依照你點擊的位置"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 49.14,
          "end": 56.07,
          "en": "of the menu depending on where you click what. These are all core tools you will need in any and really",
          "zh": "讓選單有正確的行為。這些都是核心工具，你在任何、真的是任何"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 56.07,
          "end": 59.48,
          "en": "in any application you're building with Ionic and Angular.",
          "zh": "用 Ionic 與 Angular 打造的應用程式中都會用到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 59.59,
          "end": 65.86,
          "en": "You'll need tabs and or a side menu and definitely that forward backward navigation.",
          "zh": "你會需要 tabs 或側邊選單，當然也一定需要前進與返回的導覽。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 65.91,
          "end": 70.89,
          "en": "So these are things you definitely have to know and understand which is why I spend a lot of time on",
          "zh": "這些都是你必須知道並理解的東西，所以我在這個模組上"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 70.89,
          "end": 71.76,
          "en": "this module.",
          "zh": "花了很多時間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 71.82,
          "end": 77.37,
          "en": "Now we will move on, we'll work more on the different components we can use, how we can configure them,",
          "zh": "接下來我們會繼續前進，進一步探討可以使用的各種元件、如何設定它們、"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 77.37,
          "end": 82.05,
          "en": "how we can make them look good and we'll gradually add more and more logic to the application.",
          "zh": "如何讓它們好看，並逐步為應用程式加入更多邏輯。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727892",
      "title": "Module Introduction",
      "lectureOrder": 129,
      "videoOrder": 105,
      "sourceHash": "67c3042bb87983d2a5b916cf640c43d636979cc62ee7161d78ba1100c4b54f1d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.09,
          "end": 6.51,
          "en": "Now that we're able to switch between the different pages in our application,",
          "zh": "現在我們已經能在應用程式的不同頁面之間切換，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.59,
          "end": 12.71,
          "en": "the next skill obviously is to fill these pages with some life and no matter which application you'll",
          "zh": "下一個技能當然就是讓這些頁面活起來，而不論你將來要打造"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 12.71,
          "end": 19.87,
          "en": "be building, for that you'll need the many widgets and components the Ionic framework gives you.",
          "zh": "什麼應用程式，你都會需要 Ionic framework 提供的眾多小工具與元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 20.3,
          "end": 25.52,
          "en": "And therefore in this module, we'll dive a bit deeper into that and I'll walk you through some of the",
          "zh": "因此在這個模組中，我們會更深入探討這部分，我會帶你認識一些"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 25.52,
          "end": 31.37,
          "en": "most important Ionic components, how to use them, how to use them together and how to use them in our",
          "zh": "最重要的 Ionic 元件、如何使用它們、如何搭配使用，以及如何在我們的"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 31.37,
          "end": 33.88,
          "en": "application here. To be precise,",
          "zh": "應用程式中使用。具體來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 33.89,
          "end": 42.62,
          "en": "we'll have a look at how we can use attributes and slots of components, since pretty much all Ionic components",
          "zh": "我們會看看如何使用元件的 attributes 與 slots，因為幾乎所有 Ionic 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 42.68,
          "end": 48.62,
          "en": "offer you different attributes or properties to configure them and a lot of them also give you these",
          "zh": "都提供不同的 attributes 或 properties 讓你設定，而很多元件也提供這些"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 48.71,
          "end": 52.73,
          "en": "slots and we'll dive into what these slots really are.",
          "zh": "slots，我們會深入瞭解 slot 到底是什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 52.76,
          "end": 59.57,
          "en": "We'll then have a closer look at this grid layout which we already used, the ion-grid but I'll then walk",
          "zh": "接著我們會更仔細看我們已經用過的這個 grid 版面配置，也就是 ion-grid，我會"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 59.57,
          "end": 65.84,
          "en": "you through it in detail and explain how you can configure it for all kinds of different layouts you",
          "zh": "詳細帶你走一遍，說明如何針對你可能想要的各種不同版面"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 65.84,
          "end": 72.83,
          "en": "might want to have. We'll thereafter dive into some crucial components like ion-list, ion-item, ion-label,",
          "zh": "來設定它。之後我們會深入一些關鍵元件，例如 ion-list、ion-item、ion-label，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 72.83,
          "end": 79.6,
          "en": "and also things like virtual scrolling and advanced features like that.",
          "zh": "還有 virtual scrolling 之類的進階功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 80.03,
          "end": 86.39,
          "en": "We'll then dive in general into more components we'll need in our application and that might be interesting",
          "zh": "然後我們會大致探討應用程式中會需要的更多元件，這些可能也會讓你"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 86.39,
          "end": 87.8,
          "en": "to you as well",
          "zh": "感興趣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 87.86,
          "end": 93.86,
          "en": "and last but not least, we'll dive from to some other controller components which are essentially the",
          "zh": "最後同樣重要的是，我們會探討其他一些 controller 元件，它們基本上是"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 93.86,
          "end": 102.05,
          "en": "components you don't add by adding them in your templates but by injecting their service or their controller",
          "zh": "你不是在 template 中加入的元件，而是透過注入它們的 service 或 controller"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 102.05,
          "end": 106.52000000000001,
          "en": "class as we did it for the modal controller for example.",
          "zh": "類別來使用，就像我們對 modal controller 所做的一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 106.58,
          "end": 108.78,
          "en": "So lots of ground to cover,",
          "zh": "所以有很多內容要涵蓋，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 108.8,
          "end": 110.15,
          "en": "let's get started.",
          "zh": "讓我們開始吧。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727898",
      "title": "Attributes & Slots",
      "lectureOrder": 130,
      "videoOrder": 106,
      "sourceHash": "b20d3c9e058dd2fd49cc6d6f853ee5d1c38f293290a0032fa5d7a96ae923efd0",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.28,
          "end": 11.62,
          "en": "And I want to get started with attributes and slots. If we have a look at our discover page, then there",
          "zh": "我想從 attributes 和 slots 開始。如果我們看看 discover 頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 11.62,
          "end": 18.37,
          "en": "we do have our ion-card with our featured place and below that, we have our ion-list with an",
          "zh": "那裡有顯示 featured place 的 ion-card，下面則有 ion-list，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 18.37,
          "end": 19.6,
          "en": "ion-item",
          "zh": "裡面有一個 ion-item，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 19.6,
          "end": 21.89,
          "en": "and there we got two interesting things.",
          "zh": "而在那裡有兩件有趣的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 21.91,
          "end": 28.36,
          "en": "First of all, we have added a so-called attribute to the ion-item, that is this detail thing here",
          "zh": "首先，我們在 ion-item 上加了一個所謂的 attribute，就是這裡的 detail，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 28.36,
          "end": 30.91,
          "en": "and we also are using a slot.",
          "zh": "而我們也使用了 slot。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 30.91,
          "end": 37.84,
          "en": "Now what's up with attributes and slots? Attributes are a feature you should know because they're not",
          "zh": "那 attributes 和 slots 到底是什麼？Attributes 是你應該認識的功能，因為它們並不"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 37.84,
          "end": 46.51,
          "en": "exclusive to Ionic or to Ionic Angular apps, instead attributes allow us to place information on HTML",
          "zh": "專屬於 Ionic 或 Ionic Angular app，attributes 讓我們把資訊放在 HTML"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 46.54,
          "end": 53.77,
          "en": "elements or on web components here that are then consumed by these components and that do something",
          "zh": "元素或這裡的 web component 上，再由這些元件取用，並在這些元件中"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 53.83,
          "end": 54.93,
          "en": "in these components and",
          "zh": "做一些事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 54.97,
          "end": 59.07,
          "en": "that's the same for vanilla HTML elements of course.",
          "zh": "當然，對原生 HTML 元素來說也是一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 59.2,
          "end": 66.85,
          "en": "Now the detail here for example is simply a property for which Ionic looks out for and when you add",
          "zh": "這裡的 detail 就只是 Ionic 會特別留意的一個 property，當你加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 66.85,
          "end": 75.22,
          "en": "it, it knows that it needs to add this tiny icon, this arrow icon on the item here. Another thing that",
          "zh": "它時，Ionic 就知道要在這個 item 上加上這個小圖示，也就是這個箭頭圖示。另一件"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 75.22,
          "end": 79.66,
          "en": "can be confusing is the difference between attributes and properties,",
          "zh": "容易讓人混淆的事，是 attribute 與 property 之間的差別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 79.66,
          "end": 85.26,
          "en": "I use these terms interchangeably but actually, they're not entirely the same.",
          "zh": "我常把這兩個詞交替使用，但實際上它們並不完全相同。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 85.33,
          "end": 93.16,
          "en": "This here is an attribute, whatever you place on your element selector, on this tag is an attribute. An",
          "zh": "這裡這個是 attribute，你放在元素 selector、放在這個標籤上的任何東西都是 attribute。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 93.19,
          "end": 100.39,
          "en": "attribute then internally by that component is typically bound to a property of that component and",
          "zh": "而 attribute 在該元件內部通常會綁定到該元件的一個 property，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 100.39,
          "end": 104.25,
          "en": "a property is simply like a variable inside of a class,",
          "zh": "而 property 就像是類別內部的變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 104.25999999999999,
          "end": 107.77000000000001,
          "en": "so place here for example would be a property of the place",
          "zh": "例如這裡的 place 就會是 place"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 107.77000000000001,
          "end": 114.61,
          "en": "detail page class. Web components and native HTML elements also are based on such classes in the end",
          "zh": "detail page 類別的 property。Web component 與原生 HTML 元素說到底也是以這類類別為基礎，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 114.7,
          "end": 121.48,
          "en": "you could say, they are based on Javascript objects and these objects do have properties and the attributes",
          "zh": "可以說它們是以 JavaScript 物件為基礎，而這些物件確實有 properties，而 attributes"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 121.72,
          "end": 128.89,
          "en": "are just the HTML way of assigning values to these properties. You can also assign values to them",
          "zh": "只是用 HTML 指派值給這些 properties 的方式。不過你也可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 129.13,
          "end": 135.82,
          "en": "by directly selecting the element though and then assigning a property in Javascript or in Typescript",
          "zh": "直接選取該元素，然後在 JavaScript 或 TypeScript 中指派 property，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 135.82,
          "end": 136.37,
          "en": "here.",
          "zh": "來給它們賦值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 136.39,
          "end": 141.82,
          "en": "So that's just something which is not super important for us here because it doesn't really make a difference",
          "zh": "這件事對我們來說不是非常重要，因為在我們這裡其實沒什麼差別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 141.82,
          "end": 147.97,
          "en": "for us here but it is worth noting that in theory, an attribute is what you assign here and a property",
          "zh": "但值得注意的是，理論上 attribute 是你在這裡指派的東西，而 property"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 147.97,
          "end": 153.49,
          "en": "would be whatever you use in your Typescript code, like here when I assign something to this place, then",
          "zh": "則是你在 TypeScript 程式碼中使用的東西，例如這裡當我指派值給 this.place 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 153.49,
          "end": 159.22,
          "en": "I'm assigning this to the place property not to a place attribute and this place detail component here",
          "zh": "我是指派給 place property，而不是 place attribute。而這裡的 place detail 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 159.22,
          "end": 164.68,
          "en": "by the way wouldn't even work with a place attribute because we haven't made place bindable with",
          "zh": "順帶一提，就算用 place attribute 也無法運作，因為我們沒有用"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 164.74,
          "end": 166.32999999999998,
          "en": "@input here.",
          "zh": "這裡的 @Input 讓 place 可綁定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 166.63,
          "end": 168.07,
          "en": "So that is one thing,",
          "zh": "這是一件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 168.07,
          "end": 171.64,
          "en": "the other important thing is the slot.",
          "zh": "另一件重要的事就是 slot。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 171.85,
          "end": 178.12,
          "en": "If we have a look at the discover page, we see that the thumbnail here has a slot of start. Now slots",
          "zh": "如果我們看看 discover 頁面，會看到這裡的 thumbnail 有 slot 設為 start。slots"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 178.12,
          "end": 183.92,
          "en": "are not an Ionic feature, they are also a feature you don't see in Angular apps though,",
          "zh": "不是 Ionic 的功能，而且也不是你在 Angular app 中會看到的功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 183.94,
          "end": 193.06,
          "en": "so where are slots coming from? Slots are a web component feature and web components is a term of specifications",
          "zh": "那 slots 是從哪來的呢？Slots 是 web component 的功能，而 web components 是一組規範的統稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 193.06,
          "end": 201.25,
          "en": "that are built into the browser, so native web features. A slot allows you to define a place in your web",
          "zh": "內建於瀏覽器中，也就是原生的網頁功能。Slot 讓你在 web component 中定義一個位置，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 201.25,
          "end": 205.01,
          "en": "component where external content can be rendered in.",
          "zh": "讓外部內容可以渲染進去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 205.12,
          "end": 211.72,
          "en": "So this slot here for example refers to the ion-item which basically reserves a place inside of its",
          "zh": "例如這裡的這個 slot 是相對於 ion-item，它基本上在自己的"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 211.81,
          "end": 219.73,
          "en": "internal DOM where this part here with the slot start on should be rendered in. That becomes even clearer",
          "zh": "內部 DOM 保留一個位置，讓這裡設有 start slot 的部分渲染進去。如果你深入"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 219.85,
          "end": 228.46,
          "en": "if you dive into the official source code, if you visit the Github repository of these Ionic components which",
          "zh": "官方原始碼就會更清楚，如果你前往這些 Ionic 元件的 GitHub repository，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 228.46,
          "end": 230.93,
          "en": "you'll find on the Ionic repository,",
          "zh": "你可以在 Ionic repository 上找到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 231.01,
          "end": 241.27,
          "en": "then under core source components and there, you look for the item component, here. If you dive into",
          "zh": "在 core 的 source components 底下，尋找 item 元件，就是這裡。如果你深入"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 241.27,
          "end": 250.7,
          "en": "that item.tsx file, you will in the end see if you scroll down what actually gets rendered here in",
          "zh": "那個 item.tsx 檔案，往下捲，最後就會看到這裡在"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 250.7,
          "end": 251.89,
          "en": "this render method.",
          "zh": "這個 render 方法中實際渲染了什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 251.88,
          "end": 258.49,
          "en": "Now this is just how Stencil, the compiler used by Ionic to build these web components works but in",
          "zh": "這就是 Ionic 用來建構這些 web component 的編譯器 Stencil 的運作方式，但"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 258.49,
          "end": 265.78,
          "en": "the end, this is some HTML code you could say, it's actual JSX but doesn't matter, it's like HTML",
          "zh": "說到底，這可以算是某種 HTML 程式碼，它其實是 JSX，但無所謂，它就像會被渲染的"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 265.96,
          "end": 271.93,
          "en": "which gets rendered. Now as you see, this essentially defines which kind of tag it should render, that",
          "zh": "HTML。如你所見，這基本上定義了它應該渲染哪種標籤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 271.99,
          "end": 278.40999999999997,
          "en": "either is a button or an anchor tag or a div depending on some attributes that you may have set or",
          "zh": "可能依你設定或未設定的某些 attributes，而是一個 button、一個 anchor 標籤"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 278.40999999999997,
          "end": 279.29,
          "en": "not set",
          "zh": "或一個 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 279.49,
          "end": 285.90999999999997,
          "en": "and then inside of this wrapping tag which is again a button, an anchor tag or a div, you see this slot thing.",
          "zh": "然後在這個同樣是 button、anchor 標籤或 div 的外層標籤內，你會看到這個 slot 的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 286.36,
          "end": 293.56,
          "en": "And that in the end defines OK any element inside of your ion-item that does have a slot of start will",
          "zh": "這最終定義了：任何在 ion-item 內、帶有 start slot 的元素都會"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 293.56,
          "end": 295.05,
          "en": "be rendered here,",
          "zh": "渲染在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 295.15,
          "end": 300.7,
          "en": "anything that does not have a specific slot set takes that default slot here which is in the middle",
          "zh": "任何沒有設定特定 slot 的東西則會放到這裡的 default slot，它位在"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 300.85,
          "end": 305.89,
          "en": "of these two wrapping divs which basically will assign some styling",
          "zh": "這兩個外層 div 中間，基本上會套用一些樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 305.89,
          "end": 311.41,
          "en": "and then you also have that slot with the name end. Now you also don't have to dive into the official",
          "zh": "然後還有 name 為 end 的那個 slot。你也不一定要深入官方"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 311.41,
          "end": 317.92,
          "en": "source code to find out which slots you can set, in the Ionic component documentation if you go to the",
          "zh": "原始碼才能知道可以設定哪些 slots，在 Ionic 元件文件中，如果你前往"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 317.92,
          "end": 325.09,
          "en": "item, there you also find information about the settable slots. But slots are basically your way of telling",
          "zh": "item，也能找到可設定 slots 的資訊。不過 slots 基本上就是你告訴"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 325.09,
          "end": 332.83,
          "en": "Ionic where in this item to put a certain content and this ensures that the thumbnail content, this",
          "zh": "Ionic 要把某個內容放在這個 item 的何處的方式，這確保了 thumbnail 內容，也就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 332.89,
          "end": 339.01,
          "en": "image here gets placed all the way on the left of this item or at the start of this item to be precise,",
          "zh": "這裡的圖片，會被放在這個 item 的最左邊，精確來說是這個 item 的 start 位置，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 340.18,
          "end": 346.51,
          "en": "where it is depends on your region settings and so on and that this part which does not have an explicit",
          "zh": "它實際在哪裡取決於你的地區設定等等，同時也確保這個沒有明確"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 346.6,
          "end": 352.07,
          "en": "slot assignment gets rendered in that default slot in the middle.",
          "zh": "指定 slot 的部分會渲染在中間的 default slot。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 352.24,
          "end": 359.08,
          "en": "This is how slots works and what you have to know about attributes, we'll use both heavily in this course",
          "zh": "以上就是 slots 的運作方式，以及你必須知道的 attributes 知識。我們在這門課程中會大量使用兩者，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 359.11,
          "end": 364.99,
          "en": "since Ionic uses them heavily and therefore it is important to understand what you're doing when you're",
          "zh": "因為 Ionic 大量使用它們，所以當你指派 attributes"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 364.99,
          "end": 366.94,
          "en": "assigning attributes or slots.",
          "zh": "或 slots 時，理解自己在做什麼很重要。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727900",
      "title": "Ionic Grid Basics",
      "lectureOrder": 131,
      "videoOrder": 107,
      "sourceHash": "8a68222a5ccfdd08c73ce1e6042caf85572a2e997026a24766ab2c0300960395",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.19,
          "end": 9.33,
          "en": "Let's continue with the Ionic grid layout because that Ionic grid is a crucial component that helps",
          "zh": "我們繼續來看 Ionic grid layout，因為 Ionic grid 是很關鍵的元件，能幫助"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 9.33,
          "end": 16.41,
          "en": "you with composing your complex user interfaces and with composing, I mean ordering and layout in them.",
          "zh": "你組合複雜的使用者介面。所謂組合，指的是介面裡的排序與版面配置。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 17.16,
          "end": 24.68,
          "en": "The Ionic grid layout is all about three core Ionic components which you combine together and it uses the",
          "zh": "Ionic grid layout 的核心是三個 Ionic 元件，把它們組合起來使用，而它在底層採用"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 24.68,
          "end": 27.81,
          "en": "CSS flexbox specification under the hood,",
          "zh": "CSS flexbox 規範，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 27.91,
          "end": 33.51,
          "en": "so in case you know see as as flexbox, by the way always a concept worth learning, for example my",
          "zh": "所以如果你熟悉 flexbox——順帶一提，這永遠是值得學的概念，例如我的"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 33.51,
          "end": 39.15,
          "en": "Complete CSS Guide, if you know of that, then you have a good idea of what the grid does under the",
          "zh": "Complete CSS Guide，如果你知道的話——那麼你就能大致瞭解 grid 在底層"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 39.15,
          "end": 45.35,
          "en": "hood. It abstracts the complexity away from you though, you don't have to write any CSS code to",
          "zh": "做了什麼。不過它把複雜度抽象掉了，你不需要寫任何 CSS 程式碼就能"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 45.35,
          "end": 46.36,
          "en": "use the grid.",
          "zh": "使用 grid。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 46.52,
          "end": 48.18,
          "en": "Now how does it work?",
          "zh": "那它怎麼運作呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 48.79,
          "end": 52.51,
          "en": "As I mentioned, it's all about three components working together.",
          "zh": "如我所說，關鍵就是三個元件協同運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 52.69,
          "end": 61.09,
          "en": "We always have this ion-grid component that wraps the entire area or that entire component tree which",
          "zh": "一定會有 ion-grid 元件，包住整個區域，或包住你想用 grid"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 61.09,
          "end": 63.88,
          "en": "you want to layout with the help of the grid.",
          "zh": "來排版的那整棵元件樹。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 64,
          "end": 69.67,
          "en": "Now it is important to highlight that you don't have to use the Ionic grid at all and you certainly",
          "zh": "這裡要特別強調，你完全不必使用 Ionic grid，當然也"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 69.67,
          "end": 72.58,
          "en": "don't have to use it on every page you're creating,",
          "zh": "不必在你建立的每個頁面上都用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 72.88,
          "end": 78.78999999999999,
          "en": "you just want to use it whenever you want to layout items, not just top to bottom taking the full width",
          "zh": "而是當你想排版項目時才用它——不是單純由上到下、佔滿整個寬度，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 78.78999999999999,
          "end": 84.49,
          "en": "of the screen but when you want to restrict the width, when you want to have multiple items sit next",
          "zh": "而是當你想限制寬度、想讓多個項目並排"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 84.49,
          "end": 87.14,
          "en": "to each other or anything like that.",
          "zh": "或類似需求時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 87.31,
          "end": 94.93,
          "en": "Now in your grid, you then have a couple of ion-rows because a grid thinks in rows. You can have as",
          "zh": "接著在 grid 裡會有幾個 ion-row，因為 grid 是以列為單位思考的。你可以有"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 94.93,
          "end": 98.71000000000001,
          "en": "many rows as you want and they don't have to be of equal height,",
          "zh": "任意數量的列，而且它們的高度不必相同，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 98.71000000000001,
          "end": 104.17,
          "en": "indeed you don't set the height explicitly, instead the height is determined by the content that goes",
          "zh": "事實上你不會明確設定高度，高度是由放進列裡的"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 104.17,
          "end": 108.31,
          "en": "into the rows and each row is just as tall as its highest",
          "zh": "內容決定，每一列就等於它最高的"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 108.31,
          "end": 116.07,
          "en": "child. You don't place your content right into a row though, instead the grid also requires columns to",
          "zh": "子項那麼高。不過你不會直接把內容放進列裡，grid 還需要 column 才能"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 116.07,
          "end": 117.94,
          "en": "turn it into a grid.",
          "zh": "真正形成 grid。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 118.14,
          "end": 123.57,
          "en": "And now ion-col, that is actually the component which will then hold your content you want to place in",
          "zh": "而 ion-col 才是真正裝載你想放進 grid 的內容的"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 123.57,
          "end": 130.59,
          "en": "your grid because it's the combinations of rows and columns that makes up how your content is structured.",
          "zh": "元件，因為內容的結構正是由列與欄的組合構成。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 130.59,
          "end": 138.63,
          "en": "It allows you to structure your content across multiple columns and multiple rows and the columns can",
          "zh": "它讓你以多欄、多列來組織內容，而且欄的"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 138.63,
          "end": 140.14,
          "en": "be sized by you.",
          "zh": "大小可以由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 140.16,
          "end": 145.59,
          "en": "We already did this a bit in this course but now we'll learn all the details about how you can assign",
          "zh": "這門課程裡我們已經稍微用過，但現在要完整學會如何為不同的裝置螢幕"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 145.59,
          "end": 152.67000000000002,
          "en": "different sizes for different device screens, so let's have a look. In our running application on the",
          "zh": "指定不同大小，所以我們來看看。在正在執行的應用程式中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 152.67000000000002,
          "end": 156.35,
          "en": "discover places page here, we are using grid already.",
          "zh": "discover places 這個頁面已經在用 grid 了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 156.42000000000002,
          "end": 163.47,
          "en": "This is our mobile view but if I untoggle this here and I go into the normal desktop view and I increase",
          "zh": "這是行動裝置檢視，但如果我把這個切換掉、進入一般桌面檢視，並把"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 163.47,
          "end": 169.07999999999998,
          "en": "the site width here a little bit, you'll see that this image becomes very large but still it does not",
          "zh": "網站寬度稍微調大，你會看到這張圖片變得很大，但它仍然"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 169.07999999999998,
          "end": 175.17000000000002,
          "en": "take the full width of the page because we're already using a grid here. We're using a grid which we",
          "zh": "沒有佔滿頁面寬度，因為這裡已經用了 grid。我們用的 grid 是"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 175.17000000000002,
          "end": 181.05,
          "en": "construct here with ion-grid and then ion-row and inside of the ion-row, we have a column and in that",
          "zh": "用 ion-grid 加上 ion-row 建構的，而在 ion-row 裡有一個 column，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 181.05,
          "end": 186.63,
          "en": "column is our actual content and we control the size by setting a default size which you by the way",
          "zh": "那個 column 裡才是實際內容。我們用設定預設大小來控制尺寸，順帶一提"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 186.63,
          "end": 189.81,
          "en": "could omit because 12 is the default.",
          "zh": "你也可以省略，因為 12 就是預設值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 189.93,
          "end": 191.06,
          "en": "Why is it 12?",
          "zh": "為什麼是 12？"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 191.1,
          "end": 198.42000000000002,
          "en": "Because the Ionic grid thinks in 12 columns you can use to control the width of your items and by",
          "zh": "因為 Ionic grid 以 12 欄為單位思考，你可以用這些欄來控制項目的寬度；"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 198.42000000000002,
          "end": 204.32999999999998,
          "en": "default, if you only have one column, that will automatically take all 12 columns that are available,",
          "zh": "預設情況下，如果只有一個 column，它會自動佔用可用的全部 12 欄，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 204.87,
          "end": 210.3,
          "en": "if you have more than one column in one row, they will automatically split that into six columns each.",
          "zh": "如果同一列裡有多個 column，它們就會自動各自平分為 6 欄。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 210.32999999999998,
          "end": 212.36,
          "en": "Here we have only one column in that row,",
          "zh": "這裡那一列只有一個 column，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 212.55,
          "end": 217.53,
          "en": "if you scroll down here we close that row and the column we close is still the same column we open up",
          "zh": "往下捲動，我們關閉那一列，而關閉的這個 column 仍然和"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 217.53,
          "end": 224.7,
          "en": "here and then you can control the size for different breakpoints with these responsive attributes that",
          "zh": "這裡開啟的是同一個，接著你就能用這些響應式屬性為不同斷點控制大小，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 224.7,
          "end": 228.75,
          "en": "use the built-in breakpoint definitions.",
          "zh": "它們使用的是內建的斷點定義。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 228.75,
          "end": 233.89,
          "en": "Now let's explore our different options here with a little dummy grid",
          "zh": "現在我們用一個小小的測試 grid 來試試各種選項，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 233.88,
          "end": 239.01,
          "en": "and for that, I'll go to offers and then a new offer page because here I have a blank screen which we",
          "zh": "為此我會前往 offers，再進入 new offer 頁面，因為這裡有個空白畫面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 239.01,
          "end": 245.16,
          "en": "will later fill with some useful content but for now, this is perfect for playing around with the grid,",
          "zh": "之後會填入實用內容，但目前很適合拿來玩 grid，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 245.27,
          "end": 247.06,
          "en": "so let's do just that.",
          "zh": "我們就來試試。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 247.17,
          "end": 251.95,
          "en": "Let's go to offers, new offer and then there in the content,",
          "zh": "我們前往 offers、new offer，然後在 content 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 251.97,
          "end": 254.6,
          "en": "let me remove that padding and in here,",
          "zh": "我把 padding 拿掉，然後在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 254.61,
          "end": 261.12,
          "en": "let's add an ion-grid. Now as I mentioned, the ion-grid then needs at least one ion-row and in that ion-row,",
          "zh": "加入一個 ion-grid。如我所說，ion-grid 至少需要一個 ion-row，而在那個 ion-row 裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 261.12,
          "end": 263.57,
          "en": "you add your column.",
          "zh": "加入你的 column。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 263.79,
          "end": 269.85,
          "en": "Now to make it a bit easier to see which size a column occupies,",
          "zh": "為了更容易看出每個 column 佔多大，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 269.97,
          "end": 276.42,
          "en": "I'll go into the scss file here and give the ion-col selector here some styling.",
          "zh": "我會進到這裡的 scss 檔，給 ion-col 選擇器加些樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 276.42,
          "end": 282.99,
          "en": "Now since we're using Angular here, the styles we assign to ion-col here in this scss file will only",
          "zh": "由於這裡用的是 Angular，我們在這個 scss 檔中指定給 ion-col 的樣式只會"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 282.99,
          "end": 286.59000000000003,
          "en": "apply to ion columns used in this component.",
          "zh": "套用到這個元件裡使用的 ion column。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 286.59000000000003,
          "end": 295.04,
          "en": "Now here I want to give them a border of one pixel solid and red. If I do that and I then also add some",
          "zh": "這裡我想給它們 1 像素實線的紅色邊框。這樣做之後，我再加一些"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 295.04,
          "end": 306.89,
          "en": "content here like row one, column one, then let's save this and let's wait for this to reload, login,",
          "zh": "內容，例如 row one、column one，然後存檔並等它重新載入，login、"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 309.13,
          "end": 314.52,
          "en": "offers and here it is and by the way to speed this up a little bit,",
          "zh": "offers，就是這裡。順帶一提，為了加快一點速度，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 314.65,
          "end": 321.47,
          "en": "I'll go to my auth service and set user is authenticated to true so that we are logged in by default",
          "zh": "我會到 auth service，把 user is authenticated 設為 true，讓我們預設就是已登入狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 321.52,
          "end": 327.54,
          "en": "and if I now reload, we automatically start on this page and I don't have to navigate back here.",
          "zh": "這樣重新載入後就會自動從這個頁面開始，不必再導覽回來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 327.58,
          "end": 333.94,
          "en": "So what we can see is that by default, this takes the full available width of this page, just a little",
          "zh": "可以看到，預設情況下它佔滿這個頁面可用的全部寬度，只有一點點"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 333.94,
          "end": 340.36,
          "en": "bit of padding which this grid automatically adds and which you by the way can get rid of by simply adding",
          "zh": "padding，那是 grid 自動加上的，順帶一提，只要加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 340.57,
          "end": 342.9,
          "en": "no-padding",
          "zh": "no-padding"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 342.97,
          "end": 350.2,
          "en": "and with that if I now save this, you will see it reloads here and now it actually takes the full width",
          "zh": "就能去掉。加上之後我存檔，你會看到它重新載入，現在它真的佔滿整個寬度，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 350.2,
          "end": 351.76,
          "en": "and there is no padding left.",
          "zh": "沒有任何 padding 了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 351.97,
          "end": 357.28,
          "en": "So that is a setting you can add in case you want to take that full available space, for example for",
          "zh": "所以如果你想要用滿可用空間，就可以加上這個設定，例如"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 357.28,
          "end": 359.94,
          "en": "showing a big image at the top of the page,",
          "zh": "在頁面頂端顯示一張大圖，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 360.01,
          "end": 364.93,
          "en": "I will remove that because I want to have a padding but still what we can see even with that padding",
          "zh": "我會把它移除，因為我還是想要有 padding。不過即使有 padding，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 365.02,
          "end": 370.41,
          "en": "generally, this one row with that one column takes the full width and that is what I meant.",
          "zh": "一般來說，這一列配上那一個 column 仍然佔滿整個寬度，這就是我的意思。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 370.45,
          "end": 376.48,
          "en": "If you add an ion column, by default it takes the full available 12 columns.",
          "zh": "如果你加入一個 ion column，它預設會佔用可用的全部 12 欄。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 376.57,
          "end": 379.53,
          "en": "Now with that, let's actually add 12 columns.",
          "zh": "那麼我們就實際加入 12 個 column。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 379.6,
          "end": 382.8,
          "en": "So let's add a second column here, in this first row still,",
          "zh": "我們在這裡、仍在第一列裡加入第二個 column，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 382.81,
          "end": 388.27,
          "en": "we don't add a new row because in that same row, I want to have a new column and you can have different",
          "zh": "我們不是新增一列，因為我想在同一列裡再加一個 column，而每一列都可以有不同的"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 388.27,
          "end": 395.9,
          "en": "columns in every row. Let's add column three, four and so on and I'll quickly fill this up all the way",
          "zh": "column。我們加入 column three、four 等等，我很快把它一路補到"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 396.02,
          "end": 402.71,
          "en": "to 12, so that we can see all 12 columns here in action,",
          "zh": "12，這樣就能看到全部 12 個 column 實際運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 402.75,
          "end": 407.01,
          "en": "so here's 10, 11 and 12.",
          "zh": "所以這裡是 10、11 和 12。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 407.02,
          "end": 415.81,
          "en": "Now with that saved, what you will see as this reloads is that here we have our 12 columns sitting next",
          "zh": "存檔後，重新載入時你會看到這裡有 12 個 column 並排"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 415.81,
          "end": 422.11,
          "en": "to each other in that row and they take up the full width and they distribute the available space equally.",
          "zh": "在那一列中，佔滿整個寬度，並且平均分配可用空間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 423.34,
          "end": 434.12,
          "en": "If we add a new column, a 13th column here, that actually still fits in but we're now reaching a point",
          "zh": "如果我們再加一個 column，也就是第 13 個，它其實還是塞得進去，但現在已經到了"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 434.12,
          "end": 440.99,
          "en": "where the grid is not optimized for and where also your response of breakpoints will not be usable in",
          "zh": "grid 沒有最佳化的情況，你的響應式斷點也無法"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 440.99,
          "end": 441.93,
          "en": "a perfect way,",
          "zh": "完美運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 441.98,
          "end": 449.15,
          "en": "so you should restrict yourself to twelve columns and to be honest, you very rarely have layouts where",
          "zh": "所以你應該限制自己最多用 12 欄。老實說，你很少會有版面"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 449.15,
          "end": 452.98,
          "en": "you would need more than 12 items in the same row.",
          "zh": "需要在同一列放超過 12 個項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 453.08,
          "end": 459.89,
          "en": "Now of course if you go to a small device, you see here we get a problem because we still try to squeeze",
          "zh": "當然，如果你切到小裝置，就會看到問題，因為我們仍然試著把"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 459.96,
          "end": 467.99,
          "en": "12 items into one row and you can see that automatically, a break is added here and the line wraps at",
          "zh": "12 個項目塞進一列，你可以看到它自動在這裡斷行，而換行的時機"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 467.99,
          "end": 474.77,
          "en": "the point of time where it can't shrink the items anymore since the lowest amount that it can shrink them which",
          "zh": "就是它無法再把項目縮小的時候，因為它能縮到的最小程度，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 474.77,
          "end": 476.1,
          "en": "it does automatically",
          "zh": "而這是它自動完成的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 476.15,
          "end": 477.97,
          "en": "is that the row fits in there,",
          "zh": "就是剛好讓 row 這個字放得進去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 477.97,
          "end": 483.98,
          "en": "the word row and it wouldn't be able to shrink that anymore because it can't wrap it into a new line",
          "zh": "也就是 row 這個字。它無法再把它縮得更小，因為不能把這個字拆到新的行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 484.34,
          "end": 487.76,
          "en": "and therefore it now starts wrapping the items into new lines,",
          "zh": "因此它現在開始把項目換行到新的行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 487.88,
          "end": 492.91,
          "en": "still it then takes up the full width. So this is how this generally works with the columns thing",
          "zh": "不過它仍然佔滿整個寬度。這就是 column 大致運作的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 492.92,
          "end": 499.55,
          "en": "but of course you rarely use twelve columns and you've got many options for configuring how broad your",
          "zh": "當然你很少用到 12 欄，而且如果你用的欄數少於 12，有很多選項可以設定"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 499.55,
          "end": 505.4,
          "en": "columns should be in case you're using less than 12 columns because the far more common use case is",
          "zh": "你的 column 該有多寬，因為更常見的情況"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 505.4,
          "end": 510.77,
          "en": "not that you want to have twelve items sit next to each other but that you have a couple of items that",
          "zh": "不是想讓 12 個項目並排，而是有幾個項目"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 510.77,
          "end": 513.03,
          "en": "should be broader than one column.",
          "zh": "應該比一欄更寬。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727902",
      "title": "Controlling Grid Column Sizes",
      "lectureOrder": 132,
      "videoOrder": 108,
      "sourceHash": "df8b0d2123a0ce1b47a71f54d5f9afa2cc0ffb9891fe6034b1e303de6e303888",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.42,
          "end": 6.42,
          "en": "Let's remove a couple of columns and let's say we only have two left",
          "zh": "我們移除幾個 column，假設只留下兩個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.62,
          "end": 10.95,
          "en": "and that would be a more common use case, that we want to have two items sit next to each other.",
          "zh": "這是更常見的情況：想讓兩個項目並排。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 11,
          "end": 16.67,
          "en": "Now as I reload here, we see two columns here on the small screen and on the big screen, where they of",
          "zh": "重新載入後，我們在小螢幕上看到兩個 column，在大螢幕上"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 16.67,
          "end": 20.1,
          "en": "course take up way more space. Now",
          "zh": "它們當然佔用更多空間。那麼"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 20.12,
          "end": 27.14,
          "en": "a common scenario would be that you don't want to take up that much space here on a screen, so you",
          "zh": "常見的情況是，你不希望它們在螢幕上佔那麼多空間，所以"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 27.14,
          "end": 31.58,
          "en": "can control that with the size attribute on every column.",
          "zh": "你可以用每個 column 上的 size 屬性來控制。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 31.58,
          "end": 36.03,
          "en": "You could say after 12 columns you could possibly take,",
          "zh": "你可以說，總共 12 欄，你最多可以取用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 36.26,
          "end": 46.45,
          "en": "you should take let's say 10 and the second item here should take 1, that would be a possible split.",
          "zh": "比如說你應該取 10，而第二個項目取 1，這是一種可能的分配方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 46.45,
          "end": 51.46,
          "en": "Now we have one column unassigned but that's okay, we'll just have an empty space at the end here,",
          "zh": "這樣就有一欄沒有分配，但沒關係，最後這裡就會留下一塊空白，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 51.46,
          "end": 51.9,
          "en": "right,",
          "zh": "對吧，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 51.91,
          "end": 53.14,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": "就像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 53.14,
          "end": 56.22,
          "en": "So this already shows you how you can think about that.",
          "zh": "這已經讓你瞭解可以怎麼思考這件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 56.23,
          "end": 61.26,
          "en": "It's not that you don't have to split the available space equally, here",
          "zh": "並不是說你一定要平均分配可用空間，這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 61.27,
          "end": 63.19,
          "en": "I'm certainly not doing that,",
          "zh": "我就完全沒有這樣做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 63.19,
          "end": 68.28999999999999,
          "en": "instead you have 12 columns you can play with and you can distribute that space however you want",
          "zh": "而是你有 12 欄可以運用，想怎麼分配這塊空間都行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 68.44,
          "end": 71.44,
          "en": "and you don't have to assign all 12 columns",
          "zh": "而且你不必把 12 欄全部分配完，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 71.44,
          "end": 75.28,
          "en": "and indeed, that's not what we did on the discover page either.",
          "zh": "事實上，我們在 discover 頁面也沒有這樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 75.28,
          "end": 77.5,
          "en": "If we have a look at our discover page",
          "zh": "如果我們看看 discover 頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 80.14,
          "end": 81,
          "en": "here,",
          "zh": "這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 81.06,
          "end": 87.42,
          "en": "you see that I'm basically only assigning 8 columns here of the 12 available and I'll come",
          "zh": "你會看到我基本上只分配了可用 12 欄中的 8 欄，而我會"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 87.42,
          "end": 90.87,
          "en": "back to what this sm thing means and how it works in details",
          "zh": "再回來說明 sm 這個東西代表什麼、以及它的運作細節，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 90.87,
          "end": 98.91,
          "en": "soon. You could of course also say that you want to have four columns each and therefore, we have four",
          "zh": "很快就會講到。你當然也可以說希望各佔 4 欄，這樣就會剩下 4"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 98.91,
          "end": 100.97999999999999,
          "en": "columns left over",
          "zh": "欄沒用到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 100.97999999999999,
          "end": 107.61,
          "en": "and now we see four and four, that looks about equal and then we have an equally sized space left over.",
          "zh": "現在我們看到 4 和 4，看起來大致相等，然後右邊留下一塊同樣大小的空間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 107.64,
          "end": 112.96000000000001,
          "en": "Now what about centering though? That is where this offset thing comes into play.",
          "zh": "那置中呢？這時候 offset 就派上用場了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 113.00999999999999,
          "end": 115.91,
          "en": "You can not just assign the size of a column,",
          "zh": "你不只能指定 column 的大小，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 116.00999999999999,
          "end": 121.11,
          "en": "you can also tell the Ionic grid how much is should be offset from the left.",
          "zh": "還可以告訴 Ionic grid 它應該從左邊偏移多少。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 121.62,
          "end": 129.12,
          "en": "So here, you could say offset 4 for example and what this means is this column will be pushed to the",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，你可以例如設定 offset 4，意思是這個 column 會被往"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 129.12,
          "end": 137.37,
          "en": "right by four columns and then it will have a width of four columns. This column then automatically comes",
          "zh": "右推 4 欄，然後它的寬度是 4 欄。接著這個 column 會自動接在"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 137.52,
          "end": 138.22,
          "en": "after,",
          "zh": "後面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 138.24,
          "end": 144.29,
          "en": "so on the right of the first column because it comes after the first column here in the order of HTML",
          "zh": "也就是在第一個 column 的右邊，因為在 HTML 程式碼的順序中它排在第一個 column 之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 144.29,
          "end": 151.56,
          "en": "code and therefore this starts four columns in is four columns wide, this therefore starts eight",
          "zh": "因此這個從第 4 欄開始、寬 4 欄；而這個則從第 8"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 151.56,
          "end": 156.57999999999998,
          "en": "columns in, four plus four and then is also four columns wide",
          "zh": "欄開始，4 加 4，然後寬度也是 4 欄，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 156.75,
          "end": 161.97,
          "en": "and this gives us the layout where we will have that empty space on the left and our columns take up",
          "zh": "這樣就形成一種版面：左邊留有空位，而我們的 column 佔用"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 161.97,
          "end": 163.95,
          "en": "the space on the right.",
          "zh": "右邊的空間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 163.98,
          "end": 165.51,
          "en": "Now if you want to center it,",
          "zh": "如果你想讓它置中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 165.51,
          "end": 168.93,
          "en": "the solution of course is to just push this in two columns",
          "zh": "解法當然就是把它往內推 2 欄，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 168.93,
          "end": 173.82,
          "en": "so that we have an equally open space to the left and to the right of two columns each",
          "zh": "讓我們左右各留下 2 欄相等的空白，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 173.82,
          "end": 179.63,
          "en": "because we pushed the first column in by two columns, then this has a width of four columns, therefore",
          "zh": "因為我們把第一個 column 往內推 2 欄，它的寬度是 4 欄，因此"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 179.63,
          "end": 189.25,
          "en": "the second column starts six columns in, two, two plus four and then takes four columns of width.",
          "zh": "第二個 column 從第 6 欄開始，2 加上 4，然後佔 4 欄寬。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 189.26,
          "end": 196.61,
          "en": "So of the 12 columns, we have two plus four plus four makes ten columns occupied, two columns are empty,",
          "zh": "所以在 12 欄中，2 加 4 加 4 等於佔用 10 欄，2 欄是空的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 196.88,
          "end": 202.4,
          "en": "eight columns do contain content and the other two columns on the right are left empty and that gives",
          "zh": "8 欄含有內容，右邊另外 2 欄則留空，這樣就得到"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 202.4,
          "end": 204.2,
          "en": "us this centered layout,",
          "zh": "這個置中的版面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 204.2,
          "end": 209.93,
          "en": "this is essentially also what we're using on the discover page. Now that already gives you an idea of",
          "zh": "這基本上也是我們在 discover 頁面用的方式。這已經讓你瞭解"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 209.96,
          "end": 211.27,
          "en": "how you can play around with that",
          "zh": "可以怎麼運用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 211.52,
          "end": 217.16,
          "en": "and of course, you can do the same when using six columns or eight columns. You can really play around with",
          "zh": "當然，用 6 欄或 8 欄時也一樣可以這樣做。你真的可以靈活運用"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 217.16,
          "end": 222.11,
          "en": "sizes and offsets to control how the items are rendered on the screen.",
          "zh": "大小與 offset，來控制項目在螢幕上呈現的方式。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727906",
      "title": "Controlling Grid Alignment",
      "lectureOrder": 133,
      "videoOrder": 109,
      "sourceHash": "710003b7fbf9f2ee174c33bfa008d09e46997268436fbdcf10cb6c84245821eb",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.41,
          "end": 4.81,
          "en": "Now what about sizing of items? Here",
          "zh": "那項目的尺寸呢？這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.81,
          "end": 8.79,
          "en": "these items are basically only as high as their text",
          "zh": "這些項目的高度基本上只等於文字的高度，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.83,
          "end": 10.16,
          "en": "and that's the default.",
          "zh": "這是預設行為。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.21,
          "end": 14.28,
          "en": "These items are as high as their content requires them to be",
          "zh": "這些項目就等於其內容所需的高度，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.38,
          "end": 17.3,
          "en": "unless you set an explicit height for the row.",
          "zh": "除非你為那一列設定明確的高度。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.44,
          "end": 25.39,
          "en": "So if on that row, I would quickly with an inline style set a height of let's say 300 pixels,",
          "zh": "所以如果我在那一列上，用 inline style 快速設定例如 300 像素的高度，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 25.6,
          "end": 32.17,
          "en": "if I would do that on the row, then you will see that the columns automatically take the full height",
          "zh": "如果我在那一列這樣做，你會看到 column 會自動佔滿"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 32.17,
          "end": 40.39,
          "en": "of the row. So the columns take all the height of the row but the row only takes as much height as required",
          "zh": "整列的高度。所以 column 會佔滿整列高度，但列本身只取它最高的子項"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 40.39,
          "end": 41.95,
          "en": "by its highest child,",
          "zh": "所需要的高度，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 42.07,
          "end": 47.5,
          "en": "so it's kind of that circular dependency which you can break by assigning an explicit height here to",
          "zh": "這算是某種循環依賴，你可以透過在這裡為"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 47.5,
          "end": 48.49,
          "en": "row",
          "zh": "row 指定明確高度來打破它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 48.49,
          "end": 52.91,
          "en": "or of course you can also have a column that contains some bigger content.",
          "zh": "或者當然，你也可以讓某個 column 含有比較大的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 53.17,
          "end": 58.77,
          "en": "For example here, if I do you add a card again or any other content, doesn't have to be a card,",
          "zh": "例如這裡，如果我再加入一張 card 或任何其他內容，不一定要是 card，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 58.78,
          "end": 72.81,
          "en": "could be a div, a paragraph, whatever you want and in there, I have an h1 tag, the column, row 1 col 2,",
          "zh": "可以是 div、段落，任何你想要的。而在裡面我放了一個 h1 標籤，這個 column 是 row 1 col 2，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 72.82,
          "end": 78.88,
          "en": "so now this clearly will take up more height because we have an h1 tag and a paragraph in there.",
          "zh": "現在它顯然會佔用更多高度，因為裡面有 h1 標籤和一段文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 78.91,
          "end": 86.92,
          "en": "Now you will see that the first column here is also just as tall as the second one simply because",
          "zh": "你會看到這裡第一個 column 也跟第二個一樣高，單純是因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 87.03999999999999,
          "end": 92.99000000000001,
          "en": "by default the row is as high as required by its tallest child which would be this child here",
          "zh": "預設情況下，列的高度等於最高子項所需的高度，也就是這裡這個子項，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 93.16,
          "end": 98.09,
          "en": "and therefore this column here basically adjusts.",
          "zh": "因此這裡這個 column 基本上就跟著調整。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 98.28999999999999,
          "end": 104.41,
          "en": "You can overwrite that however, if you don't want to stretch items like this, you can control how this",
          "zh": "不過你可以覆寫這點。如果你不想讓項目這樣被拉伸，可以控制它"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 104.41,
          "end": 106.12,
          "en": "should be positioned vertically,",
          "zh": "在垂直方向應該如何定位，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 106.12,
          "end": 112.69,
          "en": "so from top to bottom. Right now, the default is stretch but you can overwrite this and the official docs",
          "zh": "也就是由上到下。目前預設是 stretch，但你可以覆寫它，而官方文件"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 112.78,
          "end": 119.92,
          "en": "as always are of help for that. In the component docs, if you search the grid there and you click on",
          "zh": "一如往常能幫上忙。在元件文件中，如果你搜尋 grid 並點進"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 119.92,
          "end": 127.09,
          "en": "ion-grid, you'll find a link to the grid layout detailed documentation. There in general, you can learn",
          "zh": "ion-grid，就會找到 grid layout 詳細文件的連結。在那裡你可以學到"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 127.21,
          "end": 133.75,
          "en": "all about the grid and I strongly recommend checking that out and you'll also find more about the alignment",
          "zh": "grid 的所有內容，我強烈建議去看看。你還會找到更多關於對齊的說明，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 134.2,
          "end": 139.57,
          "en": "and you'll learn that for vertical alignment, you can use these utility attributes, the same by the",
          "zh": "並且會學到垂直對齊可以用這些工具屬性，順帶一提，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 139.57,
          "end": 143.5,
          "en": "way also for horizontal alignment which we'll also have a look at.",
          "zh": "水平對齊也一樣，我們同樣會來看看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 143.53,
          "end": 148.93,
          "en": "So now what can we set there? On your row, not on the column but on your row,",
          "zh": "那我們可以在那裡設定什麼？在你的 row 上，不是 column，而是在你的 row 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 148.93,
          "end": 156.04,
          "en": "you can set align items and now the default is stretch. So therefore if I set stretch here, nothing",
          "zh": "你可以設定 align items，而預設值是 stretch。所以如果我在這裡設成 stretch，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 156.04,
          "end": 157.3,
          "en": "will change as this reloads",
          "zh": "重新載入後不會有任何變化，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 157.3,
          "end": 158.96,
          "en": "because this is the default,",
          "zh": "因為這就是預設值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 158.98,
          "end": 167.44,
          "en": "they stretch across the vertical space. But if I set this to start for example, so align items start,",
          "zh": "它們會延展跨越垂直空間。但如果我把它設成 start，例如 align items start，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 168.04,
          "end": 170.25,
          "en": "you will see a difference.",
          "zh": "你就會看到差別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 170.29,
          "end": 177.61,
          "en": "Now these items by default will only take the height as required by their content, not of the entire row",
          "zh": "現在這些項目預設只會取內容所需的高度，而不是整列的高度，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 177.61,
          "end": 184.12,
          "en": "and then they are positioned at the start, seen from top to bottom and the start from top to bottom is",
          "zh": "然後它們會被定位在起始處，也就是由上往下看的起點，而由上往下的起點"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 184.12,
          "end": 186.34,
          "en": "of course at the top.",
          "zh": "當然就是頂端。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 186.64,
          "end": 193.1,
          "en": "Of course you also have align items end and if you know the CSS flexbox specification in CSS,",
          "zh": "當然你也有 align items end。如果你熟悉 CSS 裡的 flexbox 規範，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 193.11,
          "end": 199.12,
          "en": "you of course will probably already have recognized that this in the end will just set the CSS",
          "zh": "你大概已經認出，這最終只是把 CSS 屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 199.12,
          "end": 203.29,
          "en": "property align items to flex start or flex end.",
          "zh": "align items 設為 flex start 或 flex end。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 203.29,
          "end": 209.98,
          "en": "So with end, align items end, it's pushed all the way to the bottom if it does not take the full height",
          "zh": "所以用 end，也就是 align items end，如果項目預設沒有佔滿整列高度，它就會被推到最下方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 210.07,
          "end": 219.01,
          "en": "of the row by default. Now of course you also have center and that is by the way a nice way of vertically",
          "zh": "當然你也有 center，順帶一提，這是讓項目垂直置中的好方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 219.01,
          "end": 226.06,
          "en": "centering an item here which historically has always been tricky in HTML and CSS with the help of",
          "zh": "這件事在 HTML 與 CSS 歷史上一直很棘手，而藉由"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 226.06,
          "end": 232.18,
          "en": "flexbox and therefore here with the help of Ionic grid, it's not difficult anymore.",
          "zh": "flexbox，以及這裡藉由 Ionic grid，它再也不困難了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 232.18,
          "end": 235.99,
          "en": "Now of course, you can not just vertically position your items,",
          "zh": "當然，你不只能為項目做垂直定位，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 235.99,
          "end": 239.93,
          "en": "what about horizontal positioning? For that,",
          "zh": "那水平定位呢？為此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 239.95,
          "end": 243.99,
          "en": "you can also add a CSS utility attribute to your ion-row",
          "zh": "你也可以在 ion-row 上加入 CSS 工具屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 244,
          "end": 247.28,
          "en": "and that would be justify-content-",
          "zh": "也就是 justify-content-"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 247.36,
          "end": 250.64,
          "en": "and now you can set this for example to start.",
          "zh": "你可以把它例如設成 start。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 250.77,
          "end": 252.9,
          "en": "Now what happens if you set it to start though?",
          "zh": "不過設成 start 會發生什麼事？"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 255.74,
          "end": 257.43,
          "en": "Nothing, right?",
          "zh": "什麼都沒有，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 257.54,
          "end": 261.41,
          "en": "You'll see the effect if you remove the offset.",
          "zh": "如果你把 offset 移除，就會看到效果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 261.41,
          "end": 269.64,
          "en": "So if I remove the offset from the first column and it reloads, we see what we had before, it is all",
          "zh": "所以如果我把第一個 column 的 offset 移除，重新載入後就會看到之前的樣子，全部"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 269.64,
          "end": 271.05,
          "en": "the way on the left.",
          "zh": "靠在左邊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 271.05,
          "end": 278.7,
          "en": "Now let me show you justify-content-end, you will now see that the content, these two columns here",
          "zh": "現在我示範 justify-content-end，你會看到內容，也就是這裡這兩個 column，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 278.85,
          "end": 283.42,
          "en": "get pushed all the way to the right without an offset being set.",
          "zh": "在沒有設定 offset 的情況下被推到最右邊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 283.59000000000003,
          "end": 290.28,
          "en": "So you can also center items manually with the help of the offset and that can be especially useful",
          "zh": "所以你也可以藉由 offset 手動讓項目置中，這在"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 290.28,
          "end": 297.6,
          "en": "when working with different layouts for different device sizes but you can also control it here with",
          "zh": "為不同裝置尺寸設計不同版面時特別有用，不過你也可以在這裡用"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 297.6,
          "end": 304.77,
          "en": "justify-content-end or justify-content-center for example for horizontal centering.",
          "zh": "justify-content-end，或例如用 justify-content-center 來做水平置中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 304.77,
          "end": 307.77,
          "en": "So that is also worth keeping in mind, though",
          "zh": "所以這也值得記住，不過"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 307.86,
          "end": 314.16,
          "en": "I really want to emphasize if you are building a grid that should look and behave differently on different",
          "zh": "我真的想強調，如果你建立的 grid 要在不同螢幕尺寸上看起來與表現不同，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 314.16,
          "end": 319.68,
          "en": "screen sizes, you'll have an easier time when using the offset attribute",
          "zh": "使用 offset 屬性會讓你輕鬆許多，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 319.74,
          "end": 325.89,
          "en": "and speaking of that, let's dive into how you can ensure that your grid looks good on different screen",
          "zh": "說到這個，我們就來深入瞭解如何確保 grid 在不同螢幕"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 325.89,
          "end": 326.4,
          "en": "sizes.",
          "zh": "尺寸上都好看。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727908",
      "title": "Responsive Grid Sizing",
      "lectureOrder": 134,
      "videoOrder": 110,
      "sourceHash": "05b0962d0e317779fbac8762a268a596e15003eaa555f867af3c8eecd29e4e8d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 8.31,
          "en": "We already made sure that the grid behaves differently on different screen sizes on the discover page.",
          "zh": "我們已經在 discover 頁面確保 grid 在不同螢幕尺寸上有不同表現。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.77,
          "end": 9.17,
          "en": "There",
          "zh": "在那裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.18,
          "end": 15.42,
          "en": "I did assign size and set it equal to 12 which you could remove because that's the default anyways",
          "zh": "我確實指定了 size 並設為 12，你其實可以移除，因為那本來就是預設值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 15.87,
          "end": 18.88,
          "en": "but then I set this strange size-sm",
          "zh": "但接著我設定了這個奇怪的 size-sm"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 18.96,
          "end": 26.3,
          "en": "and offset-sm and then we assign different values and now we just have to find out what this",
          "zh": "和 offset-sm，然後指定不同的值。現在我們只要弄清楚這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 26.3,
          "end": 28.76,
          "en": "-sm stands for.",
          "zh": "-sm 代表什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 28.8,
          "end": 31.06,
          "en": "Indeed the Ionic grid gives you",
          "zh": "沒錯，Ionic grid 提供你"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 31.06,
          "end": 37.74,
          "en": "different breakpoints for which you can set the size and offset and also push and pull which I'll",
          "zh": "不同的斷點，你可以為此設定 size 和 offset，還有 push 和 pull，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 37.74,
          "end": 39.91,
          "en": "not dive in deeply",
          "zh": "這部分我不會深入說明，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 39.99,
          "end": 46.53,
          "en": "attributes and you'll find that in the official docs. Push and pull would allow you to change the order",
          "zh": "這些屬性都可以在官方文件找到。push 和 pull 讓你改變"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 46.71,
          "end": 49.81,
          "en": "of items based on different screen sizes,",
          "zh": "項目在不同螢幕尺寸下的順序，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 49.83,
          "end": 52.76,
          "en": "you can learn that in the official docs, size and offset are",
          "zh": "你可以在官方文件學到。不過 size 和 offset 是"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 52.77,
          "end": 55.17,
          "en": "the more important attributes though",
          "zh": "更重要的屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 55.17,
          "end": 56.22,
          "en": "and there you learn",
          "zh": "在那裡你會學到"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 56.22,
          "end": 65.4,
          "en": "you have xs, sm, md, lg and xl as breakpoints and you see the values which are basically the pixel",
          "zh": "斷點有 xs、sm、md、lg 和 xl，你會看到這些數值，基本上就是它們開始生效的螢幕寬度"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 65.4,
          "end": 69.38,
          "en": "values of screen width for which they will become active.",
          "zh": "像素值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 69.63,
          "end": 75.7,
          "en": "So you can just assign size and offset without any value and then this means for all screen sizes,",
          "zh": "所以你可以只指定 size 和 offset 而不加任何後綴，這代表套用於所有螢幕尺寸，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 75.78,
          "end": 83.69,
          "en": "this column will have this size and this offset but if you add size-sm for example or offset-sm, then",
          "zh": "這個 column 就會有這個大小和這個 offset。但如果你加上例如 size-sm 或 offset-sm，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 83.69,
          "end": 91.92,
          "en": "you are saying for any page that has at least this width of viewport available, this size and offset",
          "zh": "你的意思是，任何 viewport 寬度至少達到這個值的頁面，這個 size 和 offset"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 91.92,
          "end": 93.37,
          "en": "will take effect",
          "zh": "就會生效，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 93.45,
          "end": 94.5,
          "en": "and that's important,",
          "zh": "這點很重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 94.5,
          "end": 95.99000000000001,
          "en": "this acts as a minimum.",
          "zh": "它是最低門檻。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 96.18,
          "end": 105.3,
          "en": "So if you set size-sm to a column value of 6, then this means on devices that have at least a width",
          "zh": "所以如果你把 size-sm 設為 column 值 6，意思是在寬度至少達到"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 105.42,
          "end": 107.03999999999999,
          "en": "of this pixel value,",
          "zh": "這個像素值的裝置上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 107.25,
          "end": 113.61,
          "en": "this size will have an effect. So desktop devices which have way more will also take that but of course",
          "zh": "這個大小就會生效。所以寬度遠大於此的桌面裝置也會套用，但當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 113.61,
          "end": 121.2,
          "en": "you can also add multiple breakpoint specific sizes and offsets to a fine-grained control.",
          "zh": "你也可以為多個斷點分別加上 size 和 offset，做到更精細的控制。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 121.2,
          "end": 127.58,
          "en": "So back to our new offer page here, to demonstrate this",
          "zh": "回到這裡的 new offer 頁面，為了示範這點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 127.58,
          "end": 138.95,
          "en": "if I set size-sm to 4 and here also size-sm to 4 and then I also add size let's say md to 2 and",
          "zh": "如果我把 size-sm 設為 4，這裡也把 size-sm 設為 4，然後再加上例如 size-md 為 2，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 139.04,
          "end": 156.38,
          "en": "I add here size-md to 3 and then I also add offset-sm of 2 and offset-md to let's say 4,",
          "zh": "這裡把 size-md 設為 3，再設定 offset-sm 為 2，offset-md 例如設為 4，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 156.73,
          "end": 161.61,
          "en": "if I set all of that and this now reloads,",
          "zh": "如果我全部設定好，現在重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 161.81,
          "end": 163.79,
          "en": "you will see that on a big screen",
          "zh": "你會看到在大螢幕上"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 164.81,
          "end": 171.71,
          "en": "they're a bit smaller because what I basically set is that for medium-sized devices or higher and we",
          "zh": "它們變小了一些，因為我基本上設定的是：在中型或更大的裝置上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 171.71,
          "end": 178.91,
          "en": "can see that medium-sized starts at 768 pixels of screen width, we'll actually",
          "zh": "而我們可以看到中型從螢幕寬度 768 像素開始，我們實際上"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 178.91,
          "end": 188.92,
          "en": "just occupy two of the available columns. Only if we are below these 768 pixels, we'll jump to this set",
          "zh": "只佔用可用欄位中的 2 欄。只有在低於這 768 像素時，才會切換到這裡這組"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 188.92,
          "end": 191.71,
          "en": "up here where we will take four columns.",
          "zh": "設定，佔用 4 欄。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 191.71,
          "end": 199.36,
          "en": "So therefore now if I shrink that width here quite a bit and then at some point, I'm below that breakpoint",
          "zh": "所以現在如果我把這裡的寬度縮小不少，到了某個點就會低於那個斷點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 199.87,
          "end": 205.11,
          "en": "and by the way that pixel value here in the top right corner can be ignored, I'm zoomed in for recording",
          "zh": "順帶一提，右上角顯示的像素值可以忽略，我為了錄影把畫面放大了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 205.12,
          "end": 207.56,
          "en": "so these pixel values are not correct,",
          "zh": "所以那些像素值並不正確，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 207.64,
          "end": 214.42000000000002,
          "en": "so if I basically at some point here, you'll see that certainly changed. Right here it's pretty stuffed",
          "zh": "所以在這裡的某個點，你會看到它確實改變了。這裡相當擁擠，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 214.84,
          "end": 216.32,
          "en": "and we have more space.",
          "zh": "而這裡空間更多。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 216.37,
          "end": 224.71,
          "en": "So this is the 768 pixel breakpoint below which we'll make it into this for column with setup.",
          "zh": "所以這就是 768 像素的斷點，低於它就會變成這組 4 欄寬的設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 224.77,
          "end": 229.69,
          "en": "Now it is worth pointing out that this also only applies for size-sm,",
          "zh": "另外值得一提的是，這也只在 size-sm 的情況下適用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 229.81,
          "end": 237.57999999999998,
          "en": "so for devices that have at least 576 pixels of screen width. If we go even lower than that,",
          "zh": "也就是螢幕寬度至少 576 像素的裝置。如果我們縮到更低，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 241.09,
          "end": 243.49,
          "en": "you see now we take the full available width,",
          "zh": "你會看到現在我們佔滿可用的全部寬度，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 243.52,
          "end": 248.83,
          "en": "so these two columns which are still next to each other in one row split the full available width. The",
          "zh": "所以這兩個仍在同一列並排的 column 平分了可用寬度。其"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 248.83,
          "end": 258.13,
          "en": "reason for that is that size-sm 4 only kicks in for screen sizes wider than 576 pixels and anything",
          "zh": "原因是 size-sm 4 只在螢幕寬度大於 576 像素時生效，任何"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 258.13,
          "end": 268.6,
          "en": "below that takes the default of size 12. Now if I would set size-xs or just size here to let's say 5",
          "zh": "低於此的都會採用 size 12 的預設值。現在如果我設定 size-xs，或直接設 size 為例如 5，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 268.96,
          "end": 275.77,
          "en": "and here size to 1, then we would not take the full available width but instead for the first column,",
          "zh": "這裡設 size 為 1，那就不會佔滿可用寬度，而是第一個 column"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 275.8,
          "end": 280.09000000000003,
          "en": "we would take five columns of width and for the last column, only 1",
          "zh": "佔 5 欄寬，最後一個 column 只佔 1 欄，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 280.18,
          "end": 286.6,
          "en": "and that leads us to this layout which is of course not super beautiful. But this showcases how you can",
          "zh": "這就形成這個版面，雖然當然不算很好看，但它展示了你可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 286.6,
          "end": 294.52,
          "en": "control this and if you would now add a new ion-row with new ion-columns in there, these columns can",
          "zh": "如何控制。而如果你再加入一個新的 ion-row，裡面放新的 ion-column，這些 column"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 294.52,
          "end": 299.27,
          "en": "now be styled and sized totally independent of that first row.",
          "zh": "就可以完全獨立於第一列來設定樣式與大小。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 299.32,
          "end": 301.84,
          "en": "So every row works on its own,",
          "zh": "所以每一列都是獨立運作的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 301.84,
          "end": 304.54,
          "en": "that is also important to understand.",
          "zh": "這點也很重要，要理解。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 304.66,
          "end": 308.29,
          "en": "You can size columns equally across rows but you don't have to.",
          "zh": "你可以讓各列的 column 大小相同，但不一定非得如此。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727910",
      "title": "Grid Summary",
      "lectureOrder": 135,
      "videoOrder": 111,
      "sourceHash": "2940aad3d5cb05f63addc33acaee35e0d8e0de852b37ddfde64556af3de82d75",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.38,
          "end": 4.92,
          "en": "Now that's it for the grid. As I mentioned,",
          "zh": "grid 就講到這裡。如我所說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.92,
          "end": 8.05,
          "en": "check out the official docs for all features,",
          "zh": "想看所有功能就去看官方文件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.08,
          "end": 13.87,
          "en": "one thing that I want to show you is that on ion-grid, you can also add fixed. If you don't add it, by",
          "zh": "有一件事我想給你看：在 ion-grid 上你也可以加上 fixed。如果不加，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.87,
          "end": 17.64,
          "en": "default the grid takes the full width of the screen, with fixed,",
          "zh": "grid 預設佔滿螢幕的整個寬度；加上 fixed，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.65,
          "end": 25.18,
          "en": "it actually also takes breakpoints into account to use a fixed width, a pixel fixed width instead of the",
          "zh": "它其實也會考量斷點，改用固定寬度，也就是以像素為單位的固定寬度，而不是"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 25.18,
          "end": 27.87,
          "en": "full width which you see on bigger screens",
          "zh": "在大螢幕上看到的整個寬度，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 27.88,
          "end": 40.77,
          "en": "if you now actually add a new ion-column let's say in the second row here, row 2 col 1 and we",
          "zh": "如果你現在真的在第二列加入一個新的 ion-column，比如說 row 2 col 1，然後我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 40.77,
          "end": 41.92,
          "en": "repeat that.",
          "zh": "重複這個動作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 41.94,
          "end": 48.54,
          "en": "Now what you will see for that second row which should take the full available width, there is more",
          "zh": "你會看到，對於那個原本應該佔滿可用寬度的第二列，右邊還有多出"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 48.69,
          "end": 51.8,
          "en": "space to the right and that's not the default padding",
          "zh": "空間，而那並不是預設的 padding，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 51.81,
          "end": 58.65,
          "en": "and it becomes wider because now the overall grid has a fixed width across which it will not grow",
          "zh": "它會變寬，是因為現在整個 grid 有固定寬度，不會再超過這個寬度，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 58.95,
          "end": 64.4,
          "en": "and this can be helpful if you have a page where at some point, you don't want to take the full available",
          "zh": "當你的頁面在某個情況下不想佔滿可用"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 64.4,
          "end": 64.96,
          "en": "width,",
          "zh": "寬度時，這會很有幫助，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 65.04,
          "end": 70.77,
          "en": "let's say this page is viewed on a TV, then maybe you still want to have a certain area for the grid",
          "zh": "比如說這個頁面在電視上瀏覽，你可能還是想讓 grid 佔用某個特定區域，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 70.89,
          "end": 74.01,
          "en": "and not take 100% of the available width.",
          "zh": "而不是佔滿 100% 的可用寬度。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 74.13,
          "end": 79.51,
          "en": "Now that is only the case if you added fixed as an attribute to ion-grid,",
          "zh": "這只有在你在 ion-grid 上加了 fixed 屬性時才會如此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 79.59,
          "end": 86.7,
          "en": "if you don't add this, then the grid will always span 100% of the page width. But that's it for",
          "zh": "如果不加，grid 永遠會橫跨頁面 100% 的寬度。grid 就"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 86.7,
          "end": 87.66,
          "en": "the grid,",
          "zh": "講到這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 87.66,
          "end": 93.83,
          "en": "as I mentioned check the official docs to learn all about it and see more examples and what you'll also",
          "zh": "如我所說，去看官方文件來完整瞭解並看更多範例。你在那裡還會學到、"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 93.84,
          "end": 100.35,
          "en": "learn there and what we'll dive into in the styling and theming module is that you can also overwrite",
          "zh": "也是我們會在 styling and theming 模組深入探討的是：你也可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 100.41,
          "end": 106.92,
          "en": "these breakpoints with CSS and CSS variables, a feature I will dive into in the styling and theming",
          "zh": "用 CSS 和 CSS 變數覆寫這些斷點，這個功能我會在 styling and theming"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 106.92,
          "end": 107.7,
          "en": "section.",
          "zh": "章節深入說明。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 107.72999999999999,
          "end": 113.13,
          "en": "So here you can already learn more about that, that you can overwrite certain settings for the grid in",
          "zh": "所以在這裡你已經可以學到更多，也就是你可以覆寫 grid 的某些設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 113.13,
          "end": 115.71000000000001,
          "en": "case you want to adjust it to your requirements,",
          "zh": "以便依照你的需求調整，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 115.71000000000001,
          "end": 121.38,
          "en": "otherwise you learned how to work with the defaults and still set up your own layout with the help",
          "zh": "除此之外，你也學會如何使用預設值，並且藉由"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 121.38,
          "end": 129.75,
          "en": "of the size and the offset attributes and these responsive attributes with sm, md, lg and so on.",
          "zh": "size 與 offset 屬性，以及 sm、md、lg 等響應式屬性，打造自己的版面。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727914",
      "title": "ion-list vs ion-grid",
      "lectureOrder": 136,
      "videoOrder": 112,
      "sourceHash": "899a472dc172636f57bd73083a0a505cb46c7147b731a19049ac59b1f5fc0ecc",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 8.97,
          "en": "With the ion-grid covered, we now have two main components for structuring layout on that page.",
          "zh": "講完 ion-grid 之後，我們現在知道頁面上有兩個主要的版面結構元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 9.06,
          "end": 14.29,
          "en": "It might not have been obvious but ion-list is essentially fulfilling a similar purpose,",
          "zh": "這可能不太明顯，但 ion-list 基本上也在達成類似的目的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 14.31,
          "end": 17.31,
          "en": "it helps you layout items on a page.",
          "zh": "它幫助你在頁面上排版項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 17.31,
          "end": 25.04,
          "en": "So where is the important difference and when should you use which? Ion-list has a very narrow purpose",
          "zh": "那重要的差異在哪裡？什麼時候該用哪一個？ion-list 的用途其實很狹窄，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 25.04,
          "end": 28.99,
          "en": "actually, it's there to help you render ion-item,",
          "zh": "它的存在是為了幫你渲染 ion-item，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 29,
          "end": 36.87,
          "en": "so really this one component which in turn might hold any kind of content vertically from top to bottom.",
          "zh": "也就是這一個元件，而它本身則可能由上到下垂直裝載任何類型的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 37.19,
          "end": 41.15,
          "en": "And of course especially in mobile apps but also on desktop apps,",
          "zh": "當然，特別是在行動 app，在桌面 app 也一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 41.18,
          "end": 43.41,
          "en": "we work a lot with lists,",
          "zh": "我們很常使用 list，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 43.43,
          "end": 46.13,
          "en": "lists are everywhere, in this course here,",
          "zh": "list 到處都是。在這門課程裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 46.13,
          "end": 53.12,
          "en": "the curriculum is a list. So that use case of structuring content from top to bottom is pretty common",
          "zh": "課程大綱就是一個 list。所以由上到下組織內容這種用法相當常見，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 53.12,
          "end": 59.44,
          "en": "and you actually have that quite a bit and whenever you have that scenario that you simply want to structure",
          "zh": "你也經常會遇到。每當你的情境只是想把內容"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 59.45,
          "end": 66.23,
          "en": "content from top to bottom and you don't need specific control across its width, then you can use an",
          "zh": "由上到下組織，而且不需要特別控制寬度時，你就可以用"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 66.23,
          "end": 67.64,
          "en": "ion-list.",
          "zh": "ion-list。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 67.82,
          "end": 71.09,
          "en": "You should only include ion-items in there, that is important,",
          "zh": "你應該只在裡面放入 ion-item，這點很重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 71.09,
          "end": 73.46000000000001,
          "en": "that is how the Ionic list just works,",
          "zh": "Ionic list 就是這樣運作的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 73.52,
          "end": 80.78,
          "en": "it is optimized for working with ion-items regarding the looks and so on and in general as I mentioned,",
          "zh": "它在外觀等方面都是針對搭配 ion-item 最佳化的。整體來說，如我所說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 80.78,
          "end": 85.56,
          "en": "use it for possibly scrollable vertical list content.",
          "zh": "把它用在可能可以捲動的垂直 list 內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 85.7,
          "end": 92.12,
          "en": "Now what you can do though is you can wrap your list with your grid because the list always takes the",
          "zh": "不過你可以做的是用 grid 把 list 包起來，因為 list 永遠佔滿其容器的"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 92.12,
          "end": 98.75,
          "en": "full width of its container and if the container is the grid or a grid column to be precise, then you",
          "zh": "整個寬度。如果容器是 grid，更精確地說是 grid column，那麼你"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 98.75,
          "end": 101.69,
          "en": "can control the sizing of the list through the grid",
          "zh": "就能透過 grid 控制 list 的大小，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 101.69,
          "end": 103.16,
          "en": "and that takes us to the grid.",
          "zh": "這就帶我們談到 grid。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 103.25,
          "end": 111.68,
          "en": "It can render any content inside of ion-column and that's important because you always must have that",
          "zh": "它可以在 ion-column 裡渲染任何內容，這點很重要，因為你永遠必須有"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 111.68,
          "end": 119.25999999999999,
          "en": "structure of having an ion-row or multiple ion-rows in your ion-grid as a direct child or direct children",
          "zh": "這樣的結構：在 ion-grid 裡有一個或多個 ion-row 作為直接子項，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 119.50999999999999,
          "end": 126.44,
          "en": "and then inside of the ion-row, you always must have ion-columns, one or multiple ion-columns which",
          "zh": "而在 ion-row 裡，你永遠必須有 ion-column，一個或多個 ion-column，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 126.5,
          "end": 128.09,
          "en": "are also the only direct",
          "zh": "它們也是 ion-row 唯一允許的"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 128.09,
          "end": 136.04,
          "en": "children of ion-row. But inside of ion-column, you then can have any content you want, be that a div, a",
          "zh": "直接子項。但在 ion-column 裡，你就可以放任何想要的內容，無論是 div、"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 136.04,
          "end": 143.54,
          "en": "paragraph, a h1 tag or an ion-list or any other component or element, that is all fine.",
          "zh": "段落、h1 標籤、ion-list，或任何其他元件或元素，全都可以。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 143.54,
          "end": 146.93,
          "en": "So the two can actually work together quite nicely,",
          "zh": "所以這兩者其實可以搭配得很好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 146.93,
          "end": 150.19,
          "en": "you can also have an ion-grid inside of ion-item",
          "zh": "例如你也可以在 ion-list 的 ion-item 裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 150.19,
          "end": 157.34,
          "en": "inside of an ion-list for example and therefore, you basically use the grid whenever you have content",
          "zh": "放一個 ion-grid。因此，基本上當你的內容需要更複雜的結構、"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 157.37,
          "end": 163.4,
          "en": "that needs a more complex structure, where you want to have items sit next to each other in the same",
          "zh": "當你想讓項目在同一列並排，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 163.4,
          "end": 172.16,
          "en": "row or where you need to control the width or the positioning, the alignment of items.",
          "zh": "或者需要控制寬度、位置、項目對齊時，就用 grid。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 172.31,
          "end": 179.75,
          "en": "Whenever you have just top to bottom content, use an ion-list and if you need to set that width, you either",
          "zh": "如果只是由上到下的內容，就用 ion-list；而如果你需要設定寬度，可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 179.75,
          "end": 184.33,
          "en": "do that directly through CSS or by wrapping it into an ion-grid.",
          "zh": "直接用 CSS 設定，或把它包進 ion-grid。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727916",
      "title": "ion-label & ion-item",
      "lectureOrder": 137,
      "videoOrder": 113,
      "sourceHash": "00040e3f006480db6e6abfe2542ca12dbca47c23d2d2f76d1f9065759e53aa30",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.21,
          "end": 5.97,
          "en": "We also have a couple of other core elements which you use a lot",
          "zh": "我們還有幾個其他很常用的核心元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.01,
          "end": 12.1,
          "en": "and for this, I'm back on the discover page where we already got a couple of them. In our ion-list",
          "zh": "為此我回到 discover 頁面，這裡我們已經用了幾個。在我們的 ion-list"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 12.11,
          "end": 17.72,
          "en": "specifically, we have an ion-item and I mentioned that this is the structure you should have. In a",
          "zh": "裡，具體來說有一個 ion-item，我提過這就是你應該採用的結構。在"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 17.72,
          "end": 18.34,
          "en": "list,",
          "zh": "list 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 18.38,
          "end": 24.15,
          "en": "you should basically only have ion-items as direct children, inside of the ion-items,",
          "zh": "基本上只應該有 ion-item 作為直接子項；而在 ion-item 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 24.17,
          "end": 26.66,
          "en": "you can then have any content you want.",
          "zh": "你就可以放任何想要的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 26.66,
          "end": 32.12,
          "en": "Now here I also have that use case where the ion-list is inside of an ion-column which of course is",
          "zh": "這裡我也示範了那個用法：ion-list 放在 ion-column 裡，而這個 ion-column 當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 32.12,
          "end": 37.84,
          "en": "part of an ion-grid simply because that allows me to control the width of this list here.",
          "zh": "是 ion-grid 的一部分，單純因為這樣我就能控制這裡這個 list 的寬度。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 37.88,
          "end": 41.47,
          "en": "This is actually still quite wide on bigger screens as you can tell and",
          "zh": "你可以看出，在大螢幕上它其實還是相當寬，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 41.51,
          "end": 47.48,
          "en": "we could shrink this down more but it still does not take 100% of the page width which it would",
          "zh": "我們可以再把它縮小，但它仍然沒有佔滿 100% 的頁面寬度，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 47.48,
          "end": 49.39,
          "en": "do otherwise.",
          "zh": "否則它就會佔滿。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 49.4,
          "end": 54.62,
          "en": "Now inside of the ion-item, we then got an ion-thumbnail and I'll come back to images and different",
          "zh": "接著在 ion-item 裡有一個 ion-thumbnail。圖片以及 Ionic 中不同的"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 54.62,
          "end": 57.9,
          "en": "ways of loading images in Ionic later in this module,",
          "zh": "圖片載入方式，我會在這個模組稍後再談，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 57.92,
          "end": 64.07,
          "en": "for now I want to focus on the ion-label and ion-label is actually a component you'll also use quite",
          "zh": "現在我想先聚焦在 ion-label，而 ion-label 其實也是你在 Ionic 中會用蠻多的"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 64.07,
          "end": 73.64,
          "en": "a bit in Ionic. You use it typically inside of ion-items to wrap any text related content, not only just",
          "zh": "元件。你通常會在 ion-item 裡用它來包住任何與文字有關的內容，不只是純"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 73.64,
          "end": 74.33,
          "en": "text,",
          "zh": "文字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 74.33,
          "end": 80.15,
          "en": "so if I would type something like this here but also text wrapped into other elements and there it's",
          "zh": "所以如果我像這樣直接輸入文字，或者是被包在其他元素裡的文字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 80.15,
          "end": 87.53,
          "en": "just a good practice to use an ion-label and it will also optimize some stylings. The ion-label will",
          "zh": "使用 ion-label 就是很好的做法，它也會最佳化一些樣式。ion-label"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 87.65,
          "end": 94.78999999999999,
          "en": "also become very important later once we add an input and once we add form elements and I already want",
          "zh": "在之後我們加入 input、加入表單元素時也會變得非常重要。我現在就想"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 94.78999999999999,
          "end": 99.2,
          "en": "to show you what I mean on the auth page here, there",
          "zh": "在 auth 頁面示範我的意思，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 99.22999999999999,
          "end": 107.9,
          "en": "if I add an ion-item and that is also worth pointing out, whilst you typically use the ion-item inside of a list",
          "zh": "如果我在這裡加入一個 ion-item——這也值得一提：雖然你通常會在 list 裡使用 ion-item，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 107.9,
          "end": 115.07,
          "en": "and that is indeed also recommended or where you will mostly see it, you can actually also use an ion-item",
          "zh": "這確實也是建議的做法，也是你最常看到的地方，但你其實也可以在 list 之外"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 115.16,
          "end": 116.25999999999999,
          "en": "outside of a list.",
          "zh": "使用 ion-item。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 116.3,
          "end": 123.62,
          "en": "So inside of an ion-list, you should have ion-items as direct children and ion-item could be also placed outside",
          "zh": "所以在 ion-list 裡，你應該讓 ion-item 作為直接子項；不過 ion-item 也可以放在 list"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 123.62,
          "end": 124.36,
          "en": "of a list though,",
          "zh": "之外，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 124.37,
          "end": 131.09,
          "en": "so this way around it works. Now in inside of the ion-item, a pattern you'll see a lot later is that you",
          "zh": "所以這個方向是可行的。而在 ion-item 裡，你之後會很常看到的一種模式，就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 131.09,
          "end": 137.78,
          "en": "add an ion-label where you can add a position attribute which you can set to floating.",
          "zh": "加入一個 ion-label，並在上面加一個 position 屬性，把它設為 floating。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 137.78,
          "end": 145.37,
          "en": "There also are other values and I'll dive into those once we go into the input section, the form input section,",
          "zh": "還有其他值，等我們進入 input 章節、也就是表單輸入章節時我會再深入說明，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 145.55,
          "end": 151.61,
          "en": "you can of course also dive into the Ionic docs to learn all configurations for the position attribute.",
          "zh": "你當然也可以深入 Ionic 文件，瞭解 position 屬性的所有設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 151.73,
          "end": 158.3,
          "en": "Now what I actually want to show is that if you now add an ion-input or one of the other form control",
          "zh": "而我真正想展示的是，如果你現在加入 ion-input，或其他表單控制項類型的"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 158.36,
          "end": 166.94,
          "en": "Ionic components, you actually get a nice label, let's say for the email that will float up as soon as",
          "zh": "Ionic 元件，你就會得到一個漂亮的 label，比如說給 email 用的，它會在你"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 166.94,
          "end": 168.19,
          "en": "you click on the input.",
          "zh": "點進 input 時立刻浮起。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 168.86,
          "end": 174.88,
          "en": "So let's wait for the app to reload and let's logout to go to the auth screen and here's our email item,",
          "zh": "我們等 app 重新載入，然後登出以進入 auth 畫面，這裡就是我們的 email 項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 175.01,
          "end": 178.19,
          "en": "way too big of course, way too wide but still",
          "zh": "當然太大了、太寬了，不過還是"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 178.34,
          "end": 180.58,
          "en": "and it floats up when I click in there.",
          "zh": "當我點進去時它會浮起。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 180.62,
          "end": 185.46,
          "en": "Now this style is added also because of ion-item.",
          "zh": "這個樣式之所以出現，也是因為 ion-item。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 185.6,
          "end": 188,
          "en": "If I comment out ion-item here,",
          "zh": "如果我把這裡的 ion-item 註解掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 188,
          "end": 195.79,
          "en": "so I just have ion-label and ion-input and the rest is the same though, as this page reloads here,",
          "zh": "只留下 ion-label 和 ion-input，其他都一樣。當這個頁面重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 196.03,
          "end": 197.53,
          "en": "you see this looks different,",
          "zh": "你會看到它看起來不一樣了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 197.53,
          "end": 204.57999999999998,
          "en": "we can't really see that there is an input because it has no bottom line and the email is also not",
          "zh": "我們幾乎看不出這裡有 input，因為沒有底部那條線，而且 email 也不會"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 204.57999999999998,
          "end": 205.66,
          "en": "floating up.",
          "zh": "浮起。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 205.95,
          "end": 211.72,
          "en": "So the ion-item also plays an important role, in conjunction with the ion-label and the ion-input",
          "zh": "所以 ion-item 也扮演重要角色，它與 ion-label 和 ion-input 搭配，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 212.23,
          "end": 215.1,
          "en": "as a wrapper for ion-label and ion-input.",
          "zh": "作為 ion-label 與 ion-input 的包裝容器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 215.17000000000002,
          "end": 221.15,
          "en": "So ion-item used inside of an ion-list but can be used outside of it there too",
          "zh": "所以 ion-item 用在 ion-list 裡，但也可以用在 list 之外，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 221.17000000000002,
          "end": 227.23,
          "en": "and then you mostly see it being used with ion-label and ion-input, though by the way, that's also worth",
          "zh": "而在那裡你通常會看到它與 ion-label 和 ion-input 一起使用。順帶一提，這也"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 227.23,
          "end": 227.95,
          "en": "mentioning,",
          "zh": "值得一提，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 228.13,
          "end": 231.49,
          "en": "if we would have an ion-list around this, it would also work.",
          "zh": "如果我們在這外面加一層 ion-list，也一樣可行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 231.49,
          "end": 236.71,
          "en": "So just because you're holding an input in a label does not mean that the ion-item must not be in a",
          "zh": "所以，正因為你把 input 放在 label 裡，並不代表 ion-item 不能在"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 236.71,
          "end": 237.45,
          "en": "list,",
          "zh": "list 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 237.49,
          "end": 238.9,
          "en": "it absolutely can",
          "zh": "它完全可以，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 238.9,
          "end": 243.78,
          "en": "and if you're building a longer form, it would be recommended to wrap a list around this,",
          "zh": "而且如果你在建立較長的表單，會建議在外面包一層 list，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 243.88,
          "end": 246.14,
          "en": "so you don't really see a difference here though.",
          "zh": "不過在這裡你其實看不出差別就是了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 246.34,
          "end": 252.69,
          "en": "But the label is special in the sense of that with that position and inside of an ion-item and an ion-input,",
          "zh": "但 label 特別的地方在於，有了那個 position，並且身處 ion-item 與 ion-input 之中時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 252.7,
          "end": 259.63,
          "en": "it all of a sudden behaves very specialized and has this extra feature combined with the input",
          "zh": "它突然表現得非常專門，與 input 結合後有這個額外功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 259.87,
          "end": 267.79,
          "en": "but you can also use it without an input here to just wrap different text and the ion-item on the other",
          "zh": "但你也可以在這裡不加 input，只用它包住各種文字。而 ion-item 另一"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 267.79,
          "end": 275.59000000000003,
          "en": "hand can be a nice container inside of an ion-list for any content you want but in conjunction with",
          "zh": "方面，可以是 ion-list 裡裝載任何內容的好容器，但搭配"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 275.67,
          "end": 283.15,
          "en": "form inputs and ion-label, it also has this special behavior of giving you this nice input look with the",
          "zh": "表單 input 與 ion-label 時，它也有這種特殊行為，給你這種漂亮的 input 外觀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 283.15,
          "end": 287.34000000000003,
          "en": "underline here and of that floating label if you wanted.",
          "zh": "有這裡的底線，如果你想要的話還有浮動 label。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 287.59000000000003,
          "end": 295.5,
          "en": "So ion-item and ion-label are very special and very versatile in these scenarios I showed you here",
          "zh": "所以 ion-item 和 ion-label 在我示範的這些情境中非常特別、也非常靈活，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 295.51,
          "end": 296.71,
          "en": "though,",
          "zh": "不過，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 296.86,
          "end": 302.98,
          "en": "these are really the main use cases for ion-item and how you configure it and how you use it in conjunction",
          "zh": "這些真的就是 ion-item 的主要用法，以及如何設定它、如何搭配"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 302.98,
          "end": 309.58,
          "en": "with ion-label and ion-input or in conjunction with ion-list and for the ion-label, it's basically",
          "zh": "ion-label 與 ion-input，或搭配 ion-list 來使用。而對 ion-label 來說，基本上"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 309.58,
          "end": 310.36,
          "en": "the same.",
          "zh": "也是一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 310.36,
          "end": 317.35,
          "en": "It has this special behavior when combined with ion-input or similar form controls and ion-item,",
          "zh": "當它與 ion-input 或類似表單控制項以及 ion-item 結合時，就有這種特殊行為，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 317.41,
          "end": 322.54,
          "en": "if you don't have that conjunction, so if you have no related input and you're not setting the position",
          "zh": "如果沒有這種結合，也就是沒有相關的 input、也沒有設定 position"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 322.54,
          "end": 328.87,
          "en": "prop, then it just act as a wrapper around text or text elements. And I'm just really emphasizing this",
          "zh": "屬性，那它就只是包住文字或文字元素的容器。我特別強調這點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 329.08,
          "end": 336.43,
          "en": "because to me, it initially has been confusing when I use an ion-item, when I use a label and why these",
          "zh": "因為我一開始也搞不清楚什麼時候用 ion-item、什麼時候用 label，以及這些"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 336.43,
          "end": 343.33,
          "en": "components exist but they're basically all about getting good styling and nice effects in different",
          "zh": "元件為什麼存在，但它們基本上都是為了取得好樣式與漂亮效果，在不同的"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 343.33,
          "end": 344.8,
          "en": "contexts.",
          "zh": "情境中皆是如此。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 344.8,
          "end": 351.43,
          "en": "So to summarize, an ion-item is typically used instead of an ion-list but it can be combined with ion-label",
          "zh": "總結來說，ion-item 通常用在 ion-list 裡，而不是反過來；但它可以搭配 ion-label"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 351.49,
          "end": 357.87,
          "en": "and ion-input or other similar form controls outside of ion-list or inside of ion-list,",
          "zh": "和 ion-input，或其他類似的表單控制項，無論在 ion-list 之外或是在 ion-list 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 357.88,
          "end": 359.43,
          "en": "that really does not matter,",
          "zh": "那其實不重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 359.44,
          "end": 364.27,
          "en": "the important thing here is the combination with label and input to get that nice floating effect or",
          "zh": "這裡重要的是與 label 和 input 的組合，才能得到那種漂亮的浮動效果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 364.45,
          "end": 370.48,
          "en": "there also are other effects but to basically have these two components, label and input work together",
          "zh": "當然也有其他效果，但基本上就是要讓這兩個元件，label 和 input，好好搭配運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 370.48,
          "end": 371.65,
          "en": "fine",
          "zh": "運作良好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 371.65,
          "end": 376.69,
          "en": "and other than that, it's a wrapper component that provides certain styling based on the wrapped content",
          "zh": "除此之外，它是個包裝元件，可以說會根據所包裝的內容提供特定樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 376.69,
          "end": 382.07,
          "en": "you could say and it also just works nicely together with the ion-list.",
          "zh": "而且它和 ion-list 搭配起來也很合適。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 382.15,
          "end": 388.39,
          "en": "It also does have these slots which are especially useful when it is placed inside of a list for having",
          "zh": "它也有這些 slot，當它放在 list 裡時特別有用，可以在 ion-item 的開頭、"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 388.39,
          "end": 392.86,
          "en": "items at the start or the end or the middle of the ion-item.",
          "zh": "結尾或中間放置項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 392.86,
          "end": 398.82,
          "en": "Now for the label, it contains texts or multiple text containing elements like h1's, paragraphs and",
          "zh": "至於 label，它包含文字，或多個包含文字的元素，例如 h1、段落"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 398.82,
          "end": 399.82,
          "en": "so on,",
          "zh": "等等，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 399.82,
          "end": 405.1,
          "en": "it's typically used inside of an ion-item, no matter if you're using it to combine it with an input",
          "zh": "它通常用在 ion-item 裡，不論你是把它與 input 結合，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 405.19,
          "end": 411.13,
          "en": "or just to output text because if you're using other text, if you have a normal paragraph somewhere on",
          "zh": "或只是用來輸出文字。因為如果你用的是其他文字，如果你在頁面上某處、"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 411.13,
          "end": 418.6,
          "en": "your page or let's say inside of an ion-column, of an ion-grid, then you don't need to use an ion-label",
          "zh": "或比如說在 ion-grid 的 ion-column 裡有個普通段落，那你就不需要使用 ion-label"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 418.69,
          "end": 424.66,
          "en": "just to output text, so ion-label really has that kind of loose connection to ion-item.",
          "zh": "只為了輸出文字。所以 ion-label 與 ion-item 的關聯其實相當鬆散。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 424.66,
          "end": 430.03,
          "en": "But in general, you could use it anywhere where you need to wrap text, ion-label will never do any",
          "zh": "但一般來說，你可以在任何需要包住文字的地方用它，ion-label 絕不會造成"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 430.03,
          "end": 430.92,
          "en": "harm there,",
          "zh": "任何問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 430.99,
          "end": 438.22,
          "en": "you just might not see any effect because its special effects are related to ion-item. Other than that,",
          "zh": "只是你可能看不到任何效果，因為它的特殊效果都與 ion-item 有關。除此之外，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 438.25,
          "end": 440.66,
          "en": "it just gives you some basic styling,",
          "zh": "它就只是給你一些基本樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 440.68,
          "end": 445.42,
          "en": "there also is a dedicated ion-text component which gives you more control,",
          "zh": "另外還有一個專門的 ion-text 元件，能給你更多控制，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 445.45,
          "end": 446.84,
          "en": "so let's have a look at that now.",
          "zh": "我們現在就來看看。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727918",
      "title": "ion-text",
      "lectureOrder": 138,
      "videoOrder": 114,
      "sourceHash": "9a8b3a8a1da824cb7b64ba0bf254fe14aa7ae954c9bd54c3a0646b97759d97fe",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.32,
          "end": 7.18,
          "en": "If you have a place on your application where you want to style some text, let's say on the discover",
          "zh": "如果你的應用程式中有某個地方想為文字加上樣式，比如說在 discover"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.18,
          "end": 16.28,
          "en": "page here in our paragraph, in the ion-card content which would essentially be that text here below",
          "zh": "頁面這裡的段落，在 ion-card 的 content 裡，基本上就是圖片下方這段文字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 16.28,
          "end": 21.8,
          "en": "the image and there, let's say we want to give that text a different color, then you actually will have",
          "zh": "假設我們想給那段文字不同的顏色，那你其實有"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 21.8,
          "end": 28.19,
          "en": "multiple ways, for example of course you can simply select that paragraph tag with CSS and assign your",
          "zh": "多種做法。例如你當然可以單純用 CSS 選取那個段落標籤，指定你自己的"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 28.19,
          "end": 33.17,
          "en": "own color, use an inline style and so on but you can also wrap this.",
          "zh": "顏色、使用 inline style 等等，但你也可以把它包起來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 33.17,
          "end": 42.43,
          "en": "Now you could use an ion-label here to wrap this and there, you actually can set a color property and",
          "zh": "你可以在這裡用 ion-label 包住它，而在那裡你其實可以設定 color 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 42.43,
          "end": 48.97,
          "en": "you could set this to a primary or let's say to danger here, so that we can clearly see it.",
          "zh": "你可以把它設為 primary，或這裡就設為 danger，讓我們能清楚看見。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 49.23,
          "end": 52.03,
          "en": "And if you do that as this page reloads,",
          "zh": "如果你這樣做，當這個頁面重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 52.39,
          "end": 53.47,
          "en": "you actually see it's red.",
          "zh": "你會看到它變成紅色。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 53.74,
          "end": 53.95,
          "en": "OK,",
          "zh": "好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 53.98,
          "end": 57.49,
          "en": "so you can do that. If we inspect this now,",
          "zh": "所以這是可行的。如果我們現在檢查它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 57.82,
          "end": 64.21,
          "en": "we see that here is our paragraph and the label is in the paragraph there",
          "zh": "會看到這裡是我們的段落，而 label 就在那個段落裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 64.33,
          "end": 71.17,
          "en": "and this does not do much, it actually assigns quite a lot of attributes and classes here",
          "zh": "這其實沒有做太多事，它確實加了不少屬性和 class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 71.17,
          "end": 78.1,
          "en": "but if we have a look at the actual styles that are having effect or that are assigned, then we see we're",
          "zh": "但如果我們看看實際生效或是指定的樣式，就會發現我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 78.1,
          "end": 89,
          "en": "using that danger color here for this label. And all the other label effects are not really kicking",
          "zh": "在這裡為這個 label 用了 danger 顏色。而其他 label 的效果其實都沒有"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 89,
          "end": 91.32,
          "en": "in because it's not in an ion-item,",
          "zh": "生效，因為它不在 ion-item 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 91.37,
          "end": 94.6,
          "en": "it's not connected to an input or anything like that.",
          "zh": "也沒有與 input 或類似東西相連。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 94.61,
          "end": 99.56,
          "en": "Now in cases like this, of course you can use the label, as you see it works, it looks OK,",
          "zh": "在這種情況下，你當然可以使用 label，如你所見它可行、看起來也還行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 99.62,
          "end": 105.3,
          "en": "it will also not be a performance issue but if you just want to style some text, you can also use",
          "zh": "也不會造成效能問題。但如果你只是想為文字加樣式，你也可以用"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 105.38,
          "end": 106.57,
          "en": "ion-text here.",
          "zh": "這裡的 ion-text。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 106.64,
          "end": 112.13,
          "en": "If you wrap ion-text, this also has a color property and you will see as this reloads,",
          "zh": "如果你改用 ion-text 包住，它也有 color 屬性，而重新載入後你會看到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 112.19,
          "end": 113.87,
          "en": "you have the same effect.",
          "zh": "效果完全相同。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 113.99000000000001,
          "end": 121.19,
          "en": "Now ultimately, you are of course free to use what you want therefore but it is a good idea, a good practice",
          "zh": "最終你當然可以自由選擇要用哪個，不過這是個好主意、也是好做法："
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 121.52,
          "end": 127.97,
          "en": "to use ion-text whenever you are simply having the goal of styling some text. If you just want to",
          "zh": "只要你的目標單純是為文字加樣式，就用 ion-text。如果你只是想要"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 127.97,
          "end": 134.51,
          "en": "change the color of a text, use ion-text, if you want to have multiple text nodes, multiple text elements,",
          "zh": "改變文字顏色，就用 ion-text；如果你想要有多個文字節點、多個文字元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 134.54,
          "end": 140.39,
          "en": "multiple h1 and paragraphs in an ion-item, use ion-label instead.",
          "zh": "多個 h1 和段落放在 ion-item 裡，那就改用 ion-label。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 140.63,
          "end": 145.3,
          "en": "You can't really mess this up if you're using an ion-label here, it's not a problem at all,",
          "zh": "在這裡用 ion-label 其實也不會出錯，完全不是問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 145.37,
          "end": 151.19,
          "en": "just keep in mind if you're only trying to color the text or anything like that, use ion-text, if you're",
          "zh": "只要記住：如果你只是想為文字上色或類似需求，就用 ion-text；如果你"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 151.19,
          "end": 157.25,
          "en": "in an ion-item or you're working with a form control, then use ion-label instead.",
          "zh": "是在 ion-item 裡，或是在處理表單控制項，那就改用 ion-label。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727924",
      "title": "Swipeable List Items",
      "lectureOrder": 139,
      "videoOrder": 115,
      "sourceHash": "bb0afaab40bc4099025b858258541aaf7fb72b67f472b15fb2ef25c27eafad89",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.28,
          "end": 11.22,
          "en": "So now that we explored ion-label and ion-item, let's dive a bit deeper into ion-item and let's actually",
          "zh": "現在我們已經探索過 ion-label 與 ion-item，接下來讓我們更深入一點認識 ion-item，並且實際"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 11.49,
          "end": 17.84,
          "en": "go into our bookings page where we don't have any bookings yet, we'll change that",
          "zh": "進入我們的 bookings 頁面。那裡目前還沒有任何預訂，我們會改變這一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 18.03,
          "end": 24.39,
          "en": "and our offers page where we do have offers which right now are simply all the places we also have on",
          "zh": "以及我們的 offers 頁面，那裡確實已經有 offers，但目前它們就只是我們在這個頁面上"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 24.39,
          "end": 25.5,
          "en": "this page",
          "zh": "也有的那些 places。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 25.5,
          "end": 28.57,
          "en": "and I want to make sure that we can actually slide these items,",
          "zh": "而我想確保我們真的可以滑動這些項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 28.68,
          "end": 35.43,
          "en": "so not just tap them as we currently can do it but slide them from right to left for example, so that",
          "zh": "不只是像目前這樣點按它們，而是例如從右往左滑動，這樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 35.43,
          "end": 46.59,
          "en": "we can edit one of these offers or in the case of the bookings, actually cancel a booking. Now for that,",
          "zh": "我們就能編輯其中一筆 offer，或者在 bookings 的情況下真的取消一筆預訂。為此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 46.59,
          "end": 52.83,
          "en": "let's start with the offers since we already have these in place and therefore the place to go obviously",
          "zh": "讓我們從 offers 開始，因為我們已經有這些項目了，因此要前往的地方顯然"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 52.89,
          "end": 61.53,
          "en": "is our offers page and there, I am going through all the places as I mentioned at the moment, we'll later",
          "zh": "就是我們的 offers 頁面。在那裡，如我剛才提到的，我目前是遍歷所有 places，我們之後"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 61.53,
          "end": 65.52,
          "en": "change that to differentiate a bit between offers and places",
          "zh": "會改變這一點，稍微區分 offers 與 places，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 65.61,
          "end": 68.53,
          "en": "but for now, it's simply just the places being output there",
          "zh": "但現在，那裡單純只是把 places 輸出出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 68.55,
          "end": 75.93,
          "en": "but on the offers page, I want to make sure we can swipe these items to delete them. To achieve this, Ionic",
          "zh": "不過在 offers 頁面上，我想確保我們可以滑動這些項目來刪除它們。為了做到這點，Ionic"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 75.93,
          "end": 84.09,
          "en": "gives us certain components we can use inside of a list and especially in combination with an ion-item",
          "zh": "提供我們一些可以在清單裡使用的元件，尤其是與 ion-item 搭配使用時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 84.09,
          "end": 89.99,
          "en": "and as you know, the official component docs are always a great place and there under item, indeed",
          "zh": "如你所知，官方元件文件永遠是個好去處，而在 item 底下，確實"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 90,
          "end": 97.32,
          "en": "you don't only find ion-item, you also find ion-item-group, divider and ion-item-sliding, options,",
          "zh": "你不只會找到 ion-item，還會找到 ion-item-group、divider，以及 ion-item-sliding、options、"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 97.35,
          "end": 105.81,
          "en": "option. These three here, sliding, options and option are related to making these items swipeable so that",
          "zh": "option。這裡這三個：sliding、options 與 option，都和讓這些項目可以滑動有關，這樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 105.81,
          "end": 113.7,
          "en": "we can expose extra options to use or we can choose from, like editing or deleting. Divider and group",
          "zh": "我們就能顯示額外的選項供使用或選擇，例如編輯或刪除。Divider 與 group"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 113.97,
          "end": 121.14,
          "en": "just as you also have ion-list-header here are components you can use to split your list into multiple",
          "zh": "就像這裡也有的 ion-list-header 一樣，都是你可以用來把清單拆成多個"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 121.14,
          "end": 126.63,
          "en": "sections. I'll not use this feature here but explore that feature in the official docs if you need that,",
          "zh": "區塊的元件。我在這裡不會使用這個功能，但如果你有需要，可以在官方文件中探索它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 126.84,
          "end": 133.32,
          "en": "for example if you are having a list of persons and you want to group them by starting character of",
          "zh": "例如你有一個人物清單，想依姓氏的起始字母"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 133.32,
          "end": 141.27,
          "en": "their surname, well then you can use ion-item-group, back to the sliding thing which I want to use. For",
          "zh": "來分組，那你就可以使用 ion-item-group。回到我想用的滑動功能。為此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 141.27,
          "end": 149.64,
          "en": "that, you can wrap your ion-item here with ion-item-sliding and therefore you see inside of ion-list,",
          "zh": "你可以用 ion-item-sliding 把 ion-item 包起來，所以你會看到在 ion-list 裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 149.7,
          "end": 155.73,
          "en": "I'm now actually not using an ion-item but ion-item-sliding but technically, that is related to the",
          "zh": "我現在其實不是用 ion-item，而是用 ion-item-sliding，但技術上這與"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 155.73,
          "end": 163.86,
          "en": "ion-item because this ion-item-sliding component now wraps your ion-item component, so you just copy",
          "zh": "ion-item 有關，因為這個 ion-item-sliding 元件現在包住你的 ion-item 元件，所以你只要把"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 163.86,
          "end": 170.91,
          "en": "that into ion-item-sliding. This extra wrapper makes this item slideable but you also need to configure",
          "zh": "它複製到 ion-item-sliding 裡。這個額外的外層包裝讓項目可以滑動，但你也需要設定"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 170.91,
          "end": 180.12,
          "en": "which options should be exposed when these slides open and for this, you add next to the ion-item, not inside",
          "zh": "當滑動打開時要顯示哪些選項。為此，你要在 ion-item 旁邊加入，不是加在它裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 180.12,
          "end": 189.51,
          "en": "of it but inside of the ion-item-sliding, you add ion-item-options, like this. In there, you then add",
          "zh": "而是加在 ion-item-sliding 裡面，加入 ion-item-options，就像這樣。接著在裡面加入"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 189.51,
          "end": 197.9,
          "en": "ion-item-option elements, so inside ion-item-options, you have ion-item-option and these are just the",
          "zh": "ion-item-option 元素。所以在 ion-item-options 裡面會有 ion-item-option，而這些就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 197.9,
          "end": 203.97,
          "en": "components you also find here in the official docs and there, you now configure the different options",
          "zh": "你在官方文件這裡也會找到的元件。在那裡，你就能設定想要顯示的"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 203.97,
          "end": 210.75,
          "en": "you want to show. Now on such an option, you can for example set a color which will be the background",
          "zh": "各種選項。在這樣的選項上，你可以例如設定 color，這會成為"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 210.75,
          "end": 218.16,
          "en": "color of that button which gets exposed, for example secondary. You can then also register a click listener",
          "zh": "顯示出來的那個按鈕的背景色，例如 secondary。你也可以註冊一個 click 事件監聽器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 218.22,
          "end": 224.55,
          "en": "to define what should happen when this button gets pressed, for example here since I want to allow editing",
          "zh": "來定義按下這個按鈕時應該發生什麼事。例如這裡，因為我想允許編輯"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 224.55,
          "end": 232.63,
          "en": "and offer, I'll trigger onEdit and I will forward my ID of that offer we're currently looking at,",
          "zh": "一筆 offer，我會觸發 onEdit，並把我目前正在看的這筆 offer 的 ID 傳出去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 232.74,
          "end": 241.89,
          "en": "so here I'll forward offer.id. Inside of ion-item-option, you then can specify some text, for example",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我會傳出 offer.id。在 ion-item-option 裡面，你可以指定一些文字，例如"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 242.01,
          "end": 253.6,
          "en": "edit. Now let me also add the onEdit method here, onEdit and here I get my offerId which will",
          "zh": "edit。現在讓我也在這裡加入 onEdit 方法，onEdit，而這裡我會取得 offerId，它會"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 253.6,
          "end": 261.41,
          "en": "be a string and for now, I'll just console log editing item and I also want to output that offerId",
          "zh": "是個 string，現在我只要 console log「editing item」，我也想要輸出那個 offerId，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 261.41,
          "end": 262.86,
          "en": "I'm logging here.",
          "zh": "把它一起記錄在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 263.08,
          "end": 264.91,
          "en": "So with all that, we can save that and",
          "zh": "有了這一切，我們可以儲存，然後"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 264.91,
          "end": 275.17,
          "en": "let's go back to our application and now under discover places offers here, we can swipe that and you",
          "zh": "回到我們的應用程式。現在在 discover places 的 offers 這裡，我們可以滑動它，而你"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 275.17,
          "end": 280.27,
          "en": "see, this is the secondary color we configured in this application.",
          "zh": "看，這就是我們在這個應用程式裡設定的 secondary 顏色。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 280.33,
          "end": 285.79,
          "en": "Now what you'll also see is that only the first item is swipeable though, no other item,",
          "zh": "不過你也會看到，只有第一個項目可以滑動，其他項目都不行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 285.79,
          "end": 293.12,
          "en": "so what's wrong here? Well the problem is that ngFor is placed on the ion-item which is wrapped",
          "zh": "所以這裡出了什麼問題？問題在於 ngFor 放在 ion-item 上，而它被"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 293.12,
          "end": 298.84000000000003,
          "en": "by the ion-item-sliding, so in the end we repeat ion-item in this one sliding wrapper.",
          "zh": "ion-item-sliding 包住，所以最後我們是在這個滑動包裝裡重複 ion-item。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 298.94,
          "end": 304.82,
          "en": "We should instead repeat that ion-item-sliding element which wraps a single ion-item,",
          "zh": "我們應該改成重複 ion-item-sliding 這個元素，讓它包住單一個 ion-item，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 304.82,
          "end": 312.65,
          "en": "so that we create multiple slideable items for all the offers we have. With this change, you'll now see",
          "zh": "這樣就能為我們所有的 offers 建立多個可滑動的項目。做了這個修改後，你現在會看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 312.65,
          "end": 321.64,
          "en": "that once this reloads, we can swipe all these items and then we also see that added text there. So that",
          "zh": "一旦重新載入，我們就能滑動所有這些項目，然後也會看到那裡新增的文字。這"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 321.64,
          "end": 327.58,
          "en": "is nice and if I now click edit, you see now I don't go to that place but instead now in the console",
          "zh": "很好，而如果我現在點 edit，你看，我現在不會前往那個 place，而是在開發者工具的"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 327.58,
          "end": 333.4,
          "en": "of the developer tools, you'll see editing item and then the ID of that item you edited,",
          "zh": "console 裡看到「editing item」，接著是你編輯的那個項目的 ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 333.4,
          "end": 338.38,
          "en": "so here we go. You can also show an icon",
          "zh": "就是這樣。你也可以顯示一個圖示，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 338.4,
          "end": 341.23,
          "en": "and for this you can add ion-icon",
          "zh": "為此你可以加入 ion-icon，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 341.28,
          "end": 348.72,
          "en": "here, then choose a name like for example create gives us a nice pen icon and you can define a",
          "zh": "在這裡，然後選擇一個 name，例如 create 會給我們一個漂亮的筆形圖示，而你可以定義"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 348.72,
          "end": 355.48,
          "en": "slot here, for example top should actually render this icon here on top of the text.",
          "zh": "這裡的 slot，例如 top 應該會把這個圖示呈現在文字的上面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 355.8,
          "end": 360.48,
          "en": "Now I will set it at the point of time where I record this, this is a bit broken and therefore it actually",
          "zh": "在我錄製的這個時間點，這有點壞掉，因此它實際上"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 360.48,
          "end": 363.78,
          "en": "shows next to this instead of on top of this",
          "zh": "會顯示在旁邊，而不是在上面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 363.96,
          "end": 366.39,
          "en": "but eventually, this should get fixed",
          "zh": "但最終這應該會被修正，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 366.39,
          "end": 371.7,
          "en": "and here in this application it's not a huge issue because I don't want to show a text anyways and I",
          "zh": "而且在這個應用程式裡這不是什麼大問題，因為我本來就不想顯示文字，我"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 371.7,
          "end": 373.7,
          "en": "can then simply change the slot here to",
          "zh": "只要把這裡的 slot 改成"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 373.71,
          "end": 382.94,
          "en": "icon only and now in that ion-item here, we should only have this pen icon now,",
          "zh": "icon-only，那麼現在這個 ion-item 裡應該只會有這個筆形圖示，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 382.97,
          "end": 383.69,
          "en": "here it is.",
          "zh": "就是這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 384.47,
          "end": 391.31,
          "en": "So now we can choose that and we can of course not just console log something here but we can now forward",
          "zh": "現在我們可以選擇它了。我們當然不只可以在這裡 console log 一些東西，我們現在可以把"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 391.34,
          "end": 397.18,
          "en": "the user to our edit offer page and for that, we could add a router link on this page",
          "zh": "使用者導向我們的 edit offer 頁面。為此，我們可以在這個頁面上加入 router link，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 397.19,
          "end": 405.44,
          "en": "but there is a little behavior which at least at the moment requires us to use a click listener where",
          "zh": "但有個小行為，至少目前要求我們使用 click 事件監聽器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 405.44,
          "end": 409.28,
          "en": "we can execute more than just the navigation option.",
          "zh": "讓我們能執行不只是導覽的動作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 409.28,
          "end": 410.15,
          "en": "Now why is that?",
          "zh": "為什麼會這樣呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 410.72,
          "end": 418.04,
          "en": "Well let's remove that click listener temporarily and let's instead use a router link bound to a dynamic",
          "zh": "讓我們暫時移除那個 click 事件監聽器，改用綁定動態值的 router link，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 418.04,
          "end": 432.54,
          "en": "value here where we go to slash and then it's places tabs offers and then we need edit",
          "zh": "我們會前往斜線，接著是 places、tabs、offers，然後需要 edit"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 432.63,
          "end": 433.65,
          "en": "and then the ID",
          "zh": "以及 ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 433.71,
          "end": 435.09,
          "en": "and why do we need this?",
          "zh": "為什麼我們需要這樣做？"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 435.09,
          "end": 438.68,
          "en": "Because if we have a look at place routing, we see we got tabs,",
          "zh": "因為如果我們看一下 place 的路由，會看到有 tabs，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 438.81,
          "end": 443.96,
          "en": "then the offers area and then edit slash the ID and that is the place where I want to go.",
          "zh": "然後是 offers 區塊，接著是 edit 斜線 ID，那就是我想前往的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 443.97,
          "end": 448.1,
          "en": "So the ID here will be offer.id.",
          "zh": "所以這裡的 ID 會是 offer.id。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 448.47,
          "end": 455.22,
          "en": "Now with that, we have a valid router link and we should actually be able to go to that offer edit page.",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們就有有效的 router link，而且應該真的能前往那個 offer 編輯頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 455.28,
          "end": 458.15,
          "en": "So if I just swipe this, now",
          "zh": "所以如果我滑動這個，現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 458.15999999999997,
          "end": 461.90999999999997,
          "en": "first of all you see that here is a bit buggy,",
          "zh": "首先你會看到這裡有點小問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 462.03,
          "end": 465.77,
          "en": "it now renders an anchor tag and that destroys",
          "zh": "它現在會渲染出 anchor 標籤，而那會破壞"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 465.9,
          "end": 472.35,
          "en": "the look here, the CSS code. Now this will probably get fixed but if you go there and you go back, you also",
          "zh": "這裡的外觀，也就是 CSS 程式碼。這大概會被修正，但如果你前往那裡再返回，你也會"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 472.35,
          "end": 473.61,
          "en": "see this is still open,",
          "zh": "看到它仍然是打開的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 473.61,
          "end": 477.40999999999997,
          "en": "it doesn't close automatically. If all of that works just fine for you,",
          "zh": "它不會自動關閉。如果這些對你都運作良好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 477.48,
          "end": 481.62,
          "en": "you can of course use that. If it doesn't as it does for me,",
          "zh": "你當然可以使用它。如果像我這裡一樣行不通，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 481.62,
          "end": 488.43,
          "en": "the solution is to stay at this click listener and all we now need to do is we need to pass a reference",
          "zh": "解法就是保留這個 click 事件監聽器，而我們現在只需要傳入一個參考，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 488.43,
          "end": 490.75,
          "en": "to our ion-item-sliding",
          "zh": "指向我們的 ion-item-sliding，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 491.01,
          "end": 495.15,
          "en": "and for this, you can add a local reference with a hashtag here,",
          "zh": "為此，你可以在這裡用 hashtag 加入一個區域參考，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 495.15,
          "end": 496.97,
          "en": "this is an Angular feature,",
          "zh": "這是 Angular 的功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 497.13,
          "end": 502.71,
          "en": "give this any name you want, for example sliding item but the name is totally up to you and then you pass",
          "zh": "給它任何你想要的名稱，例如 sliding item，名稱完全由你決定，然後你把"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 502.77,
          "end": 510.71,
          "en": "sliding item here as a second argument to onEdit, just like this without the hashtag. And in your offers",
          "zh": "sliding item 作為第二個引數傳給 onEdit，就像這樣，不帶 hashtag。而在你的 offers"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 510.75,
          "end": 518.17,
          "en": "page where you have the onEdit method, you then get this sliding item here as a second argument,",
          "zh": "頁面中，也就是你有 onEdit 方法的地方，你會以第二個引數取得這個 sliding item，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 518.22,
          "end": 526.95,
          "en": "it is of type ion-item-sliding and this ion-item-sliding type needs to be imported from",
          "zh": "它的型別是 ion-item-sliding，而這個 ion-item-sliding 型別需要從"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 526.98,
          "end": 527.64,
          "en": "@ionic/angular,",
          "zh": "@ionic/angular 匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 527.64,
          "end": 535.93,
          "en": "so this import here needs to be added in the offers.page.ts file and you can then execute on",
          "zh": "所以這個 import 需要加在 offers.page.ts 檔案裡，然後你就可以在"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 535.93,
          "end": 539.58,
          "en": "sliding item, so on this second argument you're getting, the close method",
          "zh": "sliding item 上，也就是你取得的第二個引數上，執行 close 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 539.59,
          "end": 545.62,
          "en": "and this will close it right before you then navigate and navigation can now be done programmatically.",
          "zh": "這會在你要導覽之前先把它關閉，而現在導覽可以用程式化的方式完成。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 545.7,
          "end": 550.51,
          "en": "Therefore a button will get rendered and not an anchor tag and therefore, the styling will be fixed",
          "zh": "因此會渲染出 button 而不是 anchor 標籤，所以樣式會被修正，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 550.66,
          "end": 556.39,
          "en": "and thanks to sliding item close, it will also close so that when we navigate back, it is closed.",
          "zh": "而且多虧了 sliding item close，它也會關閉，這樣當我們導覽回來時，它就是關閉的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 556.45,
          "end": 562.51,
          "en": "So let's now inject the Angular router here with the addition to the constructor and then the addition",
          "zh": "現在讓我們在這裡注入 Angular router，在 constructor 裡加入，然後"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 562.51,
          "end": 565.54,
          "en": "of the import here at the top of the file",
          "zh": "在檔案最上方加入 import。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 565.54,
          "end": 573.01,
          "en": "and then here, we can simply say this router navigate and of course here, I want to go to /places,",
          "zh": "然後在這裡，我們只要寫 this.router.navigate，當然這裡我想前往 /places、"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 573.01,
          "end": 578.2,
          "en": "tabs, offers, edit",
          "zh": "tabs、offers、edit，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 578.32,
          "end": 581.38,
          "en": "and then here, my offerId.",
          "zh": "然後在這裡接上我的 offerId。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 582.45,
          "end": 588.18,
          "en": "And with all of that, if we save this again, now we'll have a list",
          "zh": "有了這一切，如果我們再次儲存，現在我們就會有一個清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 588.26,
          "end": 594.83,
          "en": "where this is swipeable, where it looks good and where when I tap this, I get forwarded and that",
          "zh": "它可以滑動、看起來不錯，而且當我點按它時會被導向，而且那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 594.83,
          "end": 601.4,
          "en": "sliding item closes so that when I go back, it is closed and it stays closed and that of course is behavior",
          "zh": "sliding item 會關閉，這樣當我返回時它是關閉的，並且保持關閉，這當然就是我"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 601.46,
          "end": 602.29,
          "en": "I want here.",
          "zh": "在這裡想要的行為。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 602.3,
          "end": 605.36,
          "en": "So this is how you can add slideable items, as always",
          "zh": "以上就是加入可滑動項目的方法。一如往常，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 605.36,
          "end": 608.22,
          "en": "don't hesitate to dive into the official docs,",
          "zh": "別猶豫，深入官方文件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 608.3,
          "end": 611.82,
          "en": "there you can learn more about these components as always",
          "zh": "在那裡你可以一如往常地進一步瞭解這些元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 611.89,
          "end": 616.18,
          "en": "and for example, you can learn how to change the direction from where you can swipe.",
          "zh": "例如，你可以學到如何改變可以滑動的方向。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 616.31,
          "end": 618.58,
          "en": "The default is from right to left,",
          "zh": "預設是從右到左，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 618.68,
          "end": 623.36,
          "en": "now you can always go to your, as can see here also,",
          "zh": "你隨時可以前往你的，這裡也可以看到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 623.36,
          "end": 630.44,
          "en": "you can always go to your ion-item-options surrounding block here and then change the side. And the side",
          "zh": "你隨時可以前往包住 ion-item-options 的區塊，然後改變 side。而 side"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 630.44,
          "end": 631.65,
          "en": "by default is end,",
          "zh": "預設是 end，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 631.67,
          "end": 638.66,
          "en": "if you set it to start, you can swipe from left to right, like this.",
          "zh": "如果你把它設成 start，就可以像這樣從左到右滑動。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 638.66,
          "end": 644.15,
          "en": "Now by the way, you can also have multiple ion-item-options per sliding item,",
          "zh": "順帶一提，每個 sliding item 也可以有多組 ion-item-options，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 644.15,
          "end": 650.57,
          "en": "so next to this set of ion-item-options, we could add another set of ion-item-options which would then",
          "zh": "所以在這組 ion-item-options 旁邊，我們可以再加入另一組 ion-item-options，那麼它"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 650.57,
          "end": 656.42,
          "en": "have to go onto the other side so that we can actually swipe in both directions and expose different",
          "zh": "就必須放在另一側，這樣我們就能往兩個方向滑動，並顯示不同的"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 656.45,
          "end": 657.26,
          "en": "options.",
          "zh": "選項。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 657.38,
          "end": 663.14,
          "en": "So that is all supported, setting this to side end is optional because it is the default and the official",
          "zh": "這些都支援。把它設成 side=\"end\" 是選用的，因為那本來就是預設，而官方"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 663.14,
          "end": 666.12,
          "en": "docs allow you to dive way deeper into all of that.",
