          "end": 451.5,
          "en": "to make this centered,",
          "zh": "為了讓它置中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 451.5,
          "end": 457.8,
          "en": "I'll offset this on medium-sized devices on bigger by three columns, so that we start after three",
          "zh": "我會在較大裝置上把中型尺寸的它位移三個 column，所以我們從第三個"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 457.8,
          "end": 458.42,
          "en": "columns,",
          "zh": "column 之後開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 458.46,
          "end": 463.61,
          "en": "then we take six columns and then since we have 12 columns overall, we have three columns left",
          "zh": "接著佔用六個 column，然後因為總共有 12 個 column，我們還剩三個 column，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 463.65,
          "end": 468.96,
          "en": "making this perfectly centered and therefore now when we save this, we should have a list which looks",
          "zh": "讓它完美置中。因此現在當我們儲存時，應該會有一個看起來"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 468.96,
          "end": 475.29,
          "en": "much nicer and is centered only on bigger screens. On smaller screens like this mobile device here, we",
          "zh": "好很多的清單，而且只在較大螢幕上置中。在像這裡這台行動裝置的較小螢幕上，我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 475.29,
          "end": 481.29,
          "en": "still see it in the middle and we just got some normal padding which is introduced by the grid and by",
          "zh": "仍然會看到它在中間，而且只會有一些由 grid 以及 content 上這個 padding"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 481.29,
          "end": 486.46,
          "en": "this padding attribute here on the content which you can remove of course.",
          "zh": "屬性帶入的一般 padding，你當然可以移除它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 486.56,
          "end": 490.64,
          "en": "Now one thing is missing at the moment though, I added ion-item-sliding",
          "zh": "不過目前還缺了一樣東西。我加入了 ion-item-sliding，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 490.94,
          "end": 492.79,
          "en": "but what is missing?",
          "zh": "但缺少什麼呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 492.83,
          "end": 500.34,
          "en": "Well the options, the actual buttons. For this, you can add ion-item-options here and in there, you",
          "zh": "就是選項，也就是實際的按鈕。為此，你可以在這裡加入 ion-item-options，在裡面你"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 500.34,
          "end": 503.03,
          "en": "have your ion-item-option elements",
          "zh": "會有你的 ion-item-option 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 503.34,
          "end": 509.61,
          "en": "and I only need one option here and I'll give that option a colour of danger because we'll delete the",
          "zh": "而我在這裡只需要一個選項。我會給那個選項 danger 的顏色，因為我們會用它來刪除"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 509.61,
          "end": 512.09,
          "en": "item with it and I'll say cancel.",
          "zh": "項目，而且我會寫 cancel。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 512.25,
          "end": 515.46,
          "en": "And of course you could also render a trash bin icon,",
          "zh": "當然你也可以渲染一個垃圾桶圖示，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 515.55,
          "end": 521.58,
          "en": "so you could also enter ion-icon with the name of trash, that should be a nice trash bin and give",
          "zh": "所以你也可以輸入 ion-icon，name 用 trash，那應該會是漂亮的垃圾桶，然後給"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 521.58,
          "end": 526.92,
          "en": "it a slot of icon-only. So whatever you like, text or icon or both combined.",
          "zh": "它 icon-only 的 slot。所以看你喜歡，文字、圖示，或兩者結合都可以。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 529.94,
          "end": 538.11,
          "en": "The missing piece is that we now add a click listener, onCancelBooking and there, I'll forward the booking",
          "zh": "還缺的一塊是我們現在要加入一個 click 事件監聽器 onCancelBooking，在那裡我會傳出 booking"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 538.11,
          "end": 538.67,
          "en": "ID",
          "zh": "ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 538.98,
          "end": 540.72,
          "en": "and what else?",
          "zh": "還有什麼呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 540.72,
          "end": 545.17,
          "en": "Well to close the item, a reference to the ion-item-sliding element.",
          "zh": "就是要關閉項目，需要一個指向 ion-item-sliding 元素的參考。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 545.22,
          "end": 551.61,
          "en": "So here I'll add my sliding booking, whatever you want to name it and pass this as a second argument",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我會加入我的 sliding booking，你想叫什麼都行，並把它作為第二個引數"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 551.64,
          "end": 557.99,
          "en": "to onCancelBooking and onCancelBooking is now simply a method you can add to your bookings.page.ts",
          "zh": "傳給 onCancelBooking，而 onCancelBooking 就是你加在 bookings.page.ts"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 558,
          "end": 564.98,
          "en": "file where the first argument will be the offerId of type string and",
          "zh": "檔案裡的方法，其中第一個引數會是 string 型別的 offerId，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 565.12,
          "end": 573.05,
          "en": "the second element will be a reference to the sliding element which is of type ion-item-sliding",
          "zh": "第二個元素會是滑動元素的參考，型別是 ion-item-sliding，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 573.07,
          "end": 578.07,
          "en": "and ion-item-sliding needs to be imported from @ionic/angular.",
          "zh": "而 ion-item-sliding 需要從 @ionic/angular 匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 580.8,
          "end": 592.71,
          "en": "That allows us to again call slidingEl.close and then here, we can cancel booking with ID offerId",
          "zh": "這樣我們就能再次呼叫 slidingEl.close，然後在這裡我們可以 cancel booking with ID 加上 offerId，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 592.71,
          "end": 595.05,
          "en": "and that's all I'll do for now,",
          "zh": "目前我就只做到這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 595.05,
          "end": 600.78,
          "en": "so not too useful because we're missing other basic features that would allow us to dynamically add bookings",
          "zh": "所以用處不大，因為我們還缺少其他基本功能，那些功能才能讓我們動態新增預訂，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 600.78,
          "end": 605.05,
          "en": "and so on. So with that, reloaded here is the trash bin",
          "zh": "等等。這樣一來，重新載入後這裡就是垃圾桶，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 605.05,
          "end": 609.82,
          "en": "and when I click it for now, it only closes, later we'll actually delete that item.",
          "zh": "而我現在點它時，它只會關閉，之後我們才會真的刪除那個項目。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727928",
      "title": "Understanding Virtual Scrolling",
      "lectureOrder": 141,
      "videoOrder": 117,
      "sourceHash": "bd5506d2d9b2b2f23c3ce887f6d5ba3783cc636a252d0f2a7489973191ef8832",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.31,
          "end": 9.92,
          "en": "To conclude this section in a section on lists and list items and the things you can do there,",
          "zh": "為了替這個關於清單、清單項目以及你能對它們做什麼的章節作結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 9.96,
          "end": 15.81,
          "en": "let's look at one other important topic related to lists and that is virtual scrolling for which",
          "zh": "讓我們再看看一個與清單相關的重要主題，那就是虛擬滾動，為此"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 15.81,
          "end": 18.87,
          "en": "we have a separate component in Ionic.",
          "zh": "Ionic 有提供一個獨立的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 19.17,
          "end": 21.51,
          "en": "Now what is virtual scrolling?",
          "zh": "那麼什麼是虛擬滾動？"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 21.54,
          "end": 27.51,
          "en": "Consider a list with a couple of list items, now if your viewing this on a device, no matter if it is",
          "zh": "設想一個有幾個清單項目的清單。如果你在裝置上觀看這個，不管是"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 27.6,
          "end": 31.5,
          "en": "a desktop, PC or a mobile phone or a tablet,",
          "zh": "桌機、PC、手機或平板，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 31.5,
          "end": 36.27,
          "en": "you will have a certain viewport which is basically the visible area of your app,",
          "zh": "你都會有一個特定的 viewport，基本上就是你 app 的可見區域，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 36.27,
          "end": 41.88,
          "en": "so this for example of course could be a landscape phone here or a desktop.",
          "zh": "所以這裡的例子當然可能是橫向的手機，或是桌機。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 41.88,
          "end": 46.32,
          "en": "And what we can see here is that we only see a few of these list items right,",
          "zh": "而我們在這裡能看到的是，我們只看到其中幾個清單項目，對吧，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 46.32,
          "end": 48.54,
          "en": "we don't see all list items here,",
          "zh": "我們在這裡看不到所有的清單項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 48.54,
          "end": 53.67,
          "en": "there are certain list items which simply are not visible at the moment because they're not inside of",
          "zh": "有些清單項目目前單純就是不可見，因為它們不在"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 53.67,
          "end": 60.97,
          "en": "our current viewport. Now by default when rendering items with ngFor, they're always there,",
          "zh": "我們目前的 viewport 裡。預設情況下，用 ngFor 渲染項目時，它們永遠都在，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 61,
          "end": 66.55,
          "en": "no matter if we see them or not they're on the page and when we scroll down, we can then see them but",
          "zh": "不管我們看不看得到，它們都在頁面上；當我們往下滾動時就能看到它們，但"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 66.55,
          "end": 69.73,
          "en": "they're there even if we're not scrolling there.",
          "zh": "即使我們沒有滾到那裡，它們也在那裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 69.82,
          "end": 77.37,
          "en": "So they are rendered, they are managed all the time. As you might imagine for longer lists,",
          "zh": "所以它們一直被渲染、一直被管理。你可以想見，對於較長清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 77.4,
          "end": 84.66,
          "en": "this can be quite performance intensive especially on mobile devices and there especially on",
          "zh": "這可能會相當耗效能，尤其是在行動裝置上，而且特別是"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 84.78,
          "end": 88.06,
          "en": "mobile devices, that might not be that powerful.",
          "zh": "行動裝置可能沒那麼強大。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 88.23,
          "end": 93.24000000000001,
          "en": "Obviously I'm talking about very long lists here, I'm not talking about 20 list items or anything like",
          "zh": "當然我這裡說的是非常長清單，不是 20 個清單項目之類的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 93.24000000000001,
          "end": 99.12,
          "en": "that but if you got a list with a couple of hundred items, then it really could hurt if you're rendering",
          "zh": "但如果你有一個幾百個項目的清單，那你渲染所有這些項目時"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 99.12,
          "end": 102.00999999999999,
          "en": "all these items, no matter if they're visible or not.",
          "zh": "真的可能會造成負擔，不管它們可不可見。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 102.09,
          "end": 105.75,
          "en": "The concept of virtual scrolling helps there, there",
          "zh": "虛擬滾動的概念在這裡就有幫助，在那裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 106.32,
          "end": 114.47999999999999,
          "en": "you basically don't render items that are far away from being visible and far away is actually a quite",
          "zh": "你基本上不會渲染離可見範圍很遠的項目，而「很遠」其實是個相當"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 114.47999999999999,
          "end": 115.22,
          "en": "heavy term,",
          "zh": "沉重的詞，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 115.22999999999999,
          "end": 121.3,
          "en": "with that I mean items that are let's say three or four items away from your viewport.",
          "zh": "我的意思是，比如說離你的 viewport 三、四個項目遠的項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 121.47,
          "end": 124.06,
          "en": "You also have certain items which are a kind of pre-rendered,",
          "zh": "你也有一些算是預先渲染的項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 124.08,
          "end": 130.11,
          "en": "so they are fully rendered even though they're not visible yet but you're likely to scroll to them soon",
          "zh": "所以即使它們還不可見，它們也已經完整渲染，但你很可能很快就會滾到它們，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 130.14,
          "end": 135.72,
          "en": "because they're close to your viewport and therefore they are rendered so that when you do scroll down,",
          "zh": "因為它們靠近你的 viewport，因此它們會被渲染，這樣當你真的往下滾動時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 135.72,
          "end": 142.62,
          "en": "they are already there and you don't see them pop in. And then whenever you scroll, items that are not",
          "zh": "它們已經在那裡，你不會看到它們突然冒出來。然後每當你滾動時，不可見的"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 142.62,
          "end": 150,
          "en": "visible are basically removed and items that are visible are added and they are added in advance to",
          "zh": "項目基本上會被移除，可見的項目會被加入，而且它們會提前被加入，以"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 150,
          "end": 157.5,
          "en": "provide smooth scrolling and to not hit the DOM too much and render and remove too many items at the",
          "zh": "提供流暢的滾動，並避免對 DOM 造成太大負擔，也避免同時渲染和移除太多"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 157.5,
          "end": 166,
          "en": "same time, the items that are getting invisible, so you're scrolling away from will actually be reused.",
          "zh": "項目。那些變得不可見、也就是你滾離的項目，其實會被重複使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 166.05,
          "end": 171.75,
          "en": "So if you're scrolling down, then the list item which is right now still visible, the moment it gets",
          "zh": "所以如果你往下滾動，那個現在還可見的清單項目，在它變得"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 171.75,
          "end": 177.84,
          "en": "invisible, it can get reused which means only its content is swapped and it's attached at the bottom",
          "zh": "不可見的那一刻就可以被重複使用，也就是只替換它的內容，然後再把它接到清單的"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 177.84,
          "end": 183.78,
          "en": "of the list again, so that when you're scrolling down, you're seeing that same item that already was rendered",
          "zh": "底部，這樣當你往下滾動時，你看到的是同一個已經渲染過的項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 183.78,
          "end": 185.76,
          "en": "before but with new content",
          "zh": "但內容是新的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 185.85,
          "end": 191.67,
          "en": "and this is simply done to not re-render new items all the time but reuse the items that already were",
          "zh": "這麼做只是為了不要一直重新渲染新項目，而是重複使用已經"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 191.73,
          "end": 192.43,
          "en": "rendered.",
          "zh": "渲染過的項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 192.45,
          "end": 198.9,
          "en": "So overall, it's a performance optimization which can actually be a disadvantage if you use it on very",
          "zh": "整體來說，這是一種效能最佳化，但如果你用於非常"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 198.9,
          "end": 205.02,
          "en": "short lists because then you have all that extra logic running behind the scenes that checks whether",
          "zh": "短的清單，它其實可能變成缺點，因為那樣你就有額外的邏輯在背後執行，檢查你是否"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 205.02,
          "end": 208.39,
          "en": "you're scrolling and what items need to be changed,",
          "zh": "正在滾動，以及哪些項目需要改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 208.77,
          "end": 213.96,
          "en": "then you've got this extra logic and you might not benefit that much because your list isn't that long",
          "zh": "你有了這些額外邏輯，卻可能沒得到多少好處，因為你的清單不夠長，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 214.17000000000002,
          "end": 220.62,
          "en": "but the longer your list is or especially if you have long lists of unpredictable length, so where you",
          "zh": "但你的清單越長，或者特別是當你有長度無法預測的長清單，也就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 220.62,
          "end": 227.18,
          "en": "don't know if it'll be 50 or 100 items long, then virtual scrolling can really be helpful.",
          "zh": "你不知道它會有 50 還是 100 個項目長時，虛擬滾動就真的很有幫助。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 227.19,
          "end": 228.24,
          "en": "Let's see it in practice.",
          "zh": "讓我們實際看看。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727932",
      "title": "Implementing Virtual Scrolling",
      "lectureOrder": 142,
      "videoOrder": 118,
      "sourceHash": "30f812e7f9545c019256eb1f0a714c2ab9e5b777f573f316a15137757167a8b7",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.26,
          "end": 6.86,
          "en": "Now we got no list where it would make super much sense to be very honest,",
          "zh": "老實說，我們現在沒有任何清單真的非常適合用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.94,
          "end": 8.83,
          "en": "we got very short lists here,",
          "zh": "我們這裡的清單都很短，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.83,
          "end": 15.85,
          "en": "so in reality in this application, you would probably not use virtual scrolling for any list but as",
          "zh": "所以在現實中，這個應用程式裡你可能不會對任何清單使用虛擬滾動，但隨著"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 15.85,
          "end": 19.66,
          "en": "this app grows, you could argue that more and more places are offered,",
          "zh": "這個 app 成長，你可以說會有越來越多的 places 被提供，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 19.66,
          "end": 25.72,
          "en": "so maybe you want to work virtually render those and therefore let me demonstrate virtual scrolling",
          "zh": "所以也許你會想用虛擬方式渲染它們。因此讓我以 discover 頁面"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 25.78,
          "end": 28.68,
          "en": "at the example of the discover page here.",
          "zh": "為例來示範虛擬滾動。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 28.69,
          "end": 31.44,
          "en": "Now how do you use virtual scrolling?",
          "zh": "那要如何使用虛擬滾動呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 31.72,
          "end": 37.78,
          "en": "You replace your ion-list here with ion-virtual-scroll,",
          "zh": "你把這裡的 ion-list 換成 ion-virtual-scroll，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 37.78,
          "end": 41.59,
          "en": "so instead of ion-list, you're using ion-virtual-scroll",
          "zh": "所以你不是用 ion-list，而是用 ion-virtual-scroll，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 41.68,
          "end": 44.04,
          "en": "and of course therefore you also close",
          "zh": "當然因此你也要在下面"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 44.07,
          "end": 50.8,
          "en": "ion-virtual-scroll down there and ion-virtual-scroll is a separate component shipping with Ionic which you",
          "zh": "關閉 ion-virtual-scroll，而 ion-virtual-scroll 是 Ionic 附帶的獨立元件，你"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 50.8,
          "end": 53.68,
          "en": "find here under the list section,",
          "zh": "可以在這裡的 list 區段底下找到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 53.68,
          "end": 54.81,
          "en": "here it is.",
          "zh": "就是這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 54.85,
          "end": 60.22,
          "en": "There you can also learn more about the technique that gets used and how to configure it and what you",
          "zh": "在那裡你也可以進一步瞭解所使用的技術、如何設定它，以及你"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 60.22,
          "end": 63.87,
          "en": "can now do is here on ion-virtual-scroll,",
          "zh": "現在能做的是，在 ion-virtual-scroll 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 63.88,
          "end": 69.31,
          "en": "you still have your ion-item in there but it works a bit different now, you're not using ngFor",
          "zh": "你裡面仍然有 ion-item，但它現在的運作方式有點不同，你不是用 ngFor，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 69.31,
          "end": 74.56,
          "en": "because ngFor it would automatically render all items.",
          "zh": "因為 ngFor 會自動渲染所有項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 74.56,
          "end": 79.57,
          "en": "So instead, here we can remove ngFor and on ion-virtual-scroll,",
          "zh": "所以我們可以移除 ngFor，而在 ion-virtual-scroll 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 79.6,
          "end": 90.28,
          "en": "you have to bind an items property. Now the items property then takes the array which you want to render",
          "zh": "你必須綁定一個 items 屬性。這個 items 屬性會接收你想渲染的陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 90.7,
          "end": 97.09,
          "en": "and it needs to get that array because it can then efficiently render the items which should be rendered",
          "zh": "它需要取得那個陣列，因為這樣它才能有效率地渲染應該被渲染的項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 97.18,
          "end": 99.75999999999999,
          "en": "because they're about to get visible.",
          "zh": "因為它們即將變為可見。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 99.75999999999999,
          "end": 108.78999999999999,
          "en": "So here I'm passing in my sliced array, so all the items but the first one and on the ion-item, you now",
          "zh": "所以這裡我傳入我 slice 過的陣列，也就是除了第一個之外的所有項目。而在 ion-item 上，你現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 108.78999999999999,
          "end": 111.28,
          "en": "still want to get access to every single item,",
          "zh": "仍然想要取得每一個項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 111.28,
          "end": 111.57,
          "en": "right,",
          "zh": "對吧，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 111.58,
          "end": 117.55,
          "en": "because we're also outputting data for it and therefore here, you add *virtualItem, that's a",
          "zh": "因為我們也要為它輸出資料。因此這裡你要加上 *virtualItem，那是"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 117.55,
          "end": 125.92,
          "en": "custom structural directive provided by Ionic Angular. So *virtualItem then has to be bound to let",
          "zh": "Ionic Angular 提供的自訂結構指令。所以 *virtualItem 必須綁定到 let，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 126.19,
          "end": 132.49,
          "en": "and then any name of your choice, for example let place and then you have the place variable available",
          "zh": "然後接任何你選擇的名稱，例如 let place，這樣你就有 place 變數可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 132.48,
          "end": 132.85,
          "en": "again,",
          "zh": "再次使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 132.94,
          "end": 137.82999999999998,
          "en": "so this is just a syntax you can memorize or view in the official docs.",
          "zh": "所以這只是一個語法，你可以記住它，或是在官方文件中查看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 137.82999999999998,
          "end": 149.19,
          "en": "With that if we save that and we go back to our list here, it reloads and it's missing and here, the slice",
          "zh": "有了這個，如果我們儲存並回到這裡的清單，它會重新載入，但內容不見了。而在這裡，slice"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 149.19,
          "end": 150.52,
          "en": "one is the problem,",
          "zh": "1 就是問題所在，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 150.54,
          "end": 156.12,
          "en": "such a dynamically calculated list, it will not work here.",
          "zh": "像這樣動態計算的清單，在這裡行不通。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 156.15,
          "end": 161.94,
          "en": "Now what you can do to circumvent this since we're not changing this dynamically, the amount of items",
          "zh": "現在你可以做的是繞過這個問題。既然我們不會動態改變它，也就是要 slice 掉的項目數量，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 161.94,
          "end": 171.69,
          "en": "we want to slice of, we can adjust this such that here in this discovery page component class, we add listed",
          "zh": "我們可以這樣調整：在這個 discovery page 的元件 class 裡，我們加入 listed"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 171.7,
          "end": 179.01,
          "en": "loaded places as another property for example, like this and in ngOnInit where we load everything,",
          "zh": "loaded places 作為另一個屬性，像這樣。而在我們載入所有東西的 ngOnInit 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 179.04,
          "end": 188.08,
          "en": "I set this listed loaded places equal to this loaded places slice and if we do that and we go back",
          "zh": "我把 this.listedLoadedPlaces 設為 this.loadedPlaces.slice(1)。如果我們這麼做，然後回到"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 188.08,
          "end": 196.15,
          "en": "to discovery page, to the template, then here we can point items at listed loaded places and now as this",
          "zh": "discovery page 的 template，我們就可以把 items 指向 listedLoadedPlaces，現在當這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 196.15,
          "end": 200,
          "en": "reloads, it will render our list of places correctly again,",
          "zh": "重新載入時，它就會再次正確地渲染我們的 places 清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 200.07999999999998,
          "end": 206.38,
          "en": "here they are. Now this list of course is not super long and therefore we can't see that scrolling effect",
          "zh": "它們就在這裡。這個清單當然不是很長，因此我們看不到那種滾動效果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 206.45,
          "end": 211.11,
          "en": "and you actually shouldn't see it because it will render items before they scroll into view",
          "zh": "而你其實也不應該看到，因為它會在項目滾入視野之前就渲染它們，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 211.18,
          "end": 214.65,
          "en": "but now if this were a longer list, you would have optimized it.",
          "zh": "但如果這是更長清單，你就已經把它最佳化了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 214.87,
          "end": 224.48,
          "en": "One important other note, to optimize the way this loads the elements and to let the logic behind this",
          "zh": "另一個重要提醒：為了最佳化它載入元素的方式，並讓這個元件背後的邏輯"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 224.48,
          "end": 232.34,
          "en": "component know when to pre-render a new item, you should actually approximate the height of a list item,",
          "zh": "知道何時要預先渲染新項目，你其實應該估算清單項目的高度，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 232.52,
          "end": 235.88,
          "en": "which you can do here for example with the help of the dev tools.",
          "zh": "例如你可以在這裡藉助 dev tools 來做到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 235.88,
          "end": 239.55,
          "en": "I can see that here, an item is roughly around 70 pixels high.",
          "zh": "我在這裡可以看到，一個項目大約是 70 像素高。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 239.57,
          "end": 242.97,
          "en": "Now you don't need the exact value but a rough estimation,",
          "zh": "你不需要精確的值，粗略估算就好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 243.08,
          "end": 247.43,
          "en": "it assumes a default of 40 pixels which is certainly not the case here",
          "zh": "它會假設預設是 40 像素，而這裡顯然不是這樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 247.58,
          "end": 255.92,
          "en": "and if you deviate from that assumed height by more than let's say just 4 pixels or anything like",
          "zh": "而如果你的高度與那個假設值相差超過，比如說，只要 4 像素之類的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 255.92,
          "end": 265.73,
          "en": "that, you should add the approx item height attribute here and set that to the value you are approximating",
          "zh": "你就應該在這裡加上 approxItemHeight 屬性，並把它設成你估算的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 265.73,
          "end": 271.52,
          "en": "because this behind the scenes allows the virtual scroll component to efficiently prepare the items",
          "zh": "因為這在背後能讓 virtual scroll 元件有效率地準備項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 271.52,
          "end": 279.17,
          "en": "before they come into view because it knows how far you have to scroll down or how many items fit into",
          "zh": "在它們進入視野之前，因為它知道你必須往下滾多遠，或者一次滾動"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 279.17,
          "end": 287.31,
          "en": "a single scrolling action so to say and therefore, how many items in advance it should prepare, the items.",
          "zh": "能容納多少個項目，因此它應該提前準備多少個項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 289.29,
          "end": 292.74,
          "en": "So that is how you should use virtual scrolling.",
          "zh": "以上就是你應該如何使用虛擬滾動。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 292.74,
          "end": 298.44,
          "en": "Again, keep in mind that you should not use it on every single list you have but on lists that may become",
          "zh": "再次提醒，你不應該對每一個清單都使用它，而是用在可能變得"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 298.44,
          "end": 302.81,
          "en": "very long and where you can't predict how many items might be on them.",
          "zh": "非常長、而且你無法預測會有多少項目的清單上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 302.82,
          "end": 308.64,
          "en": "So if you have a page where you restrict the amount of items you're rendering or let's say you have",
          "zh": "所以如果你有一個頁面會限制渲染的項目數量，或者比如說你有一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 308.91,
          "end": 314.61,
          "en": "a list where you're gathering user input and you do that with an ion-list, with a lot of ion-items, with",
          "zh": "清單用來收集使用者輸入，而你是用 ion-list、很多 ion-item，裡面再放"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 314.83,
          "end": 320.4,
          "en": "ion-inputs in them, then you don't need virtual scrolling but for unpredictable long lists, it can be",
          "zh": "ion-input 來做，那你就不需要虛擬滾動；但對於長度無法預測的長清單，它可能"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 320.4,
          "end": 320.99,
          "en": "pretty good.",
          "zh": "相當不錯。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727934",
      "title": "Adding Image Elements",
      "lectureOrder": 144,
      "videoOrder": 119,
      "sourceHash": "619c9205c9cf6b67b23855b654b8af8fb3ccb9a1d5f23c82cd2340a7dc7bca17",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.27,
          "end": 5.45,
          "en": "Let's talk about images in Ionic. Now",
          "zh": "讓我們談談 Ionic 裡的圖片。那麼"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.45,
          "end": 13.19,
          "en": "thus far I always use the ion-img element and that is a special Ionic component that in the end will",
          "zh": "到目前為止我都使用 ion-img 元素，那是一個特別的 Ionic 元件，它最終會"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 13.19,
          "end": 16.41,
          "en": "wrap the normal web, HTML,",
          "zh": "包住一般的網頁 HTML"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 16.51,
          "end": 21.61,
          "en": "IMG, image tag but will add extra optimizations to it.",
          "zh": "img 圖片標籤，但會為它加上額外的最佳化。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 21.92,
          "end": 29.24,
          "en": "Now inside of a virtual scrolling list, if you have items with images, you should always use ion-img",
          "zh": "在虛擬滾動清單裡，如果你的項目含有圖片，你應該一律使用 ion-img，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 29.27,
          "end": 35.6,
          "en": "because ion-virtual-scroll and ion-img will work together as such that images are loaded efficiently",
          "zh": "因為 ion-virtual-scroll 與 ion-img 會互相配合，讓圖片同樣能有效率地"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 35.6,
          "end": 42.35,
          "en": "in advance as well but even outside of a virtual scrolling list, I strongly recommend considering",
          "zh": "提前載入。但即使在虛擬滾動清單之外，我也強烈建議你考慮，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 42.35,
          "end": 46.9,
          "en": "and well if possible using the and ion-img element. Why?",
          "zh": "如果可能的話，使用 ion-img 元素。為什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 48.41,
          "end": 56.6,
          "en": "Because this element loads images lazily, which means only when they are really needed. It will not load",
          "zh": "因為這個元素會延遲載入圖片，也就是只在真正需要時才載入。它不會載入"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 56.66,
          "end": 60.14,
          "en": "images that are not visible or about to become visible,",
          "zh": "不可見、或不是即將變為可見的圖片，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 60.56,
          "end": 66.85,
          "en": "so if you have a longer list of elements or simply a page with a lot of content on it and you got images",
          "zh": "所以如果你有一個較長的元素清單，或只是一個內容很多、而你必須往下"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 66.86,
          "end": 73.06,
          "en": "somewhere down if you scroll down, then this will only load the image when you are about to see it",
          "zh": "滾動才會看到某處有圖片的頁面，那它就只會在你即將看到圖片時才載入它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 73.19,
          "end": 77.18,
          "en": "and why is this better than always loading all images in advance?",
          "zh": "而為什麼這比總是提前載入所有圖片更好呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 77.18,
          "end": 84.17,
          "en": "Well it hits your bandwidth, your network bandwidth less which can be a thing for users of your app in",
          "zh": "因為它對你的頻寬、你的網路頻寬消耗較少，這對你 app 的使用者在"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 84.17,
          "end": 91.34,
          "en": "let's say areas with bad internet connection or with limited bandwidth plans on their mobile providers.",
          "zh": "比如說網路連線不佳的地區，或行動電信方案頻寬有限的情況下，可能很重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 91.37,
          "end": 92.62,
          "en": "So that is one thing",
          "zh": "這是一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 92.69,
          "end": 99.92,
          "en": "and of course your page also simply is downloading faster if you're not loading all images in advance",
          "zh": "當然，如果你不提前載入所有圖片，你的頁面下載速度也會更快，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 100.37,
          "end": 105.56,
          "en": "and therefore ion-img is how you should include images in your Ionic app.",
          "zh": "因此在你的 Ionic app 裡，就應該用 ion-img 來加入圖片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 105.56,
          "end": 111.38,
          "en": "Now what about ion-thumbnail or ion-avatar as you also saw it in this app already?",
          "zh": "那 ion-thumbnail 或 ion-avatar 呢？你在這個 app 裡也已經看過了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 111.38,
          "end": 118.88,
          "en": "These are simply wrappers, ion-thumbnail renders a square image for example and ion-avatar simply renders",
          "zh": "它們就只是包裝。例如 ion-thumbnail 會渲染出方形圖片，而 ion-avatar 則會渲染出"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 118.91,
          "end": 120.2,
          "en": "a rounded image,",
          "zh": "圓形的圖片，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 120.47,
          "end": 125.57,
          "en": "so this is simply just some styling that makes your image or whatever you have in there look good",
          "zh": "所以這只是一些樣式，讓你裡面的圖片或任何內容看起來好看，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 125.57,
          "end": 131.93,
          "en": "and that's also worth pointing out. Into ion-thumbnail or ion-avatar,",
          "zh": "這也值得特別說明。在 ion-thumbnail 或 ion-avatar 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 131.93,
          "end": 134.99,
          "en": "you don't have to pass in an ion-img,",
          "zh": "你不一定要放入 ion-img，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 135.05,
          "end": 138.47,
          "en": "you can also pass in some text or whatever you want,",
          "zh": "你也可以放入一些文字或任何你想要的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 138.5,
          "end": 143.9,
          "en": "ion-avatar just gives you a rounded element with that content inside of it,",
          "zh": "ion-avatar 只會給你一個圓形的元素，裡面有那些內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 143.9,
          "end": 151.4,
          "en": "ion-thumbnail gives you a square element but in both cases if you do use an image, they will automatically",
          "zh": "ion-thumbnail 則給你方形的元素，但不論哪一種，如果你真的使用圖片，它們都會自動"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 151.4,
          "end": 154.52,
          "en": "adjust this image to look good inside of that container,",
          "zh": "調整這張圖片，讓它在該容器裡看起來好看，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 154.55,
          "end": 158.39,
          "en": "so to center it and make sure it has the right dimensions.",
          "zh": "也就是置中它，並確保它有正確的尺寸。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 158.39,
          "end": 159.88,
          "en": "That is how you should use images,",
          "zh": "以上就是你應該如何使用圖片，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 159.89,
          "end": 163.25,
          "en": "not too complicated but still worth pointing out.",
          "zh": "不會太複雜，但仍然值得特別說明。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727936",
      "title": "Segmented Buttons",
      "lectureOrder": 145,
      "videoOrder": 120,
      "sourceHash": "84c71778dbf5da4632ea58d4cb80cc5cf49f86170a055464c9c1b6df596642e0",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.39,
          "end": 4.11,
          "en": "We're nearing the end of this section.",
          "zh": "我們快要結束這個章節了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.22,
          "end": 10.19,
          "en": "Now let's do something which I actually need on this application, on this Discover page here, I want",
          "zh": "現在讓我們做一件我其實在這個應用程式裡需要的東西。在這個 Discover 頁面上，我想"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.19,
          "end": 12.89,
          "en": "to have two types of places I can discover.",
          "zh": "有兩種類型的 places 可以探索。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.22,
          "end": 16.72,
          "en": "One are all the places, including the ones I'm offering.",
          "zh": "一種是所有的 places，包括我自己提供的那些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.73,
          "end": 19.31,
          "en": "And of course, you could also simply filtered those out.",
          "zh": "當然，你也可以單純把它們過濾掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.31,
          "end": 25.01,
          "en": "But I want to introduce a new component as well, a component that allows us to switch between two different",
          "zh": "但我也想介紹一個新元件，一個讓我們可以在兩種不同"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 25.01,
          "end": 31.55,
          "en": "modes here, a mode for viewing all places and a mode for viewing actual bookable places.",
          "zh": "模式之間切換的元件：檢視所有 places 的模式，以及檢視真正可預訂 places 的模式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 31.55,
          "end": 33.34,
          "en": "So places not offered by us.",
          "zh": "也就是不是我們提供的 places。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 33.92,
          "end": 39.16,
          "en": "Now we could use taps, but taps should be used for navigating between different pages.",
          "zh": "我們可以用 tabs，但 tabs 應該用於在不同頁面之間導覽。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 39.56,
          "end": 41.63,
          "en": "I don't want to load different pages.",
          "zh": "我不想載入不同的頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 41.63,
          "end": 44.3,
          "en": "I in the end just want to set a different filter here.",
          "zh": "我最後只是想在這裡設定不同的篩選條件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 44.75,
          "end": 47.12,
          "en": "Now, how could we do that for that?",
          "zh": "那我們要怎麼做到呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 47.12,
          "end": 50.21,
          "en": "On the Discover page, we can add a new component.",
          "zh": "在 Discover 頁面上，我們可以加入一個新元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 51.21,
          "end": 56.37,
          "en": "At the very top of this page, outside of the eye, Ingrid, even, but you could also added insight",
          "zh": "在這個頁面的最上方，甚至放在 ion-grid 之外，但依樣式需求，你也可以放在裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 56.37,
          "end": 58.2,
          "en": "depending on the styling want.",
          "zh": "看你想要的樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 59.33,
          "end": 67.82,
          "en": "And that is the ion segment component, the ION segment component allows you to add so-called segmented",
          "zh": "那就是 ion-segment 元件。ion-segment 元件讓你加入所謂的分段"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 67.82,
          "end": 74.3,
          "en": "buttons, which means buttons were only one button of the set of buttons can be active at a time in",
          "zh": "按鈕，意思是在一組按鈕中，一次只能有一個按鈕"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 74.3,
          "end": 74.62,
          "en": "there.",
          "zh": "處於作用中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 74.63,
          "end": 82.07,
          "en": "You do indeed at the ion segment button components and these buttons can get icons, labels.",
          "zh": "你確實要在那裡放入 ion-segment-button 元件，而這些按鈕可以有圖示、標籤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 82.08,
          "end": 88.34,
          "en": "So basically how you style regular buttons or the content you can pass into regular buttons and all",
          "zh": "基本上就像你為一般按鈕設定樣式，或能傳入一般按鈕的內容那樣，而全部"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 88.34,
          "end": 92.15,
          "en": "have all places on one button and on the button.",
          "zh": "在一個按鈕上放 All places，而在另一個按鈕上"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 92.69,
          "end": 94.49000000000001,
          "en": "Bookable places let's say.",
          "zh": "就放，比如說，Bookable places。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 97.93,
          "end": 104.28999999999999,
          "en": "Now, important to these patterns, you can assign a value property which will not be visible, but",
          "zh": "重要的一點是，你可以為這些按鈕指定一個 value 屬性，它不會顯示出來，但"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 104.28999999999999,
          "end": 110.08,
          "en": "when you later select a button and listen to that event, that value property will be passed with the",
          "zh": "當你之後選取某個按鈕並監聽該事件時，那個 value 屬性會隨著"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 110.08,
          "end": 113.95,
          "en": "event so that in your code you can find out which button was pressed.",
          "zh": "事件一起傳入，這樣你在程式碼裡就能知道哪個按鈕被按下。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 113.96000000000001,
          "end": 115.65,
          "en": "So like an identifier, basically.",
          "zh": "基本上就像一個識別碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 116.11,
          "end": 121.46,
          "en": "So here, I'll pass all and here as a value, I'll pass bookable.",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我會傳入 all，而這裡我傳入 bookable 作為 value。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 122.17,
          "end": 127.72,
          "en": "You can also set the check, the attribute, but only one button at the time can be checked and that",
          "zh": "你也可以設定 checked 屬性，但一次只能有一個按鈕被 checked，而那"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 127.72,
          "end": 131.83,
          "en": "will basically be the preselected button which is selected at the start.",
          "zh": "基本上就是在一開始就被預先選取的那個按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 132.39,
          "end": 139.9,
          "en": "One important note about checked, though, if you are using Ionic for then does is correct and you",
          "zh": "不過關於 checked 有個重要提醒：如果你使用的是 Ionic 4，那這樣寫是正確的，你"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 139.9,
          "end": 146.5,
          "en": "can check your packaged adjacent file to find out which version is locked in there for the ionic packages.",
          "zh": "可以查看你的 package.json 檔案，瞭解裡面的 Ionic 套件鎖定在哪個版本。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 147.19,
          "end": 155.71,
          "en": "If you are using ionic five or higher, then you don't add checked here to set destress checked.",
          "zh": "如果你使用的是 Ionic 5 或更高版本，你就不在這裡加上 checked 來設定選取狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 155.71,
          "end": 162.55,
          "en": "Instead, you would add the value attribute to ion segment so to the surrounding element and set the",
          "zh": "相反地，你會把 value 屬性加到 ion-segment，也就是外層元素上，並把"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 162.55,
          "end": 165.74,
          "en": "value off the element which should be checked here.",
          "zh": "應該被選取的那個元素的 value 設在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 165.94,
          "end": 172.77,
          "en": "So if you want to have his first button as active, initially we would set value here to all.",
          "zh": "所以如果你想讓第一個按鈕一開始就是作用中，我們會把這裡的 value 設成 all。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 173.41,
          "end": 180.67,
          "en": "And if we later want to change the check button dynamically, if that was our goal, we would bind to",
          "zh": "而如果我們之後想動態改變被選取的按鈕，假如那是我們的目標，我們就會綁定"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 180.67,
          "end": 188.71,
          "en": "value here on ION segment and change the value we pass to the value attribute here dynamically to then",
          "zh": "ion-segment 上的 value，並動態改變我們傳給這裡 value 屬性的值，藉此"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 188.71,
          "end": 190.87,
          "en": "change which button is marked as checked.",
          "zh": "改變哪個按鈕被標記為已選取。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 191.11,
          "end": 193.27,
          "en": "That's a tiny addition you should keep in mind.",
          "zh": "這是個小補充，你應該記在心裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 193.48,
          "end": 197.77,
          "en": "What you use here simply depends on the version of Ionic you are using.",
          "zh": "這裡該用哪一種，單純取決於你使用的 Ionic 版本。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 199.14,
          "end": 206.01,
          "en": "Now, in on the Iron segment, you can listen to changes in the selection and you do that with the iron",
          "zh": "在 ion-segment 上，你可以監聽選取內容的變化，而你是用"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 206.34,
          "end": 207.37,
          "en": "change event.",
          "zh": "ionChange 事件來做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 207.81,
          "end": 213.72,
          "en": "This is obviously not a standard event, but it is an event emitted by iconic through its components.",
          "zh": "這顯然不是標準事件，而是 Ionic 透過它的元件發出的事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 214.17000000000002,
          "end": 218.67000000000002,
          "en": "So Ionic will emit this event whenever a new selection is made.",
          "zh": "所以每當有新的選取時，Ionic 就會發出這個事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 219.09,
          "end": 222.35,
          "en": "And then you can, for example, run on filter update.",
          "zh": "然後你可以，例如，執行 onFilterUpdate。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 222.45,
          "end": 229.26,
          "en": "The name of the method is up to you and important forward the default event object you get here by Ionic",
          "zh": "方法名稱由你決定。重要的是，要把 Ionic 在這裡給你的預設事件物件傳出去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 229.5,
          "end": 236.25,
          "en": "and you do that in angular by using the thylacine event variable here, which is made available by Angular",
          "zh": "而在 Angular 裡，你是用這裡的 $event 變數來做到，那是 Angular 提供"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 236.34,
          "end": 238.47,
          "en": "to hold the event object you are getting.",
          "zh": "用來存放你取得的事件物件的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 239.39,
          "end": 242.72,
          "en": "And all you have to do now is in on filter update.",
          "zh": "而現在你只要在 onFilterUpdate 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 243.62,
          "end": 248.45,
          "en": "In this component page, you can listen to that event and then react.",
          "zh": "在這個元件的 page 裡，你就可以監聽那個事件並做出反應。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 249.57,
          "end": 255.93,
          "en": "So there you'll get your event, which is of type, custom event and custom event does not need to be",
          "zh": "在那裡你會取得你的 event，型別是 CustomEvent，而 CustomEvent 不需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 255.93,
          "end": 256.48,
          "en": "imported.",
          "zh": "被 import。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 256.5,
          "end": 258.83,
          "en": "It's a default web feature.",
          "zh": "它是網頁的預設功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 259.17,
          "end": 266.22,
          "en": "It's a so-called generic type, which means you can also pass some extra data about which custom event",
          "zh": "它是所謂的泛型型別，意思是你也可以傳入一些額外資料，說明這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 266.22,
          "end": 268.65,
          "en": "data does custom event object will hold.",
          "zh": "CustomEvent 物件會裝載什麼資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 269.01,
          "end": 276.21,
          "en": "And in this case, this would be the segment change event detail object, which now needs to be imported",
          "zh": "而在這個情況下，那就是 SegmentChangeEventDetail 物件，它現在需要從"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 276.21,
          "end": 277.47,
          "en": "from ionic core.",
          "zh": "@ionic/core import。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 277.74,
          "end": 283.38,
          "en": "Now it is optional to import this, but with this type assignment, you get better auto completion.",
          "zh": "這個 import 是選用的，但有了這個型別指定，你就能得到更好的自動完成。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 285.54,
          "end": 292.77,
          "en": "So this is the event will be getting here and inside of this awful dropped it all simply long event",
          "zh": "這就是我們在這裡會取得的事件，而在它裡面我就簡單寫下 event，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 293.13,
          "end": 298.07,
          "en": "and then detail is a property that holds the detailed event data for this event.",
          "zh": "然後 detail 是一個屬性，用來存放這個事件的詳細事件資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 298.14,
          "end": 301.47,
          "en": "So that should be that segment change event detail data.",
          "zh": "所以那應該就是 SegmentChangeEventDetail 的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 302.42,
          "end": 309.14,
          "en": "And now if you go back, we see these two tabs here at the top, and if we switch to an iPhone, we",
          "zh": "現在如果你返回，我們會看到最上面有這兩個 tabs，而如果我們切換到 iPhone，我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 309.14,
          "end": 316.06,
          "en": "also see that as soon as we reload, this has the iPhone look and I'll let me open the console here.",
          "zh": "也會看到一旦重新載入，它就有 iPhone 的外觀。讓我打開這裡的 console。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 316.37,
          "end": 318.98,
          "en": "You see, we get this object value, all right.",
          "zh": "你看，我們取得這個物件，value 是 all，沒錯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 318.98,
          "end": 323.69,
          "en": "At the start, because I chose checked for the first segment and we now switch.",
          "zh": "一開始是這樣，因為我為第一個 segment 選了 checked。而我們現在切換。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 323.69,
          "end": 327.74,
          "en": "We see this now gets embedded here, value bookable.",
          "zh": "我們看到這裡現在變成 value 是 bookable。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 329.61,
          "end": 336.12,
          "en": "So these are the values you entered in your HTML code, and this will become important later when we",
          "zh": "這些就是你在 HTML 程式碼裡輸入的值，而這在之後會變得很重要，當我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 336.12,
          "end": 341.90999999999997,
          "en": "actually filter our data or when we load different data depending on our selection, to even review",
          "zh": "真的篩選資料，或根據選取內容載入不同資料時，以便檢視"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 341.90999999999997,
          "end": 345.18,
          "en": "all places or only the places we can actually book.",
          "zh": "所有 places，或只檢視我們真正能預訂的 places。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727938",
      "title": "Adding a Spinner",
      "lectureOrder": 146,
      "videoOrder": 121,
      "sourceHash": "d79122b4c1d2c9277d8cb5007bf17f8c113e2387aa184bb7d421f5b3c1a54315",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.24,
          "end": 3.45,
          "en": "A lot of ground covered,",
          "zh": "我們涵蓋了很多內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.47,
          "end": 11.06,
          "en": "let's conclude this module now by having a look at some other of these controller components, so components",
          "zh": "現在讓我們看看其他這類 controller 元件，來為這個模組作結，也就是那些"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 11.09,
          "end": 18.61,
          "en": "which you actually create programmatically by injecting their controller here in our Ionic Angular app",
          "zh": "你在我們的 Ionic Angular app 裡注入它們的 controller，以程式化方式建立的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 18.71,
          "end": 24.19,
          "en": "and specifically, I want to introduce two new controller components which we need in this app.",
          "zh": "特別是，我想介紹兩個我們在這個 app 裡需要的全新 controller 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 24.26,
          "end": 29.42,
          "en": "The first one is related to the auth page and there when we click this login button,",
          "zh": "第一個與 auth 頁面有關。在那裡，當我們點這個 login 按鈕時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 29.42,
          "end": 32.21,
          "en": "we currently simply always redirect.",
          "zh": "我們目前只是單純地一律重新導向。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 32.42,
          "end": 34.82,
          "en": "Now right now, there's little else we can do, right,",
          "zh": "現在我們能做的不多，對吧，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 34.82,
          "end": 40.34,
          "en": "we have no real login logic but later we'll send a request here to the web.",
          "zh": "我們還沒有真正的登入邏輯，但之後我們會在這裡向網路發送請求。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 40.34,
          "end": 46.07,
          "en": "So I already want to add a little timeout here to fake that we have to wait for a response",
          "zh": "所以我現在就想在這裡加個小 timeout，假裝我們必須等待回應，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 46.25,
          "end": 51.57,
          "en": "and I'm of course adding this here so that I can show you how to add a loader,",
          "zh": "我當然是為了示範如何加入 loader 才在這裡加上它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 51.59,
          "end": 58.49,
          "en": "so a loading icon. Now in this function here after one second, I will redirect or let's make it 1.5",
          "zh": "也就是載入圖示。現在在這個函式裡，一秒之後我會重新導向，或者讓我們改成 1.5"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 58.49,
          "end": 65.07,
          "en": "seconds actually and in my auth service, I'll set isAuthenticated back to false",
          "zh": "秒吧。而在我的 auth service 裡，我會把 isAuthenticated 設回 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 65.11,
          "end": 68.68,
          "en": "so that we actually start on this authentication page here.",
          "zh": "這樣我們才會真的從這個身分驗證頁面開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 68.8,
          "end": 75.3,
          "en": "So let's wait for that to reload and here I am. Now if I press login,",
          "zh": "讓我們等它重新載入，我就在這裡。現在如果我按 login，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 75.3,
          "end": 80.46000000000001,
          "en": "nothing happens for one and a half second before I'm redirected.",
          "zh": "在我被重新導向之前，會有 1.5 秒什麼都沒發生。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 80.46000000000001,
          "end": 83.78999999999999,
          "en": "Now this is of course not the best user experience,",
          "zh": "這當然不是最好的使用者體驗，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 83.78999999999999,
          "end": 89.82,
          "en": "if we have to wait for something, we want to show a loader and for that, I'll actually first start with a",
          "zh": "如果我們必須等待某件事，我們就會想顯示 loader。為此，我其實會先從"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 89.97,
          "end": 94.05,
          "en": "non-overlay loader where we don't need to inject anything",
          "zh": "不需要注入任何東西的非覆蓋式 loader 開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 94.05,
          "end": 96.42,
          "en": "and this is also something we'll use later in the course",
          "zh": "這也是我們之後在課程中會用到的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 96.42,
          "end": 102.47999999999999,
          "en": "once we add HTTP requests, I will already show it to you here. For this, I can add an isLoading property",
          "zh": "等我們加入 HTTP 請求時。我現在就先示範給你看。為此，我可以在 auth 頁面的"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 102.47999999999999,
          "end": 109.22999999999999,
          "en": "to the auth page component and set this to false here and then here in onLogin, I'll set isLoading",
          "zh": "元件裡加入一個 isLoading 屬性，在這裡設成 false，然後在 onLogin 裡，我會把 isLoading"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 109.22999999999999,
          "end": 116.63,
          "en": "to true and then once I'm done, so inside set timeout, I'll set this loading to false.",
          "zh": "設成 true，然後當我完成時，也就是在 setTimeout 裡，我會把這個 loading 設成 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 116.63,
          "end": 124.01,
          "en": "Now we can use this isLoading property here in the auth.page.html file to show a spinner and Ionic",
          "zh": "現在我們可以在 auth.page.html 檔案裡使用這個 isLoading 屬性來顯示 spinner，而 Ionic"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 124.1,
          "end": 125.49,
          "en": "has us covered here too,",
          "zh": "在這裡也為我們準備好了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 125.51,
          "end": 131.27,
          "en": "we have spinners and progress bars to choose from, the official docs of course are the place to go.",
          "zh": "我們有 spinner 和 progress bar 可以選擇，官方文件當然是該去的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 131.36,
          "end": 137.57,
          "en": "Here I'll simply replace the button with a spinner, so I'll add ion-spinner which is such an element",
          "zh": "在這裡我會直接把按鈕換成 spinner，所以我會加入 ion-spinner，就是這樣的元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 138.07999999999998,
          "end": 144.47,
          "en": "and give it a color of primary and only render that if isLoading is true",
          "zh": "給它 primary 的顏色，並且只在 isLoading 為 true 時渲染它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 144.56,
          "end": 150.59,
          "en": "and on the other hand, the button will only be rendered if we're not loading because if we are loading,",
          "zh": "另一方面，按鈕只會在我們不在載入時才渲染，因為如果我們正在載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 150.59,
          "end": 153.64,
          "en": "then the buttons should not be pressable again.",
          "zh": "那按鈕就不應該能再次被按下。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 153.65,
          "end": 160.29,
          "en": "So with that, we let this reload, as soon as I click that login button, we got that nice spinner which",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們讓它重新載入。我一按下那個 login 按鈕，就會出現漂亮的 spinner，它"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 160.29,
          "end": 163.4,
          "en": "will automatically have the platform specific look,",
          "zh": "會自動擁有平台專屬的外觀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 163.41,
          "end": 166.98,
          "en": "so if we have a look at this on a pixel device here,",
          "zh": "所以如果我們在這裡的 Pixel 裝置上看，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 167.04,
          "end": 174.99,
          "en": "so Android therefore, actually a smaller one so that it fits onto the screen, if we have a look at that",
          "zh": "因此是 Android，其實是比較小的一台，好讓它能放進畫面。如果我們看一下它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 174.99,
          "end": 177.42000000000002,
          "en": "and we reload, now we have that Android spinner.",
          "zh": "然後重新載入，現在我們就有那個 Android spinner。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 177.42000000000002,
          "end": 182.97,
          "en": "Now of course you can also center that in the middle of the screen by for example wrapping it into a",
          "zh": "當然你也可以把它放在畫面正中央，例如把它包進一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 182.97,
          "end": 190.48,
          "en": "div or an ion-grid and on the div, we could use text center here and it should now be centered.",
          "zh": "div 或 ion-grid，而在那個 div 上我們可以用 text-center，現在它應該就會置中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 190.56,
          "end": 191.88,
          "en": "So you can style that,",
          "zh": "所以你可以為它設定樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 191.88,
          "end": 197.42000000000002,
          "en": "you can also style it with CSS and all of that is nice.",
          "zh": "你也可以用 CSS 設定樣式，這些都很好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 197.43,
          "end": 200.09,
          "en": "Now this is a spinner which we absolutely can display",
          "zh": "這個 spinner 我們當然可以顯示，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 200.1,
          "end": 206.39,
          "en": "but for me such a spinner and that's now a purely philosophic thing makes more sense",
          "zh": "但對我來說，這樣的 spinner（這純粹是個人觀點）更有意義的時機"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 206.4,
          "end": 208.34,
          "en": "if we'll stay on the page.",
          "zh": "是當我們會停留在頁面上時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 208.35,
          "end": 214.78,
          "en": "So for example here, we can later add such a spinner when we're loading our places. On the login page,",
          "zh": "例如這裡，我們之後可以在載入 places 時加入這樣的 spinner。但在登入頁面上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 214.86,
          "end": 221.85,
          "en": "I actually want to add an overlay on the page so that we can't click anything and it's very clear that",
          "zh": "我其實想在頁面上加入覆蓋層，讓我們什麼都點不了，並且非常清楚"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 221.85,
          "end": 229.38,
          "en": "the entire app is now waiting for us to load this because on a screen like this here, we could argue",
          "zh": "整個 app 現在都在等我們載入完成。因為在像這裡這樣的畫面上，我們可以說"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 229.39,
          "end": 234.12,
          "en": "yes we might see a spinner here but we can still navigate to other places.",
          "zh": "是的，我們在這裡可能會看到 spinner，但我們仍然可以導覽到其他地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 234.12,
          "end": 238.22,
          "en": "Now when we're logging in, we're definitely stuck until we succeeded",
          "zh": "而當我們在登入時，在成功之前我們絕對是卡住的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 238.44,
          "end": 246.42,
          "en": "and therefore here, I will actually not use this spinner, I'll comment it out but instead use such a controller",
          "zh": "因此在這裡，我其實不會用這個 spinner，我會把它註解掉，改用這樣的 controller"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 246.51,
          "end": 251.85,
          "en": "spinner which I already announced and I also removed ngIf here by the way on the button.",
          "zh": "spinner，這我剛才已經預告過了。順帶一提，我也把按鈕上的 ngIf 移除了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 251.85,
          "end": 255.15,
          "en": "So let's now have a look at that loading controller.",
          "zh": "現在讓我們看看那個 loading controller。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727940",
      "title": "Using the Loading Controller",
      "lectureOrder": 147,
      "videoOrder": 122,
      "sourceHash": "ee7e52972d0890221ed87aa7cce8fdde3badbac9da56d9e0b4635a784247c032",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.36,
          "end": 8.63,
          "en": "For that loading controller, for that overlay, in the auth page component, just as with other controllers",
          "zh": "至於那個 loading controller、那個 overlay，在 auth page 元件裡，就像其他 controller"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.66,
          "end": 11.93,
          "en": "we used earlier like the modal controller, we have to inject it.",
          "zh": "一樣，例如我們稍早用過的 modal controller，我們必須注入它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 12.35,
          "end": 21.11,
          "en": "So here I'll inject my loading controller which is of type loading controller, now loading controller",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我要注入我的 loading controller，它的型別是 loading controller，而 loading controller"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 21.11,
          "end": 26.3,
          "en": "here needs to be imported from @ionic/angular.",
          "zh": "在這裡需要從 @ionic/angular 匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 26.4,
          "end": 30.79,
          "en": "Now this loading controller can be used here in onLogin now,",
          "zh": "現在這個 loading controller 可以在 onLogin 裡使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 30.9,
          "end": 37.14,
          "en": "this loading controller and just with all the other controllers, we can call create to create a new loading",
          "zh": "這個 loading controller，就像所有其他 controller 一樣，我們可以呼叫 create 來建立新的 loading"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 37.14,
          "end": 39.83,
          "en": "controller overlay or a new loading overlay",
          "zh": "controller overlay，或者該說是新的 loading overlay"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 39.87,
          "end": 46.2,
          "en": "I should say. You pass in a Javascript object to configure that and there you can set things like the",
          "zh": "才對。你傳入一個 JavaScript 物件來設定它，在那裡你可以設定例如"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 46.2,
          "end": 52.2,
          "en": "duration in case you can't control that on your own by dismissing it once you're done,",
          "zh": "duration，以防你沒辦法自己在完成時關閉它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 52.2,
          "end": 58.26,
          "en": "you can control whether it should close any open keyboards which it should do here in case I still have",
          "zh": "你可以控制它是否要關閉任何已開啟的鍵盤，在這裡它應該這麼做，以防我還有"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 58.27,
          "end": 60,
          "en": "one open.",
          "zh": "一個鍵盤開著。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 60.21,
          "end": 66.93,
          "en": "You can choose which spinner to show, so which kind of a spinner it should show and you can also show a",
          "zh": "你可以選擇要顯示哪一種 spinner，也就是它該顯示哪一種 spinner，你也可以顯示"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 66.93,
          "end": 73.6,
          "en": "message like logging in. Now as all these other create methods,",
          "zh": "像 logging in 這樣的訊息。就像所有其他 create 方法一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 73.6,
          "end": 75.1,
          "en": "this uses a promise,",
          "zh": "這使用的是 promise，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 75.1,
          "end": 83.28,
          "en": "so what we get back here is a loading element in our function we pass to then and on this loading element,",
          "zh": "所以這裡拿回來的是 loading 元素，在我們傳給 then 的函式中，而在這個 loading 元素上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 83.28999999999999,
          "end": 86.69,
          "en": "we now have to call present to show it.",
          "zh": "我們現在必須呼叫 present 來顯示它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 86.77,
          "end": 97.35,
          "en": "Now it's also on this element, let me move that up, where I want to actually start the timer let's say",
          "zh": "同樣是在這個元素上，讓我把這裡往上移，我想在這裡實際啟動計時器，比如說"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 99.33,
          "end": 105.58,
          "en": "and I want to dismiss the element once I'm done. So here inside of that function we passed to timeout,",
          "zh": "然後在完成後關閉這個元素。所以在這裡，在我們傳給 timeout 的那個函式裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 105.64,
          "end": 111.15,
          "en": "so once we're done logging in because remember, I'm just faking a network request here,",
          "zh": "當我們完成登入後，因為記住，我在這裡只是假裝發出網路請求，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 111.31,
          "end": 116.72,
          "en": "we can use that loading element and call dismiss and this will dismiss the overlay.",
          "zh": "我們可以使用那個 loading 元素並呼叫 dismiss，這就會關閉 overlay。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 116.74000000000001,
          "end": 121.72,
          "en": "So here we're presenting it, then we're starting the timer and this function will execute after one and",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我們顯示它，接著啟動計時器，這個函式會在一"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 121.72,
          "end": 124.6,
          "en": "a half second and we'll then remove the overlay.",
          "zh": "秒半之後執行，然後我們就會移除 overlay。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 124.6,
          "end": 131.74,
          "en": "Now what this gives us if we save this is a nice overlay that blocks us from doing anything",
          "zh": "現在如果我們儲存，這帶給我們的是一個漂亮的 overlay，阻擋我們做任何事"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 131.74,
          "end": 133.51,
          "en": "here on the page.",
          "zh": "在這個頁面上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 133.51,
          "end": 138.67000000000002,
          "en": "Now you could actually configure it to be dismissable when you click the background but the default is",
          "zh": "你其實可以把它設定成點擊背景時就能關閉，但預設是"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 138.67000000000002,
          "end": 143.47,
          "en": "that it's not this dismissable because indeed it should block all interaction.",
          "zh": "它不能這樣關閉，因為它確實應該阻擋所有互動。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 143.47,
          "end": 150.28,
          "en": "Now this is the loading controller which I want to use in places where the user just has to wait and",
          "zh": "這就是 loading controller，我想把它用在使用者只能等待的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 150.28,
          "end": 154.47,
          "en": "where you can't do anything useful with the app until the loading is done.",
          "zh": "以及載入完成前你無法用 app 做任何有用事情的地方。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727942",
      "title": "Using the ActionSheet Controller",
      "lectureOrder": 148,
      "videoOrder": 123,
      "sourceHash": "e7dd53fcb000cbbfcae720bcb7ca1d970f7c5840ec25bf5004525ec87ffcc4a6",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.38,
          "end": 5.62,
          "en": "The loading controller is not everything,",
          "zh": "loading controller 並不是全部，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.62,
          "end": 11.32,
          "en": "I also want to tweak the way we can book an event. Right now of course, we're not really doing booking",
          "zh": "我也想調整一下我們預約活動的方式。當然，目前我們其實還沒有真的在做預約，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 11.53,
          "end": 17.14,
          "en": "but in the place detail page, at least we are opening that modal through the modal controller.",
          "zh": "但在 place detail 頁面，至少我們是透過 modal controller 開啟那個 modal。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 17.14,
          "end": 21.4,
          "en": "Now that's nice, it's another controller, we're in controller mood here anyways",
          "zh": "這很好，它是另一個 controller，反正我們現在正處於 controller 的氛圍中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 21.64,
          "end": 27.25,
          "en": "but the modal controller is not the only thing I want to show in this component here.",
          "zh": "但 modal controller 並不是我想在這個元件裡展示的唯一東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 27.31,
          "end": 35.86,
          "en": "Instead I want to introduce the actionsheet controller, an actionsheet is basically a set of options",
          "zh": "相反地，我想介紹 actionsheet controller。actionsheet 基本上是一組選項，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 35.89,
          "end": 42.35,
          "en": "that slides up from the bottom of the page. To use it in the place detail page,",
          "zh": "它會從頁面底部滑上來。要在 place detail 頁面使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 42.35,
          "end": 50.03,
          "en": "I'll inject my actionsheet controller which is of type actionsheet controller and unsurprisingly, the",
          "zh": "我要注入我的 actionsheet controller，它的型別是 actionsheet controller，而毫不意外地，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 50.12,
          "end": 59.03,
          "en": "actionsheet controller here is imported from @ionic/angular up here and with the actionsheet controller",
          "zh": "這裡的 actionsheet controller 是從上面的 @ionic/angular 匯入的，有了"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 59.29,
          "end": 59.84,
          "en": "injected,",
          "zh": "注入的 actionsheet controller 之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 59.93,
          "end": 67.58,
          "en": "I want to open my actionsheet when onBookPlace is triggered, so when this book place button here is pressed",
          "zh": "我想在 onBookPlace 被觸發時開啟 actionsheet，也就是這裡這個 book place 按鈕被按下時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 67.67,
          "end": 73.9,
          "en": "on the place detail page. So I'll not open the modal right away, instead I'll use the actionsheet controller",
          "zh": "在 place detail 頁面上。所以我不會立刻開啟 modal，而是使用 actionsheet controller"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 73.9,
          "end": 76.62,
          "en": "and create a new actionsheet.",
          "zh": "並建立一個新的 actionsheet。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 76.69,
          "end": 80.08,
          "en": "Now on that actionsheet, you can set a bunch of options,",
          "zh": "在那個 actionsheet 上，你可以設定一堆選項，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 80.2,
          "end": 86.47,
          "en": "for example a header which will be choose an action and you can of course choose any header you want",
          "zh": "例如標題設為 choose an action，當然你可以選擇任何你想要的標題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 87.13,
          "end": 93.16,
          "en": "and then it's mostly about the buttons you add. You add multiple buttons here and every button can be",
          "zh": "接著主要就是關於你加入的按鈕。你在這裡加入多個按鈕，每個按鈕都可以是"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 93.16,
          "end": 96.66,
          "en": "a Javascript object where you can configure it in detail,",
          "zh": "一個 JavaScript 物件，讓你詳細設定它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 96.67,
          "end": 106.21000000000001,
          "en": "for example you can set its text and I want to make my places bookable by letting the users select",
          "zh": "例如你可以設定它的文字，而我想讓我的地點可以被預約，方法是讓使用者在"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 106.21000000000001,
          "end": 113.97999999999999,
          "en": "their own dates inside of the modal which will open up or by giving them a randomly generated timespan,",
          "zh": "即將開啟的 modal 裡選擇自己的日期，或是給他們一個隨機產生的時間範圍，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 113.97999999999999,
          "end": 119.38,
          "en": "so with some starting and ending date which is randomly generated. And therefore one option here will",
          "zh": "也就是隨機產生的開始與結束日期。因此這裡其中一個選項會"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 119.38,
          "end": 123.25,
          "en": "be select date and the other button,",
          "zh": "是 select date，而另一個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 123.25,
          "end": 130.02,
          "en": "so the second button I'll add here will have a text of a random date. Now last but not least, I also want",
          "zh": "也就是我在這裡加入的第二個按鈕，文字會是 random date。最後同樣重要的是，我也想要"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 130.02,
          "end": 136.39,
          "en": "to have a cancel button in case I pressed that book button accidentally or I simply want to cancel,",
          "zh": "有一個 cancel 按鈕，以防我不小心按了那個 book 按鈕，或者我只是想取消，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 136.41,
          "end": 139.11,
          "en": "so here the text will be cancel.",
          "zh": "所以這裡文字會是 cancel。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 139.17000000000002,
          "end": 145.62,
          "en": "Now of course right now we would have three buttons and these buttons wouldn't do much and therefore",
          "zh": "當然目前我們會有三個按鈕，而這些按鈕不會做太多事，因此"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 145.68,
          "end": 148.18,
          "en": "you can for one assign a role,",
          "zh": "首先你可以指派一個 role，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 148.2,
          "end": 156,
          "en": "for example here on the cancel button, you can set role and now role can be set to cancel or destructive.",
          "zh": "例如在這裡的 cancel 按鈕上，你可以設定 role，而 role 可以設為 cancel 或 destructive。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 156.54,
          "end": 162.72,
          "en": "Now destructive will basically color the button red and you should use that option on options where you",
          "zh": "destructive 基本上會把按鈕變成紅色，你應該在會刪除東西的選項上使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 162.72,
          "end": 168.57,
          "en": "will delete something and you'll have to write the logic for deleting it on your own and I'll show you",
          "zh": "而你必須自己撰寫刪除的邏輯，我待會會示範"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 168.78,
          "end": 175.31,
          "en": "how to attach your own logic to a button in a second but basically this colors the button red. Now cancelling",
          "zh": "如何把自訂邏輯附加到按鈕上，但基本上這會把按鈕變成紅色。至於 cancel"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 175.32,
          "end": 181.41,
          "en": "on the other hand, so role cancel will not color it red but this will always be the bottommost button",
          "zh": "另一方面，role cancel 不會把它變成紅色，但它永遠會是最底部的按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 181.41,
          "end": 187.38,
          "en": "which makes sense because once you see the actionsheet, you will have seen that in other apps too and",
          "zh": "這很合理，因為一旦你看到 actionsheet，你在其他 app 也看過，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 187.38,
          "end": 192.33,
          "en": "it makes sense that the bottommost button which is the easiest one to reach with your fingers is the",
          "zh": "而最底部、手指最容易觸及的按鈕是"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 192.33,
          "end": 198.34,
          "en": "one that allows you to cancel this operation. If you assign no role, it'll be a regular button in your",
          "zh": "讓你取消這個操作的按鈕，這很合理。如果不指派 role，它就會是你"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 198.34,
          "end": 206.59,
          "en": "set of options and then, you can add a handler method which defines which code should run",
          "zh": "選項中的一般按鈕。接著你可以加入一個 handler 方法，定義按下時應該執行哪段程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 206.7,
          "end": 212.72,
          "en": "once this gets pressed and here I'll assign anonymous functions in both cases.",
          "zh": "一旦它被按下，而在這裡兩種情況我都會指派匿名函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 212.97,
          "end": 219.39,
          "en": "Now in both cases, I actually want to open my modal through the modal controller. So therefore, I'll add",
          "zh": "在兩種情況中，我其實都想透過 modal controller 開啟 modal。因此我要加入"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 219.42000000000002,
          "end": 234.46,
          "en": "a new method here, openBookingModal and add a mode here which is let's say either select or random, so",
          "zh": "一個新方法 openBookingModal，並加入一個 mode，比如說可以是 select 或 random，所以"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 234.46,
          "end": 236.42000000000002,
          "en": "this is just a Typescript,",
          "zh": "這只是 TypeScript 的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 236.65,
          "end": 237.96,
          "en": "should be a pipe symbol,",
          "zh": "應該是直線符號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 237.98,
          "end": 243.73,
          "en": "this is just a Typescript type assignment which means mode has to be a string but not any string,",
          "zh": "這只是 TypeScript 的型別指派，意思是 mode 必須是字串，但不是任何字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 243.73,
          "end": 252.13,
          "en": "it has to be exactly select or random. So I'm accepting two values for the mode string here and then here,",
          "zh": "它必須正好是 select 或 random。所以在這裡我接受 mode 字串的兩個值，然後在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 252.14,
          "end": 260.32,
          "en": "I'll simply console log mode and I then want to call this code here that uses the modal controller and",
          "zh": "我會直接 console log 出 mode，接著我要呼叫這裡這段使用 modal controller 的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 260.32,
          "end": 264.25,
          "en": "later we'll add logic to pass that mode into the modal,",
          "zh": "稍後我們會加入邏輯，把那個 mode 傳進 modal，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 264.25,
          "end": 266.19,
          "en": "obviously you already learned how it works",
          "zh": "顯然你已經學過它怎麼運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 266.2,
          "end": 270.91,
          "en": "so feel free to do it right now already but we'll use that information in the modal later,",
          "zh": "所以你可以現在就自己做，但我們稍後會在 modal 裡用到那個資訊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 270.91,
          "end": 276.43,
          "en": "for now I'll just log the mode here and open my modal. Now here in the handler,",
          "zh": "目前我只在這裡 log 出 mode 並開啟 modal。現在在 handler 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 276.43,
          "end": 287.61,
          "en": "I can call this openBookingModal and here I'll pass select and for the other function here, I'll pass",
          "zh": "我可以呼叫這個 openBookingModal，這裡我傳入 select，而另一個函式這裡我傳入"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 287.82,
          "end": 294.47,
          "en": "random. So in both cases, I open the modal but I pass select or random based on which option was chosen",
          "zh": "random。所以兩種情況我都開啟 modal，但我會根據 actionsheet 中選擇的選項"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 294.47,
          "end": 296,
          "en": "in the actionsheet.",
          "zh": "來傳入 select 或 random。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 296,
          "end": 301.91,
          "en": "Now as with all these controllers, calling create alone creates the element but doesn't show it,",
          "zh": "就像所有這些 controller 一樣，單獨呼叫 create 只會建立元素，但不會顯示它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 301.91,
          "end": 308.45,
          "en": "so this also gives us a promise where in the function that is called inside of the then block, we get",
          "zh": "所以這也會給我們一個 promise，在 then 區塊內被呼叫的函式中，我們會取得"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 308.51,
          "end": 317.42,
          "en": "our actionsheet element and on this actionsheet element, we can now call present to open it.",
          "zh": "我們的 actionsheet 元素，而在這個 actionsheet 元素上，我們現在可以呼叫 present 來開啟它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 317.42,
          "end": 322.68,
          "en": "And now with all of that, let's have a look at the result and let's see what this gives us.",
          "zh": "有了這一切，我們來看看結果，看看這會帶給我們什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 322.69,
          "end": 324.19,
          "en": "So let me login here,",
          "zh": "讓我在這裡登入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 324.44,
          "end": 327.97,
          "en": "wait for this and go to a place and click book",
          "zh": "等一下，然後前往某個地點並點擊 book，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 328.16,
          "end": 332,
          "en": "and this is the actionsheet on Android, cancelling closes it",
          "zh": "這就是 Android 上的 actionsheet，取消會把它關閉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 332.26,
          "end": 335.34000000000003,
          "en": "and if I choose select date, the modal opens",
          "zh": "如果我選擇 select date，modal 就會開啟，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 335.39,
          "end": 338.03,
          "en": "and here you see select being output",
          "zh": "在這裡你可以看到輸出 select，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 338.03,
          "end": 342.75,
          "en": "and if I choose random date, the modal opens too",
          "zh": "如果我選擇 random date，modal 也會開啟，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 342.77,
          "end": 345.59000000000003,
          "en": "but here you saw random being output.",
          "zh": "但這裡你看到輸出的是 random。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 345.59000000000003,
          "end": 349.79,
          "en": "Now let me show you the same on an iPhone because there, the actionsheet",
          "zh": "現在讓我在 iPhone 上示範同樣的流程，因為在那裡 actionsheet"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 349.79,
          "end": 351.3,
          "en": "simply looks different,",
          "zh": "看起來就是不一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 351.5,
          "end": 359.29,
          "en": "reload, login and then here go to the booking page,",
          "zh": "重新載入、登入，然後在這裡前往 booking 頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 359.29,
          "end": 365.88,
          "en": "click book and it's a little bit cut off here at the bottom since it's too big.",
          "zh": "點擊 book，因為它太大，底部這裡有一點被裁掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 365.9,
          "end": 366.77,
          "en": "Now we can see it,",
          "zh": "現在我們可以看到它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 366.77,
          "end": 368.21,
          "en": "so let's click book.",
          "zh": "所以我們來點擊 book。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 368.21,
          "end": 375.23,
          "en": "Here is the actionsheet, I can cancel and I can also select the date, open the modal or choose a random",
          "zh": "這就是 actionsheet，我可以取消，也可以選擇日期、開啟 modal，或選擇隨機"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 375.23,
          "end": 375.78,
          "en": "date,",
          "zh": "日期、"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 375.8,
          "end": 380,
          "en": "open the modal and you see the different outputs here on the right.",
          "zh": "開啟 modal，你可以在右邊看到不同的輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 380,
          "end": 381.68,
          "en": "So this is the actionsheet,",
          "zh": "這就是 actionsheet，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 381.68,
          "end": 383.27,
          "en": "also very useful",
          "zh": "也非常實用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 383.27,
          "end": 389.72,
          "en": "and of course there are some other controllers like toasts and so on and you should simply check the official",
          "zh": "當然還有一些其他 controller，例如 toast 等等，你應該直接查看官方"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 389.72,
          "end": 396.65,
          "en": "docs to learn about all components you have including all these controllers and whenever you see something",
          "zh": "文件，了解你擁有的所有元件，包括這些 controller，而每當你看到某個東西"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 396.65,
          "end": 401.22,
          "en": "with controller, you know in an Ionic Angular app, you can inject it,",
          "zh": "帶有 controller，你就知道在 Ionic Angular app 裡可以注入它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 401.27,
          "end": 406.73,
          "en": "you can create it with the create method, you learned all about it here in the official docs and you can",
          "zh": "可以用 create 方法建立它，你在官方文件裡都學過了，然後你可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 406.73,
          "end": 408.38,
          "en": "then show it in your app.",
          "zh": "在 app 中顯示它。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "13727944",
      "title": "Wrap Up",
      "lectureOrder": 149,
      "videoOrder": 124,
      "sourceHash": "0caa07c9b0fa7797031f79e95a0bf39f15bd8aaa10977cff2cc53abbfaf463c3",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.26,
          "end": 8.68,
          "en": "We could spend hours and hours going through all the components here but I think that's not really the",
          "zh": "我們可以花上好幾個小時逐一介紹這裡的所有元件，但我認為那不是"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.68,
          "end": 10.78,
          "en": "idea behind a course like this one.",
          "zh": "像這樣一門課程背後的重點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.78,
          "end": 13.1,
          "en": "I don't want to read the docs to you,",
          "zh": "我不想把文件念給你聽，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.12,
          "end": 21.88,
          "en": "I want to use as many components as possibly fit into the app we're building without the app then becoming",
          "zh": "我想盡可能把最多元件塞進我們正在打造的 app 裡，同時又不讓這個 app 變成"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 22,
          "end": 25.16,
          "en": "an unrealistic joke or anything like that.",
          "zh": "不切實際的笑話之類的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 25.24,
          "end": 31.06,
          "en": "So we covered a lot of components and I mentioned a couple of times that the official docs are the way",
          "zh": "所以我們涵蓋了很多元件，而我也提過好幾次，官方文件是"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 31.06,
          "end": 37.87,
          "en": "to go to learn all about both the components we covered and their many configuration options as",
          "zh": "了解我們介紹過的元件及其許多設定選項的最佳途徑，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 37.87,
          "end": 43.51,
          "en": "well as components we haven't had a look yet because Ionic has so many components.",
          "zh": "同時也能了解我們還沒看過的元件，因為 Ionic 的元件實在太多了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 43.51,
          "end": 47.56,
          "en": "But the idea is not to learn them by heart but really when you're building an app,",
          "zh": "但重點不是把它們背起來，而是當你在打造 app 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 47.59,
          "end": 49.54,
          "en": "think about what you want to add,",
          "zh": "想想你想加入什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 49.54,
          "end": 50.6,
          "en": "do you need a button?",
          "zh": "你需要按鈕嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 50.63,
          "end": 51.52,
          "en": "Do you need a menu?",
          "zh": "你需要選單嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 51.52,
          "end": 51.97,
          "en": "Do you",
          "zh": "你需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 52.06,
          "end": 53.26,
          "en": "need a modal?",
          "zh": "modal 嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 53.44,
          "end": 59.56,
          "en": "And then have a look at the docs and see which components could help you and how you use them.",
          "zh": "然後查看文件，看看哪些元件能幫上忙，以及該怎麼使用它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 59.56,
          "end": 67.4,
          "en": "With that I'm quite happy with the current state of our application here, of the app we have here.",
          "zh": "到這裡，我對我們應用程式目前的狀態相當滿意。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 67.42,
          "end": 73.3,
          "en": "I'd say it's missing some styling and we can certainly change the default styling to not use the default",
          "zh": "我會說它還缺一些樣式，我們當然可以修改預設樣式，不要用預設的"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 73.33,
          "end": 79.24,
          "en": "blue and therefore in the next module, we will have a look at how we style our Ionic apps, how we",
          "zh": "藍色，因此在接下來這個模組，我們會看看如何為 Ionic app 加上樣式、我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 79.24,
          "end": 87.34,
          "en": "can write our own CSS code, how we can overwrite Ionic defaults, how we can work with themes to set a general",
          "zh": "如何撰寫自己的 CSS 程式碼、如何覆寫 Ionic 的預設值、如何運用主題來設定 app 的"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 87.34,
          "end": 95.53,
          "en": "color for the app. So that will be what we'll dive in next to make sure that our application",
          "zh": "整體色彩。這就是我們接下來要深入探討的內容，確保我們的應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 95.53,
          "end": 99.91,
          "en": "takes more and more shape before we of course will also add more logic to it.",
          "zh": "越來越有樣子，當然之後我們也會為它加入更多邏輯。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}